window.IELTS_BILINGUAL={"M01":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to talk about a colleague of mine called Adam. We met at work about two years ago, and we gradually became friends. He's a few years older than me, and he's someone I often turn to when I need advice.","heading":"认识同事","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to talk about a colleague of mine called Adam.","zh":"我想聊聊我的一位同事，他叫 Adam。"},{"en":"We met at work about two years ago, and we gradually became friends.","zh":"我们大约两年前在工作中认识，后来慢慢成了朋友。"},{"en":"He's a few years older than me, and he's someone I often turn to when I need advice.","zh":"他比我大几岁，我需要建议时，经常会找他。"}]},{"source":"What stands out about him is how organised he is. Before starting a task, he writes down the main steps and decides what needs to be done first. He doesn't make things complicated. In fact, he's usually the person who makes a confusing situation easier to understand.","heading":"做事很有条理","sentences":[{"en":"What stands out about him is how organised he is.","zh":"他最突出的特点就是做事很有条理。"},{"en":"Before starting a task, he writes down the main steps and decides what needs to be done first.","zh":"开始一项任务前，他会写下主要步骤，再决定先做什么。"},{"en":"He doesn't make things complicated.","zh":"他不会把事情弄得很复杂。"},{"en":"In fact, he's usually the person who makes a confusing situation easier to understand.","zh":"实际上，遇到让人摸不着头脑的情况，通常都是他把事情解释清楚。"}]},{"source":"A few months ago, I had to explain a new idea to our team. I knew the details, but I couldn't present them clearly. Adam suggested using one simple example instead of showing everything at once. He also helped me practise and pointed out the parts that were difficult to follow.","heading":"练习表达","sentences":[{"en":"A few months ago, I had to explain a new idea to our team.","zh":"几个月前，我需要向团队解释一个新想法。"},{"en":"I knew the details, but I couldn't present them clearly.","zh":"我了解其中的细节，却没办法把它们讲清楚。"},{"en":"Adam suggested using one simple example instead of showing everything at once.","zh":"Adam 建议用一个简单的例子来说明，而不是一下子把所有内容都展示出来。"},{"en":"He also helped me practise and pointed out the parts that were difficult to follow.","zh":"他还帮我练习，指出了哪些地方让人听不明白。"}]},{"source":"The presentation went much better than I expected. People understood the idea, and I felt more confident afterwards. What I appreciate most is that he helped me learn a useful skill rather than just doing the work for me.","heading":"学会表达","sentences":[{"en":"The presentation went much better than I expected.","zh":"那次演示比我预想的顺利得多。"},{"en":"People understood the idea, and I felt more confident afterwards.","zh":"大家理解了这个想法，之后我也更有信心了。"},{"en":"What I appreciate most is that he helped me learn a useful skill rather than just doing the work for me.","zh":"我最感谢的是，他帮我学会了一项实用的技能，而不是直接替我把工作做完。","skeleton":"What I appreciate most is that he helped me learn a useful skill ..."}]},{"source":"Since then, I've tried to follow his approach. Whenever a task feels overwhelming, I break it into smaller steps. So he's had a positive influence on the way I work.","heading":"拆分任务的方法","sentences":[{"en":"Since then, I've tried to follow his approach.","zh":"从那以后，我就试着照他的方法去做。"},{"en":"Whenever a task feels overwhelming, I break it into smaller steps.","zh":"每当一项任务让我觉得难以应付时，我就把它拆成更小的步骤。"},{"en":"So he's had a positive influence on the way I work.","zh":"所以，他对我的工作方式产生了积极的影响。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"What I appreciate most is that he helped me learn a useful skill rather than just doing the work for me.","method":"先把 What I appreciate most is that 连成一块，再接学会技能，最后用 rather than 对比替我做完。"}},"M02":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to talk about a novel called The Martian, by Andy Weir. I read it a few months ago after a friend recommended it. I usually prefer stories that feel practical, so the combination of science and adventure appealed to me.","heading":"初读火星救援","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to talk about a novel called The Martian, by Andy Weir.","zh":"我想聊一本小说，叫《火星救援》，作者是安迪·威尔。"},{"en":"I read it a few months ago after a friend recommended it.","zh":"几个月前，一位朋友推荐了这本书，我就读了。"},{"en":"I usually prefer stories that feel practical, so the combination of science and adventure appealed to me.","zh":"我平时更喜欢感觉贴近实际的故事，所以科学和冒险结合在一起，很吸引我。"}]},{"source":"The main character is an astronaut called Mark Watney, who is accidentally left behind on Mars. He has to find ways to stay alive and contact people on Earth. The situation sounds hopeless, but he doesn't give up. He deals with one problem at a time, using whatever resources he has.","heading":"火星求生故事","sentences":[{"en":"The main character is an astronaut called Mark Watney, who is accidentally left behind on Mars.","zh":"主角是一位叫马克·沃特尼的宇航员，他意外地被留在了火星上。"},{"en":"He has to find ways to stay alive and contact people on Earth.","zh":"他必须想办法活下去，并联系上地球上的人。"},{"en":"The situation sounds hopeless, but he doesn't give up.","zh":"处境听起来没有希望，但他没有放弃。"},{"en":"He deals with one problem at a time, using whatever resources he has.","zh":"他利用手头所有能用的资源，一次解决一个问题。"}]},{"source":"What I enjoyed most was the way he thought through his difficulties. The book made me feel as if I was following his attempts step by step. Some parts were tense, but his sense of humour made the story enjoyable as well.","heading":"理性与幽默感","sentences":[{"en":"What I enjoyed most was the way he thought through his difficulties.","zh":"我最喜欢的是他认真思考、想办法解决困难的方式。","skeleton":"What I enjoyed most was the way ..."},{"en":"The book made me feel as if I was following his attempts step by step.","zh":"这本书让我感觉，自己好像在一步一步跟着他尝试。"},{"en":"Some parts were tense, but his sense of humour made the story enjoyable as well.","zh":"有些情节很紧张，但他的幽默感又让故事读起来很有意思。"}]},{"source":"I read a little in the evening, and I often continued longer than I had planned because I wanted to know what would happen next. I felt relieved whenever one of his ideas worked.","heading":"读得入迷","sentences":[{"en":"I read a little in the evening, and I often continued longer than I had planned because I wanted to know what would happen next.","zh":"我晚上会读一会儿，而且经常读得比原本计划的更久，因为我想知道接下来会发生什么。","skeleton":"I read a little in the evening, and I often continued longer than I had planned because I wanted to know ..."},{"en":"I felt relieved whenever one of his ideas worked.","zh":"每当他的某个办法奏效时，我就会松一口气。"}]},{"source":"The story also gave me a useful reminder: a big problem becomes less frightening when you focus on the next small action. I think that's why it stayed with me. I'd recommend it to someone who enjoys a hopeful story with a clever main character.","heading":"小步化解难题","sentences":[{"en":"The story also gave me a useful reminder: a big problem becomes less frightening when you focus on the next small action.","zh":"这个故事也给了我一个很有用的提醒：当你专注于下一步小行动时，大问题就没那么吓人了。","skeleton":"The story also gave me a useful reminder: a big problem becomes less frightening when you focus on ..."},{"en":"I think that's why it stayed with me.","zh":"我想，这就是它一直留在我心里的原因。"},{"en":"I'd recommend it to someone who enjoys a hopeful story with a clever main character.","zh":"如果有人喜欢充满希望、主角又很聪明的故事，我会向他们推荐这本书。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I read a little in the evening, and I often continued longer than I had planned because I wanted to know what would happen next.","method":"按晚上读书、比计划读得久、想知道后续这三步记，分别用 and 和 because 串起来。"}},"M03":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to describe an afternoon I spent exploring an older part of Dubai with a friend. We went there on a weekend because we wanted a break from our usual routine. We weren't trying to visit every attraction. We just wanted to walk around and see something different.","heading":"老迪拜漫游","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to describe an afternoon I spent exploring an older part of Dubai with a friend.","zh":"我想讲讲一个下午，我和朋友一起逛了迪拜一片比较老的城区。"},{"en":"We went there on a weekend because we wanted a break from our usual routine.","zh":"我们是在周末去的，因为想暂时换换平时的生活节奏。"},{"en":"We weren't trying to visit every attraction.","zh":"我们并不是想把每个景点都逛完。"},{"en":"We just wanted to walk around and see something different.","zh":"我们只是想四处走走，看看不一样的东西。"}]},{"source":"We started near the creek and spent some time looking at the old buildings and small shops. What I liked was the atmosphere. It felt different from the modern shopping malls I normally see. There were narrow streets, people selling different products, and plenty of small details to notice.","heading":"老城氛围","sentences":[{"en":"We started near the creek and spent some time looking at the old buildings and small shops.","zh":"我们从迪拜河附近开始逛，花了些时间看看老建筑和小商店。"},{"en":"What I liked was the atmosphere.","zh":"我喜欢的是那里的氛围。"},{"en":"It felt different from the modern shopping malls I normally see.","zh":"那种感觉和我平时见到的现代购物中心很不一样。"},{"en":"There were narrow streets, people selling different products, and plenty of small details to notice.","zh":"那里有狭窄的街道、售卖各种商品的人，还有很多值得留意的小细节。"}]},{"source":"At one point, we walked through a busy market. It was quite crowded, and I could hear people talking and calling out to customers. Later, we moved to a quieter spot by the water and took a few photos. The light was softer by then, which made the area look especially nice.","heading":"市场水边","sentences":[{"en":"At one point, we walked through a busy market.","zh":"途中有一段，我们穿过了一个热闹的市场。"},{"en":"It was quite crowded, and I could hear people talking and calling out to customers.","zh":"那里挺拥挤的，我能听到人们聊天和招呼顾客的声音。"},{"en":"Later, we moved to a quieter spot by the water and took a few photos.","zh":"后来，我们去了水边一个更安静的地方，拍了几张照片。"},{"en":"The light was softer by then, which made the area look especially nice.","zh":"那时候光线已经柔和了些，让那一带看起来特别漂亮。"}]},{"source":"We also had a simple drink and talked for a while. The outing didn't cost us much, but I enjoyed it more than some expensive activities I've tried.","heading":"花少玩好","sentences":[{"en":"We also had a simple drink and talked for a while.","zh":"我们还简单喝了点东西，聊了一会儿。"},{"en":"The outing didn't cost us much, but I enjoyed it more than some expensive activities I've tried.","zh":"这次外出没花多少钱，但比起我试过的一些昂贵的活动，我更喜欢这次。"}]},{"source":"I remember feeling relaxed afterwards. It reminded me that I don't always need a complicated plan to have a good day. Sometimes a walk, a friend and a change of surroundings are enough.","heading":"简单的快乐一天","sentences":[{"en":"I remember feeling relaxed afterwards.","zh":"我记得结束后，整个人都很放松。"},{"en":"It reminded me that I don't always need a complicated plan to have a good day.","zh":"这让我意识到，想过得开心，不一定每次都要安排一个复杂的计划。"},{"en":"Sometimes a walk, a friend and a change of surroundings are enough.","zh":"有时候，散散步、和朋友在一起、换个环境，就足够了。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"There were narrow streets, people selling different products, and plenty of small details to notice.","method":"用 There were 开头，依次记街道、卖东西的人、小细节这三个画面。"}},"M04":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to describe a decision I made while working on a small project with my team. We had a repetitive task that involved checking information manually, and I wanted to build a tool to make it easier.","heading":"项目决定","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to describe a decision I made while working on a small project with my team.","zh":"我想讲讲和团队做一个小项目时，我作出的一个决定。"},{"en":"We had a repetitive task that involved checking information manually, and I wanted to build a tool to make it easier.","zh":"我们有一项重复性的任务，需要人工核对信息，我想做一个工具，让这件事更容易些。","skeleton":"We had a repetitive task ..., and I wanted to build a tool to make it easier."}]},{"source":"At first, I thought we should create a complete system with lots of features. However, a colleague suggested starting with a simple version. I wasn't fully convinced because I worried it would look unfinished, but we discussed the idea and agreed to test it.","heading":"先试简版","sentences":[{"en":"At first, I thought we should create a complete system with lots of features.","zh":"一开始，我觉得我们应该做一个功能很多的完整系统。"},{"en":"However, a colleague suggested starting with a simple version.","zh":"不过，一位同事建议先从简单的版本做起。"},{"en":"I wasn't fully convinced because I worried it would look unfinished, but we discussed the idea and agreed to test it.","zh":"我还没有完全被说服，因为我担心它看起来像没做完，但我们讨论了这个想法，决定先试一试。","skeleton":"I wasn't fully convinced because I worried ..., but we discussed the idea and agreed to test it."}]},{"source":"We divided the work between us and focused on the most common problem. I worked on the main function, while another person tested it with a few examples. Our first attempt didn't work properly because we had misunderstood part of the information. We checked the issue together and corrected it.","heading":"分工纠错","sentences":[{"en":"We divided the work between us and focused on the most common problem.","zh":"我们分好了工，把重点放在最常见的问题上。"},{"en":"I worked on the main function, while another person tested it with a few examples.","zh":"我负责主要功能，另一个人则用几个例子进行测试。"},{"en":"Our first attempt didn't work properly because we had misunderstood part of the information.","zh":"第一次尝试没能正常运行，因为我们误解了部分信息。"},{"en":"We checked the issue together and corrected it.","zh":"我们一起检查了问题，并把它纠正了。"}]},{"source":"Eventually, the tool handled the basic task well. It wasn't perfect, but it saved us time and helped us understand what to improve next. Seeing it work was a satisfying moment for me.","heading":"原型成功运行","sentences":[{"en":"Eventually, the tool handled the basic task well.","zh":"最后，这个工具很好地完成了基本任务。"},{"en":"It wasn't perfect, but it saved us time and helped us understand what to improve next.","zh":"它并不完美，但帮我们省了时间，也让我们知道下一步该改进什么。"},{"en":"Seeing it work was a satisfying moment for me.","zh":"看到它运行起来的那一刻，我很有成就感。"}]},{"source":"I was happy with the decision because we learned something useful without spending weeks on an idea that might not work. The experience changed my opinion about planning. I still think planning matters, but now I prefer to try a small, practical solution before making a bigger commitment.","heading":"小步尝试","sentences":[{"en":"I was happy with the decision because we learned something useful without spending weeks on an idea that might not work.","zh":"我对这个决定很满意，因为我们学到了有用的东西，又没有花好几周去做一个可能行不通的想法。","skeleton":"I was happy with the decision because we learned something useful without spending weeks on an idea ..."},{"en":"The experience changed my opinion about planning.","zh":"这次经历改变了我对做计划的看法。"},{"en":"I still think planning matters, but now I prefer to try a small, practical solution before making a bigger commitment.","zh":"我还是觉得计划很重要，但现在我更愿意先尝试一个小而实用的解决办法，再投入更多。","skeleton":"I still think planning matters, but now I prefer to try a small, practical solution before making ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I was happy with the decision because we learned something useful without spending weeks on an idea that might not work.","method":"以对决定满意为开头，用 because 接学到东西，再用 without spending 补上没有白花好几周的好处。"}},"M05":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to talk about a small change I made to my evening routine. I used to come home from work and immediately start looking at my phone. I told myself I was taking a short break, but quite often I ended up scrolling for nearly an hour.","heading":"下班刷屏","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to talk about a small change I made to my evening routine.","zh":"我想聊聊我对晚间习惯作出的一点小改变。"},{"en":"I used to come home from work and immediately start looking at my phone.","zh":"以前我下班回到家，就会马上开始看手机。"},{"en":"I told myself I was taking a short break, but quite often I ended up scrolling for nearly an hour.","zh":"我告诉自己只是休息一小会儿，但经常一刷就刷了将近一个小时。"}]},{"source":"The problem was that I didn't feel rested afterwards. I was still tired, and sometimes I went to bed later than I had planned. So I decided to replace part of that screen time with a short walk.","heading":"散步替代","sentences":[{"en":"The problem was that I didn't feel rested afterwards.","zh":"问题是，刷完以后我并没有觉得休息好了。"},{"en":"I was still tired, and sometimes I went to bed later than I had planned.","zh":"我还是很累，有时还比计划的时间更晚睡。"},{"en":"So I decided to replace part of that screen time with a short walk.","zh":"所以我决定用短时间的散步，代替一部分看屏幕的时间。"}]},{"source":"I started with just ten minutes because I knew I wouldn't stick to an ambitious exercise plan. When the weather was comfortable, I walked outside. On other days, I found somewhere indoors where I could move around. I usually left my phone in my pocket and paid attention to my surroundings.","heading":"从短时散步起","sentences":[{"en":"I started with just ten minutes because I knew I wouldn't stick to an ambitious exercise plan.","zh":"我一开始只走十分钟，因为我知道，目标定得太高的锻炼计划，我坚持不下来。"},{"en":"When the weather was comfortable, I walked outside.","zh":"天气舒服的时候，我就去外面走走。"},{"en":"On other days, I found somewhere indoors where I could move around.","zh":"其他时候，我会找个能走动的室内地方。"},{"en":"I usually left my phone in my pocket and paid attention to my surroundings.","zh":"我通常把手机放在口袋里，留意周围的环境。"}]},{"source":"After a while, a friend began joining me. That made the habit easier to maintain because we could chat and remind each other to go. We weren't trying to become athletes. We just wanted to do something more active after sitting for most of the day.","heading":"结伴坚持","sentences":[{"en":"After a while, a friend began joining me.","zh":"过了一阵子，一位朋友开始和我一起走。"},{"en":"That made the habit easier to maintain because we could chat and remind each other to go.","zh":"这样更容易坚持这个习惯，因为我们可以聊天，也能互相提醒出去走走。"},{"en":"We weren't trying to become athletes.","zh":"我们并不是想成为运动员。"},{"en":"We just wanted to do something more active after sitting for most of the day.","zh":"我们只是想在坐了大半天之后，做点能让身体活动起来的事。"}]},{"source":"The walk gives me a clear break between work and the rest of my evening. The change is simple, but it helps me relax and makes me feel more in control of my time.","heading":"散步带来的改变","sentences":[{"en":"The walk gives me a clear break between work and the rest of my evening.","zh":"这段散步时间，让我的工作和当晚剩下的时间之间有了一个明确的分界。"},{"en":"The change is simple, but it helps me relax and makes me feel more in control of my time.","zh":"这个改变很简单，但它让我放松下来，也让我觉得自己更能掌控时间。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I told myself I was taking a short break, but quite often I ended up scrolling for nearly an hour.","method":"把 taking a short break 和 scrolling for nearly an hour 当成前后对照，用 but 和 ended up 说出实际结果。"}},"M06":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to talk about a pair of headphones that I saved up to buy. I wanted them because I often needed to concentrate in places where there was background noise. I also thought they would be useful for listening to English recordings.","heading":"攒钱买耳机","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to talk about a pair of headphones that I saved up to buy.","zh":"我想聊聊一副我攒钱买的耳机。"},{"en":"I wanted them because I often needed to concentrate in places where there was background noise.","zh":"我想买它，是因为我经常需要在有背景噪声的地方集中注意力。"},{"en":"I also thought they would be useful for listening to English recordings.","zh":"我也觉得它会很适合用来听英语录音。"}]},{"source":"They were more expensive than the basic headphones I had used before, so I didn't buy them immediately. I compared a few options and put aside a little money each month. I also cut back on a few small purchases that I didn't really need.","heading":"攒钱购买耳机","sentences":[{"en":"They were more expensive than the basic headphones I had used before, so I didn't buy them immediately.","zh":"它比我以前用的基础款耳机贵，所以我没有马上买。"},{"en":"I compared a few options and put aside a little money each month.","zh":"我比较了几个选择，每个月都存一点钱。"},{"en":"I also cut back on a few small purchases that I didn't really need.","zh":"我还减少了几笔其实没必要的小额消费。"}]},{"source":"When I finally bought them, I was pleased because I had made a deliberate choice rather than buying something on impulse. I started using them regularly for work and language practice.","heading":"理性购买耳机","sentences":[{"en":"When I finally bought them, I was pleased because I had made a deliberate choice rather than buying something on impulse.","zh":"终于买下这副耳机时，我挺开心的，因为这是我认真考虑后的选择，而不是一时冲动买下的东西。","skeleton":"When I finally bought them, I was pleased because I had made a deliberate choice rather than ..."},{"en":"I started using them regularly for work and language practice.","zh":"之后，我经常用它来工作和练习语言。"}]},{"source":"A few weeks later, one side stopped working properly. I took them back to the shop, expecting a long argument. Instead, the assistant listened carefully, checked the problem and explained the next steps. After confirming the fault, the shop arranged a replacement.","heading":"故障换新","sentences":[{"en":"A few weeks later, one side stopped working properly.","zh":"几周后，其中一边开始不能正常工作了。"},{"en":"I took them back to the shop, expecting a long argument.","zh":"我把耳机拿回店里，本以为要争论很久。"},{"en":"Instead, the assistant listened carefully, checked the problem and explained the next steps.","zh":"结果店员认真听了我的情况，检查了问题，还解释了接下来怎么处理。"},{"en":"After confirming the fault, the shop arranged a replacement.","zh":"确认故障后，店里安排给我换了一副。"}]},{"source":"That experience made the purchase more memorable. I appreciated both the product and the way the problem was handled. For me, the value wasn't just the price or the brand. It was having something useful and knowing that I could get help when it didn't work as expected.","heading":"产品与服务价值","sentences":[{"en":"That experience made the purchase more memorable.","zh":"这次经历让这笔购买更让我印象深刻。"},{"en":"I appreciated both the product and the way the problem was handled.","zh":"我既喜欢这个产品，也很认可他们处理问题的方式。"},{"en":"For me, the value wasn't just the price or the brand.","zh":"对我来说，它的价值不只是价格或者品牌。"},{"en":"It was having something useful and knowing that I could get help when it didn't work as expected.","zh":"真正的价值在于，拥有一件实用的东西，而且知道它没有正常发挥作用时，我能得到帮助。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"When I finally bought them, I was pleased because I had made a deliberate choice rather than buying something on impulse.","method":"按“终于买下—感到开心—因为认真选择而非冲动消费”的顺序复述，并记住rather than连接两种购买方式。"}},"M07":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to talk about my grandmother and a skill she taught me when I was a child. She enjoyed looking after plants, and whenever I visited her, I liked spending time in the small garden near her home.","heading":"祖母花园","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to talk about my grandmother and a skill she taught me when I was a child.","zh":"我想聊聊我的祖母，还有她在我小时候教给我的一项技能。"},{"en":"She enjoyed looking after plants, and whenever I visited her, I liked spending time in the small garden near her home.","zh":"她喜欢照料植物，每次我去看她，都喜欢在她家附近的小花园里待一会儿。","skeleton":"She enjoyed looking after plants, and whenever I visited her, I liked spending time in the small garden ..."}]},{"source":"When I was about ten, she helped me grow a plant of my own. At first, I thought I only needed to put it in the soil and water it as much as possible. She explained that plants needed the right amount of water and enough light, and that doing more wasn't always doing better.","heading":"学会适度养护","sentences":[{"en":"When I was about ten, she helped me grow a plant of my own.","zh":"我大约十岁时，她帮我种了一株属于我自己的植物。"},{"en":"At first, I thought I only needed to put it in the soil and water it as much as possible.","zh":"一开始，我以为只要把它种进土里，再尽量多浇水就行了。"},{"en":"She explained that plants needed the right amount of water and enough light, and that doing more wasn't always doing better.","zh":"她解释说，植物需要适量的水和充足的光照，而且做得更多，并不总是做得更好。","skeleton":"She explained that plants needed ... and that doing more wasn't always doing better."}]},{"source":"We checked the plant together every few days. I was impatient because I wanted to see a result immediately. She encouraged me to notice small changes instead of expecting something dramatic overnight.","heading":"耐心观察生长","sentences":[{"en":"We checked the plant together every few days.","zh":"我们每隔几天就一起看看那株植物。"},{"en":"I was impatient because I wanted to see a result immediately.","zh":"我没什么耐心，因为想马上看到结果。"},{"en":"She encouraged me to notice small changes instead of expecting something dramatic overnight.","zh":"她鼓励我留意细微的变化，而不是期待一夜之间就出现巨大的变化。"}]},{"source":"Eventually, I saw new leaves, and I felt surprisingly proud. It was a small achievement, but it was something I had helped create and look after myself.","heading":"新叶带来成就","sentences":[{"en":"Eventually, I saw new leaves, and I felt surprisingly proud.","zh":"后来，我看到了新长出的叶子，没想到自己会那么自豪。"},{"en":"It was a small achievement, but it was something I had helped create and look after myself.","zh":"这只是一个小小的成果，但也是我亲自参与种植和照料出来的。"}]},{"source":"What I admire about my grandmother is her patience. She didn't make me feel foolish when I made mistakes. She explained things calmly and let me try again. I still remember that experience because it taught me more than how to care for a plant. It also taught me to be consistent and to give things time.","heading":"耐心的教导","sentences":[{"en":"What I admire about my grandmother is her patience.","zh":"我佩服祖母的地方，是她很有耐心。"},{"en":"She didn't make me feel foolish when I made mistakes.","zh":"我犯错的时候，她不会让我觉得自己很笨。"},{"en":"She explained things calmly and let me try again.","zh":"她会平静地给我解释，让我再试一次。"},{"en":"I still remember that experience because it taught me more than how to care for a plant.","zh":"我到现在还记得那次经历，因为它教给我的不只是怎么照顾一株植物。"},{"en":"It also taught me to be consistent and to give things time.","zh":"它也教会了我要坚持做下去，并给事情一些时间。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"She explained that plants needed the right amount of water and enough light, and that doing more wasn't always doing better.","method":"用两个that记住她解释的两点：先说水和光照的需求，再说“多做不等于做好”。"}},"M08":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to describe a birthday dinner I helped organise for a friend. It happened a few months ago, and there were just a few of us. We wanted to make the evening special without turning it into a complicated or expensive event.","heading":"生日筹备","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to describe a birthday dinner I helped organise for a friend.","zh":"我想讲讲我帮朋友筹办的一次生日晚餐。"},{"en":"It happened a few months ago, and there were just a few of us.","zh":"那是几个月前的事，当时就我们几个人。"},{"en":"We wanted to make the evening special without turning it into a complicated or expensive event.","zh":"我们想让那个晚上特别一点，又不想把它弄成一场复杂或昂贵的活动。"}]},{"source":"I checked when everyone was available and chose a place that was easy for us to reach. Another friend arranged the cake, while I made the reservation and confirmed the time. We also asked him what food he liked so that he would enjoy the meal.","heading":"晚餐分工","sentences":[{"en":"I checked when everyone was available and chose a place that was easy for us to reach.","zh":"我确认了大家什么时候有空，选了一个我们都方便去的地方。"},{"en":"Another friend arranged the cake, while I made the reservation and confirmed the time.","zh":"另一位朋友负责蛋糕，我则负责订位和确认时间。"},{"en":"We also asked him what food he liked so that he would enjoy the meal.","zh":"我们也问了他喜欢吃什么，好让他能吃得开心。"}]},{"source":"On the evening itself, we arrived a little early and made sure everything was ready. The atmosphere was relaxed. We talked about work, shared some funny stories and took a few photos together.","heading":"轻松的生日聚会","sentences":[{"en":"On the evening itself, we arrived a little early and made sure everything was ready.","zh":"到了聚会那天晚上，我们稍微提前到场，确认一切都准备好了。"},{"en":"The atmosphere was relaxed.","zh":"气氛很轻松。"},{"en":"We talked about work, shared some funny stories and took a few photos together.","zh":"我们聊了工作，分享了几个有趣的故事，还一起拍了几张照片。"}]},{"source":"The most memorable moment was when the cake came out. It was quite simple, but it had a small decoration connected to one of his hobbies. He hadn't expected it, and his reaction made the effort feel worthwhile.","heading":"蛋糕惊喜","sentences":[{"en":"The most memorable moment was when the cake came out.","zh":"最难忘的时刻，是蛋糕端上来的时候。"},{"en":"It was quite simple, but it had a small decoration connected to one of his hobbies.","zh":"蛋糕挺简单，但上面有一个与他的某项爱好有关的小装饰。"},{"en":"He hadn't expected it, and his reaction made the effort feel worthwhile.","zh":"他没想到会有这个安排，他的反应让我们觉得这番心思花得很值。"}]},{"source":"I was pleased that the plan worked and that everyone had a good time. It reminded me that a successful celebration doesn't depend on spending a lot of money. Paying attention to the person and making time for each other can be much more important.","heading":"用心胜过花费","sentences":[{"en":"I was pleased that the plan worked and that everyone had a good time.","zh":"计划顺利实现，大家也都玩得很开心，这让我很高兴。"},{"en":"It reminded me that a successful celebration doesn't depend on spending a lot of money.","zh":"这提醒了我，一场成功的庆祝活动，并不取决于花多少钱。"},{"en":"Paying attention to the person and making time for each other can be much more important.","zh":"关心对方，并为彼此留出时间，可能要重要得多。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"We wanted to make the evening special without turning it into a complicated or expensive event.","method":"先记 make the evening special 这个目标，再用 without turning it into 接上希望避免的复杂和昂贵。"}},"M09":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to talk about my childhood friend Ben. We grew up in the same neighbourhood and became friends when we were about ten. We used to ride our bikes after school, and although we now live in different cities, we still talk regularly.","heading":"童年好友","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to talk about my childhood friend Ben.","zh":"我想聊聊我的童年好友 Ben。"},{"en":"We grew up in the same neighbourhood and became friends when we were about ten.","zh":"我们在同一个社区长大，大约十岁时成了朋友。"},{"en":"We used to ride our bikes after school, and although we now live in different cities, we still talk regularly.","zh":"以前放学后我们常一起骑自行车，虽然现在住在不同的城市，但还是经常联系。","skeleton":"We used to ride our bikes ..., and although we now live in different cities, we still talk regularly."}]},{"source":"One thing I admire about him is the way he learns languages. He studies English by watching short videos with subtitles, noting useful expressions and recording himself using them. He also learns Chinese, and we practise together through voice messages. Rather than memorising long lists, he uses new words in simple conversations. Recently, he managed to order a meal in Chinese and ask the waiter about the ingredients without switching to English.","heading":"实用语言学法","sentences":[{"en":"One thing I admire about him is the way he learns languages.","zh":"他有一点让我很佩服，就是他学习语言的方式。"},{"en":"He studies English by watching short videos with subtitles, noting useful expressions and recording himself using them.","zh":"他通过看带字幕的短视频来学英语，记下实用的表达，再把自己使用这些表达的过程录下来。","skeleton":"He studies English by watching ..., noting ... and recording himself using them."},{"en":"He also learns Chinese, and we practise together through voice messages.","zh":"他也在学中文，我们会发语音消息一起练习。"},{"en":"Rather than memorising long lists, he uses new words in simple conversations.","zh":"他不会去背一长串词汇，而是把新单词用在简单的对话里。"},{"en":"Recently, he managed to order a meal in Chinese and ask the waiter about the ingredients without switching to English.","zh":"最近，他成功用中文点了餐，还问了服务员菜里有哪些食材，全程没有切换成英语。","skeleton":"Recently, he managed to order ... and ask ... without switching to English."}]},{"source":"Ben is also interested in history. He once found a box of his grandfather's old photographs and asked him about the people and places in them. He put the pictures in an album with short descriptions. When we visited a local museum, he explained how an old railway had changed the town.","heading":"朋友的历史兴趣","sentences":[{"en":"Ben is also interested in history.","zh":"Ben 也对历史感兴趣。"},{"en":"He once found a box of his grandfather's old photographs and asked him about the people and places in them.","zh":"有一次，他找到一盒爷爷的老照片，就问爷爷照片里的人和地方都是什么。"},{"en":"He put the pictures in an album with short descriptions.","zh":"他把这些照片放进相册，还配上了简短的说明。"},{"en":"When we visited a local museum, he explained how an old railway had changed the town.","zh":"我们参观当地一家博物馆时，他给我讲了一条老铁路如何改变了这座小镇。"}]},{"source":"What makes our friendship special is that he never makes me feel embarrassed when I get something wrong. He corrects me gently and usually adds a funny example. He's curious, patient and easy to talk to, so spending time with him always feels worthwhile.","heading":"让人自在的友谊","sentences":[{"en":"What makes our friendship special is that he never makes me feel embarrassed when I get something wrong.","zh":"我们的友谊特别之处在于，即使我弄错了什么，他也从来不会让我觉得难堪。","skeleton":"What makes our friendship special is that he never makes me feel embarrassed ..."},{"en":"He corrects me gently and usually adds a funny example.","zh":"他会温和地纠正我，通常还会加上一个有趣的例子。"},{"en":"He's curious, patient and easy to talk to, so spending time with him always feels worthwhile.","zh":"他有好奇心、有耐心，又很好聊，所以跟他相处总让我觉得很值得。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"He studies English by watching short videos with subtitles, noting useful expressions and recording himself using them.","method":"按“看视频—记表达—录下自己使用表达”的练习顺序，记住by后面的三个并列动作。"}},"M10":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to talk about my cousin Sara, who wants to become a nurse. She's a few years younger than me, and we've known each other since childhood. We usually meet at family gatherings, but recently we've also been talking about her future career.","heading":"表妹理想","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to talk about my cousin Sara, who wants to become a nurse.","zh":"我想聊聊我的表妹 Sara，她想成为一名护士。"},{"en":"She's a few years younger than me, and we've known each other since childhood.","zh":"她比我小几岁，我们从小就认识。"},{"en":"We usually meet at family gatherings, but recently we've also been talking about her future career.","zh":"我们通常在家庭聚会时见面，不过最近也一直在聊她未来的职业。"}]},{"source":"Her interest in nursing began when our grandmother spent several days in hospital. Sara noticed that the nurses did much more than check equipment. They explained what was happening and helped our grandmother feel less anxious. She said she wanted a job where her work could make a practical difference to someone's day.","heading":"护理志向的起点","sentences":[{"en":"Her interest in nursing began when our grandmother spent several days in hospital.","zh":"我们祖母住院几天的那次经历，让她开始对护理产生了兴趣。"},{"en":"Sara noticed that the nurses did much more than check equipment.","zh":"萨拉注意到，护士做的远不只是检查设备。"},{"en":"They explained what was happening and helped our grandmother feel less anxious.","zh":"她们会解释当时的情况，还帮助我们祖母减轻焦虑。"},{"en":"She said she wanted a job where her work could make a practical difference to someone's day.","zh":"她说，她想找一份工作，能实实在在地让别人的一天过得更好一些。"}]},{"source":"To explore the idea, she volunteered at a community health event last summer. Her role was simple: welcoming visitors, showing them where to queue and helping them complete basic forms. She didn't provide medical treatment. One older visitor was confused about the registration process, and Sara patiently explained each step. Afterwards, she told me that she had enjoyed helping him feel comfortable.","heading":"志愿体验","sentences":[{"en":"To explore the idea, she volunteered at a community health event last summer.","zh":"为了进一步了解这个想法，去年夏天她在一场社区健康活动中做了志愿者。"},{"en":"Her role was simple: welcoming visitors, showing them where to queue and helping them complete basic forms.","zh":"她的工作很简单：接待来访者，告诉他们在哪里排队，再帮他们填写一些基本表格。"},{"en":"She didn't provide medical treatment.","zh":"她没有提供医疗治疗。"},{"en":"One older visitor was confused about the registration process, and Sara patiently explained each step.","zh":"一位年纪较大的来访者不太明白登记流程，Sara 就耐心地解释了每一步。"},{"en":"Afterwards, she told me that she had enjoyed helping him feel comfortable.","zh":"事后，她告诉我，能帮助他感到自在，她很开心。"}]},{"source":"Her plan is to apply for a nursing course, improve her science knowledge and keep volunteering when she can. She knows the work can involve long shifts and difficult situations, so she doesn't see it as an easy career. I admire her because her ambition is based on real interest and some first-hand experience, rather than just the title.","heading":"踏实规划护理路","sentences":[{"en":"Her plan is to apply for a nursing course, improve her science knowledge and keep volunteering when she can.","zh":"她打算申请护理课程，补充自己的科学知识，并在有时间的时候继续做志愿者。"},{"en":"She knows the work can involve long shifts and difficult situations, so she doesn't see it as an easy career.","zh":"她知道，这份工作可能要长时间轮班，也会遇到棘手的情况，所以她并不觉得这是个轻松的职业。"},{"en":"I admire her because her ambition is based on real interest and some first-hand experience, rather than just the title.","zh":"我佩服她，因为她的志向来自真实的兴趣和一些亲身经历，而不只是冲着护士这个身份。","skeleton":"I admire her because her ambition is based on ..., rather than just the title."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I admire her because her ambition is based on real interest and some first-hand experience, rather than just the title.","method":"把句子记成“我佩服她，因为志向源于兴趣和经历”，再用rather than排除“只看职业称号”。"}},"M11":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to talk about Lei Jun, the co-founder of Xiaomi. He's a well-known Chinese entrepreneur, but I feel a particular connection with him. We come from the same part of China, and we both studied at Wuhan University. That gives me a personal reason to pay attention to him, beyond simply recognising his name.","heading":"与雷军的渊源","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to talk about Lei Jun, the co-founder of Xiaomi.","zh":"我想聊聊小米的联合创始人雷军。"},{"en":"He's a well-known Chinese entrepreneur, but I feel a particular connection with him.","zh":"他是一位知名的中国企业家，但我觉得自己和他之间有一种特别的联系。"},{"en":"We come from the same part of China, and we both studied at Wuhan University.","zh":"我们来自中国的同一个地区，也都在武汉大学读过书。"},{"en":"That gives me a personal reason to pay attention to him, beyond simply recognising his name.","zh":"所以，我关注他有一个与自己有关的原因，并不只是因为听过他的名字。"}]},{"source":"He co-founded Xiaomi in 2010, and the company became known for its smartphones and other technology products. What interests me is the journey from having an idea to building something that ordinary people actually use. I think that requires more than technical knowledge; it also takes teamwork and an understanding of customers.","heading":"创业历程","sentences":[{"en":"He co-founded Xiaomi in 2010, and the company became known for its smartphones and other technology products.","zh":"他在二〇一〇年参与创办了小米，公司后来因智能手机和其他科技产品而出名。"},{"en":"What interests me is the journey from having an idea to building something that ordinary people actually use.","zh":"让我感兴趣的是这个过程：从有一个想法，到做出普通人真正会用的东西。"},{"en":"I think that requires more than technical knowledge; it also takes teamwork and an understanding of customers.","zh":"我觉得这需要的不只是技术知识，还需要团队合作和对客户的了解。"}]},{"source":"His career wasn't a straight line. In an account of his university years, he described an early business that eventually closed. He realised that technical ability alone wasn't enough to run a company. I find that experience encouraging because it shows that a disappointing start doesn't have to decide the rest of your career.","heading":"创业并非一路顺利","sentences":[{"en":"His career wasn't a straight line.","zh":"他的职业发展并不是一路顺顺当当的。"},{"en":"In an account of his university years, he described an early business that eventually closed.","zh":"在一次讲述大学经历时，他提到自己早期做过的一门生意，后来最终关门了。"},{"en":"He realised that technical ability alone wasn't enough to run a company.","zh":"他意识到，经营一家公司，光有技术能力是不够的。"},{"en":"I find that experience encouraging because it shows that a disappointing start doesn't have to decide the rest of your career.","zh":"我觉得这段经历很鼓舞人，因为它说明，开头不顺利，并不一定会决定你之后整个职业生涯的发展。","skeleton":"I find that experience encouraging because ... a disappointing start doesn't have to decide ..."}]},{"source":"What interests me most is how he built his wealth. As someone from my home region and a fellow university alumnus, he feels quite relatable to me. If I could meet him, I'd ask how he made his first significant amount of money and which decision contributed most to his financial success. I'd also like to know what he would do if he had to start again with very little money.","heading":"财富之路","sentences":[{"en":"What interests me most is how he built his wealth.","zh":"我最感兴趣的是他如何积累起财富。"},{"en":"As someone from my home region and a fellow university alumnus, he feels quite relatable to me.","zh":"他和我来自同一片地区，又是大学校友，所以我觉得挺有亲近感。"},{"en":"If I could meet him, I'd ask how he made his first significant amount of money and which decision contributed most to his financial success.","zh":"如果能见到他，我会问他是怎样赚到第一笔可观的钱，以及哪个决定对他的财务成功贡献最大。","skeleton":"If I could meet him, I'd ask how he made ... and which decision contributed most to his financial success."},{"en":"I'd also like to know what he would do if he had to start again with very little money.","zh":"我也想知道，如果他必须从头再来，而且手头只有很少的钱，他会怎么做。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"If I could meet him, I'd ask how he made his first significant amount of money and which decision contributed most to his financial success.","method":"先记 If I could meet him, I'd ask，再按 how 问第一笔钱、which 问关键决定这两个问题顺序展开。"}},"M12":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to talk about my friend Alex, who runs a small coffee shop near a residential area. I met him through a mutual friend a few years ago. Since then, I've visited his shop fairly often, usually on a Saturday morning.","heading":"朋友的小咖啡店","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to talk about my friend Alex, who runs a small coffee shop near a residential area.","zh":"我想聊聊我的朋友 Alex，他在一个住宅区附近经营着一家小咖啡店。"},{"en":"I met him through a mutual friend a few years ago.","zh":"几年前，我通过一位共同的朋友认识了他。"},{"en":"Since then, I've visited his shop fairly often, usually on a Saturday morning.","zh":"从那以后，我就经常去他的店，通常是在星期六上午。"}]},{"source":"When he first opened it, the business was difficult. There weren't many customers in the morning, and some food was left unsold at the end of each day. Instead of immediately spending more money on advertising, he asked regular customers what they wanted and checked which items actually sold.","heading":"开店遇难","sentences":[{"en":"When he first opened it, the business was difficult.","zh":"他刚开店的时候，生意很不好做。"},{"en":"There weren't many customers in the morning, and some food was left unsold at the end of each day.","zh":"早上的顾客不多，每天结束时也会有一些食物没卖出去。"},{"en":"Instead of immediately spending more money on advertising, he asked regular customers what they wanted and checked which items actually sold.","zh":"他没有马上花更多钱做广告，而是问常客想要什么，并查看哪些东西确实卖得出去。","skeleton":"Instead of immediately spending more money on advertising, he asked regular customers ... and checked ..."}]},{"source":"He reduced the menu to a few reliable choices, prepared smaller batches and introduced a simple breakfast combination. He also created a quiet corner where customers could read or work. Gradually, people started coming back. What I like most is the service: he remembers regular customers' orders and deals with problems politely. Once, my coffee arrived cold, and he replaced it without making the situation awkward.","heading":"调整经营","sentences":[{"en":"He reduced the menu to a few reliable choices, prepared smaller batches and introduced a simple breakfast combination.","zh":"他把菜单缩减为几个比较稳妥的选择，每次准备少一些，还推出了一个简单的早餐组合。","skeleton":"He reduced the menu ..., prepared smaller batches and introduced a simple breakfast combination."},{"en":"He also created a quiet corner where customers could read or work.","zh":"他还布置了一个安静的角落，让顾客可以阅读或工作。"},{"en":"Gradually, people started coming back.","zh":"慢慢地，大家开始再次光顾。"},{"en":"What I like most is the service: he remembers regular customers' orders and deals with problems politely.","zh":"我最喜欢的是那里的服务：他记得常客通常点什么，也会礼貌地处理问题。"},{"en":"Once, my coffee arrived cold, and he replaced it without making the situation awkward.","zh":"有一次，我的咖啡送来时已经冷了，他直接给我换了一杯，没有让场面变得尴尬。"}]},{"source":"I think the shop succeeds because he understands his customers and pays attention to everyday details. He keeps a clear stock list and gives his team sensible tasks, but he's also friendly and enjoys chatting with people. I'm pleased to see his hard work paying off. His experience reminds me that running a good business often depends on steady improvements, rather than one dramatic idea.","heading":"生意成功的原因","sentences":[{"en":"I think the shop succeeds because he understands his customers and pays attention to everyday details.","zh":"我觉得这家店能成功，是因为他了解顾客，也注意日常经营中的细节。"},{"en":"He keeps a clear stock list and gives his team sensible tasks, but he's also friendly and enjoys chatting with people.","zh":"他的库存清单很清楚，给团队安排的任务也很合理，而且他很友善，喜欢和人聊天。","skeleton":"He keeps ... and gives ..., but he's also friendly and enjoys chatting ..."},{"en":"I'm pleased to see his hard work paying off.","zh":"看到他的努力有了回报，我很高兴。"},{"en":"His experience reminds me that running a good business often depends on steady improvements, rather than one dramatic idea.","zh":"他的经历让我想到，经营好一家生意，往往靠的是不断稳步改进，而不是一个惊天动地的点子。","skeleton":"His experience reminds me that running a good business often depends on steady improvements, rather than ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"Instead of immediately spending more money on advertising, he asked regular customers what they wanted and checked which items actually sold.","method":"先记 Instead of 后面省下广告钱的做法，再用 asked 和 checked 记他实际做的问顾客与查销量两步。"}},"M13":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to talk about Roger Federer, the retired Swiss tennis player. I first became interested in him when I watched some of his matches on television as a student. I didn't understand every rule, but I could tell that his movement and timing were special.","heading":"关注网球名将","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to talk about Roger Federer, the retired Swiss tennis player.","zh":"我想聊聊罗杰·费德勒，这位已经退役的瑞士网球运动员。"},{"en":"I first became interested in him when I watched some of his matches on television as a student.","zh":"我还是学生时，在电视上看过他的几场比赛，从那时开始对他产生了兴趣。"},{"en":"I didn't understand every rule, but I could tell that his movement and timing were special.","zh":"我当时并不是每条规则都懂，但能看出他的移动和时机把握很不一般。"}]},{"source":"He finished his career with twenty Grand Slam singles titles, including eight Wimbledon titles. What I admire most, though, is the way he makes a difficult sport look natural. His movements seem smooth, and watching him has made me appreciate the importance of technique.","heading":"钦佩球技","sentences":[{"en":"He finished his career with twenty Grand Slam singles titles, including eight Wimbledon titles.","zh":"他的职业生涯结束时，共获得了二十个大满贯单打冠军，其中包括八个温网冠军。"},{"en":"What I admire most, though, is the way he makes a difficult sport look natural.","zh":"不过，我最佩服的是，他能把一项很难的运动打得那么自然。"},{"en":"His movements seem smooth, and watching him has made me appreciate the importance of technique.","zh":"他的动作看起来很流畅，看他比赛也让我更能体会到技术的重要性。"}]},{"source":"One part of his career that really impressed me was his return after injury. He missed the second half of the 2016 season because of a knee problem. Then, in 2017, he came back and won both the Australian Open and Wimbledon. To me, that is a powerful example of recovering from a setback.","heading":"伤后回归","sentences":[{"en":"One part of his career that really impressed me was his return after injury.","zh":"他职业生涯中，让我特别印象深刻的一段，是受伤之后的回归。"},{"en":"He missed the second half of the 2016 season because of a knee problem.","zh":"因为膝盖出了问题，他缺席了二〇一六赛季的后半段。"},{"en":"Then, in 2017, he came back and won both the Australian Open and Wimbledon.","zh":"随后在二〇一七年，他重返赛场，赢得了澳网和温网两个冠军。"},{"en":"To me, that is a powerful example of recovering from a setback.","zh":"在我看来，这是一个从挫折中恢复过来的有力例子。"}]},{"source":"I also like the fact that I can learn something from his story without becoming a professional athlete. When I'm struggling with a new skill, I sometimes expect results too quickly. Thinking about his comeback reminds me to be patient, work on the basics and give myself time. That's why I admire him as both a sportsman and an example of persistence.","heading":"复出带来的启发","sentences":[{"en":"I also like the fact that I can learn something from his story without becoming a professional athlete.","zh":"我还喜欢的一点是，即使我不成为职业运动员，也能从他的故事里学到东西。"},{"en":"When I'm struggling with a new skill, I sometimes expect results too quickly.","zh":"学习一项新技能遇到困难时，我有时会太急着看到成果。"},{"en":"Thinking about his comeback reminds me to be patient, work on the basics and give myself time.","zh":"想到他复出的经历，就会提醒我耐心一点，练好基础，也给自己一些时间。"},{"en":"That's why I admire him as both a sportsman and an example of persistence.","zh":"所以我钦佩他，不仅因为他是一名运动员，也因为他体现了坚持不懈的精神。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I first became interested in him when I watched some of his matches on television as a student.","method":"以“我开始对他感兴趣”为主线，用when补“看比赛的时候”，再补“当时还是学生”。"}},"M14":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"An animal story I remember clearly is The Tortoise and the Hare. It's a short fable associated with Aesop, and I first heard it from my father when I was in primary school. Later, I read an illustrated version myself, which made me feel quite proud.","heading":"初听龟兔赛跑","sentences":[{"en":"An animal story I remember clearly is The Tortoise and the Hare.","zh":"我记得很清楚的一个动物故事是《龟兔赛跑》。"},{"en":"It's a short fable associated with Aesop, and I first heard it from my father when I was in primary school.","zh":"这是一个与伊索有关的短篇寓言，我第一次听到它，是上小学时爸爸讲给我的。"},{"en":"Later, I read an illustrated version myself, which made me feel quite proud.","zh":"后来，我自己读了一个插图版，当时觉得挺自豪的。"}]},{"source":"The story is about a race between two very different animals. The hare is fast and confident, while the tortoise moves slowly. Because the hare thinks winning will be easy, he stops for a nap. The tortoise keeps going and reaches the finish before him.","heading":"龟兔比赛经过","sentences":[{"en":"The story is about a race between two very different animals.","zh":"这个故事讲的是两只很不一样的动物之间的一场比赛。"},{"en":"The hare is fast and confident, while the tortoise moves slowly.","zh":"兔子跑得快，也很有信心，而乌龟走得慢。"},{"en":"Because the hare thinks winning will be easy, he stops for a nap.","zh":"兔子觉得赢得比赛很容易，就停下来睡了一觉。"},{"en":"The tortoise keeps going and reaches the finish before him.","zh":"乌龟一直往前走，比兔子先到达了终点。"}]},{"source":"As a child, I found the ending funny and surprising. At the beginning, I was certain that the hare would win, so I wanted to turn the pages quickly. I also liked the pictures because they helped me understand what was happening without needing an adult to explain every sentence.","heading":"童年读故事","sentences":[{"en":"As a child, I found the ending funny and surprising.","zh":"小时候，我觉得这个结局又好笑又出人意料。"},{"en":"At the beginning, I was certain that the hare would win, so I wanted to turn the pages quickly.","zh":"一开始，我很确定兔子会赢，所以很想赶紧往后翻。"},{"en":"I also liked the pictures because they helped me understand what was happening without needing an adult to explain every sentence.","zh":"我也喜欢里面的插图，因为不用大人逐句解释，它们就能帮我看懂发生了什么。","skeleton":"I also liked the pictures because they helped me understand ... without needing an adult to explain every sentence."}]},{"source":"The lesson has stayed with me: steady effort matters, and being good at something doesn't mean you can stop trying. I think of it when I'm learning a skill and comparing myself with people who improve faster. The story reminds me to focus on my own progress. It's simple, but that's probably why I still remember it after so many years.","heading":"坚持比天赋重要","sentences":[{"en":"The lesson has stayed with me: steady effort matters, and being good at something doesn't mean you can stop trying.","zh":"这个道理我一直记着：持续努力很重要，擅长一件事也不意味着你就可以不再努力。","skeleton":"The lesson has stayed with me: ... being good at something doesn't mean you can stop trying."},{"en":"I think of it when I'm learning a skill and comparing myself with people who improve faster.","zh":"每当我学习一项技能，又拿自己和进步更快的人比较时，我就会想到这个故事。"},{"en":"The story reminds me to focus on my own progress.","zh":"这个故事提醒我要关注自己的进步。"},{"en":"It's simple, but that's probably why I still remember it after so many years.","zh":"它很简单，但也许正因为如此，这么多年以后我仍然记得它。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I also liked the pictures because they helped me understand what was happening without needing an adult to explain every sentence.","method":"先说喜欢插图，再用 because 解释帮助看懂故事，最后用 without needing 补上不需要大人逐句解释。"}},"M15":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"An existing rule I think is useful is Shanghai's household waste sorting rule. Shanghai is a city in China, and sorting household rubbish has been legally required there since the first of July, 2019. I'm talking about a local rule in Shanghai, rather than one identical rule for the whole country.","heading":"上海垃圾分类","sentences":[{"en":"An existing rule I think is useful is Shanghai's household waste sorting rule.","zh":"我觉得一项很有用的现行规定，是上海的生活垃圾分类规定。"},{"en":"Shanghai is a city in China, and sorting household rubbish has been legally required there since the first of July, 2019.","zh":"上海是中国的一座城市，从2019年7月1日起，那里依法要求居民对生活垃圾进行分类。","skeleton":"Shanghai is a city in China, and sorting household rubbish has been legally required there since ..."},{"en":"I'm talking about a local rule in Shanghai, rather than one identical rule for the whole country.","zh":"我说的是上海的一项地方规定，并不是全国都完全一样的一项规定。"}]},{"source":"The system separates household waste into four categories: recyclables, hazardous waste, wet waste and dry waste. For example, food leftovers belong with wet waste, while materials that can be recycled should go into the appropriate recycling bin. Hazardous items need to be handled separately.","heading":"四类垃圾处理","sentences":[{"en":"The system separates household waste into four categories: recyclables, hazardous waste, wet waste and dry waste.","zh":"这套分类制度把生活垃圾分成四类：可回收物、有害垃圾、湿垃圾和干垃圾。","skeleton":"The system separates household waste into four categories: ..."},{"en":"For example, food leftovers belong with wet waste, while materials that can be recycled should go into the appropriate recycling bin.","zh":"比如，剩饭剩菜属于湿垃圾，而可以回收的材料应该放进相应的回收桶里。","skeleton":"For example, food leftovers belong with wet waste, while materials ... should go into ..."},{"en":"Hazardous items need to be handled separately.","zh":"有害物品需要单独处理。"}]},{"source":"I became more aware of this rule during a visit to relatives in Shanghai. In their kitchen, they kept separate containers and checked the labels before throwing things away. At first, I found it a little confusing, especially when an item contained different materials. After a few days, though, the basic routine felt much easier.","heading":"逐渐习惯分类","sentences":[{"en":"I became more aware of this rule during a visit to relatives in Shanghai.","zh":"有一次去上海探望亲戚时，我对这项规定有了更多了解。"},{"en":"In their kitchen, they kept separate containers and checked the labels before throwing things away.","zh":"他们在厨房里放了不同的垃圾容器，扔东西前会先看标签。"},{"en":"At first, I found it a little confusing, especially when an item contained different materials.","zh":"刚开始，我觉得有点搞不清楚，尤其是一样东西里含有不同材料的时候。"},{"en":"After a few days, though, the basic routine felt much easier.","zh":"不过，过了几天后，这些基本操作就觉得容易多了。"}]},{"source":"I support the idea because it encourages people to think about what happens after they throw something away. However, I think clear signs and convenient collection points are essential. People are more likely to follow a rule when they understand it and can fit it into their daily routine. For me, good environmental rules need practical support as well as expectations.","heading":"规定需要配套","sentences":[{"en":"I support the idea because it encourages people to think about what happens after they throw something away.","zh":"我支持这个做法，因为它会鼓励人们去想，东西扔掉之后会怎样。"},{"en":"However, I think clear signs and convenient collection points are essential.","zh":"不过，我觉得清楚的标识和方便的收集点必不可少。"},{"en":"People are more likely to follow a rule when they understand it and can fit it into their daily routine.","zh":"当人们理解一项规定，又能把它融入日常生活时，就更有可能遵守它。"},{"en":"For me, good environmental rules need practical support as well as expectations.","zh":"对我来说，好的环保规定除了提出要求，也需要实际的配套支持。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"For example, food leftovers belong with wet waste, while materials that can be recycled should go into the appropriate recycling bin.","method":"先记“剩饭剩菜归湿垃圾”，再用while对照“可回收材料进相应回收桶”，把两类投放方式分开记。"}},"M16":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A piece of local news I found encouraging was about improvements to Dubai's bus network. I read an RTA announcement in September 2026 after a friend shared the link. The announcement itself was published on the sixth of January, so I was discovering an earlier development rather than reading about something launched that week.","heading":"读到公交新消息","sentences":[{"en":"A piece of local news I found encouraging was about improvements to Dubai's bus network.","zh":"有一条当地新闻让我觉得很振奋，讲的是迪拜公交网络的改善。"},{"en":"I read an RTA announcement in September 2026 after a friend shared the link.","zh":"2026年9月，一位朋友分享了链接，我读到了迪拜道路与交通管理局的一则公告。"},{"en":"The announcement itself was published on the sixth of January, so I was discovering an earlier development rather than reading about something launched that week.","zh":"公告本身是在1月6日发布的，所以我了解到的是之前已经发生的变化，而不是那一周刚推出的新措施。","skeleton":"The announcement itself was published ..., so I was discovering an earlier development rather than reading about ..."}]},{"source":"According to the announcement, four new public bus routes were scheduled to start operating on the ninth of January. RTA also announced improvements to more than seventy existing internal routes, including changes to route coverage and services during busy periods. The aim was to make everyday travel more convenient.","heading":"公交新安排","sentences":[{"en":"According to the announcement, four new public bus routes were scheduled to start operating on the ninth of January.","zh":"根据公告，四条新的公共公交线路计划于一月九日开始运营。","skeleton":"According to the announcement, four new public bus routes were scheduled to start operating ..."},{"en":"RTA also announced improvements to more than seventy existing internal routes, including changes to route coverage and services during busy periods.","zh":"迪拜道路与交通管理局还宣布，要对七十多条现有的市内线路进行优化，包括调整线路覆盖范围和繁忙时段的服务。","skeleton":"RTA also announced improvements to ... existing internal routes, including changes to route coverage and services ..."},{"en":"The aim was to make everyday travel more convenient.","zh":"目的是让日常出行更方便。"}]},{"source":"This caught my attention because I live in Dubai and sometimes use public transport. I don't use every route mentioned, so I can't say that the changes directly shortened my own commute. Still, better connections could make buses a more practical option for people travelling between neighbourhoods.","heading":"出行的意义","sentences":[{"en":"This caught my attention because I live in Dubai and sometimes use public transport.","zh":"这条消息引起了我的注意，因为我住在迪拜，有时也会乘坐公共交通。"},{"en":"I don't use every route mentioned, so I can't say that the changes directly shortened my own commute.","zh":"公告里提到的线路，我并不是每一条都坐，所以不能说这些变化直接缩短了我自己的通勤时间。"},{"en":"Still, better connections could make buses a more practical option for people travelling between neighbourhoods.","zh":"不过，更好的线路衔接可能会让公交车成为来往于不同社区的人更实用的选择。","skeleton":"Still, better connections could make buses a more practical option for people ..."}]},{"source":"After reading the article, I checked whether any of the routes were relevant to places I visit. I also sent the link back to my friend with a short comment saying that this was the kind of local news I liked: a practical improvement that could affect ordinary daily life. It made me feel positive about the city, and I would like to see the network continue to improve.","heading":"实用新闻的影响","sentences":[{"en":"After reading the article, I checked whether any of the routes were relevant to places I visit.","zh":"读完文章后，我查了一下这些线路里有没有哪条能到我常去的地方。"},{"en":"I also sent the link back to my friend with a short comment saying that this was the kind of local news I liked: a practical improvement that could affect ordinary daily life.","zh":"我还把链接回发给朋友，附了一句简短的评论，说这正是我喜欢的本地新闻：切实的改善，能影响普通人的日常生活。","skeleton":"I also sent the link back ... with a short comment saying that this was the kind of local news I liked: ..."},{"en":"It made me feel positive about the city, and I would like to see the network continue to improve.","zh":"这让我对这座城市更有好感，我也希望看到公交网络继续改善。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I also sent the link back to my friend with a short comment saying that this was the kind of local news I liked: a practical improvement that could affect ordinary daily life.","method":"先记“回发链接并附评论”，接 saying that 说明喜欢这类新闻，最后用冒号补“能影响日常生活的实际改善”。"}},"M17":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to describe West Lake in Hangzhou, a city in Zhejiang Province in eastern China. I visited it with a friend during a short holiday last year. We had a busy few weeks before the trip, so we wanted somewhere we could explore without rushing.","heading":"西湖之旅","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to describe West Lake in Hangzhou, a city in Zhejiang Province in eastern China.","zh":"我想介绍一下杭州的西湖，杭州是中国东部浙江省的一座城市。"},{"en":"I visited it with a friend during a short holiday last year.","zh":"去年短假期间，我和一位朋友去过那里。"},{"en":"We had a busy few weeks before the trip, so we wanted somewhere we could explore without rushing.","zh":"出发前的几周我们很忙，所以想找个可以慢慢逛、不用赶时间的地方。"}]},{"source":"We spent an afternoon walking along the paths beside the lake. What I remember most is the space around the water. There were trees beside the path, and we could stop whenever we noticed a view we liked. I took a few photos, but I also put my phone away for part of the walk.","heading":"沿着湖边慢行","sentences":[{"en":"We spent an afternoon walking along the paths beside the lake.","zh":"我们花了一个下午，沿着湖边的小路散步。"},{"en":"What I remember most is the space around the water.","zh":"我印象最深的是水边的那片空间。"},{"en":"There were trees beside the path, and we could stop whenever we noticed a view we liked.","zh":"小路旁边有树，每当看到喜欢的景色，我们就可以停下来。"},{"en":"I took a few photos, but I also put my phone away for part of the walk.","zh":"我拍了几张照片，不过散步途中也有一段时间把手机收了起来。"}]},{"source":"At one point, we sat down and watched the light change on the water. We talked about ordinary things and didn't feel that we had to keep moving to another attraction. Afterwards, we found somewhere nearby to have a simple meal.","heading":"湖边闲坐","sentences":[{"en":"At one point, we sat down and watched the light change on the water.","zh":"途中我们坐下来，看着水面上的光线变化。"},{"en":"We talked about ordinary things and didn't feel that we had to keep moving to another attraction.","zh":"我们聊些日常小事，也没觉得非得一直赶去下一个景点。"},{"en":"Afterwards, we found somewhere nearby to have a simple meal.","zh":"之后，我们在附近找了个地方，简单吃了顿饭。"}]},{"source":"For me, the lake is important because it gives people a place to enjoy being outdoors while visiting a city. I liked the balance between walking, looking around and having time to talk.","heading":"湖畔的价值","sentences":[{"en":"For me, the lake is important because it gives people a place to enjoy being outdoors while visiting a city.","zh":"对我来说，这个湖很重要，因为它让人们在游览一座城市的同时，也有地方可以享受户外时光。"},{"en":"I liked the balance between walking, looking around and having time to talk.","zh":"我喜欢那种平衡：既能走走看看，又有时间聊天。"}]},{"source":"I'd happily go back, especially with someone who enjoys a slower kind of holiday. Next time, I'd leave more time to explore Hangzhou beyond the lake, rather than trying to fit everything into one afternoon.","heading":"再次游览杭州","sentences":[{"en":"I'd happily go back, especially with someone who enjoys a slower kind of holiday.","zh":"我很愿意再去一次，尤其想和喜欢慢节奏度假的人一起去。"},{"en":"Next time, I'd leave more time to explore Hangzhou beyond the lake, rather than trying to fit everything into one afternoon.","zh":"下次，我会多留些时间，去看看西湖以外的杭州，而不是试着把所有行程都塞进一个下午。","skeleton":"I'd leave more time to explore Hangzhou ..., rather than trying to fit everything ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"Next time, I'd leave more time to explore Hangzhou beyond the lake, rather than trying to fit everything into one afternoon.","method":"按“下次—多留时间—探索湖外杭州”记主线，再用 rather than 接“不把一切塞进一个下午”。"}},"M18":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A natural place I enjoy visiting is Sunset Beach in Dubai. I went there with a friend one evening a few months ago, after a week when we had both spent too much time indoors. We wanted a short break without planning a whole day out.","heading":"海边短休","sentences":[{"en":"A natural place I enjoy visiting is Sunset Beach in Dubai.","zh":"我喜欢去的一处自然场所，是迪拜的日落海滩。"},{"en":"I went there with a friend one evening a few months ago, after a week when we had both spent too much time indoors.","zh":"几个月前的一个傍晚，我和朋友去了那里，那之前的一周，我们两个在室内待的时间都太长了。","skeleton":"I went there with a friend one evening a few months ago, after a week ..."},{"en":"We wanted a short break without planning a whole day out.","zh":"我们想短暂放松一下，又不想安排一整天的外出活动。"}]},{"source":"We walked along the sand and then found a place to sit away from the busier part of the beach. It wasn't completely silent, but I could hear the waves more clearly than the conversations around us. There was a light breeze, which made sitting outside comfortable.","heading":"海边散步与微风","sentences":[{"en":"We walked along the sand and then found a place to sit away from the busier part of the beach.","zh":"我们沿着沙滩走了一会儿，然后找了个远离海滩热闹区域的地方坐下。"},{"en":"It wasn't completely silent, but I could hear the waves more clearly than the conversations around us.","zh":"那里并不是完全安静，但比起周围的交谈声，我能更清楚地听到海浪声。"},{"en":"There was a light breeze, which made sitting outside comfortable.","zh":"有一点微风，坐在外面很舒服。"}]},{"source":"The most memorable part was the sky. At first, it was quite bright, but later the colours became softer. I noticed shades of orange near the horizon, with a little pink above them. We took a photograph, although it didn't quite capture what we could see.","heading":"天空渐变的颜色","sentences":[{"en":"The most memorable part was the sky.","zh":"最让我难忘的是天空。"},{"en":"At first, it was quite bright, but later the colours became softer.","zh":"起初，天空还很明亮，后来颜色渐渐柔和下来。"},{"en":"I noticed shades of orange near the horizon, with a little pink above them.","zh":"我看到地平线附近有深浅不同的橙色，上方还有一点粉色。"},{"en":"We took a photograph, although it didn't quite capture what we could see.","zh":"我们拍了一张照片，但它没能完全拍出眼前看到的景象。"}]},{"source":"For a while, we stopped talking and simply watched the water. I normally feel that I should be checking a message or finishing something, so it was pleasant to have no particular task.","heading":"暂时放下任务","sentences":[{"en":"For a while, we stopped talking and simply watched the water.","zh":"有一会儿，我们没有说话，只是看着水面。"},{"en":"I normally feel that I should be checking a message or finishing something, so it was pleasant to have no particular task.","zh":"平时我总觉得自己应该查看消息，或者做完什么事情，所以那时没有任何特定的任务，感觉很舒服。","skeleton":"I normally feel that I should be ..., so it was pleasant to have no particular task."}]},{"source":"I left feeling calmer. What I liked wasn't an expensive activity or a special event. It was the chance to slow down and pay attention to something outside my usual routine. I'd go back when I needed a similar break.","heading":"放慢脚步休息","sentences":[{"en":"I left feeling calmer.","zh":"离开时，我的心情平静了不少。"},{"en":"What I liked wasn't an expensive activity or a special event.","zh":"我喜欢的并不是什么昂贵的活动，也不是什么特别的事件。"},{"en":"It was the chance to slow down and pay attention to something outside my usual routine.","zh":"我喜欢的是这个机会，可以慢下来，留意一些平时生活之外的东西。"},{"en":"I'd go back when I needed a similar break.","zh":"当我需要同样的放松时，还会再去。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I normally feel that I should be checking a message or finishing something, so it was pleasant to have no particular task.","method":"把前半句的“看消息或完成事情”作为平时习惯，再用 so 连接“没有任务很舒服”的结果。"}},"M19":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A public building I'd like to describe is Mohammed Bin Rashid Library in Dubai. It stands beside Dubai Creek, and its design is inspired by a traditional book rest. The library has seven levels, but what first caught my attention was its unusual shape rather than its height.","heading":"图书馆独特外形","sentences":[{"en":"A public building I'd like to describe is Mohammed Bin Rashid Library in Dubai.","zh":"我想介绍的一座公共建筑是迪拜的穆罕默德·本·拉希德图书馆。"},{"en":"It stands beside Dubai Creek, and its design is inspired by a traditional book rest.","zh":"它位于迪拜河畔，设计灵感来自一种传统的书托。"},{"en":"The library has seven levels, but what first caught my attention was its unusual shape rather than its height.","zh":"这座图书馆有七层，不过最先吸引我的，是它独特的外形，而不是它的高度。"}]},{"source":"I visited it one afternoon after a friend suggested going somewhere different from our usual cafés. Before that visit, I had seen photographs of the building, but I wanted to understand what it was like to spend time there.","heading":"初访图书馆","sentences":[{"en":"I visited it one afternoon after a friend suggested going somewhere different from our usual cafés.","zh":"一位朋友提议去个和平常那些咖啡馆不一样的地方，于是一个下午我去了那里。"},{"en":"Before that visit, I had seen photographs of the building, but I wanted to understand what it was like to spend time there.","zh":"去之前，我看过这座建筑的照片，但想了解一下真的在里面待着是什么感觉。","skeleton":"Before that visit, I had seen photographs of the building, but I wanted to understand ..."}]},{"source":"We looked around and then found somewhere to sit and read. I chose a book in English and spent some time working through a few pages. I didn't understand every word, but the setting helped me stay focused instead of moving between different things on my phone.","heading":"图书馆里专注","sentences":[{"en":"We looked around and then found somewhere to sit and read.","zh":"我们先四处看了看，然后找了个地方坐下来读书。"},{"en":"I chose a book in English and spent some time working through a few pages.","zh":"我选了一本英文书，花了些时间慢慢读了几页。"},{"en":"I didn't understand every word, but the setting helped me stay focused instead of moving between different things on my phone.","zh":"我并不是每个词都认识，但那里的环境帮我保持专注，不会在手机上不断切换着看各种东西。","skeleton":"I didn't understand every word, but the setting helped me stay focused instead of ..."}]},{"source":"What I appreciated most was that the visit had a clear purpose without feeling rushed. I could read, notice the building and take a short break from work. It felt different from being in a shopping centre, where I often end up looking at things I don't need.","heading":"有目的的参观","sentences":[{"en":"What I appreciated most was that the visit had a clear purpose without feeling rushed.","zh":"我最喜欢的是，这次参观有明确的目的，却不会让人觉得很赶。"},{"en":"I could read, notice the building and take a short break from work.","zh":"我可以读读书，看看这座建筑，也能暂时从工作中休息一下。"},{"en":"It felt different from being in a shopping centre, where I often end up looking at things I don't need.","zh":"这和去购物中心的感觉不一样，在购物中心，我最后常常会看一些自己并不需要的东西。"}]},{"source":"I'd recommend it to someone interested in books or architecture. For me, a useful public building offers more than an interesting photograph. It gives people somewhere to learn and spend their time well.","heading":"公共建筑的价值","sentences":[{"en":"I'd recommend it to someone interested in books or architecture.","zh":"我会把这里推荐给对书籍或建筑感兴趣的人。"},{"en":"For me, a useful public building offers more than an interesting photograph.","zh":"对我来说，一座有用的公共建筑，提供的不只是拍一张有意思的照片的机会。"},{"en":"It gives people somewhere to learn and spend their time well.","zh":"它也给人们提供了一个可以学习、把时间过得有意义的地方。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I didn't understand every word, but the setting helped me stay focused instead of moving between different things on my phone.","method":"先说“不懂每个词”，再用but转到“环境帮我专注”，最后用instead of补“手机上来回切换”的对照。"}},"M20":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A home I enjoy visiting is my grandmother's house. I used to go there quite often when I was younger, and I still associate it with spending unhurried time with my family. It isn't a large or modern place, but it feels familiar to me.","heading":"熟悉的祖母家","sentences":[{"en":"A home I enjoy visiting is my grandmother's house.","zh":"我喜欢去拜访的一个家，是我祖母的家。"},{"en":"I used to go there quite often when I was younger, and I still associate it with spending unhurried time with my family.","zh":"小时候，我经常去那里，到现在我仍然一想到那里，就会想到和家人悠闲相处的时光。","skeleton":"I used to go there ..., and I still associate it with spending unhurried time with my family."},{"en":"It isn't a large or modern place, but it feels familiar to me.","zh":"那个地方不大，也不现代，但对我来说很熟悉。"}]},{"source":"The room I remember best is the living room. There is a comfortable sofa, a small table and some family photographs. My grandmother also looks after a few plants near the house. When I visit, we usually have something to drink and talk about what has happened since we last saw each other.","heading":"祖母家的客厅","sentences":[{"en":"The room I remember best is the living room.","zh":"我印象最深的房间是客厅。"},{"en":"There is a comfortable sofa, a small table and some family photographs.","zh":"那里有一张舒服的沙发、一张小桌子，还有一些家庭照片。"},{"en":"My grandmother also looks after a few plants near the house.","zh":"我祖母还照料着房子附近的几株植物。"},{"en":"When I visit, we usually have something to drink and talk about what has happened since we last saw each other.","zh":"我去看她时，我们通常会喝点东西，聊聊上次见面之后发生的事。","skeleton":"When I visit, we usually have something to drink and talk about what has happened since ..."}]},{"source":"On my last visit, I helped her with a small job and then stayed for lunch. Nothing especially exciting happened, but I enjoyed having time for an ordinary conversation. I didn't feel that I had to keep checking the time.","heading":"平常相处的快乐","sentences":[{"en":"On my last visit, I helped her with a small job and then stayed for lunch.","zh":"上次去她家，我帮她做了一点小事，然后留下来吃了午饭。"},{"en":"Nothing especially exciting happened, but I enjoyed having time for an ordinary conversation.","zh":"没有发生什么特别令人兴奋的事，但能有时间随意聊聊天，我就觉得很开心。"},{"en":"I didn't feel that I had to keep checking the time.","zh":"我没觉得自己需要不停地看时间。"}]},{"source":"Although I like visiting, I wouldn't choose to live there permanently. It is too far from the places I need to reach for work, and I'd prefer having my own space and routine. As an adult, I moved into an apartment closer to work, which suited my daily life better.","heading":"居住的选择","sentences":[{"en":"Although I like visiting, I wouldn't choose to live there permanently.","zh":"虽然我喜欢去那里做客，但不会选择长期住在那里。"},{"en":"It is too far from the places I need to reach for work, and I'd prefer having my own space and routine.","zh":"那里离我工作需要去的地方太远，而且我更希望有自己的空间和生活节奏。"},{"en":"As an adult, I moved into an apartment closer to work, which suited my daily life better.","zh":"成年后，我搬进了一套离工作地点更近的公寓，更适合我的日常生活。"}]},{"source":"So the house is special because of the person and memories connected with it. Enjoying a visit doesn't necessarily mean that it would be the right place for me to live.","heading":"喜欢未必要住","sentences":[{"en":"So the house is special because of the person and memories connected with it.","zh":"所以，这栋房子很特别，是因为与它有关的人和回忆。"},{"en":"Enjoying a visit doesn't necessarily mean that it would be the right place for me to live.","zh":"喜欢去那里做客，并不一定说明它适合我住。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I used to go there quite often when I was younger, and I still associate it with spending unhurried time with my family.","method":"按“小时候常去—现在仍联想到家人时光”记两个时间段，用 associate it with 接后面的回忆。"}},"M21":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A long-term goal I'd like to achieve is being able to use English comfortably in work and study. I understand a lot when I read, but I sometimes hesitate when explaining my own ideas. I want that gap to shrink.","heading":"自在使用英语","sentences":[{"en":"A long-term goal I'd like to achieve is being able to use English comfortably in work and study.","zh":"我想实现的一个长期目标，是在工作和学习中能轻松自如地使用英语。"},{"en":"I understand a lot when I read, but I sometimes hesitate when explaining my own ideas.","zh":"阅读时，我能理解很多内容，但有时候要解释自己的想法，还是会犹豫。"},{"en":"I want that gap to shrink.","zh":"我想缩小这种差距。"}]},{"source":"This matters because good ideas are less useful if I can't communicate them clearly. I'd like to take part in discussions, ask questions when something is unclear and explain a problem without worrying much about finding the perfect words.","heading":"清楚表达的意义","sentences":[{"en":"This matters because good ideas are less useful if I can't communicate them clearly.","zh":"这很重要，因为如果我不能把好点子说清楚，它们的作用就会打折扣。"},{"en":"I'd like to take part in discussions, ask questions when something is unclear and explain a problem without worrying much about finding the perfect words.","zh":"我希望能参与讨论，在有不明白的地方时提问，解释一个问题时也不用太担心找不到最恰当的词。","skeleton":"I'd like to take part in discussions, ask questions ... and explain a problem without worrying much ..."}]},{"source":"I've started with a simple routine. I choose a short question, record an answer and listen back. If a sentence is difficult to say, I try again with simpler language. I also read or listen to something useful and explain the main point in my own words.","heading":"英语练习法","sentences":[{"en":"I've started with a simple routine.","zh":"我先从一个简单的日常练习安排开始了。"},{"en":"I choose a short question, record an answer and listen back.","zh":"我选一个简短的问题，把答案录下来，再回放听一听。"},{"en":"If a sentence is difficult to say, I try again with simpler language.","zh":"如果某个句子说起来很难，我就换成更简单的表达再试一次。"},{"en":"I also read or listen to something useful and explain the main point in my own words.","zh":"我也会读或听一些有用的内容，再用自己的话讲出它的要点。"}]},{"source":"Some days feel easier than others. I don't expect every recording to be better than the previous one, but I can notice small changes, such as pausing less or giving a clearer example. That helps me continue when progress feels slow.","heading":"留意点滴进步","sentences":[{"en":"Some days feel easier than others.","zh":"有些日子会比其他日子轻松一些。"},{"en":"I don't expect every recording to be better than the previous one, but I can notice small changes, such as pausing less or giving a clearer example.","zh":"我并不指望每次录音都比上一次更好，但我能注意到一些小变化，比如停顿少了，或者举的例子更清楚了。","skeleton":"I don't expect every recording to be better ..., but I can notice small changes, such as ..."},{"en":"That helps me continue when progress feels slow.","zh":"当我觉得进步很慢时，这些变化能帮我坚持下去。"}]},{"source":"I would consider the goal achieved when I can express what I mean and follow a conversation more confidently. It isn't about using impressive words all the time. For me, it is about being able to communicate naturally and take part more fully.","heading":"目标的标准","sentences":[{"en":"I would consider the goal achieved when I can express what I mean and follow a conversation more confidently.","zh":"当我能更有信心地表达自己的意思，也能更有信心地听懂并跟上对话时，我就会觉得这个目标实现了。"},{"en":"It isn't about using impressive words all the time.","zh":"这并不是说，要一直使用让人觉得很厉害的词。"},{"en":"For me, it is about being able to communicate naturally and take part more fully.","zh":"对我来说，目标是能自然地交流，更充分地参与其中。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I'd like to take part in discussions, ask questions when something is unclear and explain a problem without worrying much about finding the perfect words.","method":"按“参与讨论—有疑问就问—解释问题”记三个并列动作，再给最后一个动作接 without worrying。"}},"M22":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A song that has special meaning for me is Happy Birthday to You. It is a familiar song, but I associate it with being remembered and spending time with people I care about. The meaning comes from the occasions rather than a recording.","heading":"生日歌意义","sentences":[{"en":"A song that has special meaning for me is Happy Birthday to You.","zh":"一首对我有特别意义的歌，是《祝你生日快乐》。"},{"en":"It is a familiar song, but I associate it with being remembered and spending time with people I care about.","zh":"这是一首大家都熟悉的歌，但我会把它和被人惦记、与在乎的人共度时光联系起来。"},{"en":"The meaning comes from the occasions rather than a recording.","zh":"它的意义来自那些场合，而不是某个录音版本。"}]},{"source":"One evening that stands out was a birthday dinner we arranged for a friend. We had kept the plan simple and met at a place that was convenient for everyone. Towards the end of the meal, someone brought out a cake and we sang.","heading":"生日晚餐唱歌","sentences":[{"en":"One evening that stands out was a birthday dinner we arranged for a friend.","zh":"有一个晚上让我印象很深，是我们给一位朋友安排生日晚餐的那次。"},{"en":"We had kept the plan simple and met at a place that was convenient for everyone.","zh":"我们的安排很简单，约在了一个大家去都方便的地方。"},{"en":"Towards the end of the meal, someone brought out a cake and we sang.","zh":"饭快吃完时，有人端出了蛋糕，我们就唱起了歌。"}]},{"source":"None of us was a particularly good singer, and we didn't all start at the same moment. However, that made the experience feel relaxed rather than embarrassing. Our friend looked surprised and then started smiling, which made me enjoy the song even more.","heading":"不完美的生日歌","sentences":[{"en":"None of us was a particularly good singer, and we didn't all start at the same moment.","zh":"我们都算不上唱歌特别好的人，开始唱的时候也没有完全同步。"},{"en":"However, that made the experience feel relaxed rather than embarrassing.","zh":"不过，这反而让整个过程显得轻松，而不是尴尬。"},{"en":"Our friend looked surprised and then started smiling, which made me enjoy the song even more.","zh":"我们的朋友先是一脸惊讶，然后笑了起来，这也让我唱这首歌时更开心了。"}]},{"source":"What I like about the tune is that it is easy to recognise and join in with. I don't need to concentrate on a complicated performance. I can simply take part and pay attention to the people around me.","heading":"容易参与的旋律","sentences":[{"en":"What I like about the tune is that it is easy to recognise and join in with.","zh":"我喜欢这首曲子的一点是，它很容易听出来，也很容易跟着一起唱。"},{"en":"I don't need to concentrate on a complicated performance.","zh":"我不用费心去完成什么复杂的表演。"},{"en":"I can simply take part and pay attention to the people around me.","zh":"我只要参与其中，关注身边的人就行了。"}]},{"source":"I wouldn't put the song on when I'm working or travelling. Still, hearing it at a celebration brings back warm memories. For me, it shows how even a simple piece of music can become meaningful through the experiences connected with it.","heading":"歌曲承载的回忆","sentences":[{"en":"I wouldn't put the song on when I'm working or travelling.","zh":"工作或出行时，我不会特意放这首歌。"},{"en":"Still, hearing it at a celebration brings back warm memories.","zh":"不过，在庆祝活动中听到它，会勾起温暖的回忆。"},{"en":"For me, it shows how even a simple piece of music can become meaningful through the experiences connected with it.","zh":"对我来说，它说明了，即使是一首简单的曲子，也能因为与它相关的经历而变得有意义。","skeleton":"For me, it shows how even a simple piece of music can become meaningful through ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"For me, it shows how even a simple piece of music can become meaningful through the experiences connected with it.","method":"先说 it shows how，再按“简单音乐—变得有意义—因为相关经历”串起来，用 through 连接最后一块。"}},"M23":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A piece of art I like is a watercolour painting of Dubai Creek that a friend gave me. He enjoys painting in his free time, and he made it after we spent an afternoon walking around the area.","heading":"朋友送的水彩画","sentences":[{"en":"A piece of art I like is a watercolour painting of Dubai Creek that a friend gave me.","zh":"我喜欢的一件艺术作品，是朋友送我的一幅迪拜河水彩画。"},{"en":"He enjoys painting in his free time, and he made it after we spent an afternoon walking around the area.","zh":"他平时喜欢在空闲时间画画，这幅画是在我们花了一下午在那一带散步之后画的。"}]},{"source":"The picture shows a boat on the water, with a row of buildings behind it. The walls are painted in warm, pale colours, while the water has different shades of blue. There are a few soft reflections, which make the scene feel calm rather than completely still.","heading":"水彩的画面","sentences":[{"en":"The picture shows a boat on the water, with a row of buildings behind it.","zh":"画里是一艘水上的船，船后面有一排建筑。"},{"en":"The walls are painted in warm, pale colours, while the water has different shades of blue.","zh":"墙面画成了温暖的浅色，水面则有不同深浅的蓝色。"},{"en":"There are a few soft reflections, which make the scene feel calm rather than completely still.","zh":"水上有几处柔和的倒影，让画面显得平静，却不是完全静止。"}]},{"source":"What caught my attention was that it didn't include every detail. My friend had left out things that weren't important to the scene. That made it easier to notice the boat, the light and the relationship between the colours.","heading":"删去的细节","sentences":[{"en":"What caught my attention was that it didn't include every detail.","zh":"吸引我注意的是，这幅画没有把每一个细节都画进去。"},{"en":"My friend had left out things that weren't important to the scene.","zh":"朋友省略了对这个画面不重要的东西。"},{"en":"That made it easier to notice the boat, the light and the relationship between the colours.","zh":"这样更容易注意到船、光线，以及不同颜色之间的关系。"}]},{"source":"He gave it to me later as a gift. I put it near my desk, where I could see it without it taking up much space. I look at it after a busy day, and it reminds me of our walk and conversation.","heading":"画作陪伴日常","sentences":[{"en":"He gave it to me later as a gift.","zh":"后来，他把这幅画送给了我，当作礼物。"},{"en":"I put it near my desk, where I could see it without it taking up much space.","zh":"我把它放在书桌附近，既能看得到，又不会占太多地方。"},{"en":"I look at it after a busy day, and it reminds me of our walk and conversation.","zh":"忙了一天后，我会看看它，它让我想起我们那次散步和聊天。"}]},{"source":"I like it partly because of the picture itself, but also because someone I know took the time to make it. I wouldn't try to judge its financial value. For me, its value comes from the memory and the thought behind the gift.","heading":"礼物背后的心意","sentences":[{"en":"I like it partly because of the picture itself, but also because someone I know took the time to make it.","zh":"我喜欢它，一部分是因为画本身，另一部分则是因为一个我认识的人花时间画了它。"},{"en":"I wouldn't try to judge its financial value.","zh":"我不会试着评判它值多少钱。"},{"en":"For me, its value comes from the memory and the thought behind the gift.","zh":"对我来说，它的价值来自那段回忆，还有这份礼物背后的心意。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I like it partly because of the picture itself, but also because someone I know took the time to make it.","method":"用partly because和but also because记住两个喜欢的原因：“画本身”和“熟人花时间制作”。"}},"M24":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A short journey I don't enjoy is the drive from home to the supermarket when the roads are busy. I make it because I need to buy groceries, but it can take much longer than the distance would suggest.","heading":"堵车时去超市","sentences":[{"en":"A short journey I don't enjoy is the drive from home to the supermarket when the roads are busy.","zh":"有一段短途路程我不太喜欢，就是道路拥堵时，从家开车去超市。"},{"en":"I make it because I need to buy groceries, but it can take much longer than the distance would suggest.","zh":"我得去，因为要买日常吃用的东西，但实际花的时间可能比按距离估计的长得多。"}]},{"source":"One Saturday, I left at a busy time without thinking about the journey. I had things to do afterwards, so I assumed I could get the shopping finished quickly. Instead, the traffic moved slowly, and I spent much longer on the road than I had planned.","heading":"堵车耽误买菜","sentences":[{"en":"One Saturday, I left at a busy time without thinking about the journey.","zh":"有个星期六，我没怎么考虑路上的情况，就在繁忙时段出门了。"},{"en":"I had things to do afterwards, so I assumed I could get the shopping finished quickly.","zh":"之后我还有事情要做，所以以为自己能很快买完东西。"},{"en":"Instead, the traffic moved slowly, and I spent much longer on the road than I had planned.","zh":"结果路上的车开得很慢，我在路上花的时间比计划长得多。"}]},{"source":"What bothered me most was the uncertainty. I could see that the supermarket wasn't very far away, but I couldn't tell how long it would take to reach it. I kept thinking about the other tasks waiting for me at home.","heading":"路近时间难料","sentences":[{"en":"What bothered me most was the uncertainty.","zh":"最让我烦的是，不知道到底要花多久。"},{"en":"I could see that the supermarket wasn't very far away, but I couldn't tell how long it would take to reach it.","zh":"我能看到超市离得并不远，却没法判断多久才能到。"},{"en":"I kept thinking about the other tasks waiting for me at home.","zh":"我一直想着，家里还有其他事情等着我做。"}]},{"source":"When I finally arrived, I still had to choose everything and pay, so the whole errand felt less simple than I had expected. Nothing serious happened. It was mainly a frustrating use of time for an ordinary task.","heading":"买菜并不轻松","sentences":[{"en":"When I finally arrived, I still had to choose everything and pay, so the whole errand felt less simple than I had expected.","zh":"等我终于到了，还是得挑好所有东西再付款，所以整个买东西的过程，比我原以为的要麻烦。","skeleton":"When I finally arrived, I still had to choose everything and pay, so the whole errand felt less simple ..."},{"en":"Nothing serious happened.","zh":"倒是没发生什么严重的事。"},{"en":"It was mainly a frustrating use of time for an ordinary task.","zh":"主要就是做这么一件日常小事，却浪费了时间，让人挺烦的。"}]},{"source":"Since then, I've tried to go at a quieter time and prepare a list before leaving. That doesn't make the journey exciting, but it makes it easier to manage. I dislike it because a short, necessary trip can sometimes take up too much of my day.","heading":"调整购物安排","sentences":[{"en":"Since then, I've tried to go at a quieter time and prepare a list before leaving.","zh":"从那以后，我就尽量选人少车少的时候去，出门前也会列好购物清单。"},{"en":"That doesn't make the journey exciting, but it makes it easier to manage.","zh":"这不会让路程变得有趣，但会让事情更好安排。"},{"en":"I dislike it because a short, necessary trip can sometimes take up too much of my day.","zh":"我不喜欢这段路程，是因为这么一趟短短的、又必须去的路，有时却会占用我一天里太多的时间。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"When I finally arrived, I still had to choose everything and pay, so the whole errand felt less simple than I had expected.","method":"按“终于到达—仍要挑选付款—所以比想象麻烦”串起时间、动作和结果，用 so 接最后一块。"}},"T001":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to describe a decision I made while working on a small project with my team. We had a repetitive task that involved checking information manually, and I wanted to build a tool to make it easier.","heading":"项目决定","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to describe a decision I made while working on a small project with my team.","zh":"我想讲讲和团队做一个小项目时，我作出的一个决定。"},{"en":"We had a repetitive task that involved checking information manually, and I wanted to build a tool to make it easier.","zh":"我们有一项重复性的任务，需要人工核对信息，我想做一个工具，让这件事更容易些。","skeleton":"We had a repetitive task ..., and I wanted to build a tool to make it easier."}]},{"source":"At first, I thought we should create a complete system with lots of features. However, a colleague suggested starting with a simple version. I wasn't fully convinced because I worried it would look unfinished, but we discussed the idea and agreed to test it.","heading":"先试简版","sentences":[{"en":"At first, I thought we should create a complete system with lots of features.","zh":"一开始，我觉得我们应该做一个功能很多的完整系统。"},{"en":"However, a colleague suggested starting with a simple version.","zh":"不过，一位同事建议先从简单的版本做起。"},{"en":"I wasn't fully convinced because I worried it would look unfinished, but we discussed the idea and agreed to test it.","zh":"我还没有完全被说服，因为我担心它看起来像没做完，但我们讨论了这个想法，决定先试一试。","skeleton":"I wasn't fully convinced because I worried ..., but we discussed the idea and agreed to test it."}]},{"source":"We divided the work between us and focused on the most common problem. I worked on the main function, while another person tested it with a few examples. Our first attempt didn't work properly because we had misunderstood part of the information. We checked the issue together and corrected it.","heading":"分工纠错","sentences":[{"en":"We divided the work between us and focused on the most common problem.","zh":"我们分好了工，把重点放在最常见的问题上。"},{"en":"I worked on the main function, while another person tested it with a few examples.","zh":"我负责主要功能，另一个人则用几个例子进行测试。"},{"en":"Our first attempt didn't work properly because we had misunderstood part of the information.","zh":"第一次尝试没能正常运行，因为我们误解了部分信息。"},{"en":"We checked the issue together and corrected it.","zh":"我们一起检查了问题，并把它纠正了。"}]},{"source":"Eventually, the tool handled the basic task well. It wasn't perfect, but it saved us time and helped us understand what to improve next. Seeing it work was a satisfying moment for me.","heading":"原型成功运行","sentences":[{"en":"Eventually, the tool handled the basic task well.","zh":"最后，这个工具很好地完成了基本任务。"},{"en":"It wasn't perfect, but it saved us time and helped us understand what to improve next.","zh":"它并不完美，但帮我们省了时间，也让我们知道下一步该改进什么。"},{"en":"Seeing it work was a satisfying moment for me.","zh":"看到它运行起来的那一刻，我很有成就感。"}]},{"source":"I was happy with the decision because we learned something useful without spending weeks on an idea that might not work. The experience changed my opinion about planning. I still think planning matters, but now I prefer to try a small, practical solution before making a bigger commitment.","heading":"小步尝试","sentences":[{"en":"I was happy with the decision because we learned something useful without spending weeks on an idea that might not work.","zh":"我对这个决定很满意，因为我们学到了有用的东西，又没有花好几周去做一个可能行不通的想法。","skeleton":"I was happy with the decision because we learned something useful without spending weeks on an idea ..."},{"en":"The experience changed my opinion about planning.","zh":"这次经历改变了我对做计划的看法。"},{"en":"I still think planning matters, but now I prefer to try a small, practical solution before making a bigger commitment.","zh":"我还是觉得计划很重要，但现在我更愿意先尝试一个小而实用的解决办法，再投入更多。","skeleton":"I still think planning matters, but now I prefer to try a small, practical solution before making ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I was happy with the decision because we learned something useful without spending weeks on an idea that might not work.","method":"以对决定满意为开头，用 because 接学到东西，再用 without spending 补上没有白花好几周的好处。"}},"T002":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to talk about my friend Alex, who runs a small coffee shop near a residential area. I met him through a mutual friend a few years ago. Since then, I've visited his shop fairly often, usually on a Saturday morning.","heading":"朋友的小咖啡店","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to talk about my friend Alex, who runs a small coffee shop near a residential area.","zh":"我想聊聊我的朋友 Alex，他在一个住宅区附近经营着一家小咖啡店。"},{"en":"I met him through a mutual friend a few years ago.","zh":"几年前，我通过一位共同的朋友认识了他。"},{"en":"Since then, I've visited his shop fairly often, usually on a Saturday morning.","zh":"从那以后，我就经常去他的店，通常是在星期六上午。"}]},{"source":"When he first opened it, the business was difficult. There weren't many customers in the morning, and some food was left unsold at the end of each day. Instead of immediately spending more money on advertising, he asked regular customers what they wanted and checked which items actually sold.","heading":"开店遇难","sentences":[{"en":"When he first opened it, the business was difficult.","zh":"他刚开店的时候，生意很不好做。"},{"en":"There weren't many customers in the morning, and some food was left unsold at the end of each day.","zh":"早上的顾客不多，每天结束时也会有一些食物没卖出去。"},{"en":"Instead of immediately spending more money on advertising, he asked regular customers what they wanted and checked which items actually sold.","zh":"他没有马上花更多钱做广告，而是问常客想要什么，并查看哪些东西确实卖得出去。","skeleton":"Instead of immediately spending more money on advertising, he asked regular customers ... and checked ..."}]},{"source":"He reduced the menu to a few reliable choices, prepared smaller batches and introduced a simple breakfast combination. He also created a quiet corner where customers could read or work. Gradually, people started coming back. What I like most is the service: he remembers regular customers' orders and deals with problems politely. Once, my coffee arrived cold, and he replaced it without making the situation awkward.","heading":"调整经营","sentences":[{"en":"He reduced the menu to a few reliable choices, prepared smaller batches and introduced a simple breakfast combination.","zh":"他把菜单缩减为几个比较稳妥的选择，每次准备少一些，还推出了一个简单的早餐组合。","skeleton":"He reduced the menu ..., prepared smaller batches and introduced a simple breakfast combination."},{"en":"He also created a quiet corner where customers could read or work.","zh":"他还布置了一个安静的角落，让顾客可以阅读或工作。"},{"en":"Gradually, people started coming back.","zh":"慢慢地，大家开始再次光顾。"},{"en":"What I like most is the service: he remembers regular customers' orders and deals with problems politely.","zh":"我最喜欢的是那里的服务：他记得常客通常点什么，也会礼貌地处理问题。"},{"en":"Once, my coffee arrived cold, and he replaced it without making the situation awkward.","zh":"有一次，我的咖啡送来时已经冷了，他直接给我换了一杯，没有让场面变得尴尬。"}]},{"source":"I'm pleased to see his hard work paying off. I respect him because he looked at the actual problem instead of hoping it would disappear. The shop now has regular visitors, and his experience reminds me that success can come from a series of sensible improvements, rather than one dramatic idea.","heading":"改进换来成功","sentences":[{"en":"I'm pleased to see his hard work paying off.","zh":"看到他的努力有了回报，我很高兴。"},{"en":"I respect him because he looked at the actual problem instead of hoping it would disappear.","zh":"我尊重他，因为他正视实际的问题，而不是指望问题自己消失。"},{"en":"The shop now has regular visitors, and his experience reminds me that success can come from a series of sensible improvements, rather than one dramatic idea.","zh":"现在这家店已经有了常客，他的经历也提醒我，成功可能来自一连串合理的改进，而不是一个惊天动地的点子。","skeleton":"The shop now has regular visitors, and his experience reminds me that success can come from ... rather than ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"The shop now has regular visitors, and his experience reminds me that success can come from a series of sensible improvements, rather than one dramatic idea.","method":"先说店里有了常客，再用 and 转到经验带来的启发，最后对比“一系列改进”和“一个大点子”。"}},"T003":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A happy person I know is my colleague Adam. We met at work about two years ago and gradually became friends. He isn't excited all the time, but he usually seems comfortable with himself and finds something positive in an ordinary day.","heading":"乐观同事亚当","sentences":[{"en":"A happy person I know is my colleague Adam.","zh":"我认识一个挺快乐的人，就是我的同事Adam。"},{"en":"We met at work about two years ago and gradually became friends.","zh":"我们大约两年前在工作中认识，后来慢慢成了朋友。"},{"en":"He isn't excited all the time, but he usually seems comfortable with himself and finds something positive in an ordinary day.","zh":"他并不是时时刻刻都很兴奋，但通常看起来对自己很自在，也能在普通的一天里发现积极的东西。","skeleton":"He isn't excited ..., but he usually seems comfortable ... and finds something positive ..."}]},{"source":"He enjoys small things, like having a good conversation or helping someone finish a task. When a plan goes wrong, he tends to focus on what we can try next rather than complain about the whole situation. That makes it pleasant to work with him.","heading":"遇事寻找出路","sentences":[{"en":"He enjoys small things, like having a good conversation or helping someone finish a task.","zh":"他喜欢一些小事，比如好好聊一次天，或者帮别人完成一项任务。"},{"en":"When a plan goes wrong, he tends to focus on what we can try next rather than complain about the whole situation.","zh":"当计划出了问题时，他通常会关注下一步还能试什么，而不是抱怨整个状况。","skeleton":"When a plan goes wrong, he tends to focus on what we can try next rather than complain about ..."},{"en":"That makes it pleasant to work with him.","zh":"这让和他一起工作变得很愉快。"}]},{"source":"A few months ago, I had to explain a new idea to our team. I knew the details, but I couldn't present them clearly. Adam suggested using one simple example instead of showing everything at once. He also helped me practise and pointed out the parts that were difficult to follow.","heading":"练习表达","sentences":[{"en":"A few months ago, I had to explain a new idea to our team.","zh":"几个月前，我需要向团队解释一个新想法。"},{"en":"I knew the details, but I couldn't present them clearly.","zh":"我了解其中的细节，却没办法把它们讲清楚。"},{"en":"Adam suggested using one simple example instead of showing everything at once.","zh":"Adam 建议用一个简单的例子来说明，而不是一下子把所有内容都展示出来。"},{"en":"He also helped me practise and pointed out the parts that were difficult to follow.","zh":"他还帮我练习，指出了哪些地方让人听不明白。"}]},{"source":"The presentation went much better than I expected. People understood the idea, and I felt more confident afterwards. What I appreciate most is that he helped me learn a useful skill rather than just doing the work for me.","heading":"学会表达","sentences":[{"en":"The presentation went much better than I expected.","zh":"那次演示比我预想的顺利得多。"},{"en":"People understood the idea, and I felt more confident afterwards.","zh":"大家理解了这个想法，之后我也更有信心了。"},{"en":"What I appreciate most is that he helped me learn a useful skill rather than just doing the work for me.","zh":"我最感谢的是，他帮我学会了一项实用的技能，而不是直接替我把工作做完。","skeleton":"What I appreciate most is that he helped me learn a useful skill ..."}]},{"source":"I think he is a happy person because he doesn't expect everything to be perfect. He puts effort into things he can change and doesn't spend the whole day worrying about things he can't control. Being around him often improves my mood.","heading":"乐观的处事方式","sentences":[{"en":"I think he is a happy person because he doesn't expect everything to be perfect.","zh":"我觉得他是个快乐的人，因为他不指望一切都十全十美。"},{"en":"He puts effort into things he can change and doesn't spend the whole day worrying about things he can't control.","zh":"他把精力放在自己能改变的事情上，不会整天担心那些控制不了的事。"},{"en":"Being around him often improves my mood.","zh":"和他待在一起，常常会让我心情变好。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"He isn't excited all the time, but he usually seems comfortable with himself and finds something positive in an ordinary day.","method":"先记“并非一直兴奋”，再用but引出“自在”和“能发现积极之处”这两个日常表现。"}},"T004":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to describe an interview with Lei Jun, the co-founder of Xiaomi, conducted by Li Xiang. The video was released in July 2024, and it looked back at Xiaomi's three-year journey into making electric cars. I watched part of it online at home one evening because I wanted to hear about the decisions behind a new business.","heading":"观看雷军访谈","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to describe an interview with Lei Jun, the co-founder of Xiaomi, conducted by Li Xiang.","zh":"我想介绍一次雷军的访谈，采访者是李翔，雷军是小米的联合创始人。"},{"en":"The video was released in July 2024, and it looked back at Xiaomi's three-year journey into making electric cars.","zh":"这个视频于二〇二四年七月发布，回顾了小米进入电动汽车制造领域的三年历程。"},{"en":"I watched part of it online at home one evening because I wanted to hear about the decisions behind a new business.","zh":"有一天晚上，我在家上网看了其中一部分，因为我想听听开展一项新业务背后的那些决策。","skeleton":"I watched part of it ... because I wanted to hear about ..."}]},{"source":"I had a personal reason to choose this interview. Lei Jun comes from the same part of China as I do, and we both studied at Wuhan University. I already recognised his name, but those connections made me more interested in the person behind the company.","heading":"采访中的亲近感","sentences":[{"en":"I had a personal reason to choose this interview.","zh":"我选择看这次采访，有一个与我自己有关的原因。"},{"en":"Lei Jun comes from the same part of China as I do, and we both studied at Wuhan University.","zh":"雷军和我来自中国同一个地区，而且我们都曾在武汉大学读书。"},{"en":"I already recognised his name, but those connections made me more interested in the person behind the company.","zh":"我之前就听说过他的名字，但这些共同点让我对公司背后的这个人更感兴趣。"}]},{"source":"The main subject was the experience of entering the car industry. What interested me was the difference between having an ambitious idea and turning it into something real. Building a new type of product involves learning, working with other people and making difficult decisions. The interview gave me a useful subject to think about, beyond the excitement of a product launch.","heading":"把想法变成现实","sentences":[{"en":"The main subject was the experience of entering the car industry.","zh":"访谈主要讲的是进入汽车行业的经历。"},{"en":"What interested me was the difference between having an ambitious idea and turning it into something real.","zh":"让我感兴趣的是，有一个雄心勃勃的想法，和真正把它做出来，究竟有什么不同。"},{"en":"Building a new type of product involves learning, working with other people and making difficult decisions.","zh":"做一种新型产品，需要学习、与人合作，还要做出艰难的决定。"},{"en":"The interview gave me a useful subject to think about, beyond the excitement of a product launch.","zh":"这次访谈让我有了一个值得思考的话题，收获不只是新产品发布时的兴奋感。"}]},{"source":"I found it worth watching because I enjoy hearing about how people approach an unfamiliar challenge. I didn't watch the whole long video in one sitting, but it made me curious enough to come back to it. I'd recommend it to a friend who's interested in technology or entrepreneurship, especially someone who shares our university background.","heading":"值得看采访","sentences":[{"en":"I found it worth watching because I enjoy hearing about how people approach an unfamiliar challenge.","zh":"我觉得这个采访值得看，因为我喜欢听别人说他们如何应对不熟悉的挑战。"},{"en":"I didn't watch the whole long video in one sitting, but it made me curious enough to come back to it.","zh":"我没有一口气看完整个长视频，但它让我有足够的好奇心，之后还想回来继续看。"},{"en":"I'd recommend it to a friend who's interested in technology or entrepreneurship, especially someone who shares our university background.","zh":"我会把它推荐给对科技或创业感兴趣的朋友，特别是和我们来自同一所大学的人。","skeleton":"I'd recommend it to a friend ..., especially someone ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I'd recommend it to a friend who's interested in technology or entrepreneurship, especially someone who shares our university background.","method":"先记 recommend it to a friend，再用 who's interested in 补朋友的兴趣，最后用 especially 突出同校背景。"}},"T005":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to talk about a colleague of mine called Adam. We met at work about two years ago, and we gradually became friends. He's a few years older than me, and he's someone I often turn to when I need advice.","heading":"认识同事","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to talk about a colleague of mine called Adam.","zh":"我想聊聊我的一位同事，他叫 Adam。"},{"en":"We met at work about two years ago, and we gradually became friends.","zh":"我们大约两年前在工作中认识，后来慢慢成了朋友。"},{"en":"He's a few years older than me, and he's someone I often turn to when I need advice.","zh":"他比我大几岁，我需要建议时，经常会找他。"}]},{"source":"What stands out about him is how organised he is. Before starting a task, he writes down the main steps and decides what needs to be done first. He doesn't make things complicated. In fact, he's usually the person who makes a confusing situation easier to understand.","heading":"做事很有条理","sentences":[{"en":"What stands out about him is how organised he is.","zh":"他最突出的特点就是做事很有条理。"},{"en":"Before starting a task, he writes down the main steps and decides what needs to be done first.","zh":"开始一项任务前，他会写下主要步骤，再决定先做什么。"},{"en":"He doesn't make things complicated.","zh":"他不会把事情弄得很复杂。"},{"en":"In fact, he's usually the person who makes a confusing situation easier to understand.","zh":"实际上，遇到让人摸不着头脑的情况，通常都是他把事情解释清楚。"}]},{"source":"A few months ago, I had to explain a new idea to our team. I knew the details, but I couldn't present them clearly. Adam suggested using one simple example instead of showing everything at once. He also helped me practise and pointed out the parts that were difficult to follow.","heading":"练习表达","sentences":[{"en":"A few months ago, I had to explain a new idea to our team.","zh":"几个月前，我需要向团队解释一个新想法。"},{"en":"I knew the details, but I couldn't present them clearly.","zh":"我了解其中的细节，却没办法把它们讲清楚。"},{"en":"Adam suggested using one simple example instead of showing everything at once.","zh":"Adam 建议用一个简单的例子来说明，而不是一下子把所有内容都展示出来。"},{"en":"He also helped me practise and pointed out the parts that were difficult to follow.","zh":"他还帮我练习，指出了哪些地方让人听不明白。"}]},{"source":"The presentation went much better than I expected. People understood the idea, and I felt more confident afterwards. What I appreciate most is that he helped me learn a useful skill rather than just doing the work for me.","heading":"学会表达","sentences":[{"en":"The presentation went much better than I expected.","zh":"那次演示比我预想的顺利得多。"},{"en":"People understood the idea, and I felt more confident afterwards.","zh":"大家理解了这个想法，之后我也更有信心了。"},{"en":"What I appreciate most is that he helped me learn a useful skill rather than just doing the work for me.","zh":"我最感谢的是，他帮我学会了一项实用的技能，而不是直接替我把工作做完。","skeleton":"What I appreciate most is that he helped me learn a useful skill ..."}]},{"source":"Since then, I've tried to follow his approach. Whenever a task feels overwhelming, I break it into smaller steps. So he's had a positive influence on the way I work.","heading":"拆分任务的方法","sentences":[{"en":"Since then, I've tried to follow his approach.","zh":"从那以后，我就试着照他的方法去做。"},{"en":"Whenever a task feels overwhelming, I break it into smaller steps.","zh":"每当一项任务让我觉得难以应付时，我就把它拆成更小的步骤。"},{"en":"So he's had a positive influence on the way I work.","zh":"所以，他对我的工作方式产生了积极的影响。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"What I appreciate most is that he helped me learn a useful skill rather than just doing the work for me.","method":"先把 What I appreciate most is that 连成一块，再接学会技能，最后用 rather than 对比替我做完。"}},"T006":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A noisy place I remember visiting is a busy market near Dubai Creek. I went there with a friend on a weekend afternoon. We wanted to explore the area, look at the small shops and see something different from our usual surroundings.","heading":"河边热闹的市场","sentences":[{"en":"A noisy place I remember visiting is a busy market near Dubai Creek.","zh":"我记得去过一个很嘈杂的地方，就是迪拜河附近一处热闹的市场。"},{"en":"I went there with a friend on a weekend afternoon.","zh":"我是在一个周末的下午和朋友一起去的。"},{"en":"We wanted to explore the area, look at the small shops and see something different from our usual surroundings.","zh":"我们想逛逛那一带，看看小店，也看看和平时环境不一样的东西。"}]},{"source":"We started near the creek and spent some time looking at the old buildings and small shops. What I liked was the atmosphere. It felt different from the modern shopping malls I normally see. There were narrow streets, people selling different products, and plenty of small details to notice.","heading":"老城氛围","sentences":[{"en":"We started near the creek and spent some time looking at the old buildings and small shops.","zh":"我们从迪拜河附近开始逛，花了些时间看看老建筑和小商店。"},{"en":"What I liked was the atmosphere.","zh":"我喜欢的是那里的氛围。"},{"en":"It felt different from the modern shopping malls I normally see.","zh":"那种感觉和我平时见到的现代购物中心很不一样。"},{"en":"There were narrow streets, people selling different products, and plenty of small details to notice.","zh":"那里有狭窄的街道、售卖各种商品的人，还有很多值得留意的小细节。"}]},{"source":"The narrow paths were full of shoppers. I could hear sellers calling to customers, groups talking loudly and carts moving between the shops. The sounds overlapped, so my friend and I sometimes had to repeat ourselves. I found it lively at first, but after a while I wanted a break.","heading":"市场里的声音","sentences":[{"en":"The narrow paths were full of shoppers.","zh":"狭窄的通道里挤满了买东西的人。"},{"en":"I could hear sellers calling to customers, groups talking loudly and carts moving between the shops.","zh":"我能听到摊贩招呼顾客、一群群人大声聊天，还有推车在店铺之间移动的声音。"},{"en":"The sounds overlapped, so my friend and I sometimes had to repeat ourselves.","zh":"这些声音混在一起，所以我和朋友有时得把话再说一遍。"},{"en":"I found it lively at first, but after a while I wanted a break.","zh":"起初我觉得挺热闹的，但过了一会儿，就想休息一下了。"}]},{"source":"We also had a simple drink and talked for a while. The outing didn't cost us much, but I enjoyed it more than some expensive activities I've tried.","heading":"花少玩好","sentences":[{"en":"We also had a simple drink and talked for a while.","zh":"我们还简单喝了点东西，聊了一会儿。"},{"en":"The outing didn't cost us much, but I enjoyed it more than some expensive activities I've tried.","zh":"这次外出没花多少钱，但比起我试过的一些昂贵的活动，我更喜欢这次。"}]},{"source":"I enjoyed looking around, but I wouldn't want to spend the whole day there. The noise made it difficult to concentrate on a conversation. Moving to the quieter waterfront afterwards helped me appreciate the difference. So it was interesting to visit, even though it wasn't somewhere I could fully relax.","heading":"热闹与安静之别","sentences":[{"en":"I enjoyed looking around, but I wouldn't want to spend the whole day there.","zh":"我挺喜欢在那里逛逛，但不想待上一整天。"},{"en":"The noise made it difficult to concentrate on a conversation.","zh":"噪音让我很难专心和人聊天。"},{"en":"Moving to the quieter waterfront afterwards helped me appreciate the difference.","zh":"后来去到安静一些的水边，让我更明显地感受到两者的差别。"},{"en":"So it was interesting to visit, even though it wasn't somewhere I could fully relax.","zh":"所以，去看看挺有意思，尽管那里不是一个能让我完全放松的地方。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"We wanted to explore the area, look at the small shops and see something different from our usual surroundings.","method":"把 We wanted to 后面的三个动作按“探索地区—看小店—看不同景象”排序，一口气用逗号和 and 接起来。"}},"T007":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A natural place I enjoy visiting is Sunset Beach in Dubai. I went there with a friend one evening a few months ago, after a week when we had both spent too much time indoors. We wanted a short break without planning a whole day out.","heading":"海边短休","sentences":[{"en":"A natural place I enjoy visiting is Sunset Beach in Dubai.","zh":"我喜欢去的一处自然场所，是迪拜的日落海滩。"},{"en":"I went there with a friend one evening a few months ago, after a week when we had both spent too much time indoors.","zh":"几个月前的一个傍晚，我和朋友去了那里，那之前的一周，我们两个在室内待的时间都太长了。","skeleton":"I went there with a friend one evening a few months ago, after a week ..."},{"en":"We wanted a short break without planning a whole day out.","zh":"我们想短暂放松一下，又不想安排一整天的外出活动。"}]},{"source":"We walked along the sand and then found a place to sit away from the busier part of the beach. It wasn't completely silent, but I could hear the waves more clearly than the conversations around us. There was a light breeze, which made sitting outside comfortable.","heading":"海边散步与微风","sentences":[{"en":"We walked along the sand and then found a place to sit away from the busier part of the beach.","zh":"我们沿着沙滩走了一会儿，然后找了个远离海滩热闹区域的地方坐下。"},{"en":"It wasn't completely silent, but I could hear the waves more clearly than the conversations around us.","zh":"那里并不是完全安静，但比起周围的交谈声，我能更清楚地听到海浪声。"},{"en":"There was a light breeze, which made sitting outside comfortable.","zh":"有一点微风，坐在外面很舒服。"}]},{"source":"The most memorable part was the sky. At first, it was quite bright, but later the colours became softer. I noticed shades of orange near the horizon, with a little pink above them. We took a photograph, although it didn't quite capture what we could see.","heading":"天空渐变的颜色","sentences":[{"en":"The most memorable part was the sky.","zh":"最让我难忘的是天空。"},{"en":"At first, it was quite bright, but later the colours became softer.","zh":"起初，天空还很明亮，后来颜色渐渐柔和下来。"},{"en":"I noticed shades of orange near the horizon, with a little pink above them.","zh":"我看到地平线附近有深浅不同的橙色，上方还有一点粉色。"},{"en":"We took a photograph, although it didn't quite capture what we could see.","zh":"我们拍了一张照片，但它没能完全拍出眼前看到的景象。"}]},{"source":"For a while, we stopped talking and simply watched the water. I normally feel that I should be checking a message or finishing something, so it was pleasant to have no particular task.","heading":"暂时放下任务","sentences":[{"en":"For a while, we stopped talking and simply watched the water.","zh":"有一会儿，我们没有说话，只是看着水面。"},{"en":"I normally feel that I should be checking a message or finishing something, so it was pleasant to have no particular task.","zh":"平时我总觉得自己应该查看消息，或者做完什么事情，所以那时没有任何特定的任务，感觉很舒服。","skeleton":"I normally feel that I should be ..., so it was pleasant to have no particular task."}]},{"source":"I left feeling calmer. What I liked wasn't an expensive activity or a special event. It was the chance to slow down and pay attention to something outside my usual routine. I'd go back when I needed a similar break.","heading":"放慢脚步休息","sentences":[{"en":"I left feeling calmer.","zh":"离开时，我的心情平静了不少。"},{"en":"What I liked wasn't an expensive activity or a special event.","zh":"我喜欢的并不是什么昂贵的活动，也不是什么特别的事件。"},{"en":"It was the chance to slow down and pay attention to something outside my usual routine.","zh":"我喜欢的是这个机会，可以慢下来，留意一些平时生活之外的东西。"},{"en":"I'd go back when I needed a similar break.","zh":"当我需要同样的放松时，还会再去。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I normally feel that I should be checking a message or finishing something, so it was pleasant to have no particular task.","method":"把前半句的“看消息或完成事情”作为平时习惯，再用 so 连接“没有任务很舒服”的结果。"}},"T008":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to talk about a pair of headphones that I saved up to buy. I wanted them because I often needed to concentrate in places where there was background noise. I also thought they would be useful for listening to English recordings.","heading":"攒钱买耳机","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to talk about a pair of headphones that I saved up to buy.","zh":"我想聊聊一副我攒钱买的耳机。"},{"en":"I wanted them because I often needed to concentrate in places where there was background noise.","zh":"我想买它，是因为我经常需要在有背景噪声的地方集中注意力。"},{"en":"I also thought they would be useful for listening to English recordings.","zh":"我也觉得它会很适合用来听英语录音。"}]},{"source":"They were more expensive than the basic headphones I had used before, so I didn't buy them immediately. I compared a few options and put aside a little money each month. I also cut back on a few small purchases that I didn't really need.","heading":"攒钱购买耳机","sentences":[{"en":"They were more expensive than the basic headphones I had used before, so I didn't buy them immediately.","zh":"它比我以前用的基础款耳机贵，所以我没有马上买。"},{"en":"I compared a few options and put aside a little money each month.","zh":"我比较了几个选择，每个月都存一点钱。"},{"en":"I also cut back on a few small purchases that I didn't really need.","zh":"我还减少了几笔其实没必要的小额消费。"}]},{"source":"When I finally bought them, I was pleased because I had made a deliberate choice rather than buying something on impulse. I started using them regularly for work and language practice.","heading":"理性购买耳机","sentences":[{"en":"When I finally bought them, I was pleased because I had made a deliberate choice rather than buying something on impulse.","zh":"终于买下这副耳机时，我挺开心的，因为这是我认真考虑后的选择，而不是一时冲动买下的东西。","skeleton":"When I finally bought them, I was pleased because I had made a deliberate choice rather than ..."},{"en":"I started using them regularly for work and language practice.","zh":"之后，我经常用它来工作和练习语言。"}]},{"source":"A few weeks later, one side stopped working properly. I took them back to the shop, expecting a long argument. Instead, the assistant listened carefully, checked the problem and explained the next steps. After confirming the fault, the shop arranged a replacement.","heading":"故障换新","sentences":[{"en":"A few weeks later, one side stopped working properly.","zh":"几周后，其中一边开始不能正常工作了。"},{"en":"I took them back to the shop, expecting a long argument.","zh":"我把耳机拿回店里，本以为要争论很久。"},{"en":"Instead, the assistant listened carefully, checked the problem and explained the next steps.","zh":"结果店员认真听了我的情况，检查了问题，还解释了接下来怎么处理。"},{"en":"After confirming the fault, the shop arranged a replacement.","zh":"确认故障后，店里安排给我换了一副。"}]},{"source":"That experience made the purchase more memorable. I appreciated both the product and the way the problem was handled. For me, the value wasn't just the price or the brand. It was having something useful and knowing that I could get help when it didn't work as expected.","heading":"产品与服务价值","sentences":[{"en":"That experience made the purchase more memorable.","zh":"这次经历让这笔购买更让我印象深刻。"},{"en":"I appreciated both the product and the way the problem was handled.","zh":"我既喜欢这个产品，也很认可他们处理问题的方式。"},{"en":"For me, the value wasn't just the price or the brand.","zh":"对我来说，它的价值不只是价格或者品牌。"},{"en":"It was having something useful and knowing that I could get help when it didn't work as expected.","zh":"真正的价值在于，拥有一件实用的东西，而且知道它没有正常发挥作用时，我能得到帮助。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"When I finally bought them, I was pleased because I had made a deliberate choice rather than buying something on impulse.","method":"按“终于买下—感到开心—因为认真选择而非冲动消费”的顺序复述，并记住rather than连接两种购买方式。"}},"T009":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to talk about my grandmother and a skill she taught me when I was a child. She enjoyed looking after plants, and whenever I visited her, I liked spending time in the small garden near her home.","heading":"祖母花园","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to talk about my grandmother and a skill she taught me when I was a child.","zh":"我想聊聊我的祖母，还有她在我小时候教给我的一项技能。"},{"en":"She enjoyed looking after plants, and whenever I visited her, I liked spending time in the small garden near her home.","zh":"她喜欢照料植物，每次我去看她，都喜欢在她家附近的小花园里待一会儿。","skeleton":"She enjoyed looking after plants, and whenever I visited her, I liked spending time in the small garden ..."}]},{"source":"When I was about ten, she helped me grow a plant of my own. At first, I thought I only needed to put it in the soil and water it as much as possible. She explained that plants needed the right amount of water and enough light, and that doing more wasn't always doing better.","heading":"学会适度养护","sentences":[{"en":"When I was about ten, she helped me grow a plant of my own.","zh":"我大约十岁时，她帮我种了一株属于我自己的植物。"},{"en":"At first, I thought I only needed to put it in the soil and water it as much as possible.","zh":"一开始，我以为只要把它种进土里，再尽量多浇水就行了。"},{"en":"She explained that plants needed the right amount of water and enough light, and that doing more wasn't always doing better.","zh":"她解释说，植物需要适量的水和充足的光照，而且做得更多，并不总是做得更好。","skeleton":"She explained that plants needed ... and that doing more wasn't always doing better."}]},{"source":"We checked the plant together every few days. I was impatient because I wanted to see a result immediately. She encouraged me to notice small changes instead of expecting something dramatic overnight.","heading":"耐心观察生长","sentences":[{"en":"We checked the plant together every few days.","zh":"我们每隔几天就一起看看那株植物。"},{"en":"I was impatient because I wanted to see a result immediately.","zh":"我没什么耐心，因为想马上看到结果。"},{"en":"She encouraged me to notice small changes instead of expecting something dramatic overnight.","zh":"她鼓励我留意细微的变化，而不是期待一夜之间就出现巨大的变化。"}]},{"source":"Eventually, I saw new leaves, and I felt surprisingly proud. It was a small achievement, but it was something I had helped create and look after myself.","heading":"新叶带来成就","sentences":[{"en":"Eventually, I saw new leaves, and I felt surprisingly proud.","zh":"后来，我看到了新长出的叶子，没想到自己会那么自豪。"},{"en":"It was a small achievement, but it was something I had helped create and look after myself.","zh":"这只是一个小小的成果，但也是我亲自参与种植和照料出来的。"}]},{"source":"What I admire about my grandmother is her patience. She didn't make me feel foolish when I made mistakes. She explained things calmly and let me try again. I still remember that experience because it taught me more than how to care for a plant. It also taught me to be consistent and to give things time.","heading":"耐心的教导","sentences":[{"en":"What I admire about my grandmother is her patience.","zh":"我佩服祖母的地方，是她很有耐心。"},{"en":"She didn't make me feel foolish when I made mistakes.","zh":"我犯错的时候，她不会让我觉得自己很笨。"},{"en":"She explained things calmly and let me try again.","zh":"她会平静地给我解释，让我再试一次。"},{"en":"I still remember that experience because it taught me more than how to care for a plant.","zh":"我到现在还记得那次经历，因为它教给我的不只是怎么照顾一株植物。"},{"en":"It also taught me to be consistent and to give things time.","zh":"它也教会了我要坚持做下去，并给事情一些时间。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"She explained that plants needed the right amount of water and enough light, and that doing more wasn't always doing better.","method":"用两个that记住她解释的两点：先说水和光照的需求，再说“多做不等于做好”。"}},"T010":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A person I know who really enjoys photography is my colleague Adam. We met at work about two years ago and became friends. Outside work, he often takes photos of ordinary streets, small shops and interesting patterns in buildings.","heading":"同事喜欢摄影","sentences":[{"en":"A person I know who really enjoys photography is my colleague Adam.","zh":"我认识的一个特别喜欢摄影的人，是我的同事 Adam。"},{"en":"We met at work about two years ago and became friends.","zh":"我们大约两年前在工作中认识，后来成了朋友。"},{"en":"Outside work, he often takes photos of ordinary streets, small shops and interesting patterns in buildings.","zh":"工作之外，他经常拍普通的街道、小店，还有建筑上有趣的图案。"}]},{"source":"He usually uses his phone rather than carrying a lot of equipment. What I like about his photos is that he notices details other people walk past. He might photograph the reflection in a window or the shadow of a tree instead of a famous landmark.","heading":"留意小细节","sentences":[{"en":"He usually uses his phone rather than carrying a lot of equipment.","zh":"他通常用手机拍照，而不会带一大堆设备。"},{"en":"What I like about his photos is that he notices details other people walk past.","zh":"我喜欢他的照片，是因为他会留意到别人路过时没注意的小细节。"},{"en":"He might photograph the reflection in a window or the shadow of a tree instead of a famous landmark.","zh":"他可能会拍窗户里的倒影，或一棵树的影子，而不是某个著名地标。"}]},{"source":"Last month, we went for a walk near Dubai Creek. I took a quick photo and thought the scene looked rather ordinary. Adam suggested moving a few steps to the side and waiting until fewer people were in the picture. The result looked much clearer.","heading":"调整角度拍照","sentences":[{"en":"Last month, we went for a walk near Dubai Creek.","zh":"上个月，我们去迪拜河附近散了步。"},{"en":"I took a quick photo and thought the scene looked rather ordinary.","zh":"我随手拍了一张照片，觉得这个景象看起来挺普通的。"},{"en":"Adam suggested moving a few steps to the side and waiting until fewer people were in the picture.","zh":"Adam 建议往旁边挪几步，再等画面里的人少一点。"},{"en":"The result looked much clearer.","zh":"拍出来的效果看着清晰多了。"}]},{"source":"He also explained that good light matters more than simply having an expensive camera. I enjoyed learning something practical without having to study a long list of technical terms. We compared our pictures afterwards and talked about why they looked different.","heading":"拍照的窍门","sentences":[{"en":"He also explained that good light matters more than simply having an expensive camera.","zh":"他还解释说，光线好比光有一台昂贵的相机更重要。"},{"en":"I enjoyed learning something practical without having to study a long list of technical terms.","zh":"我很喜欢这种学到实用东西的感觉，不用先研究一长串技术术语。"},{"en":"We compared our pictures afterwards and talked about why they looked different.","zh":"之后我们对比了各自拍的照片，聊了聊它们为什么看起来不一样。"}]},{"source":"I appreciate his hobby because it encourages him to pay attention to his surroundings. His example has made me look more carefully when I go for a walk. I still don't take photos as seriously as he does, but I understand why he enjoys it.","heading":"摄影让我留心","sentences":[{"en":"I appreciate his hobby because it encourages him to pay attention to his surroundings.","zh":"我很欣赏他的这个爱好，因为它让他更留心周围的环境。"},{"en":"His example has made me look more carefully when I go for a walk.","zh":"受他的影响，我现在散步时会观察得更仔细。"},{"en":"I still don't take photos as seriously as he does, but I understand why he enjoys it.","zh":"我还是没有他那么认真地对待拍照，但我能理解他为什么喜欢摄影。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"Outside work, he often takes photos of ordinary streets, small shops and interesting patterns in buildings.","method":"先说 Outside work 和 he often takes photos，再按“街道—小店—建筑图案”从大场景记到细节。"}},"T011":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to talk about my grandmother and a skill she taught me when I was a child. She enjoyed looking after plants, and whenever I visited her, I liked spending time in the small garden near her home.","heading":"祖母花园","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to talk about my grandmother and a skill she taught me when I was a child.","zh":"我想聊聊我的祖母，还有她在我小时候教给我的一项技能。"},{"en":"She enjoyed looking after plants, and whenever I visited her, I liked spending time in the small garden near her home.","zh":"她喜欢照料植物，每次我去看她，都喜欢在她家附近的小花园里待一会儿。","skeleton":"She enjoyed looking after plants, and whenever I visited her, I liked spending time in the small garden ..."}]},{"source":"When I was about ten, she helped me grow a plant of my own. At first, I thought I only needed to put it in the soil and water it as much as possible. She explained that plants needed the right amount of water and enough light, and that doing more wasn't always doing better.","heading":"学会适度养护","sentences":[{"en":"When I was about ten, she helped me grow a plant of my own.","zh":"我大约十岁时，她帮我种了一株属于我自己的植物。"},{"en":"At first, I thought I only needed to put it in the soil and water it as much as possible.","zh":"一开始，我以为只要把它种进土里，再尽量多浇水就行了。"},{"en":"She explained that plants needed the right amount of water and enough light, and that doing more wasn't always doing better.","zh":"她解释说，植物需要适量的水和充足的光照，而且做得更多，并不总是做得更好。","skeleton":"She explained that plants needed ... and that doing more wasn't always doing better."}]},{"source":"We checked the plant together every few days. I was impatient because I wanted to see a result immediately. She encouraged me to notice small changes instead of expecting something dramatic overnight.","heading":"耐心观察生长","sentences":[{"en":"We checked the plant together every few days.","zh":"我们每隔几天就一起看看那株植物。"},{"en":"I was impatient because I wanted to see a result immediately.","zh":"我没什么耐心，因为想马上看到结果。"},{"en":"She encouraged me to notice small changes instead of expecting something dramatic overnight.","zh":"她鼓励我留意细微的变化，而不是期待一夜之间就出现巨大的变化。"}]},{"source":"Eventually, I saw new leaves, and I felt surprisingly proud. It was a small achievement, but it was something I had helped create and look after myself.","heading":"新叶带来成就","sentences":[{"en":"Eventually, I saw new leaves, and I felt surprisingly proud.","zh":"后来，我看到了新长出的叶子，没想到自己会那么自豪。"},{"en":"It was a small achievement, but it was something I had helped create and look after myself.","zh":"这只是一个小小的成果，但也是我亲自参与种植和照料出来的。"}]},{"source":"What I admire about my grandmother is her patience. She didn't make me feel foolish when I made mistakes. She explained things calmly and let me try again. I still remember that experience because it taught me more than how to care for a plant. It also taught me to be consistent and to give things time.","heading":"耐心的教导","sentences":[{"en":"What I admire about my grandmother is her patience.","zh":"我佩服祖母的地方，是她很有耐心。"},{"en":"She didn't make me feel foolish when I made mistakes.","zh":"我犯错的时候，她不会让我觉得自己很笨。"},{"en":"She explained things calmly and let me try again.","zh":"她会平静地给我解释，让我再试一次。"},{"en":"I still remember that experience because it taught me more than how to care for a plant.","zh":"我到现在还记得那次经历，因为它教给我的不只是怎么照顾一株植物。"},{"en":"It also taught me to be consistent and to give things time.","zh":"它也教会了我要坚持做下去，并给事情一些时间。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"She explained that plants needed the right amount of water and enough light, and that doing more wasn't always doing better.","method":"用两个that记住她解释的两点：先说水和光照的需求，再说“多做不等于做好”。"}},"T012":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A time I listened to something I wasn't initially interested in was when my grandmother explained how she looked after her plants. I visited her one afternoon, and she was excited to show me a plant that had produced new leaves.","heading":"听祖母讲植物","sentences":[{"en":"A time I listened to something I wasn't initially interested in was when my grandmother explained how she looked after her plants.","zh":"有一次，我认真听了一个起初不感兴趣的话题，那是祖母给我讲她怎样照顾植物的时候。","skeleton":"A time I listened to something ... was when my grandmother explained how she looked after her plants."},{"en":"I visited her one afternoon, and she was excited to show me a plant that had produced new leaves.","zh":"有天下午，我去看她，她很兴奋地给我看一棵长出了新叶子的植物。"}]},{"source":"At first, I didn't really care about the details. I thought she would point out the plant quickly, but she began explaining the light, watering and changes she had noticed over several weeks. I was tempted to change the subject.","heading":"起初没兴趣听","sentences":[{"en":"At first, I didn't really care about the details.","zh":"一开始，我其实不太关心那些细节。"},{"en":"I thought she would point out the plant quickly, but she began explaining the light, watering and changes she had noticed over several weeks.","zh":"我以为她很快就会把那株植物指给我看，但她却开始解释光照、浇水，以及过去几周里她注意到的变化。","skeleton":"I thought she would point out the plant quickly, but she began explaining the light, watering and changes ..."},{"en":"I was tempted to change the subject.","zh":"我有点想换个话题。"}]},{"source":"I kept listening because I knew the hobby mattered to her. She had put time and effort into it, and I didn't want to make her feel that her excitement was unimportant. I put my phone away and asked a couple of simple questions.","heading":"认真听朋友","sentences":[{"en":"I kept listening because I knew the hobby mattered to her.","zh":"我继续听着，因为我知道这项爱好对她很重要。"},{"en":"She had put time and effort into it, and I didn't want to make her feel that her excitement was unimportant.","zh":"她为此付出了时间和精力，我不想让她觉得自己的兴奋劲儿不被重视。"},{"en":"I put my phone away and asked a couple of simple questions.","zh":"我把手机收起来，问了几个简单的问题。"}]},{"source":"As the conversation continued, I became more interested. I could see that she enjoyed noticing small changes and solving practical problems. I also learned why giving a plant too much attention could sometimes be less helpful than being patient.","heading":"逐渐产生兴趣","sentences":[{"en":"As the conversation continued, I became more interested.","zh":"随着谈话继续，我越来越感兴趣。"},{"en":"I could see that she enjoyed noticing small changes and solving practical problems.","zh":"我能看出来，她很享受观察细微变化、解决实际问题的过程。"},{"en":"I also learned why giving a plant too much attention could sometimes be less helpful than being patient.","zh":"我也明白了，为什么有时候过分照料一棵植物，反而不如耐心等待更有用。"}]},{"source":"I felt glad that I had listened properly. The conversation made her happy and helped me understand her hobby rather than just see it as a collection of pots. It reminded me that showing interest in another person's experience can matter even when the subject isn't one of my favourites.","heading":"认真倾听的收获","sentences":[{"en":"I felt glad that I had listened properly.","zh":"我很庆幸自己当时认真听了。"},{"en":"The conversation made her happy and helped me understand her hobby rather than just see it as a collection of pots.","zh":"那次聊天让她很开心，也帮我理解了她的爱好，不再只是把它看成一堆花盆。","skeleton":"The conversation made her happy and helped me understand her hobby rather than just see it as ..."},{"en":"It reminded me that showing interest in another person's experience can matter even when the subject isn't one of my favourites.","zh":"这提醒了我，即使话题并不是我特别喜欢的，表现出对别人经历的兴趣，也可能很重要。","skeleton":"It reminded me that showing interest ... can matter even when ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I thought she would point out the plant quickly, but she began explaining the light, watering and changes she had noticed over several weeks.","method":"用I thought和but she began对照“原以为简单指出”和“实际开始细讲”，再记光照、浇水、变化三项内容。"}},"T013":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"The good service I'd like to describe was the help I received in a shop when my headphones stopped working. I had bought them a few weeks earlier after saving up. Because I used them often, I was disappointed when one side began to fail.","heading":"耳机坏后的服务","sentences":[{"en":"The good service I'd like to describe was the help I received in a shop when my headphones stopped working.","zh":"我想说的一次好服务，是耳机坏了之后，我在一家店里得到的帮助。"},{"en":"I had bought them a few weeks earlier after saving up.","zh":"几周前，我攒够钱买了这副耳机。"},{"en":"Because I used them often, I was disappointed when one side began to fail.","zh":"因为我经常用它，所以一边开始出问题时，我挺失望的。"}]},{"source":"I brought the headphones and the proof of purchase back to the shop. The assistant asked me to explain what had happened and listened without interrupting. He then checked the problem instead of immediately suggesting that I had caused it.","heading":"店员耐心检查","sentences":[{"en":"I brought the headphones and the proof of purchase back to the shop.","zh":"我带着耳机和购买凭证回到了店里。"},{"en":"The assistant asked me to explain what had happened and listened without interrupting.","zh":"店员请我解释发生了什么，并一直听着，没有打断我。"},{"en":"He then checked the problem instead of immediately suggesting that I had caused it.","zh":"然后他检查了问题，而不是马上暗示是我弄坏的。"}]},{"source":"He explained the next steps in language I could understand and told me what information the shop needed. After confirming the fault, the staff arranged a replacement. I appreciated knowing what was happening, rather than being passed from one person to another.","heading":"清楚的处理","sentences":[{"en":"He explained the next steps in language I could understand and told me what information the shop needed.","zh":"他用我能听懂的话解释了接下来怎么处理，还告诉我店里需要哪些信息。"},{"en":"After confirming the fault, the staff arranged a replacement.","zh":"确认故障后，工作人员安排了更换。"},{"en":"I appreciated knowing what was happening, rather than being passed from one person to another.","zh":"我很感谢能知道事情进展到哪一步，而不是被从一个人推给另一个人。"}]},{"source":"The assistant also gave me time to ask questions and check the replacement. I had expected the visit to be stressful, but it was straightforward. The most helpful part was his calm attitude, which made me feel that the problem was being taken seriously.","heading":"服务的态度","sentences":[{"en":"The assistant also gave me time to ask questions and check the replacement.","zh":"店员也留了时间让我提问，并检查换来的耳机。"},{"en":"I had expected the visit to be stressful, but it was straightforward.","zh":"我原本以为这次去店里会很闹心，但处理起来很简单。"},{"en":"The most helpful part was his calm attitude, which made me feel that the problem was being taken seriously.","zh":"最有帮助的是他冷静的态度，让我觉得这个问题得到了认真对待。"}]},{"source":"That experience made the purchase more memorable. I appreciated both the product and the way the problem was handled. For me, the value wasn't just the price or the brand. It was having something useful and knowing that I could get help when it didn't work as expected.","heading":"产品与服务价值","sentences":[{"en":"That experience made the purchase more memorable.","zh":"这次经历让这笔购买更让我印象深刻。"},{"en":"I appreciated both the product and the way the problem was handled.","zh":"我既喜欢这个产品，也很认可他们处理问题的方式。"},{"en":"For me, the value wasn't just the price or the brand.","zh":"对我来说，它的价值不只是价格或者品牌。"},{"en":"It was having something useful and knowing that I could get help when it didn't work as expected.","zh":"真正的价值在于，拥有一件实用的东西，而且知道它没有正常发挥作用时，我能得到帮助。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"The good service I'd like to describe was the help I received in a shop when my headphones stopped working.","method":"先搭出“我想描述的好服务是我得到的帮助”，再分别用in a shop和when补地点与发生原因。"}},"T014":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A person I know who is good at making things by hand is my grandmother. When I was a child, I often visited her home and watched her repair clothes or make small useful items. She enjoyed the process and didn't rush through it.","heading":"祖母的手工本领","sentences":[{"en":"A person I know who is good at making things by hand is my grandmother.","zh":"我认识一位很擅长手工的人，就是我的祖母。"},{"en":"When I was a child, I often visited her home and watched her repair clothes or make small useful items.","zh":"小时候，我经常去她家，看她修补衣服，或者做一些实用的小东西。"},{"en":"She enjoyed the process and didn't rush through it.","zh":"她很享受这个过程，也从不急着做完。"}]},{"source":"One summer, when I was about ten, she helped me make a simple cloth bag. We chose some spare material and decided on a size that I could use for a few books. She showed me how to measure it and join the pieces carefully.","heading":"一起制作布袋","sentences":[{"en":"One summer, when I was about ten, she helped me make a simple cloth bag.","zh":"有一年夏天，我大约十岁，她帮我做了一个简单的布袋。"},{"en":"We chose some spare material and decided on a size that I could use for a few books.","zh":"我们选了一些剩余的布料，定了一个能装几本书的尺寸。"},{"en":"She showed me how to measure it and join the pieces carefully.","zh":"她教我怎么量尺寸，以及怎么仔细地把布片缝在一起。"}]},{"source":"My first attempt was uneven, and I wanted to start again. She explained that we could undo one small section and fix it instead. That made the task feel less intimidating. I slowly began to understand that a mistake didn't mean the whole item was ruined.","heading":"出错可以局部改","sentences":[{"en":"My first attempt was uneven, and I wanted to start again.","zh":"第一次做出来不太平整，我想重新做。"},{"en":"She explained that we could undo one small section and fix it instead.","zh":"她解释说，我们可以只拆开一小部分，把那部分修好就行。"},{"en":"That made the task feel less intimidating.","zh":"这让我觉得，做这件事没那么可怕了。"},{"en":"I slowly began to understand that a mistake didn't mean the whole item was ruined.","zh":"我慢慢开始明白，犯了一个错，并不代表整件东西都毁了。"}]},{"source":"When we finished, the bag wasn't perfect, but it was useful. I felt proud that I had helped make something rather than just buy it. I used it afterwards, which made the experience more memorable.","heading":"亲手做布袋","sentences":[{"en":"When we finished, the bag wasn't perfect, but it was useful.","zh":"做完时，那个袋子并不完美，但很实用。"},{"en":"I felt proud that I had helped make something rather than just buy it.","zh":"我挺自豪的，因为自己参与做出了一个东西，而不只是把它买回来。"},{"en":"I used it afterwards, which made the experience more memorable.","zh":"后来我还用过它，这让那次经历更难忘了。"}]},{"source":"I admire her patience and practical skills. She could turn simple materials into something that solved a small everyday problem. I don't make many things by hand now, but the lesson has stayed with me: work carefully, notice mistakes and improve one part at a time.","heading":"细心改进每一处","sentences":[{"en":"I admire her patience and practical skills.","zh":"我很佩服她的耐心和实用的手艺。"},{"en":"She could turn simple materials into something that solved a small everyday problem.","zh":"她能把简单的材料，变成解决日常小问题的东西。"},{"en":"I don't make many things by hand now, but the lesson has stayed with me: work carefully, notice mistakes and improve one part at a time.","zh":"现在我不怎么自己动手做东西了，但那次学到的道理一直记在心里：认真做，发现错误，一次改进一个部分。","skeleton":"I don't make many things ..., but the lesson has stayed with me: work ..., notice ... and improve ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I don't make many things by hand now, but the lesson has stayed with me: work carefully, notice mistakes and improve one part at a time.","method":"先记“现在少做手工，但道理一直记得”，再按“认真做—看出错误—逐步改进”三个祈使动作背后半句。"}},"T015":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"One enjoyable evening was when a friend and I explored an older part of Dubai and then sat down for a drink near the creek. It happened on a weekend a few months ago. Neither of us wanted a big event; we just wanted time to talk.","heading":"河边畅聊的夜晚","sentences":[{"en":"One enjoyable evening was when a friend and I explored an older part of Dubai and then sat down for a drink near the creek.","zh":"有一个晚上我过得很开心，那天我和朋友先逛了迪拜一片老城区，然后坐在迪拜河附近喝点东西。","skeleton":"One enjoyable evening was when a friend and I explored ... and then sat down for a drink near the creek."},{"en":"It happened on a weekend a few months ago.","zh":"那是几个月前的一个周末。"},{"en":"Neither of us wanted a big event; we just wanted time to talk.","zh":"我们俩都不想参加什么大型活动，只是想有点时间聊聊天。"}]},{"source":"We started near the creek and spent some time looking at the old buildings and small shops. What I liked was the atmosphere. It felt different from the modern shopping malls I normally see. There were narrow streets, people selling different products, and plenty of small details to notice.","heading":"老城氛围","sentences":[{"en":"We started near the creek and spent some time looking at the old buildings and small shops.","zh":"我们从迪拜河附近开始逛，花了些时间看看老建筑和小商店。"},{"en":"What I liked was the atmosphere.","zh":"我喜欢的是那里的氛围。"},{"en":"It felt different from the modern shopping malls I normally see.","zh":"那种感觉和我平时见到的现代购物中心很不一样。"},{"en":"There were narrow streets, people selling different products, and plenty of small details to notice.","zh":"那里有狭窄的街道、售卖各种商品的人，还有很多值得留意的小细节。"}]},{"source":"As it became darker, the area felt calmer. We walked past the shops, took a few photos and then chose somewhere comfortable to sit. We talked about things that had happened that week, shared a few funny stories and stopped checking our phones for a while.","heading":"朋友的夜晚","sentences":[{"en":"As it became darker, the area felt calmer.","zh":"天色渐暗时，那一带也安静了下来。"},{"en":"We walked past the shops, took a few photos and then chose somewhere comfortable to sit.","zh":"我们走过几家商店，拍了几张照片，然后找了个舒服的地方坐下。"},{"en":"We talked about things that had happened that week, shared a few funny stories and stopped checking our phones for a while.","zh":"我们聊了那一周发生的事，分享了几个有趣的故事，也有一阵子没再看手机。","skeleton":"We talked about things ..., shared a few funny stories and stopped checking our phones for a while."}]},{"source":"We also had a simple drink and talked for a while. The outing didn't cost us much, but I enjoyed it more than some expensive activities I've tried.","heading":"花少玩好","sentences":[{"en":"We also had a simple drink and talked for a while.","zh":"我们还简单喝了点东西，聊了一会儿。"},{"en":"The outing didn't cost us much, but I enjoyed it more than some expensive activities I've tried.","zh":"这次外出没花多少钱，但比起我试过的一些昂贵的活动，我更喜欢这次。"}]},{"source":"I remember feeling relaxed afterwards. It reminded me that I don't always need a complicated plan to have a good day. Sometimes a walk, a friend and a change of surroundings are enough.","heading":"简单的快乐一天","sentences":[{"en":"I remember feeling relaxed afterwards.","zh":"我记得结束后，整个人都很放松。"},{"en":"It reminded me that I don't always need a complicated plan to have a good day.","zh":"这让我意识到，想过得开心，不一定每次都要安排一个复杂的计划。"},{"en":"Sometimes a walk, a friend and a change of surroundings are enough.","zh":"有时候，散散步、和朋友在一起、换个环境，就足够了。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"One enjoyable evening was when a friend and I explored an older part of Dubai and then sat down for a drink near the creek.","method":"用One enjoyable evening was when起头，再按“逛老城区—然后河边坐下喝东西”的先后顺序展开。"}},"T016":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"An activity I regularly do that I consider a waste of time is scrolling through short posts on my phone. It often happens after work. I tell myself that I'll look for a few minutes, but the activity can take up much more of the evening than I intended.","heading":"刷手机浪费时间","sentences":[{"en":"An activity I regularly do that I consider a waste of time is scrolling through short posts on my phone.","zh":"我经常做、又觉得浪费时间的一件事，就是拿着手机刷短帖。"},{"en":"It often happens after work.","zh":"这种情况经常发生在下班之后。"},{"en":"I tell myself that I'll look for a few minutes, but the activity can take up much more of the evening than I intended.","zh":"我告诉自己只看几分钟，可这一刷，花掉的晚间时间可能远远超出我原本的打算。","skeleton":"I tell myself that I'll look for a few minutes, but the activity can take up much more of the evening ..."}]},{"source":"The problem was that I didn't feel rested afterwards. I was still tired, and sometimes I went to bed later than I had planned. So I decided to replace part of that screen time with a short walk.","heading":"散步替代","sentences":[{"en":"The problem was that I didn't feel rested afterwards.","zh":"问题是，刷完以后我并没有觉得休息好了。"},{"en":"I was still tired, and sometimes I went to bed later than I had planned.","zh":"我还是很累，有时还比计划的时间更晚睡。"},{"en":"So I decided to replace part of that screen time with a short walk.","zh":"所以我决定用短时间的散步，代替一部分看屏幕的时间。"}]},{"source":"I started with just ten minutes because I knew I wouldn't stick to an ambitious exercise plan. When the weather was comfortable, I walked outside. On other days, I found somewhere indoors where I could move around. I usually left my phone in my pocket and paid attention to my surroundings.","heading":"从短时散步起","sentences":[{"en":"I started with just ten minutes because I knew I wouldn't stick to an ambitious exercise plan.","zh":"我一开始只走十分钟，因为我知道，目标定得太高的锻炼计划，我坚持不下来。"},{"en":"When the weather was comfortable, I walked outside.","zh":"天气舒服的时候，我就去外面走走。"},{"en":"On other days, I found somewhere indoors where I could move around.","zh":"其他时候，我会找个能走动的室内地方。"},{"en":"I usually left my phone in my pocket and paid attention to my surroundings.","zh":"我通常把手机放在口袋里，留意周围的环境。"}]},{"source":"After a while, a friend began joining me. That made the habit easier to maintain because we could chat and remind each other to go. We weren't trying to become athletes. We just wanted to do something more active after sitting for most of the day.","heading":"结伴坚持","sentences":[{"en":"After a while, a friend began joining me.","zh":"过了一阵子，一位朋友开始和我一起走。"},{"en":"That made the habit easier to maintain because we could chat and remind each other to go.","zh":"这样更容易坚持这个习惯，因为我们可以聊天，也能互相提醒出去走走。"},{"en":"We weren't trying to become athletes.","zh":"我们并不是想成为运动员。"},{"en":"We just wanted to do something more active after sitting for most of the day.","zh":"我们只是想在坐了大半天之后，做点能让身体活动起来的事。"}]},{"source":"I consider it a waste of time because I usually haven't chosen a clear purpose and I remember very little afterwards. A few useful posts do appear, but they don't justify all the time I spend. I'm trying to keep a limit and choose a more deliberate way to relax.","heading":"无目的刷屏耗时","sentences":[{"en":"I consider it a waste of time because I usually haven't chosen a clear purpose and I remember very little afterwards.","zh":"我觉得这很浪费时间，因为我通常没有明确的目的，而且看完之后，记得的东西很少。","skeleton":"I consider it a waste of time because I usually haven't chosen ... and I remember very little ..."},{"en":"A few useful posts do appear, but they don't justify all the time I spend.","zh":"确实偶尔会看到几条有用的帖子，但这也不足以说明我花那么多时间是值得的。"},{"en":"I'm trying to keep a limit and choose a more deliberate way to relax.","zh":"我正在尝试限制时间，选择一种更有意识的放松方式。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I tell myself that I'll look for a few minutes, but the activity can take up much more of the evening than I intended.","method":"先记“告诉自己只看几分钟”，再用 but 对照“占掉更多晚间时间”，最后补 than I intended 表示超出本意。"}},"T017":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A crowded place I've visited is a market near Dubai Creek. I went there with a friend on a weekend afternoon. We wanted to explore the small shops and take a few photos, but there were more people than we had expected.","heading":"拥挤的河边市场","sentences":[{"en":"A crowded place I've visited is a market near Dubai Creek.","zh":"我去过一个很拥挤的地方，是迪拜河附近的一处市场。"},{"en":"I went there with a friend on a weekend afternoon.","zh":"我和朋友在一个周末下午去了那里。"},{"en":"We wanted to explore the small shops and take a few photos, but there were more people than we had expected.","zh":"我们想逛逛小店、拍几张照片，但那里的人比我们预想的多。"}]},{"source":"We started near the creek and spent some time looking at the old buildings and small shops. What I liked was the atmosphere. It felt different from the modern shopping malls I normally see. There were narrow streets, people selling different products, and plenty of small details to notice.","heading":"老城氛围","sentences":[{"en":"We started near the creek and spent some time looking at the old buildings and small shops.","zh":"我们从迪拜河附近开始逛，花了些时间看看老建筑和小商店。"},{"en":"What I liked was the atmosphere.","zh":"我喜欢的是那里的氛围。"},{"en":"It felt different from the modern shopping malls I normally see.","zh":"那种感觉和我平时见到的现代购物中心很不一样。"},{"en":"There were narrow streets, people selling different products, and plenty of small details to notice.","zh":"那里有狭窄的街道、售卖各种商品的人，还有很多值得留意的小细节。"}]},{"source":"At some points, the path was so busy that we had to wait before moving forward. People stopped to look at products while others tried to pass them. I kept my bag close and paid attention to where my friend was, because it would have been easy to lose each other.","heading":"在人群中慢行","sentences":[{"en":"At some points, the path was so busy that we had to wait before moving forward.","zh":"有些路段人太多，我们得等一等才能往前走。"},{"en":"People stopped to look at products while others tried to pass them.","zh":"有些人停下来看看商品，另一些人则想从他们旁边挤过去。"},{"en":"I kept my bag close and paid attention to where my friend was, because it would have been easy to lose each other.","zh":"我把包放在贴身的地方，也一直留意朋友的位置，因为我们很容易就会走散。","skeleton":"I kept ... and paid attention to where my friend was, because it would have been easy to ..."}]},{"source":"We also had a simple drink and talked for a while. The outing didn't cost us much, but I enjoyed it more than some expensive activities I've tried.","heading":"花少玩好","sentences":[{"en":"We also had a simple drink and talked for a while.","zh":"我们还简单喝了点东西，聊了一会儿。"},{"en":"The outing didn't cost us much, but I enjoyed it more than some expensive activities I've tried.","zh":"这次外出没花多少钱，但比起我试过的一些昂贵的活动，我更喜欢这次。"}]},{"source":"The crowd gave the market an energetic atmosphere, but it also made simple things take longer. I was glad we eventually found a quiet place to sit. If I go again, I'll choose a less busy time so that I can enjoy the shops without constantly moving around other people.","heading":"避开市场高峰","sentences":[{"en":"The crowd gave the market an energetic atmosphere, but it also made simple things take longer.","zh":"人多让市场充满活力，但也让简单的事情花了更长时间。"},{"en":"I was glad we eventually found a quiet place to sit.","zh":"我们最后找到了一个安静的地方坐下，我很庆幸。"},{"en":"If I go again, I'll choose a less busy time so that I can enjoy the shops without constantly moving around other people.","zh":"如果再去，我会挑一个人没那么多的时间，这样就能好好逛店，不用一直绕着别人走。","skeleton":"If I go again, I'll choose a less busy time so that I can enjoy the shops ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"If I go again, I'll choose a less busy time so that I can enjoy the shops without constantly moving around other people.","method":"按“如果再去—选人少的时间—为了好好逛店”记条件和目的，再用 without 补上“不用不停绕人”。"}},"T018":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to talk about Ben, a childhood friend who learns about history in his free time. We grew up in the same neighbourhood, and we still talk regularly. His interest has made me look at familiar places differently.","heading":"童年好友爱历史","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to talk about Ben, a childhood friend who learns about history in his free time.","zh":"我想聊聊 Ben，他是我从小认识的朋友，空闲时喜欢了解历史。"},{"en":"We grew up in the same neighbourhood, and we still talk regularly.","zh":"我们在同一个社区长大，现在也经常联系。"},{"en":"His interest has made me look at familiar places differently.","zh":"他的这个兴趣，让我对熟悉的地方有了不同的看法。"}]},{"source":"His interest started with a box of his grandfather's old photographs. Ben wanted to know who the people were and why the streets looked different. He asked his grandfather about them and put the pictures in an album with short descriptions. It became a record of his family's life as well as the town's history.","heading":"老照片引发兴趣","sentences":[{"en":"His interest started with a box of his grandfather's old photographs.","zh":"他的兴趣是从一盒爷爷的老照片开始的。"},{"en":"Ben wanted to know who the people were and why the streets looked different.","zh":"Ben 想知道，照片里的人是谁，为什么街道看起来和现在不一样。"},{"en":"He asked his grandfather about them and put the pictures in an album with short descriptions.","zh":"他就问了爷爷，把照片放进相册，还配了简短的说明。"},{"en":"It became a record of his family's life as well as the town's history.","zh":"这本相册成了他家生活和小镇历史的记录。"}]},{"source":"When we visited a local museum, he showed me an old railway map and explained how trains had helped the town develop. He didn't just repeat dates from the labels. He connected the railway with local shops, jobs and travel, which made the explanation easy to follow.","heading":"铁路地图讲历史","sentences":[{"en":"When we visited a local museum, he showed me an old railway map and explained how trains had helped the town develop.","zh":"我们参观当地一家博物馆时，他给我看了一张旧铁路地图，解释火车怎样推动了这座城镇的发展。","skeleton":"When we visited ..., he showed me ... and explained how trains had helped the town develop."},{"en":"He didn't just repeat dates from the labels.","zh":"他并不是照着标签，把日期重复一遍。"},{"en":"He connected the railway with local shops, jobs and travel, which made the explanation easy to follow.","zh":"他把铁路和当地的商店、工作机会、出行联系起来，这样就很容易听懂。"}]},{"source":"He also takes photographs of interesting museum displays and looks up unfamiliar details afterwards. I used to think history was mostly about remembering facts for school, but his enthusiasm changed my mind. Through him, I've realised that it can explain ordinary places and help us understand how people lived before us.","heading":"历史的新意","sentences":[{"en":"He also takes photographs of interesting museum displays and looks up unfamiliar details afterwards.","zh":"他还会给博物馆里有趣的展品拍照，之后再查自己不了解的细节。"},{"en":"I used to think history was mostly about remembering facts for school, but his enthusiasm changed my mind.","zh":"我以前觉得，历史主要就是为了上学而记住一些知识，但他的热情改变了我的想法。"},{"en":"Through him, I've realised that it can explain ordinary places and help us understand how people lived before us.","zh":"因为他，我意识到，历史可以解释一些普通地方的来历，也能帮助我们了解前人是怎样生活的。","skeleton":"Through him, I've realised that it can explain ordinary places and help us understand ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"When we visited a local museum, he showed me an old railway map and explained how trains had helped the town develop.","method":"先用When交代参观博物馆，再按“给我看地图—解释火车促进发展”记住两个动作。"}},"T019":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"The person I'd like to describe is my colleague Adam, who taught me how to present a complicated idea clearly. We met at work about two years ago, and he is a few years older than me. Before he helped me, I often included too many details when explaining something.","heading":"同事教我表达","sentences":[{"en":"The person I'd like to describe is my colleague Adam, who taught me how to present a complicated idea clearly.","zh":"我想介绍的人是我的同事 Adam，他教会了我怎样清楚地表达一个复杂的想法。"},{"en":"We met at work about two years ago, and he is a few years older than me.","zh":"我们大约两年前在工作中认识，他比我大几岁。"},{"en":"Before he helped me, I often included too many details when explaining something.","zh":"在他帮我之前，我解释事情时常常会带上太多细节。"}]},{"source":"What stands out about him is how organised he is. Before starting a task, he writes down the main steps and decides what needs to be done first. He doesn't make things complicated. In fact, he's usually the person who makes a confusing situation easier to understand.","heading":"做事很有条理","sentences":[{"en":"What stands out about him is how organised he is.","zh":"他最突出的特点就是做事很有条理。"},{"en":"Before starting a task, he writes down the main steps and decides what needs to be done first.","zh":"开始一项任务前，他会写下主要步骤，再决定先做什么。"},{"en":"He doesn't make things complicated.","zh":"他不会把事情弄得很复杂。"},{"en":"In fact, he's usually the person who makes a confusing situation easier to understand.","zh":"实际上，遇到让人摸不着头脑的情况，通常都是他把事情解释清楚。"}]},{"source":"A few months ago, I had to explain a new idea to our team. I knew the details, but I couldn't present them clearly. Adam suggested using one simple example instead of showing everything at once. He also helped me practise and pointed out the parts that were difficult to follow.","heading":"练习表达","sentences":[{"en":"A few months ago, I had to explain a new idea to our team.","zh":"几个月前，我需要向团队解释一个新想法。"},{"en":"I knew the details, but I couldn't present them clearly.","zh":"我了解其中的细节，却没办法把它们讲清楚。"},{"en":"Adam suggested using one simple example instead of showing everything at once.","zh":"Adam 建议用一个简单的例子来说明，而不是一下子把所有内容都展示出来。"},{"en":"He also helped me practise and pointed out the parts that were difficult to follow.","zh":"他还帮我练习，指出了哪些地方让人听不明白。"}]},{"source":"The presentation went much better than I expected. People understood the idea, and I felt more confident afterwards. What I appreciate most is that he helped me learn a useful skill rather than just doing the work for me.","heading":"学会表达","sentences":[{"en":"The presentation went much better than I expected.","zh":"那次演示比我预想的顺利得多。"},{"en":"People understood the idea, and I felt more confident afterwards.","zh":"大家理解了这个想法，之后我也更有信心了。"},{"en":"What I appreciate most is that he helped me learn a useful skill rather than just doing the work for me.","zh":"我最感谢的是，他帮我学会了一项实用的技能，而不是直接替我把工作做完。","skeleton":"What I appreciate most is that he helped me learn a useful skill ..."}]},{"source":"Since then, I've tried to follow his approach. Whenever a task feels overwhelming, I break it into smaller steps. So he's had a positive influence on the way I work.","heading":"拆分任务的方法","sentences":[{"en":"Since then, I've tried to follow his approach.","zh":"从那以后，我就试着照他的方法去做。"},{"en":"Whenever a task feels overwhelming, I break it into smaller steps.","zh":"每当一项任务让我觉得难以应付时，我就把它拆成更小的步骤。"},{"en":"So he's had a positive influence on the way I work.","zh":"所以，他对我的工作方式产生了积极的影响。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"The person I'd like to describe is my colleague Adam, who taught me how to present a complicated idea clearly.","method":"先说 The person I'd like to describe is my colleague Adam，再用 who taught me how to 接他教我的表达技能。"}},"T020":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"The film I'd choose is The Martian. I watched it at home a few months ago after reading the novel by Andy Weir. Because I had enjoyed the book, I expected the film to give me the same sense of involvement, but some parts disappointed me.","heading":"电影不如预期","sentences":[{"en":"The film I'd choose is The Martian.","zh":"我会选的电影是《火星救援》。"},{"en":"I watched it at home a few months ago after reading the novel by Andy Weir.","zh":"几个月前，读完安迪·威尔的小说后，我在家看了这部电影。"},{"en":"Because I had enjoyed the book, I expected the film to give me the same sense of involvement, but some parts disappointed me.","zh":"因为我很喜欢那本书，所以我期待电影也能带给我同样的投入感，但其中一些部分让我失望了。","skeleton":"Because I had enjoyed the book, I expected the film to give me ..., but some parts disappointed me."}]},{"source":"The story follows an astronaut called Mark Watney who is accidentally left behind on Mars. He has to work out how to survive and contact Earth. The main idea is interesting, and I liked the fact that science and practical thinking were important to the story.","heading":"火星求生","sentences":[{"en":"The story follows an astronaut called Mark Watney who is accidentally left behind on Mars.","zh":"故事讲的是一位叫 Mark Watney 的宇航员，他意外被留在了火星上。"},{"en":"He has to work out how to survive and contact Earth.","zh":"他必须想办法生存下去，并与地球取得联系。"},{"en":"The main idea is interesting, and I liked the fact that science and practical thinking were important to the story.","zh":"故事的核心想法很有意思，而且我喜欢它把科学和务实的思考放在重要位置这一点。","skeleton":"The main idea is interesting, and I liked the fact that ... were important to the story."}]},{"source":"My disappointment was mainly about the pace of the problem-solving. In the book, I could spend time following his thoughts and understanding why a particular solution might work. In the film, some of those steps felt rushed, so I was less involved in the decisions.","heading":"解题太匆忙","sentences":[{"en":"My disappointment was mainly about the pace of the problem-solving.","zh":"我失望的地方，主要是解决问题的节奏。"},{"en":"In the book, I could spend time following his thoughts and understanding why a particular solution might work.","zh":"读书时，我可以花时间跟着他的思路走，理解某个办法为什么可能有用。"},{"en":"In the film, some of those steps felt rushed, so I was less involved in the decisions.","zh":"电影里，有些步骤显得很仓促，所以我对那些决定的投入感也没那么强。"}]},{"source":"The visuals were impressive, and the acting was enjoyable, but I sometimes felt that a difficult problem had been solved before I fully understood it. I watched it with a friend, and we discussed that difference afterwards.","heading":"难题解决得太快","sentences":[{"en":"The visuals were impressive, and the acting was enjoyable, but I sometimes felt that a difficult problem had been solved before I fully understood it.","zh":"视觉效果很惊艳，演员的表演也很好看，但有时我觉得，还没完全弄懂一个难题，电影就已经把它解决了。","skeleton":"The visuals were impressive, and the acting was enjoyable, but I sometimes felt that ... before I fully understood it."},{"en":"I watched it with a friend, and we discussed that difference afterwards.","zh":"我和一个朋友一起看的，之后我们也聊了书和电影的这种不同。"}]},{"source":"I wouldn't describe it as a terrible film. My expectations were simply too closely connected to the book. I learned that an adaptation can tell the same story while creating a different experience. If I watched it again, I'd probably judge it more on its own terms.","heading":"重新看待改编","sentences":[{"en":"I wouldn't describe it as a terrible film.","zh":"我不会说它是一部很糟糕的电影。"},{"en":"My expectations were simply too closely connected to the book.","zh":"只是我的期待和原著联系得太紧了。"},{"en":"I learned that an adaptation can tell the same story while creating a different experience.","zh":"我明白了，改编作品可以讲同一个故事，却带来不一样的体验。"},{"en":"If I watched it again, I'd probably judge it more on its own terms.","zh":"如果再看一次，我可能会更多地按电影本身来评价它。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"The visuals were impressive, and the acting was enjoyable, but I sometimes felt that a difficult problem had been solved before I fully understood it.","method":"先记“画面好、表演好”两项肯定，再用 but 转到难题已解决，最后加 before I fully understood it 说明失望原因。"}},"T021":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A short journey I don't enjoy is the drive from home to the supermarket when the roads are busy. I make it because I need to buy groceries, but it can take much longer than the distance would suggest.","heading":"堵车时去超市","sentences":[{"en":"A short journey I don't enjoy is the drive from home to the supermarket when the roads are busy.","zh":"有一段短途路程我不太喜欢，就是道路拥堵时，从家开车去超市。"},{"en":"I make it because I need to buy groceries, but it can take much longer than the distance would suggest.","zh":"我得去，因为要买日常吃用的东西，但实际花的时间可能比按距离估计的长得多。"}]},{"source":"One Saturday, I left at a busy time without thinking about the journey. I had things to do afterwards, so I assumed I could get the shopping finished quickly. Instead, the traffic moved slowly, and I spent much longer on the road than I had planned.","heading":"堵车耽误买菜","sentences":[{"en":"One Saturday, I left at a busy time without thinking about the journey.","zh":"有个星期六，我没怎么考虑路上的情况，就在繁忙时段出门了。"},{"en":"I had things to do afterwards, so I assumed I could get the shopping finished quickly.","zh":"之后我还有事情要做，所以以为自己能很快买完东西。"},{"en":"Instead, the traffic moved slowly, and I spent much longer on the road than I had planned.","zh":"结果路上的车开得很慢，我在路上花的时间比计划长得多。"}]},{"source":"What bothered me most was the uncertainty. I could see that the supermarket wasn't very far away, but I couldn't tell how long it would take to reach it. I kept thinking about the other tasks waiting for me at home.","heading":"路近时间难料","sentences":[{"en":"What bothered me most was the uncertainty.","zh":"最让我烦的是，不知道到底要花多久。"},{"en":"I could see that the supermarket wasn't very far away, but I couldn't tell how long it would take to reach it.","zh":"我能看到超市离得并不远，却没法判断多久才能到。"},{"en":"I kept thinking about the other tasks waiting for me at home.","zh":"我一直想着，家里还有其他事情等着我做。"}]},{"source":"When I finally arrived, I still had to choose everything and pay, so the whole errand felt less simple than I had expected. Nothing serious happened. It was mainly a frustrating use of time for an ordinary task.","heading":"买菜并不轻松","sentences":[{"en":"When I finally arrived, I still had to choose everything and pay, so the whole errand felt less simple than I had expected.","zh":"等我终于到了，还是得挑好所有东西再付款，所以整个买东西的过程，比我原以为的要麻烦。","skeleton":"When I finally arrived, I still had to choose everything and pay, so the whole errand felt less simple ..."},{"en":"Nothing serious happened.","zh":"倒是没发生什么严重的事。"},{"en":"It was mainly a frustrating use of time for an ordinary task.","zh":"主要就是做这么一件日常小事，却浪费了时间，让人挺烦的。"}]},{"source":"Since then, I've tried to go at a quieter time and prepare a list before leaving. That doesn't make the journey exciting, but it makes it easier to manage. I dislike it because a short, necessary trip can sometimes take up too much of my day.","heading":"调整购物安排","sentences":[{"en":"Since then, I've tried to go at a quieter time and prepare a list before leaving.","zh":"从那以后，我就尽量选人少车少的时候去，出门前也会列好购物清单。"},{"en":"That doesn't make the journey exciting, but it makes it easier to manage.","zh":"这不会让路程变得有趣，但会让事情更好安排。"},{"en":"I dislike it because a short, necessary trip can sometimes take up too much of my day.","zh":"我不喜欢这段路程，是因为这么一趟短短的、又必须去的路，有时却会占用我一天里太多的时间。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"When I finally arrived, I still had to choose everything and pay, so the whole errand felt less simple than I had expected.","method":"按“终于到达—仍要挑选付款—所以比想象麻烦”串起时间、动作和结果，用 so 接最后一块。"}},"T022":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A popular person I know is my colleague Adam. We met at work about two years ago and gradually became friends. Many people in our team enjoy working with him because he is approachable and takes other people's questions seriously.","heading":"受欢迎同事","sentences":[{"en":"A popular person I know is my colleague Adam.","zh":"我认识的一位很受欢迎的人，是我的同事 Adam。"},{"en":"We met at work about two years ago and gradually became friends.","zh":"我们大约两年前在工作中认识，慢慢成了朋友。"},{"en":"Many people in our team enjoy working with him because he is approachable and takes other people's questions seriously.","zh":"团队里很多人喜欢和他共事，因为他很容易亲近，也会认真对待别人的问题。","skeleton":"Many people ... enjoy working with him because he is approachable and takes ... seriously."}]},{"source":"He remembers small things about people and is willing to help without making a big show of it. For example, if someone is new to the team, he explains the basic information and checks whether they are comfortable asking questions. That makes people feel included.","heading":"体贴地帮助新人","sentences":[{"en":"He remembers small things about people and is willing to help without making a big show of it.","zh":"他会记住别人身上的小细节，也愿意帮忙，而且不会刻意张扬。"},{"en":"For example, if someone is new to the team, he explains the basic information and checks whether they are comfortable asking questions.","zh":"比如，团队里来了新人，他会介绍基本情况，还会确认对方是否能自在地提问。","skeleton":"For example, if someone is new to the team, he explains ... and checks whether ..."},{"en":"That makes people feel included.","zh":"这会让大家有被接纳的感觉。"}]},{"source":"A few months ago, I had to explain a new idea to our team. I knew the details, but I couldn't present them clearly. Adam suggested using one simple example instead of showing everything at once. He also helped me practise and pointed out the parts that were difficult to follow.","heading":"练习表达","sentences":[{"en":"A few months ago, I had to explain a new idea to our team.","zh":"几个月前，我需要向团队解释一个新想法。"},{"en":"I knew the details, but I couldn't present them clearly.","zh":"我了解其中的细节，却没办法把它们讲清楚。"},{"en":"Adam suggested using one simple example instead of showing everything at once.","zh":"Adam 建议用一个简单的例子来说明，而不是一下子把所有内容都展示出来。"},{"en":"He also helped me practise and pointed out the parts that were difficult to follow.","zh":"他还帮我练习，指出了哪些地方让人听不明白。"}]},{"source":"The presentation went much better than I expected. People understood the idea, and I felt more confident afterwards. What I appreciate most is that he helped me learn a useful skill rather than just doing the work for me.","heading":"学会表达","sentences":[{"en":"The presentation went much better than I expected.","zh":"那次演示比我预想的顺利得多。"},{"en":"People understood the idea, and I felt more confident afterwards.","zh":"大家理解了这个想法，之后我也更有信心了。"},{"en":"What I appreciate most is that he helped me learn a useful skill rather than just doing the work for me.","zh":"我最感谢的是，他帮我学会了一项实用的技能，而不是直接替我把工作做完。","skeleton":"What I appreciate most is that he helped me learn a useful skill ..."}]},{"source":"I think he is popular because people feel respected around him. He doesn't need to dominate a conversation or impress everyone. His friendliness and willingness to help are enough. I enjoy his company for the same reasons, and I try to learn from the way he treats others.","heading":"受欢迎因尊重人","sentences":[{"en":"I think he is popular because people feel respected around him.","zh":"我觉得他受欢迎，是因为大家和他相处时都感觉被尊重。"},{"en":"He doesn't need to dominate a conversation or impress everyone.","zh":"他不需要在聊天时占据主导，也不需要让每个人都对他刮目相看。"},{"en":"His friendliness and willingness to help are enough.","zh":"他的友善和愿意帮忙，就已经足够了。"},{"en":"I enjoy his company for the same reasons, and I try to learn from the way he treats others.","zh":"我也因为同样的原因喜欢和他相处，并且尽量学习他待人的方式。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"For example, if someone is new to the team, he explains the basic information and checks whether they are comfortable asking questions.","method":"从“有人新加入团队”的 if 条件出发，按“解释基本信息—确认能否自在提问”记住 explains 和 checks。"}},"T023":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to talk about Roger Federer, the retired Swiss tennis player. I first became interested in him when I watched some of his matches on television as a student. I didn't understand every rule, but I could tell that his movement and timing were special.","heading":"关注网球名将","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to talk about Roger Federer, the retired Swiss tennis player.","zh":"我想聊聊罗杰·费德勒，这位已经退役的瑞士网球运动员。"},{"en":"I first became interested in him when I watched some of his matches on television as a student.","zh":"我还是学生时，在电视上看过他的几场比赛，从那时开始对他产生了兴趣。"},{"en":"I didn't understand every rule, but I could tell that his movement and timing were special.","zh":"我当时并不是每条规则都懂，但能看出他的移动和时机把握很不一般。"}]},{"source":"He finished his career with twenty Grand Slam singles titles, including eight Wimbledon titles. What I admire most, though, is the way he makes a difficult sport look natural. His movements seem smooth, and watching him has made me appreciate the importance of technique.","heading":"钦佩球技","sentences":[{"en":"He finished his career with twenty Grand Slam singles titles, including eight Wimbledon titles.","zh":"他的职业生涯结束时，共获得了二十个大满贯单打冠军，其中包括八个温网冠军。"},{"en":"What I admire most, though, is the way he makes a difficult sport look natural.","zh":"不过，我最佩服的是，他能把一项很难的运动打得那么自然。"},{"en":"His movements seem smooth, and watching him has made me appreciate the importance of technique.","zh":"他的动作看起来很流畅，看他比赛也让我更能体会到技术的重要性。"}]},{"source":"One part of his career that really impressed me was his return after injury. He missed the second half of the 2016 season because of a knee problem. Then, in 2017, he came back and won both the Australian Open and Wimbledon. To me, that is a powerful example of recovering from a setback.","heading":"伤后回归","sentences":[{"en":"One part of his career that really impressed me was his return after injury.","zh":"他职业生涯中，让我特别印象深刻的一段，是受伤之后的回归。"},{"en":"He missed the second half of the 2016 season because of a knee problem.","zh":"因为膝盖出了问题，他缺席了二〇一六赛季的后半段。"},{"en":"Then, in 2017, he came back and won both the Australian Open and Wimbledon.","zh":"随后在二〇一七年，他重返赛场，赢得了澳网和温网两个冠军。"},{"en":"To me, that is a powerful example of recovering from a setback.","zh":"在我看来，这是一个从挫折中恢复过来的有力例子。"}]},{"source":"I also like the fact that I can learn something from his story without becoming a professional athlete. When I'm struggling with a new skill, I sometimes expect results too quickly. Thinking about his comeback reminds me to be patient, work on the basics and give myself time. That's why I admire him as both a sportsman and an example of persistence.","heading":"复出带来的启发","sentences":[{"en":"I also like the fact that I can learn something from his story without becoming a professional athlete.","zh":"我还喜欢的一点是，即使我不成为职业运动员，也能从他的故事里学到东西。"},{"en":"When I'm struggling with a new skill, I sometimes expect results too quickly.","zh":"学习一项新技能遇到困难时，我有时会太急着看到成果。"},{"en":"Thinking about his comeback reminds me to be patient, work on the basics and give myself time.","zh":"想到他复出的经历，就会提醒我耐心一点，练好基础，也给自己一些时间。"},{"en":"That's why I admire him as both a sportsman and an example of persistence.","zh":"所以我钦佩他，不仅因为他是一名运动员，也因为他体现了坚持不懈的精神。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I first became interested in him when I watched some of his matches on television as a student.","method":"以“我开始对他感兴趣”为主线，用when补“看比赛的时候”，再补“当时还是学生”。"}},"T024":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A person whose fitness I helped improve is a friend called Sam. Like me, he spent most of his working day sitting down. He wanted to be more active, but he found it difficult to start an exercise routine that he could continue.","heading":"帮助朋友多活动","sentences":[{"en":"A person whose fitness I helped improve is a friend called Sam.","zh":"我帮助过一个叫 Sam 的朋友改善身体状态。"},{"en":"Like me, he spent most of his working day sitting down.","zh":"他和我一样，一天的大部分工作时间都坐着。"},{"en":"He wanted to be more active, but he found it difficult to start an exercise routine that he could continue.","zh":"他想多活动活动，但发现很难开始一个自己能够一直坚持的运动习惯。"}]},{"source":"A few months ago, I suggested that we begin with a short walk after work. I didn't give him complicated fitness advice. I simply thought doing something together would make the first step easier. We agreed to try ten minutes rather than set an ambitious target.","heading":"结伴迈出第一步","sentences":[{"en":"A few months ago, I suggested that we begin with a short walk after work.","zh":"几个月前，我建议我们从下班后短时间散步开始。"},{"en":"I didn't give him complicated fitness advice.","zh":"我没有给他复杂的健身建议。"},{"en":"I simply thought doing something together would make the first step easier.","zh":"我只是觉得，两个人一起做点什么，会让迈出第一步更容易。"},{"en":"We agreed to try ten minutes rather than set an ambitious target.","zh":"我们说好先试十分钟，而不是定一个很高的目标。"}]},{"source":"When the weather was comfortable, we walked outside. Otherwise, we found somewhere suitable indoors. I checked in with him before the walk and tried to make the plan convenient. On days when one of us felt tired, we still did a shorter version instead of cancelling everything.","heading":"灵活坚持散步","sentences":[{"en":"When the weather was comfortable, we walked outside.","zh":"天气舒服的时候，我们就在外面走走。"},{"en":"Otherwise, we found somewhere suitable indoors.","zh":"不然，我们就找个合适的室内地方。"},{"en":"I checked in with him before the walk and tried to make the plan convenient.","zh":"散步前，我会和他联系一下，也尽量把安排弄得方便些。"},{"en":"On days when one of us felt tired, we still did a shorter version instead of cancelling everything.","zh":"如果某天我们其中一个人觉得累，还是会走，只是缩短一点，而不是直接取消。"}]},{"source":"After a few weeks, he said the routine had become easier to maintain. He also enjoyed having a break between work and the rest of the evening. I can't claim that it transformed his health, but it did help him spend more time moving regularly.","heading":"逐渐坚持运动","sentences":[{"en":"After a few weeks, he said the routine had become easier to maintain.","zh":"几周后，他说这个习惯已经更容易坚持下去了。"},{"en":"He also enjoyed having a break between work and the rest of the evening.","zh":"他也很喜欢在工作和晚上剩下的时间之间，留出这样一段休息时间。"},{"en":"I can't claim that it transformed his health, but it did help him spend more time moving regularly.","zh":"我不能说这彻底改变了他的健康状况，但的确帮他更经常地花时间活动身体。"}]},{"source":"The hardest part was getting started and keeping the plan simple. I'm pleased that I could support him without putting pressure on him. Helping with a small habit was more practical than telling him to make a huge change overnight.","heading":"简单习惯的帮助","sentences":[{"en":"The hardest part was getting started and keeping the plan simple.","zh":"最难的部分是开始行动，同时让计划保持简单。"},{"en":"I'm pleased that I could support him without putting pressure on him.","zh":"我很高兴自己能支持他，又不会给他压力。"},{"en":"Helping with a small habit was more practical than telling him to make a huge change overnight.","zh":"帮他养成一个小习惯，比叫他一夜之间做出巨大的改变更实际。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"He wanted to be more active, but he found it difficult to start an exercise routine that he could continue.","method":"先说“想更活跃”，再用 but 接“难以开始”，最后用 that he could continue 限定他想坚持的运动习惯。"}},"T025":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A tall building I'd like to describe is the Burj Khalifa in Dubai. It is 828 metres high, and I saw it up close during an afternoon out with a friend. I had seen plenty of photographs before, but standing near it gave me a much stronger impression of its size.","heading":"近看哈利法塔","sentences":[{"en":"A tall building I'd like to describe is the Burj Khalifa in Dubai.","zh":"我想介绍的一座高楼是迪拜的哈利法塔。"},{"en":"It is 828 metres high, and I saw it up close during an afternoon out with a friend.","zh":"它高八百二十八米，有一天下午我和朋友外出时，近距离看到了它。"},{"en":"I had seen plenty of photographs before, but standing near it gave me a much stronger impression of its size.","zh":"之前我已经看过很多照片，但站在它附近，让我更强烈地感受到了它的庞大。"}]},{"source":"What I noticed first was how far I had to look up. From the ground, the upper part seemed very distant, and it was difficult to fit the whole building into one photograph. We walked around the nearby area and stopped where we could see it more clearly.","heading":"仰望高楼","sentences":[{"en":"What I noticed first was how far I had to look up.","zh":"我最先注意到的是，我得抬头望得多高。"},{"en":"From the ground, the upper part seemed very distant, and it was difficult to fit the whole building into one photograph.","zh":"从地面看，楼的上部似乎非常遥远，很难用一张照片把整栋楼拍进去。","skeleton":"From the ground, the upper part seemed very distant, and it was difficult to fit ... into one photograph."},{"en":"We walked around the nearby area and stopped where we could see it more clearly.","zh":"我们在附近逛了一会儿，到了能看得更清楚的地方就停下来。"}]},{"source":"I haven't visited an observation deck inside it, so I can't describe that experience. What I'm describing is seeing it from outside. I enjoyed noticing how the appearance changed as we moved and looked from different angles.","heading":"楼外的视角","sentences":[{"en":"I haven't visited an observation deck inside it, so I can't describe that experience.","zh":"我没去过它里面的观景台，所以没办法描述那种体验。"},{"en":"What I'm describing is seeing it from outside.","zh":"我讲的是从外面看它的经历。"},{"en":"I enjoyed noticing how the appearance changed as we moved and looked from different angles.","zh":"我很喜欢观察，随着我们移动、从不同角度看，它的外观会怎样变化。"}]},{"source":"I don't usually take a strong interest in tall buildings, but this one made me curious about how such a large structure is designed and built. I'd like to learn a little more about that process before another visit.","heading":"好奇高楼的建造","sentences":[{"en":"I don't usually take a strong interest in tall buildings, but this one made me curious about how such a large structure is designed and built.","zh":"我平时对高楼没有特别大的兴趣，但这座楼让我好奇，这么庞大的建筑究竟是怎样设计和建造出来的。","skeleton":"I don't usually take a strong interest ..., but this one made me curious about how ... is designed and built."},{"en":"I'd like to learn a little more about that process before another visit.","zh":"我想在下次参观前，稍微多了解一下这个过程。"}]},{"source":"It stayed in my mind because the real experience felt different from seeing an image on a screen. I'd like to go back at a different time of day to notice the light on its surface.","heading":"亲眼的感受","sentences":[{"en":"It stayed in my mind because the real experience felt different from seeing an image on a screen.","zh":"这栋楼让我印象很深，因为亲眼看到它的感受，和在屏幕上看图片很不一样。"},{"en":"I'd like to go back at a different time of day to notice the light on its surface.","zh":"我想换个时段再去，看看它表面上的光线。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I don't usually take a strong interest in tall buildings, but this one made me curious about how such a large structure is designed and built.","method":"先记“平时兴趣不大”，用 but 转到 made me curious about，再把 how 后的 designed 和 built 成对记。"}},"T026":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"An interesting video I watched was a recording of Roger Federer's 2024 commencement speech at Dartmouth. A friend recommended it to me a few months ago. I knew him as a tennis player, so I was curious about what he would say to graduating students.","heading":"费德勒毕业演讲","sentences":[{"en":"An interesting video I watched was a recording of Roger Federer's 2024 commencement speech at Dartmouth.","zh":"我看过的一个有趣视频，是罗杰·费德勒二〇二四年在达特茅斯学院毕业典礼上演讲的录像。"},{"en":"A friend recommended it to me a few months ago.","zh":"几个月前，一位朋友把它推荐给了我。"},{"en":"I knew him as a tennis player, so I was curious about what he would say to graduating students.","zh":"我知道他是一名网球运动员，所以很好奇他会对毕业生说些什么。"}]},{"source":"I watched it at home when I had some time in the evening. He shared lessons from tennis, but the part that stayed with me was the idea that a performance which looks effortless can actually require a great deal of work.","heading":"轻松背后","sentences":[{"en":"I watched it at home when I had some time in the evening.","zh":"那天晚上有空时，我在家看了这个视频。"},{"en":"He shared lessons from tennis, but the part that stayed with me was the idea that a performance which looks effortless can actually require a great deal of work.","zh":"他分享了从网球中学到的道理，但最让我记住的是这个想法：看起来毫不费力的表现，实际上可能需要付出大量努力。","skeleton":"He shared lessons from tennis, but the part that stayed with me was the idea that a performance ... can actually require a great deal of work."}]},{"source":"That caught my attention because I sometimes compare my own speaking with people who sound very confident. I notice the result, but I don't always think about the practice behind it. His explanation helped me look at that difference in a more useful way.","heading":"看到成果与练习","sentences":[{"en":"That caught my attention because I sometimes compare my own speaking with people who sound very confident.","zh":"那一点吸引了我的注意，因为我有时候会把自己的口语和那些听起来很有自信的人比较。"},{"en":"I notice the result, but I don't always think about the practice behind it.","zh":"我会注意到他们的表现，却不总会想到背后的练习。"},{"en":"His explanation helped me look at that difference in a more useful way.","zh":"他的解释让我能用一种更有帮助的方式来看待这种差距。"}]},{"source":"I also enjoyed the way he mixed personal experiences with a relaxed style. The video didn't feel like a list of instructions I had to memorise. I could understand the main idea and connect it with something I was trying to improve myself.","heading":"轻松视频有启发","sentences":[{"en":"I also enjoyed the way he mixed personal experiences with a relaxed style.","zh":"我也喜欢他把个人经历融入轻松讲述风格的方式。"},{"en":"The video didn't feel like a list of instructions I had to memorise.","zh":"这个视频不像是一串必须背下来的说明。"},{"en":"I could understand the main idea and connect it with something I was trying to improve myself.","zh":"我能理解它的主要意思，也能把它和自己正想改进的事情联系起来。"}]},{"source":"Afterwards, I thought about my English practice. Instead of expecting every answer to sound natural immediately, I felt more willing to repeat it and make small changes. I found the video interesting because advice from a different field could still be useful in my everyday life.","heading":"练习的启发","sentences":[{"en":"Afterwards, I thought about my English practice.","zh":"看完后，我想到了自己的英语练习。"},{"en":"Instead of expecting every answer to sound natural immediately, I felt more willing to repeat it and make small changes.","zh":"我没有再期待每个答案一开始就说得自然，而是更愿意反复练习，再作些小调整。","skeleton":"Instead of expecting every answer to sound natural ..., I felt more willing to repeat it and make small changes."},{"en":"I found the video interesting because advice from a different field could still be useful in my everyday life.","zh":"我觉得这个视频很有意思，因为来自另一个领域的建议，也能对我的日常生活有用。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"He shared lessons from tennis, but the part that stayed with me was the idea that a performance which looks effortless can actually require a great deal of work.","method":"先记 the part that stayed with me was the idea，再接表演需要很多努力的主干，最后在 performance 后补看似轻松。"}},"T027":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A place I found boring was the waiting room of a customer-service centre. I went there a while ago to update some account details, and I expected the visit to be fairly quick. However, I needed to wait for my number to be called.","heading":"无聊的等候","sentences":[{"en":"A place I found boring was the waiting room of a customer-service centre.","zh":"一个让我觉得无聊的地方，是客服中心的等候室。"},{"en":"I went there a while ago to update some account details, and I expected the visit to be fairly quick.","zh":"前阵子我去那里更新一些账户信息，本以为很快就能办完。"},{"en":"However, I needed to wait for my number to be called.","zh":"但我得等着叫到自己的号码。"}]},{"source":"The room had rows of chairs and a few information posters on the walls. There wasn't much to look at, and most people were sitting quietly. I found a seat and checked the papers I had brought, but that only took a few minutes.","heading":"乏味的等候室","sentences":[{"en":"The room had rows of chairs and a few information posters on the walls.","zh":"房间里摆着一排排椅子，墙上贴了几张信息海报。"},{"en":"There wasn't much to look at, and most people were sitting quietly.","zh":"没什么东西可看，大多数人都安静地坐着。"},{"en":"I found a seat and checked the papers I had brought, but that only took a few minutes.","zh":"我找了个座位，检查了一下带来的文件，但这只花了几分钟。"}]},{"source":"After that, I kept looking at the time and the number being shown. I hadn't brought a book because I didn't expect to wait long. I tried reading the information posters, although most of it wasn't connected with the reason I was there.","heading":"等候时的消遣","sentences":[{"en":"After that, I kept looking at the time and the number being shown.","zh":"那之后，我就不停地看时间和屏幕上显示的号码。"},{"en":"I hadn't brought a book because I didn't expect to wait long.","zh":"我没带书，因为我原以为不用等很久。"},{"en":"I tried reading the information posters, although most of it wasn't connected with the reason I was there.","zh":"我试着读那些信息海报，尽管大部分内容都与我到那里的原因无关。"}]},{"source":"What made the place boring was having very little to do while not knowing exactly how long I would be waiting. I couldn't simply leave, because I still needed to get the account issue sorted out. The visit took around forty minutes before someone could help me.","heading":"无事可做的等待","sentences":[{"en":"What made the place boring was having very little to do while not knowing exactly how long I would be waiting.","zh":"那个地方让人觉得无聊，是因为几乎没什么事可做，又不知道究竟还要等多久。"},{"en":"I couldn't simply leave, because I still needed to get the account issue sorted out.","zh":"我也不能直接离开，因为账户的问题还没有解决。"},{"en":"The visit took around forty minutes before someone could help me.","zh":"在那里待了大约四十分钟，才有人能帮我处理。"}]},{"source":"The staff dealt with the task once it was my turn, so I wouldn't describe the whole service as bad. It was mainly the waiting room experience that I disliked. Next time, I'd bring something to read and allow more time.","heading":"等候体验待改善","sentences":[{"en":"The staff dealt with the task once it was my turn, so I wouldn't describe the whole service as bad.","zh":"轮到我之后，工作人员就把事情处理了，所以我不会说整个服务都很差。"},{"en":"It was mainly the waiting room experience that I disliked.","zh":"我不喜欢的，主要还是等候室里的体验。"},{"en":"Next time, I'd bring something to read and allow more time.","zh":"下次我会带点东西读，也会多预留些时间。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"What made the place boring was having very little to do while not knowing exactly how long I would be waiting.","method":"用 What made the place boring was 开头，随后把“几乎无事可做”和“不知道等多久”通过 while 连起来。"}},"T028":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A time I got up earlier than usual was one Saturday when I arranged to meet a friend for a morning walk. We wanted to go out before the day became too hot, so we agreed to meet shortly after sunrise.","heading":"约好清早散步","sentences":[{"en":"A time I got up earlier than usual was one Saturday when I arranged to meet a friend for a morning walk.","zh":"有一次我比平时起得早，是一个星期六，我约了朋友早上去散步。"},{"en":"We wanted to go out before the day became too hot, so we agreed to meet shortly after sunrise.","zh":"我们想趁天气还没变得太热就出门，所以约好在日出后不久见面。"}]},{"source":"I'm not normally someone who wakes up very early on a day off. To make it easier, I prepared my clothes and set an alarm the night before. I also went to bed a little earlier instead of staying on my phone.","heading":"为早起提前准备","sentences":[{"en":"I'm not normally someone who wakes up very early on a day off.","zh":"平时休息日，我不是那种会很早起床的人。"},{"en":"To make it easier, I prepared my clothes and set an alarm the night before.","zh":"为了更容易起床，我前一天晚上就准备好了衣服，也设好了闹钟。"},{"en":"I also went to bed a little earlier instead of staying on my phone.","zh":"我还比平时早一点上床，没有一直玩手机。"}]},{"source":"When the alarm rang, I wanted to go back to sleep. However, I knew my friend was expecting me, so I got ready and left. Once I was outside, I began to feel more awake. The streets were quieter than usual, and the air felt more comfortable.","heading":"起床出门","sentences":[{"en":"When the alarm rang, I wanted to go back to sleep.","zh":"闹钟响时，我还想继续睡。"},{"en":"However, I knew my friend was expecting me, so I got ready and left.","zh":"不过，我知道朋友正等着我，所以就收拾好出门了。"},{"en":"Once I was outside, I began to feel more awake.","zh":"出了门后，我开始觉得清醒了些。"},{"en":"The streets were quieter than usual, and the air felt more comfortable.","zh":"街上比平时安静，空气也让人觉得更舒服。"}]},{"source":"We walked for a while and then had breakfast together. I enjoyed having time to talk without feeling rushed. By the time I got home, I had already done something pleasant, and there was still most of the day left.","heading":"早起的收获","sentences":[{"en":"We walked for a while and then had breakfast together.","zh":"我们走了一会儿，然后一起吃了早餐。"},{"en":"I enjoyed having time to talk without feeling rushed.","zh":"我很享受有时间聊天，而且不用赶时间。"},{"en":"By the time I got home, I had already done something pleasant, and there was still most of the day left.","zh":"等我回到家时，已经做了一件开心的事，而这一天还剩下大半。"}]},{"source":"I was glad I had made the effort. I wouldn't want to wake up at that time every weekend, but it showed me why some people enjoy an early start. Planning one enjoyable activity made getting out of bed much easier.","heading":"早起也有乐趣","sentences":[{"en":"I was glad I had made the effort.","zh":"我很高兴自己努力做到了。"},{"en":"I wouldn't want to wake up at that time every weekend, but it showed me why some people enjoy an early start.","zh":"我不想每个周末都那么早起，但这次经历让我明白，为什么有些人喜欢早点开始一天。"},{"en":"Planning one enjoyable activity made getting out of bed much easier.","zh":"安排一项有趣的活动，让起床变得容易多了。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I wouldn't want to wake up at that time every weekend, but it showed me why some people enjoy an early start.","method":"用“我不想每周都早起”开头，再用but接“这让我理解别人为何喜欢早起”，保留why引出的原因从句。"}},"T029":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to talk about my grandmother and a skill she taught me when I was a child. She enjoyed looking after plants, and whenever I visited her, I liked spending time in the small garden near her home.","heading":"祖母花园","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to talk about my grandmother and a skill she taught me when I was a child.","zh":"我想聊聊我的祖母，还有她在我小时候教给我的一项技能。"},{"en":"She enjoyed looking after plants, and whenever I visited her, I liked spending time in the small garden near her home.","zh":"她喜欢照料植物，每次我去看她，都喜欢在她家附近的小花园里待一会儿。","skeleton":"She enjoyed looking after plants, and whenever I visited her, I liked spending time in the small garden ..."}]},{"source":"When I was about ten, she helped me grow a plant of my own. At first, I thought I only needed to put it in the soil and water it as much as possible. She explained that plants needed the right amount of water and enough light, and that doing more wasn't always doing better.","heading":"学会适度养护","sentences":[{"en":"When I was about ten, she helped me grow a plant of my own.","zh":"我大约十岁时，她帮我种了一株属于我自己的植物。"},{"en":"At first, I thought I only needed to put it in the soil and water it as much as possible.","zh":"一开始，我以为只要把它种进土里，再尽量多浇水就行了。"},{"en":"She explained that plants needed the right amount of water and enough light, and that doing more wasn't always doing better.","zh":"她解释说，植物需要适量的水和充足的光照，而且做得更多，并不总是做得更好。","skeleton":"She explained that plants needed ... and that doing more wasn't always doing better."}]},{"source":"We checked the plant together every few days. I was impatient because I wanted to see a result immediately. She encouraged me to notice small changes instead of expecting something dramatic overnight.","heading":"耐心观察生长","sentences":[{"en":"We checked the plant together every few days.","zh":"我们每隔几天就一起看看那株植物。"},{"en":"I was impatient because I wanted to see a result immediately.","zh":"我没什么耐心，因为想马上看到结果。"},{"en":"She encouraged me to notice small changes instead of expecting something dramatic overnight.","zh":"她鼓励我留意细微的变化，而不是期待一夜之间就出现巨大的变化。"}]},{"source":"Eventually, I saw new leaves, and I felt surprisingly proud. It was a small achievement, but it was something I had helped create and look after myself.","heading":"新叶带来成就","sentences":[{"en":"Eventually, I saw new leaves, and I felt surprisingly proud.","zh":"后来，我看到了新长出的叶子，没想到自己会那么自豪。"},{"en":"It was a small achievement, but it was something I had helped create and look after myself.","zh":"这只是一个小小的成果，但也是我亲自参与种植和照料出来的。"}]},{"source":"What I admire about my grandmother is her patience. She didn't make me feel foolish when I made mistakes. She explained things calmly and let me try again. I still remember that experience because it taught me more than how to care for a plant. It also taught me to be consistent and to give things time.","heading":"耐心的教导","sentences":[{"en":"What I admire about my grandmother is her patience.","zh":"我佩服祖母的地方，是她很有耐心。"},{"en":"She didn't make me feel foolish when I made mistakes.","zh":"我犯错的时候，她不会让我觉得自己很笨。"},{"en":"She explained things calmly and let me try again.","zh":"她会平静地给我解释，让我再试一次。"},{"en":"I still remember that experience because it taught me more than how to care for a plant.","zh":"我到现在还记得那次经历，因为它教给我的不只是怎么照顾一株植物。"},{"en":"It also taught me to be consistent and to give things time.","zh":"它也教会了我要坚持做下去，并给事情一些时间。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"She explained that plants needed the right amount of water and enough light, and that doing more wasn't always doing better.","method":"用两个that记住她解释的两点：先说水和光照的需求，再说“多做不等于做好”。"}},"T030":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A new rule I'd like to introduce more widely in China, my home country, would require large residential buildings to provide convenient recycling points and clear instructions. Some places already have useful systems, but I'd like residents in more communities to have easy access to them. The focus would be on making recycling a simple part of everyday life.","heading":"便利回收新规定","sentences":[{"en":"A new rule I'd like to introduce more widely in China, my home country, would require large residential buildings to provide convenient recycling points and clear instructions.","zh":"我希望在我的祖国中国，更广泛地引入一项新规定，要求大型住宅楼提供方便的回收点和清楚的说明。","skeleton":"A new rule ... would require large residential buildings to provide ... and clear instructions."},{"en":"Some places already have useful systems, but I'd like residents in more communities to have easy access to them.","zh":"有些地方已经有了实用的制度，但我希望更多社区的居民都能方便地使用这样的设施。","skeleton":"Some places already have useful systems, but I'd like residents ... to have easy access to them."},{"en":"The focus would be on making recycling a simple part of everyday life.","zh":"重点是让回收成为日常生活里一件简单的事。"}]},{"source":"For example, each building could have an accessible collection area for paper, plastic bottles and metal cans. The signs could use simple pictures and several languages, so new residents would understand what belongs in each container. Building managers would also need to arrange regular collection.","heading":"回收的安排","sentences":[{"en":"For example, each building could have an accessible collection area for paper, plastic bottles and metal cans.","zh":"比如，每栋楼都可以设置一个方便使用的回收区，用来收集纸张、塑料瓶和金属罐。"},{"en":"The signs could use simple pictures and several languages, so new residents would understand what belongs in each container.","zh":"标识可以用简单的图片和几种语言，这样新住户就能知道每种东西该放进哪个容器。","skeleton":"The signs could use simple pictures and several languages, so new residents would understand ..."},{"en":"Building managers would also need to arrange regular collection.","zh":"楼宇管理人员也需要安排定期回收。"}]},{"source":"I started thinking about this while sorting packaging at home. Sometimes I have a few empty bottles or delivery boxes, and I want to deal with them properly without making a separate trip across the city. A reliable collection point close to home would make the routine much simpler.","heading":"家附近的回收点","sentences":[{"en":"I started thinking about this while sorting packaging at home.","zh":"我是在家分类整理包装废弃物时，开始考虑这件事的。"},{"en":"Sometimes I have a few empty bottles or delivery boxes, and I want to deal with them properly without making a separate trip across the city.","zh":"有时家里会有几个空瓶子或快递箱，我想妥善处理它们，又不想为此专门跑到城市另一头。","skeleton":"Sometimes I have a few empty bottles or delivery boxes, and I want to deal with them properly ..."},{"en":"A reliable collection point close to home would make the routine much simpler.","zh":"如果家附近有一个可靠的回收点，这件日常小事就会简单得多。"}]},{"source":"I'd prefer a gradual introduction, with clear guidance before penalties. If people misunderstand the system, helping them correct the mistake would be more useful than immediately punishing them.","heading":"逐步推新规","sentences":[{"en":"I'd prefer a gradual introduction, with clear guidance before penalties.","zh":"我更希望逐步推行，在处罚之前先给出明确的指导。"},{"en":"If people misunderstand the system, helping them correct the mistake would be more useful than immediately punishing them.","zh":"如果大家误解了这套制度，帮他们改正错误会比立刻处罚他们更有用。","skeleton":"If people misunderstand the system, helping them ... would be more useful than ... punishing them."}]},{"source":"The main reason I support this idea is that convenience affects behaviour. When the easier choice is also the environmentally responsible choice, more people are likely to follow it consistently.","heading":"便利促进环保","sentences":[{"en":"The main reason I support this idea is that convenience affects behaviour.","zh":"我支持这个想法的主要原因是，方便与否会影响人的行为。"},{"en":"When the easier choice is also the environmentally responsible choice, more people are likely to follow it consistently.","zh":"当更方便的选择也是对环境负责任的选择时，更多人就可能一直照着做。","skeleton":"When ..., more people are likely to follow it consistently."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"A new rule I'd like to introduce more widely in China, my home country, would require large residential buildings to provide convenient recycling points and clear instructions.","method":"先抓“A new rule would require buildings to provide”这个主干，再补“在中国推广”和“回收点及说明”两组细节。"}},"T031":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to talk about my childhood friend Ben. We grew up in the same neighbourhood and became friends when we were about ten. We used to ride our bikes after school, and although we now live in different cities, we still talk regularly.","heading":"童年好友","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to talk about my childhood friend Ben.","zh":"我想聊聊我的童年好友 Ben。"},{"en":"We grew up in the same neighbourhood and became friends when we were about ten.","zh":"我们在同一个社区长大，大约十岁时成了朋友。"},{"en":"We used to ride our bikes after school, and although we now live in different cities, we still talk regularly.","zh":"以前放学后我们常一起骑自行车，虽然现在住在不同的城市，但还是经常联系。","skeleton":"We used to ride our bikes ..., and although we now live in different cities, we still talk regularly."}]},{"source":"My clearest memory of Ben is from a school sports day. I fell off my bike on the way home and felt embarrassed because other children were watching. He stayed with me, checked that I was all right and walked his own bike beside mine. It was a small gesture, but it showed me that I could count on him.","heading":"童年朋友的照顾","sentences":[{"en":"My clearest memory of Ben is from a school sports day.","zh":"关于本，我最清楚的一段回忆，发生在学校运动会那天。"},{"en":"I fell off my bike on the way home and felt embarrassed because other children were watching.","zh":"回家的路上，我从自行车上摔了下来，因为别的孩子都看着，我觉得很难堪。"},{"en":"He stayed with me, checked that I was all right and walked his own bike beside mine.","zh":"他留下来陪我，确认我没事，然后推着自己的自行车，和我并排走。"},{"en":"It was a small gesture, but it showed me that I could count on him.","zh":"这只是一个小小的举动，但让我知道，我可以信赖他。"}]},{"source":"We were both quite curious as children. We built small things from cardboard, borrowed books from the library and argued about which bike route was faster. These days, we have different interests and live in different cities, but we still exchange messages. He sometimes practises Chinese with me, and I ask him about his latest history project.","heading":"友谊的延续","sentences":[{"en":"We were both quite curious as children.","zh":"我们小时候都挺好奇的。"},{"en":"We built small things from cardboard, borrowed books from the library and argued about which bike route was faster.","zh":"我们用纸板做些小东西，从图书馆借书，还会争论哪条骑车路线更快。","skeleton":"We built small things from cardboard, borrowed books from the library and argued about ..."},{"en":"These days, we have different interests and live in different cities, but we still exchange messages.","zh":"现在我们兴趣不同，也住在不同的城市，但还是会互发消息。"},{"en":"He sometimes practises Chinese with me, and I ask him about his latest history project.","zh":"他有时和我练中文，我也会问他最近在做的历史项目。"}]},{"source":"What makes the friendship valuable is that we can speak honestly without trying to impress each other. He remembers what I was like before I started working, and that makes talking to him feel comfortable. I'm glad we've stayed in touch because a friendship like that has grown through years of ordinary, shared experiences.","heading":"多年友谊的价值","sentences":[{"en":"What makes the friendship valuable is that we can speak honestly without trying to impress each other.","zh":"这段友谊可贵的地方在于，我们能坦诚地聊天，不用刻意让对方对自己刮目相看。"},{"en":"He remembers what I was like before I started working, and that makes talking to him feel comfortable.","zh":"他记得我开始工作以前的样子，所以和他聊天让我觉得很自在。"},{"en":"I'm glad we've stayed in touch because a friendship like that has grown through years of ordinary, shared experiences.","zh":"我很庆幸我们一直保持联系，因为这样的友谊，是在多年来一起经历的那些平凡小事中慢慢成长起来的。","skeleton":"I'm glad we've stayed in touch because a friendship like that has grown through ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I'm glad we've stayed in touch because a friendship like that has grown through years of ordinary, shared experiences.","method":"从“庆幸保持联系”开始，用 because 说原因，再把 years of ordinary, shared experiences 当成一整块记忆。"}},"T032":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to talk about my cousin Sara, who wants to become a nurse. She's a few years younger than me, and we've known each other since childhood. We usually meet at family gatherings, but recently we've also been talking about her future career.","heading":"表妹理想","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to talk about my cousin Sara, who wants to become a nurse.","zh":"我想聊聊我的表妹 Sara，她想成为一名护士。"},{"en":"She's a few years younger than me, and we've known each other since childhood.","zh":"她比我小几岁，我们从小就认识。"},{"en":"We usually meet at family gatherings, but recently we've also been talking about her future career.","zh":"我们通常在家庭聚会时见面，不过最近也一直在聊她未来的职业。"}]},{"source":"Her interest in nursing began when our grandmother spent several days in hospital. Sara noticed that the nurses did much more than check equipment. They explained what was happening and helped our grandmother feel less anxious. She said she wanted a job where her work could make a practical difference to someone's day.","heading":"护理志向的起点","sentences":[{"en":"Her interest in nursing began when our grandmother spent several days in hospital.","zh":"我们祖母住院几天的那次经历，让她开始对护理产生了兴趣。"},{"en":"Sara noticed that the nurses did much more than check equipment.","zh":"萨拉注意到，护士做的远不只是检查设备。"},{"en":"They explained what was happening and helped our grandmother feel less anxious.","zh":"她们会解释当时的情况，还帮助我们祖母减轻焦虑。"},{"en":"She said she wanted a job where her work could make a practical difference to someone's day.","zh":"她说，她想找一份工作，能实实在在地让别人的一天过得更好一些。"}]},{"source":"To explore the idea, she volunteered at a community health event last summer. Her role was simple: welcoming visitors, showing them where to queue and helping them complete basic forms. She didn't provide medical treatment. One older visitor was confused about the registration process, and Sara patiently explained each step. Afterwards, she told me that she had enjoyed helping him feel comfortable.","heading":"志愿体验","sentences":[{"en":"To explore the idea, she volunteered at a community health event last summer.","zh":"为了进一步了解这个想法，去年夏天她在一场社区健康活动中做了志愿者。"},{"en":"Her role was simple: welcoming visitors, showing them where to queue and helping them complete basic forms.","zh":"她的工作很简单：接待来访者，告诉他们在哪里排队，再帮他们填写一些基本表格。"},{"en":"She didn't provide medical treatment.","zh":"她没有提供医疗治疗。"},{"en":"One older visitor was confused about the registration process, and Sara patiently explained each step.","zh":"一位年纪较大的来访者不太明白登记流程，Sara 就耐心地解释了每一步。"},{"en":"Afterwards, she told me that she had enjoyed helping him feel comfortable.","zh":"事后，她告诉我，能帮助他感到自在，她很开心。"}]},{"source":"Her plan is to apply for a nursing course, improve her science knowledge and keep volunteering when she can. She knows the work can involve long shifts and difficult situations, so she doesn't see it as an easy career. I admire her because her ambition is based on real interest and some first-hand experience, rather than just the title.","heading":"踏实规划护理路","sentences":[{"en":"Her plan is to apply for a nursing course, improve her science knowledge and keep volunteering when she can.","zh":"她打算申请护理课程，补充自己的科学知识，并在有时间的时候继续做志愿者。"},{"en":"She knows the work can involve long shifts and difficult situations, so she doesn't see it as an easy career.","zh":"她知道，这份工作可能要长时间轮班，也会遇到棘手的情况，所以她并不觉得这是个轻松的职业。"},{"en":"I admire her because her ambition is based on real interest and some first-hand experience, rather than just the title.","zh":"我佩服她，因为她的志向来自真实的兴趣和一些亲身经历，而不只是冲着护士这个身份。","skeleton":"I admire her because her ambition is based on ..., rather than just the title."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I admire her because her ambition is based on real interest and some first-hand experience, rather than just the title.","method":"把句子记成“我佩服她，因为志向源于兴趣和经历”，再用rather than排除“只看职业称号”。"}},"T033":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to talk about my friend Alex, who runs a small coffee shop near a residential area. I met him through a mutual friend a few years ago. Since then, I've visited his shop fairly often, usually on a Saturday morning.","heading":"朋友的小咖啡店","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to talk about my friend Alex, who runs a small coffee shop near a residential area.","zh":"我想聊聊我的朋友 Alex，他在一个住宅区附近经营着一家小咖啡店。"},{"en":"I met him through a mutual friend a few years ago.","zh":"几年前，我通过一位共同的朋友认识了他。"},{"en":"Since then, I've visited his shop fairly often, usually on a Saturday morning.","zh":"从那以后，我就经常去他的店，通常是在星期六上午。"}]},{"source":"When he first opened it, the business was difficult. There weren't many customers in the morning, and some food was left unsold at the end of each day. Instead of immediately spending more money on advertising, he asked regular customers what they wanted and checked which items actually sold.","heading":"开店遇难","sentences":[{"en":"When he first opened it, the business was difficult.","zh":"他刚开店的时候，生意很不好做。"},{"en":"There weren't many customers in the morning, and some food was left unsold at the end of each day.","zh":"早上的顾客不多，每天结束时也会有一些食物没卖出去。"},{"en":"Instead of immediately spending more money on advertising, he asked regular customers what they wanted and checked which items actually sold.","zh":"他没有马上花更多钱做广告，而是问常客想要什么，并查看哪些东西确实卖得出去。","skeleton":"Instead of immediately spending more money on advertising, he asked regular customers ... and checked ..."}]},{"source":"He reduced the menu to a few reliable choices, prepared smaller batches and introduced a simple breakfast combination. He also created a quiet corner where customers could read or work. Gradually, people started coming back. What I like most is the service: he remembers regular customers' orders and deals with problems politely. Once, my coffee arrived cold, and he replaced it without making the situation awkward.","heading":"调整经营","sentences":[{"en":"He reduced the menu to a few reliable choices, prepared smaller batches and introduced a simple breakfast combination.","zh":"他把菜单缩减为几个比较稳妥的选择，每次准备少一些，还推出了一个简单的早餐组合。","skeleton":"He reduced the menu ..., prepared smaller batches and introduced a simple breakfast combination."},{"en":"He also created a quiet corner where customers could read or work.","zh":"他还布置了一个安静的角落，让顾客可以阅读或工作。"},{"en":"Gradually, people started coming back.","zh":"慢慢地，大家开始再次光顾。"},{"en":"What I like most is the service: he remembers regular customers' orders and deals with problems politely.","zh":"我最喜欢的是那里的服务：他记得常客通常点什么，也会礼貌地处理问题。"},{"en":"Once, my coffee arrived cold, and he replaced it without making the situation awkward.","zh":"有一次，我的咖啡送来时已经冷了，他直接给我换了一杯，没有让场面变得尴尬。"}]},{"source":"I think the shop succeeds because he understands his customers and pays attention to everyday details. He keeps a clear stock list and gives his team sensible tasks, but he's also friendly and enjoys chatting with people. I'm pleased to see his hard work paying off. His experience reminds me that running a good business often depends on steady improvements, rather than one dramatic idea.","heading":"生意成功的原因","sentences":[{"en":"I think the shop succeeds because he understands his customers and pays attention to everyday details.","zh":"我觉得这家店能成功，是因为他了解顾客，也注意日常经营中的细节。"},{"en":"He keeps a clear stock list and gives his team sensible tasks, but he's also friendly and enjoys chatting with people.","zh":"他的库存清单很清楚，给团队安排的任务也很合理，而且他很友善，喜欢和人聊天。","skeleton":"He keeps ... and gives ..., but he's also friendly and enjoys chatting ..."},{"en":"I'm pleased to see his hard work paying off.","zh":"看到他的努力有了回报，我很高兴。"},{"en":"His experience reminds me that running a good business often depends on steady improvements, rather than one dramatic idea.","zh":"他的经历让我想到，经营好一家生意，往往靠的是不断稳步改进，而不是一个惊天动地的点子。","skeleton":"His experience reminds me that running a good business often depends on steady improvements, rather than ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"Instead of immediately spending more money on advertising, he asked regular customers what they wanted and checked which items actually sold.","method":"先记 Instead of 后面省下广告钱的做法，再用 asked 和 checked 记他实际做的问顾客与查销量两步。"}},"T034":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"One time I changed a plan was when I was organising a birthday gathering for a friend. My original idea was to have a small picnic outdoors. A few of us would bring food, sit together and keep the afternoon simple and inexpensive.","heading":"原定生日野餐","sentences":[{"en":"One time I changed a plan was when I was organising a birthday gathering for a friend.","zh":"有一次我改了计划，是在给朋友组织生日聚会的时候。"},{"en":"My original idea was to have a small picnic outdoors.","zh":"我原本想在户外来一次小野餐。"},{"en":"A few of us would bring food, sit together and keep the afternoon simple and inexpensive.","zh":"我们几个人会带点吃的，一起坐着，让这个下午过得简单又不花太多钱。"}]},{"source":"However, on the morning of the gathering, the weather looked windy, and the forecast suggested that rain was possible. I realised that the food and decorations would be difficult to manage outside. I also didn't want everyone to arrive and then feel uncomfortable.","heading":"天气迫使改安排","sentences":[{"en":"However, on the morning of the gathering, the weather looked windy, and the forecast suggested that rain was possible.","zh":"不过，聚会当天早上，看起来风很大，天气预报也说可能会下雨。","skeleton":"However, ... the weather looked windy, and the forecast suggested that rain was possible."},{"en":"I realised that the food and decorations would be difficult to manage outside.","zh":"我意识到，在户外的话，食物和装饰都不太好弄。"},{"en":"I also didn't want everyone to arrive and then feel uncomfortable.","zh":"我也不想让大家到了之后，觉得不舒服。"}]},{"source":"I checked with the group and suggested meeting at a restaurant instead. I found somewhere within our budget, confirmed that there was room for us and sent everyone the new address and time. Another friend contacted the person bringing the cake so that it went to the right place.","heading":"重新安排聚餐","sentences":[{"en":"I checked with the group and suggested meeting at a restaurant instead.","zh":"我和大家确认了一下，建议改到一家餐厅见面。"},{"en":"I found somewhere within our budget, confirmed that there was room for us and sent everyone the new address and time.","zh":"我找了一家价格在预算内的餐厅，确认有位置容纳我们，再把新的地址和时间发给了所有人。","skeleton":"I found somewhere ..., confirmed that there was room for us and sent everyone the new address and time."},{"en":"Another friend contacted the person bringing the cake so that it went to the right place.","zh":"另一个朋友联系了负责带蛋糕的人，确保蛋糕送到正确的地方。"}]},{"source":"The change meant that we no longer needed to prepare picnic food or carry everything outdoors. We could simply meet, order a meal and enjoy the evening. The birthday friend seemed pleased, and the atmosphere was relaxed because nobody was worrying about the weather.","heading":"改计划后的轻松","sentences":[{"en":"The change meant that we no longer needed to prepare picnic food or carry everything outdoors.","zh":"改了计划之后，我们就不用准备野餐食物，也不用把所有东西搬到户外了。"},{"en":"We could simply meet, order a meal and enjoy the evening.","zh":"我们只要碰面，点一顿饭，就能好好享受这个晚上。"},{"en":"The birthday friend seemed pleased, and the atmosphere was relaxed because nobody was worrying about the weather.","zh":"过生日的朋友看起来很开心，气氛也很轻松，因为没有人再为天气担心。","skeleton":"The birthday friend seemed pleased, and the atmosphere was relaxed because ..."}]},{"source":"I was happy with the decision because the important part of the plan was spending time together. Although the setting changed, we still achieved that. The experience taught me to keep the purpose of an event in mind and make a practical adjustment when the original arrangement becomes difficult.","heading":"保留聚会的初衷","sentences":[{"en":"I was happy with the decision because the important part of the plan was spending time together.","zh":"我很满意这个决定，因为这个计划最重要的部分，是大家能一起相处。"},{"en":"Although the setting changed, we still achieved that.","zh":"虽然地点变了，但我们还是做到了这一点。"},{"en":"The experience taught me to keep the purpose of an event in mind and make a practical adjustment when the original arrangement becomes difficult.","zh":"这次经历让我学会，始终记住活动的目的，并在原本的安排变得困难时，做出切实可行的调整。","skeleton":"The experience taught me to keep ... in mind and make a practical adjustment when ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"The experience taught me to keep the purpose of an event in mind and make a practical adjustment when the original arrangement becomes difficult.","method":"记住taught me to后的两个动作：“牢记目的”和“做实际调整”，再用when补调整的时机。"}},"T035":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A time I worked in a group was when a few colleagues and I built a small tool for a repeated task at work. We wanted to reduce the amount of manual checking. Each person understood a different part of the problem, so working together was important.","heading":"合作做工具","sentences":[{"en":"A time I worked in a group was when a few colleagues and I built a small tool for a repeated task at work.","zh":"有一次，我和几位同事合作，为工作中一项重复性的任务做了个小工具。"},{"en":"We wanted to reduce the amount of manual checking.","zh":"我们想减少人工核对的工作量。"},{"en":"Each person understood a different part of the problem, so working together was important.","zh":"每个人了解这个问题的不同部分，所以合作很重要。"}]},{"source":"At first, I thought we should create a complete system with lots of features. However, a colleague suggested starting with a simple version. I wasn't fully convinced because I worried it would look unfinished, but we discussed the idea and agreed to test it.","heading":"先试简版","sentences":[{"en":"At first, I thought we should create a complete system with lots of features.","zh":"一开始，我觉得我们应该做一个功能很多的完整系统。"},{"en":"However, a colleague suggested starting with a simple version.","zh":"不过，一位同事建议先从简单的版本做起。"},{"en":"I wasn't fully convinced because I worried it would look unfinished, but we discussed the idea and agreed to test it.","zh":"我还没有完全被说服，因为我担心它看起来像没做完，但我们讨论了这个想法，决定先试一试。","skeleton":"I wasn't fully convinced because I worried ..., but we discussed the idea and agreed to test it."}]},{"source":"We divided the work between us and focused on the most common problem. I worked on the main function, while another person tested it with a few examples. Our first attempt didn't work properly because we had misunderstood part of the information. We checked the issue together and corrected it.","heading":"分工纠错","sentences":[{"en":"We divided the work between us and focused on the most common problem.","zh":"我们分好了工，把重点放在最常见的问题上。"},{"en":"I worked on the main function, while another person tested it with a few examples.","zh":"我负责主要功能，另一个人则用几个例子进行测试。"},{"en":"Our first attempt didn't work properly because we had misunderstood part of the information.","zh":"第一次尝试没能正常运行，因为我们误解了部分信息。"},{"en":"We checked the issue together and corrected it.","zh":"我们一起检查了问题，并把它纠正了。"}]},{"source":"Eventually, the tool handled the basic task well. It wasn't perfect, but it saved us time and helped us understand what to improve next. Seeing it work was a satisfying moment for me.","heading":"原型成功运行","sentences":[{"en":"Eventually, the tool handled the basic task well.","zh":"最后，这个工具很好地完成了基本任务。"},{"en":"It wasn't perfect, but it saved us time and helped us understand what to improve next.","zh":"它并不完美，但帮我们省了时间，也让我们知道下一步该改进什么。"},{"en":"Seeing it work was a satisfying moment for me.","zh":"看到它运行起来的那一刻，我很有成就感。"}]},{"source":"I was happy with the decision because we learned something useful without spending weeks on an idea that might not work. The experience changed my opinion about planning. I still think planning matters, but now I prefer to try a small, practical solution before making a bigger commitment.","heading":"小步尝试","sentences":[{"en":"I was happy with the decision because we learned something useful without spending weeks on an idea that might not work.","zh":"我对这个决定很满意，因为我们学到了有用的东西，又没有花好几周去做一个可能行不通的想法。","skeleton":"I was happy with the decision because we learned something useful without spending weeks on an idea ..."},{"en":"The experience changed my opinion about planning.","zh":"这次经历改变了我对做计划的看法。"},{"en":"I still think planning matters, but now I prefer to try a small, practical solution before making a bigger commitment.","zh":"我还是觉得计划很重要，但现在我更愿意先尝试一个小而实用的解决办法，再投入更多。","skeleton":"I still think planning matters, but now I prefer to try a small, practical solution before making ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I was happy with the decision because we learned something useful without spending weeks on an idea that might not work.","method":"以对决定满意为开头，用 because 接学到东西，再用 without spending 补上没有白花好几周的好处。"}},"T036":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to describe a decision I made while working on a small project with my team. We had a repetitive task that involved checking information manually, and I wanted to build a tool to make it easier.","heading":"项目决定","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to describe a decision I made while working on a small project with my team.","zh":"我想讲讲和团队做一个小项目时，我作出的一个决定。"},{"en":"We had a repetitive task that involved checking information manually, and I wanted to build a tool to make it easier.","zh":"我们有一项重复性的任务，需要人工核对信息，我想做一个工具，让这件事更容易些。","skeleton":"We had a repetitive task ..., and I wanted to build a tool to make it easier."}]},{"source":"At first, I thought we should create a complete system with lots of features. However, a colleague suggested starting with a simple version. I wasn't fully convinced because I worried it would look unfinished, but we discussed the idea and agreed to test it.","heading":"先试简版","sentences":[{"en":"At first, I thought we should create a complete system with lots of features.","zh":"一开始，我觉得我们应该做一个功能很多的完整系统。"},{"en":"However, a colleague suggested starting with a simple version.","zh":"不过，一位同事建议先从简单的版本做起。"},{"en":"I wasn't fully convinced because I worried it would look unfinished, but we discussed the idea and agreed to test it.","zh":"我还没有完全被说服，因为我担心它看起来像没做完，但我们讨论了这个想法，决定先试一试。","skeleton":"I wasn't fully convinced because I worried ..., but we discussed the idea and agreed to test it."}]},{"source":"We divided the work between us and focused on the most common problem. I worked on the main function, while another person tested it with a few examples. Our first attempt didn't work properly because we had misunderstood part of the information. We checked the issue together and corrected it.","heading":"分工纠错","sentences":[{"en":"We divided the work between us and focused on the most common problem.","zh":"我们分好了工，把重点放在最常见的问题上。"},{"en":"I worked on the main function, while another person tested it with a few examples.","zh":"我负责主要功能，另一个人则用几个例子进行测试。"},{"en":"Our first attempt didn't work properly because we had misunderstood part of the information.","zh":"第一次尝试没能正常运行，因为我们误解了部分信息。"},{"en":"We checked the issue together and corrected it.","zh":"我们一起检查了问题，并把它纠正了。"}]},{"source":"Eventually, the tool handled the basic task well. It wasn't perfect, but it saved us time and helped us understand what to improve next. Seeing it work was a satisfying moment for me.","heading":"原型成功运行","sentences":[{"en":"Eventually, the tool handled the basic task well.","zh":"最后，这个工具很好地完成了基本任务。"},{"en":"It wasn't perfect, but it saved us time and helped us understand what to improve next.","zh":"它并不完美，但帮我们省了时间，也让我们知道下一步该改进什么。"},{"en":"Seeing it work was a satisfying moment for me.","zh":"看到它运行起来的那一刻，我很有成就感。"}]},{"source":"I was happy with the decision because we learned something useful without spending weeks on an idea that might not work. The experience changed my opinion about planning. I still think planning matters, but now I prefer to try a small, practical solution before making a bigger commitment.","heading":"小步尝试","sentences":[{"en":"I was happy with the decision because we learned something useful without spending weeks on an idea that might not work.","zh":"我对这个决定很满意，因为我们学到了有用的东西，又没有花好几周去做一个可能行不通的想法。","skeleton":"I was happy with the decision because we learned something useful without spending weeks on an idea ..."},{"en":"The experience changed my opinion about planning.","zh":"这次经历改变了我对做计划的看法。"},{"en":"I still think planning matters, but now I prefer to try a small, practical solution before making a bigger commitment.","zh":"我还是觉得计划很重要，但现在我更愿意先尝试一个小而实用的解决办法，再投入更多。","skeleton":"I still think planning matters, but now I prefer to try a small, practical solution before making ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I was happy with the decision because we learned something useful without spending weeks on an idea that might not work.","method":"以对决定满意为开头，用 because 接学到东西，再用 without spending 补上没有白花好几周的好处。"}},"T037":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A live sporting event I enjoyed was the men's final at the Dubai Duty Free Tennis Championships on the first of March, 2025. I went with a friend to the Dubai Duty Free Tennis Stadium. The match was between Stefanos Tsitsipas and Felix Auger-Aliassime, and Tsitsipas won six-three, six-three.","heading":"现场观看网球决赛","sentences":[{"en":"A live sporting event I enjoyed was the men's final at the Dubai Duty Free Tennis Championships on the first of March, 2025.","zh":"我很喜欢的一场现场体育比赛，是二〇二五年三月一日迪拜免税网球锦标赛的男子决赛。","skeleton":"A live sporting event I enjoyed was the men's final at the Dubai Duty Free Tennis Championships ..."},{"en":"I went with a friend to the Dubai Duty Free Tennis Stadium.","zh":"我和一位朋友一起去了迪拜免税网球体育场。"},{"en":"The match was between Stefanos Tsitsipas and Felix Auger-Aliassime, and Tsitsipas won six-three, six-three.","zh":"那场比赛是斯特凡诺斯·西西帕斯对阵费利克斯·奥热阿利亚西姆，西西帕斯以六比三、六比三获胜。"}]},{"source":"We arrived before the match and had time to find our seats and look around. I'd watched tennis at home before, but being there felt different. I could hear the ball striking the rackets, and the players seemed much faster when I saw them with my own eyes.","heading":"现场看网球比赛","sentences":[{"en":"We arrived before the match and had time to find our seats and look around.","zh":"我们在比赛前就到了，有时间找到座位，再四处看看。"},{"en":"I'd watched tennis at home before, but being there felt different.","zh":"我以前在家看过网球，但到了现场，感觉很不一样。"},{"en":"I could hear the ball striking the rackets, and the players seemed much faster when I saw them with my own eyes.","zh":"我能听到球打在球拍上的声音，亲眼看到球员时，也觉得他们的动作快得多。","skeleton":"I could hear ..., and the players seemed much faster when I saw them ..."}]},{"source":"The crowd became quiet before each point, then reacted together when a rally ended. I found myself paying more attention than I normally would in front of a television. Even when I didn't fully understand a tactical decision, the tension was easy to feel.","heading":"观众反应与紧张","sentences":[{"en":"The crowd became quiet before each point, then reacted together when a rally ended.","zh":"每一分开始前，观众都会安静下来，等一段来回击球结束，大家又一起作出反应。"},{"en":"I found myself paying more attention than I normally would in front of a television.","zh":"我发现自己比平时在电视前看比赛时更专注。"},{"en":"Even when I didn't fully understand a tactical decision, the tension was easy to feel.","zh":"即使我没有完全看懂某个战术选择，也能很容易感受到那种紧张感。"}]},{"source":"Afterwards, my friend and I discussed the match on our way home. I enjoyed both the sport and the feeling of sharing an evening with so many other spectators. The result was part of the experience, but what I remember most is the atmosphere. It made me want to attend another tennis event.","heading":"难忘的赛场氛围","sentences":[{"en":"Afterwards, my friend and I discussed the match on our way home.","zh":"比赛结束后，我和朋友在回家路上聊了这场比赛。"},{"en":"I enjoyed both the sport and the feeling of sharing an evening with so many other spectators.","zh":"我既享受比赛本身，也享受和那么多其他观众一起度过一个晚上的感觉。"},{"en":"The result was part of the experience, but what I remember most is the atmosphere.","zh":"比赛结果是这次经历的一部分，但我记得最深的是现场氛围。"},{"en":"It made me want to attend another tennis event.","zh":"这让我想再去现场看一场网球比赛。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"A live sporting event I enjoyed was the men's final at the Dubai Duty Free Tennis Championships on the first of March, 2025.","method":"先说“我喜欢的现场赛事是男子决赛”，再接赛事名称，最后把 on the first of March, 2025 单独记作日期块。"}},"T038":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A food that people often eat on a special occasion is birthday cake. In my experience, it is usually brought out near the end of a birthday meal and shared with friends or family. The style depends on what the person likes.","heading":"生日吃蛋糕","sentences":[{"en":"A food that people often eat on a special occasion is birthday cake.","zh":"一种大家常在特殊场合吃的食物，是生日蛋糕。"},{"en":"In my experience, it is usually brought out near the end of a birthday meal and shared with friends or family.","zh":"按我的经历，生日餐快结束时通常会把蛋糕端出来，与朋友或家人一起分享。","skeleton":"In my experience, it is usually brought out ... and shared with friends or family."},{"en":"The style depends on what the person likes.","zh":"蛋糕的样式取决于过生日的人喜欢什么。"}]},{"source":"One example I remember is a chocolate cake at a friend's birthday dinner. It had a small decoration connected to his hobby. We had arranged the dinner simply, but the cake made the evening feel more like a celebration.","heading":"生日巧克力蛋糕","sentences":[{"en":"One example I remember is a chocolate cake at a friend's birthday dinner.","zh":"我记得的一个例子，是朋友生日晚餐上的巧克力蛋糕。"},{"en":"It had a small decoration connected to his hobby.","zh":"上面有一个与他爱好有关的小装饰。"},{"en":"We had arranged the dinner simply, but the cake made the evening feel more like a celebration.","zh":"我们把晚餐安排得很简单，但这个蛋糕让那天晚上更有庆祝的感觉。"}]},{"source":"A basic cake is made by preparing a mixture, baking it and then adding some decoration or a topping. I don't think the recipe has to be complicated. The important thing is that everyone can share it and that it suits the person whose birthday it is.","heading":"生日蛋糕的意义","sentences":[{"en":"A basic cake is made by preparing a mixture, baking it and then adding some decoration or a topping.","zh":"普通蛋糕的做法，就是先调好面糊，放进去烤，再加点装饰或表面的配料。"},{"en":"I don't think the recipe has to be complicated.","zh":"我觉得做法不用太复杂。"},{"en":"The important thing is that everyone can share it and that it suits the person whose birthday it is.","zh":"重要的是，大家能一起分享，而且蛋糕符合过生日那个人的喜好。"}]},{"source":"When we brought out my friend's cake, we gathered around, sang and took a few photos. He hadn't expected the personal decoration, so his reaction was the most memorable part. Afterwards, we cut the cake and continued talking.","heading":"惊喜的蛋糕装饰","sentences":[{"en":"When we brought out my friend's cake, we gathered around, sang and took a few photos.","zh":"我们把朋友的蛋糕端出来时，大家围过来，一起唱歌，还拍了几张照片。"},{"en":"He hadn't expected the personal decoration, so his reaction was the most memorable part.","zh":"他没想到会有那个为他特意做的装饰，所以他的反应最让我难忘。"},{"en":"Afterwards, we cut the cake and continued talking.","zh":"之后，我们切了蛋糕，接着聊天。"}]},{"source":"I associate this food with making time for other people. It gives a group a small shared moment, rather than just another item to eat. That's why even a simple birthday cake can feel special. If the question required a traditional festival food, I'd choose a different example.","heading":"蛋糕的心意","sentences":[{"en":"I associate this food with making time for other people.","zh":"我会把这种食物和为别人留出时间联系起来。"},{"en":"It gives a group a small shared moment, rather than just another item to eat.","zh":"它给一群人带来一个共同享受的小小瞬间，而不只是又多了一样吃的。"},{"en":"That's why even a simple birthday cake can feel special.","zh":"所以，就算是简单的生日蛋糕，也能让人觉得很特别。"},{"en":"If the question required a traditional festival food, I'd choose a different example.","zh":"如果题目要求讲传统节日食品，我会选另一个例子。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"In my experience, it is usually brought out near the end of a birthday meal and shared with friends or family.","method":"先记 it is usually brought out and shared 这两个被动动作，再分别补端出来的时间和一起分享的人。"}},"T039":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"Someone I know who's good at learning languages is my childhood friend Ben. We became friends when we were about ten, and we still practise together through voice messages even though we now live in different cities.","heading":"和好友练习语言","sentences":[{"en":"Someone I know who's good at learning languages is my childhood friend Ben.","zh":"我认识的一个很擅长学语言的人，是我从小的朋友 Ben。"},{"en":"We became friends when we were about ten, and we still practise together through voice messages even though we now live in different cities.","zh":"我们大约十岁时成了朋友，虽然现在住在不同城市，还是会通过语音消息一起练习。","skeleton":"We became friends when we were about ten, and we still practise together through voice messages ..."}]},{"source":"One thing I admire about him is the way he learns languages. He studies English by watching short videos with subtitles, noting useful expressions and recording himself using them. He also learns Chinese, and we practise together through voice messages. Rather than memorising long lists, he uses new words in simple conversations. Recently, he managed to order a meal in Chinese and ask the waiter about the ingredients without switching to English.","heading":"实用语言学法","sentences":[{"en":"One thing I admire about him is the way he learns languages.","zh":"他有一点让我很佩服，就是他学习语言的方式。"},{"en":"He studies English by watching short videos with subtitles, noting useful expressions and recording himself using them.","zh":"他通过看带字幕的短视频来学英语，记下实用的表达，再把自己使用这些表达的过程录下来。","skeleton":"He studies English by watching ..., noting ... and recording himself using them."},{"en":"He also learns Chinese, and we practise together through voice messages.","zh":"他也在学中文，我们会发语音消息一起练习。"},{"en":"Rather than memorising long lists, he uses new words in simple conversations.","zh":"他不会去背一长串词汇，而是把新单词用在简单的对话里。"},{"en":"Recently, he managed to order a meal in Chinese and ask the waiter about the ingredients without switching to English.","zh":"最近，他成功用中文点了餐，还问了服务员菜里有哪些食材，全程没有切换成英语。","skeleton":"Recently, he managed to order ... and ask ... without switching to English."}]},{"source":"What impresses me most is how confidently Ben uses the languages he learns. When we practise Chinese, he asks me to correct one or two mistakes at a time. The following week, those mistakes have usually disappeared. He also records the same English story twice and compares the recordings, so he can hear whether his speech is becoming clearer.","heading":"主动纠错练语言","sentences":[{"en":"What impresses me most is how confidently Ben uses the languages he learns.","zh":"最让我佩服的是，本能很自信地使用他学的语言。"},{"en":"When we practise Chinese, he asks me to correct one or two mistakes at a time.","zh":"我们练中文时，他会让我每次纠正一两个错误。"},{"en":"The following week, those mistakes have usually disappeared.","zh":"到了下一周，那些错误通常就不再出现了。"},{"en":"He also records the same English story twice and compares the recordings, so he can hear whether his speech is becoming clearer.","zh":"他还会把同一个英语故事录两遍，再比较两次录音，这样就能听出自己的表达是不是越来越清楚了。","skeleton":"He also records ... and compares ..., so he can hear whether his speech is becoming clearer."}]},{"source":"I admire his patience as much as his progress. When I make a mistake, he corrects me gently and adds a funny example, so the conversation doesn't become stressful. He has shown me that improving a language can come from small daily habits, rather than waiting until you feel ready to speak.","heading":"耐心帮助学语言","sentences":[{"en":"I admire his patience as much as his progress.","zh":"我不仅佩服他的进步，也同样佩服他的耐心。"},{"en":"When I make a mistake, he corrects me gently and adds a funny example, so the conversation doesn't become stressful.","zh":"我说错时，他会温和地纠正我，再举一个有趣的例子，所以聊天不会变得有压力。","skeleton":"When I make a mistake, he corrects me ... and adds ..., so the conversation doesn't become stressful."},{"en":"He has shown me that improving a language can come from small daily habits, rather than waiting until you feel ready to speak.","zh":"他让我明白，语言的进步可以来自每天的小习惯，而不是一直等到觉得自己准备好了才开口。","skeleton":"He has shown me that improving a language can come from small daily habits, ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"We became friends when we were about ten, and we still practise together through voice messages even though we now live in different cities.","method":"按“十岁成为朋友—现在仍用语音练习—虽然住不同城市”记三块，把 even though 的让步放到最后。"}},"T040":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A challenging technical problem I faced was getting a small tool to read information correctly. I was working on it with a team at work. The aim was to reduce manual checking, but our first attempt produced results we couldn't rely on.","heading":"工具读错了","sentences":[{"en":"A challenging technical problem I faced was getting a small tool to read information correctly.","zh":"我遇到的一个棘手的技术问题，是怎样让一个小工具正确读取信息。"},{"en":"I was working on it with a team at work.","zh":"当时我正在公司和一个团队一起做这个工具。"},{"en":"The aim was to reduce manual checking, but our first attempt produced results we couldn't rely on.","zh":"目的是减少人工核对，但第一次尝试得到的结果并不可靠。"}]},{"source":"At first, I thought the main function was wrong. However, after comparing a few examples, we realised that some of the information was written in a different format. The tool was treating those examples as if they followed the same pattern as the others.","heading":"查明格式差","sentences":[{"en":"At first, I thought the main function was wrong.","zh":"一开始，我以为是主要功能出了问题。"},{"en":"However, after comparing a few examples, we realised that some of the information was written in a different format.","zh":"不过，比较了几个例子后，我们发现有些信息采用了不同的格式。","skeleton":"However, after comparing a few examples, we realised that some of the information was written ..."},{"en":"The tool was treating those examples as if they followed the same pattern as the others.","zh":"工具却把这些例子也当成和其他例子格式相同的来处理。"}]},{"source":"We divided the work between us and focused on the most common problem. I worked on the main function, while another person tested it with a few examples. Our first attempt didn't work properly because we had misunderstood part of the information. We checked the issue together and corrected it.","heading":"分工纠错","sentences":[{"en":"We divided the work between us and focused on the most common problem.","zh":"我们分好了工，把重点放在最常见的问题上。"},{"en":"I worked on the main function, while another person tested it with a few examples.","zh":"我负责主要功能，另一个人则用几个例子进行测试。"},{"en":"Our first attempt didn't work properly because we had misunderstood part of the information.","zh":"第一次尝试没能正常运行，因为我们误解了部分信息。"},{"en":"We checked the issue together and corrected it.","zh":"我们一起检查了问题，并把它纠正了。"}]},{"source":"Eventually, the tool handled the basic task well. It wasn't perfect, but it saved us time and helped us understand what to improve next. Seeing it work was a satisfying moment for me.","heading":"原型成功运行","sentences":[{"en":"Eventually, the tool handled the basic task well.","zh":"最后，这个工具很好地完成了基本任务。"},{"en":"It wasn't perfect, but it saved us time and helped us understand what to improve next.","zh":"它并不完美，但帮我们省了时间，也让我们知道下一步该改进什么。"},{"en":"Seeing it work was a satisfying moment for me.","zh":"看到它运行起来的那一刻，我很有成就感。"}]},{"source":"I was happy with the decision because we learned something useful without spending weeks on an idea that might not work. The experience changed my opinion about planning. I still think planning matters, but now I prefer to try a small, practical solution before making a bigger commitment.","heading":"小步尝试","sentences":[{"en":"I was happy with the decision because we learned something useful without spending weeks on an idea that might not work.","zh":"我对这个决定很满意，因为我们学到了有用的东西，又没有花好几周去做一个可能行不通的想法。","skeleton":"I was happy with the decision because we learned something useful without spending weeks on an idea ..."},{"en":"The experience changed my opinion about planning.","zh":"这次经历改变了我对做计划的看法。"},{"en":"I still think planning matters, but now I prefer to try a small, practical solution before making a bigger commitment.","zh":"我还是觉得计划很重要，但现在我更愿意先尝试一个小而实用的解决办法，再投入更多。","skeleton":"I still think planning matters, but now I prefer to try a small, practical solution before making ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I was happy with the decision because we learned something useful without spending weeks on an idea that might not work.","method":"以对决定满意为开头，用 because 接学到东西，再用 without spending 补上没有白花好几周的好处。"}},"T041":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to describe a Xiaomi Mi 11 advertisement featuring Lei Jun, the company's co-founder. It was a promotional poster from a campaign announced in early 2021. I saw a picture of the poster online while reading about Xiaomi. What caught my attention was that the founder himself was advertising a product from his own company.","heading":"雷军做广告","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to describe a Xiaomi Mi 11 advertisement featuring Lei Jun, the company's co-founder.","zh":"我想介绍一个小米十一的广告，里面出现了公司的联合创始人雷军。"},{"en":"It was a promotional poster from a campaign announced in early 2021.","zh":"那是一张宣传海报，属于二〇二一年初公布的一次宣传活动。"},{"en":"I saw a picture of the poster online while reading about Xiaomi.","zh":"我在网上看小米相关内容时，看到了这张海报的图片。"},{"en":"What caught my attention was that the founder himself was advertising a product from his own company.","zh":"吸引我注意的是，创始人亲自为自己公司的产品做广告。"}]},{"source":"Lei Jun isn't a film star or a professional model, so I found that choice interesting. The campaign connected the phone with a person many customers already recognised. Instead of remembering only the product name, I could associate it with the person behind the brand.","heading":"品牌与创始人","sentences":[{"en":"Lei Jun isn't a film star or a professional model, so I found that choice interesting.","zh":"雷军不是电影明星，也不是职业模特，所以我觉得这个选择挺有意思。"},{"en":"The campaign connected the phone with a person many customers already recognised.","zh":"这次宣传把手机和一位许多顾客早就认识的人联系在了一起。"},{"en":"Instead of remembering only the product name, I could associate it with the person behind the brand.","zh":"这样我不只是记住产品名称，还能把它和品牌背后的人联系起来。"}]},{"source":"It also stood out to me for a personal reason. We come from the same part of China, and we both studied at Wuhan University. That doesn't tell me whether a phone is right for me, but it explains why I paid more attention to this poster than to a typical advertisement.","heading":"校友的亲近感","sentences":[{"en":"It also stood out to me for a personal reason.","zh":"它引起我的注意，也有一个个人原因。"},{"en":"We come from the same part of China, and we both studied at Wuhan University.","zh":"我们来自中国的同一个地区，也都在武汉大学读过书。"},{"en":"That doesn't tell me whether a phone is right for me, but it explains why I paid more attention to this poster than to a typical advertisement.","zh":"这些并不能告诉我某款手机是否适合我，但能解释为什么我对这张海报比对一般广告更关注。","skeleton":"That doesn't tell me ..., but it explains why I paid more attention to this poster than to a typical advertisement."}]},{"source":"I found the advertisement memorable because it gave the company a human face. It didn't make me buy the phone, but it made me more curious about the business. I think a familiar person can help an advertisement attract attention, while the final buying decision should still depend on the product's quality, usefulness and price.","heading":"广告里的人物作用","sentences":[{"en":"I found the advertisement memorable because it gave the company a human face.","zh":"我觉得这则广告让人印象深刻，因为它让这家公司有了一个具体的人物形象。"},{"en":"It didn't make me buy the phone, but it made me more curious about the business.","zh":"它没有让我买那部手机，但让我对这家公司更好奇了。"},{"en":"I think a familiar person can help an advertisement attract attention, while the final buying decision should still depend on the product's quality, usefulness and price.","zh":"我觉得，一个大家熟悉的人能帮广告吸引注意，不过最后买不买，还是应该取决于产品的质量、实用性和价格。","skeleton":"I think a familiar person can help ... attract attention, while the final buying decision should still depend on ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I think a familiar person can help an advertisement attract attention, while the final buying decision should still depend on the product's quality, usefulness and price.","method":"先记“熟悉的人吸引注意”，再用while接“购买决定看产品”，最后按质量、实用性、价格列出三项依据。"}},"T042":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to describe West Lake in Hangzhou, a city in Zhejiang Province in eastern China. I visited it with a friend during a short holiday last year. We had a busy few weeks before the trip, so we wanted somewhere we could explore without rushing.","heading":"西湖之旅","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to describe West Lake in Hangzhou, a city in Zhejiang Province in eastern China.","zh":"我想介绍一下杭州的西湖，杭州是中国东部浙江省的一座城市。"},{"en":"I visited it with a friend during a short holiday last year.","zh":"去年短假期间，我和一位朋友去过那里。"},{"en":"We had a busy few weeks before the trip, so we wanted somewhere we could explore without rushing.","zh":"出发前的几周我们很忙，所以想找个可以慢慢逛、不用赶时间的地方。"}]},{"source":"We spent an afternoon walking along the paths beside the lake. What I remember most is the space around the water. There were trees beside the path, and we could stop whenever we noticed a view we liked. I took a few photos, but I also put my phone away for part of the walk.","heading":"沿着湖边慢行","sentences":[{"en":"We spent an afternoon walking along the paths beside the lake.","zh":"我们花了一个下午，沿着湖边的小路散步。"},{"en":"What I remember most is the space around the water.","zh":"我印象最深的是水边的那片空间。"},{"en":"There were trees beside the path, and we could stop whenever we noticed a view we liked.","zh":"小路旁边有树，每当看到喜欢的景色，我们就可以停下来。"},{"en":"I took a few photos, but I also put my phone away for part of the walk.","zh":"我拍了几张照片，不过散步途中也有一段时间把手机收了起来。"}]},{"source":"At one point, we sat down and watched the light change on the water. We talked about ordinary things and didn't feel that we had to keep moving to another attraction. Afterwards, we found somewhere nearby to have a simple meal.","heading":"湖边闲坐","sentences":[{"en":"At one point, we sat down and watched the light change on the water.","zh":"途中我们坐下来，看着水面上的光线变化。"},{"en":"We talked about ordinary things and didn't feel that we had to keep moving to another attraction.","zh":"我们聊些日常小事，也没觉得非得一直赶去下一个景点。"},{"en":"Afterwards, we found somewhere nearby to have a simple meal.","zh":"之后，我们在附近找了个地方，简单吃了顿饭。"}]},{"source":"For me, the lake is important because it gives people a place to enjoy being outdoors while visiting a city. I liked the balance between walking, looking around and having time to talk.","heading":"湖畔的价值","sentences":[{"en":"For me, the lake is important because it gives people a place to enjoy being outdoors while visiting a city.","zh":"对我来说，这个湖很重要，因为它让人们在游览一座城市的同时，也有地方可以享受户外时光。"},{"en":"I liked the balance between walking, looking around and having time to talk.","zh":"我喜欢那种平衡：既能走走看看，又有时间聊天。"}]},{"source":"I'd happily go back, especially with someone who enjoys a slower kind of holiday. Next time, I'd leave more time to explore Hangzhou beyond the lake, rather than trying to fit everything into one afternoon.","heading":"再次游览杭州","sentences":[{"en":"I'd happily go back, especially with someone who enjoys a slower kind of holiday.","zh":"我很愿意再去一次，尤其想和喜欢慢节奏度假的人一起去。"},{"en":"Next time, I'd leave more time to explore Hangzhou beyond the lake, rather than trying to fit everything into one afternoon.","zh":"下次，我会多留些时间，去看看西湖以外的杭州，而不是试着把所有行程都塞进一个下午。","skeleton":"I'd leave more time to explore Hangzhou ..., rather than trying to fit everything ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"Next time, I'd leave more time to explore Hangzhou beyond the lake, rather than trying to fit everything into one afternoon.","method":"按“下次—多留时间—探索湖外杭州”记主线，再用 rather than 接“不把一切塞进一个下午”。"}},"T043":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A home I enjoy visiting but wouldn't want to live in is my grandmother's house. I used to go there quite often when I was younger, and I still associate it with spending unhurried time with my family. It isn't a large or modern place, but it feels familiar to me.","heading":"喜欢祖母家","sentences":[{"en":"A home I enjoy visiting but wouldn't want to live in is my grandmother's house.","zh":"我喜欢去做客、但不想住下的一个家，是我祖母家。"},{"en":"I used to go there quite often when I was younger, and I still associate it with spending unhurried time with my family.","zh":"小时候我常去那里，现在想到那里，也还是会想到和家人悠闲地共度时光。","skeleton":"I used to go there ..., and I still associate it with spending unhurried time with my family."},{"en":"It isn't a large or modern place, but it feels familiar to me.","zh":"那里不大，也不现代，但让我觉得很熟悉。"}]},{"source":"The room I remember best is the living room. There is a comfortable sofa, a small table and some family photographs. My grandmother also looks after a few plants near the house. When I visit, we usually have something to drink and talk about what has happened since we last saw each other.","heading":"祖母家的客厅","sentences":[{"en":"The room I remember best is the living room.","zh":"我印象最深的房间是客厅。"},{"en":"There is a comfortable sofa, a small table and some family photographs.","zh":"那里有一张舒服的沙发、一张小桌子，还有一些家庭照片。"},{"en":"My grandmother also looks after a few plants near the house.","zh":"我祖母还照料着房子附近的几株植物。"},{"en":"When I visit, we usually have something to drink and talk about what has happened since we last saw each other.","zh":"我去看她时，我们通常会喝点东西，聊聊上次见面之后发生的事。","skeleton":"When I visit, we usually have something to drink and talk about what has happened since ..."}]},{"source":"On my last visit, I helped her with a small job and then stayed for lunch. Nothing especially exciting happened, but I enjoyed having time for an ordinary conversation. I didn't feel that I had to keep checking the time.","heading":"平常相处的快乐","sentences":[{"en":"On my last visit, I helped her with a small job and then stayed for lunch.","zh":"上次去她家，我帮她做了一点小事，然后留下来吃了午饭。"},{"en":"Nothing especially exciting happened, but I enjoyed having time for an ordinary conversation.","zh":"没有发生什么特别令人兴奋的事，但能有时间随意聊聊天，我就觉得很开心。"},{"en":"I didn't feel that I had to keep checking the time.","zh":"我没觉得自己需要不停地看时间。"}]},{"source":"Although I like visiting, I wouldn't choose to live there permanently. It is too far from the places I need to reach for work, and I'd prefer having my own space and routine. As an adult, I moved into an apartment closer to work, which suited my daily life better.","heading":"居住的选择","sentences":[{"en":"Although I like visiting, I wouldn't choose to live there permanently.","zh":"虽然我喜欢去那里做客，但不会选择长期住在那里。"},{"en":"It is too far from the places I need to reach for work, and I'd prefer having my own space and routine.","zh":"那里离我工作需要去的地方太远，而且我更希望有自己的空间和生活节奏。"},{"en":"As an adult, I moved into an apartment closer to work, which suited my daily life better.","zh":"成年后，我搬进了一套离工作地点更近的公寓，更适合我的日常生活。"}]},{"source":"So the house is special because of the person and memories connected with it. Enjoying a visit doesn't necessarily mean that it would be the right place for me to live.","heading":"喜欢未必要住","sentences":[{"en":"So the house is special because of the person and memories connected with it.","zh":"所以，这栋房子很特别，是因为与它有关的人和回忆。"},{"en":"Enjoying a visit doesn't necessarily mean that it would be the right place for me to live.","zh":"喜欢去那里做客，并不一定说明它适合我住。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I used to go there quite often when I was younger, and I still associate it with spending unhurried time with my family.","method":"先用 used to 回顾小时候常去，再用 and I still associate it with 接如今想到的悠闲家庭时光。"}},"T044":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"An animal story I remember clearly is The Tortoise and the Hare. It's a short fable associated with Aesop, and I first heard it from my father when I was in primary school. Later, I read an illustrated version myself, which made me feel quite proud.","heading":"初听龟兔赛跑","sentences":[{"en":"An animal story I remember clearly is The Tortoise and the Hare.","zh":"我记得很清楚的一个动物故事是《龟兔赛跑》。"},{"en":"It's a short fable associated with Aesop, and I first heard it from my father when I was in primary school.","zh":"这是一个与伊索有关的短篇寓言，我第一次听到它，是上小学时爸爸讲给我的。"},{"en":"Later, I read an illustrated version myself, which made me feel quite proud.","zh":"后来，我自己读了一个插图版，当时觉得挺自豪的。"}]},{"source":"The story is about a race between two very different animals. The hare is fast and confident, while the tortoise moves slowly. Because the hare thinks winning will be easy, he stops for a nap. The tortoise keeps going and reaches the finish before him.","heading":"龟兔比赛经过","sentences":[{"en":"The story is about a race between two very different animals.","zh":"这个故事讲的是两只很不一样的动物之间的一场比赛。"},{"en":"The hare is fast and confident, while the tortoise moves slowly.","zh":"兔子跑得快，也很有信心，而乌龟走得慢。"},{"en":"Because the hare thinks winning will be easy, he stops for a nap.","zh":"兔子觉得赢得比赛很容易，就停下来睡了一觉。"},{"en":"The tortoise keeps going and reaches the finish before him.","zh":"乌龟一直往前走，比兔子先到达了终点。"}]},{"source":"As a child, I found the ending funny and surprising. At the beginning, I was certain that the hare would win, so I wanted to turn the pages quickly. I also liked the pictures because they helped me understand what was happening without needing an adult to explain every sentence.","heading":"童年读故事","sentences":[{"en":"As a child, I found the ending funny and surprising.","zh":"小时候，我觉得这个结局又好笑又出人意料。"},{"en":"At the beginning, I was certain that the hare would win, so I wanted to turn the pages quickly.","zh":"一开始，我很确定兔子会赢，所以很想赶紧往后翻。"},{"en":"I also liked the pictures because they helped me understand what was happening without needing an adult to explain every sentence.","zh":"我也喜欢里面的插图，因为不用大人逐句解释，它们就能帮我看懂发生了什么。","skeleton":"I also liked the pictures because they helped me understand ... without needing an adult to explain every sentence."}]},{"source":"The lesson has stayed with me: steady effort matters, and being good at something doesn't mean you can stop trying. I think of it when I'm learning a skill and comparing myself with people who improve faster. The story reminds me to focus on my own progress. It's simple, but that's probably why I still remember it after so many years.","heading":"坚持比天赋重要","sentences":[{"en":"The lesson has stayed with me: steady effort matters, and being good at something doesn't mean you can stop trying.","zh":"这个道理我一直记着：持续努力很重要，擅长一件事也不意味着你就可以不再努力。","skeleton":"The lesson has stayed with me: ... being good at something doesn't mean you can stop trying."},{"en":"I think of it when I'm learning a skill and comparing myself with people who improve faster.","zh":"每当我学习一项技能，又拿自己和进步更快的人比较时，我就会想到这个故事。"},{"en":"The story reminds me to focus on my own progress.","zh":"这个故事提醒我要关注自己的进步。"},{"en":"It's simple, but that's probably why I still remember it after so many years.","zh":"它很简单，但也许正因为如此，这么多年以后我仍然记得它。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I also liked the pictures because they helped me understand what was happening without needing an adult to explain every sentence.","method":"先说喜欢插图，再用 because 解释帮助看懂故事，最后用 without needing 补上不需要大人逐句解释。"}},"T045":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"An existing rule I think is useful is Shanghai's household waste sorting rule. Shanghai is a city in China, and sorting household rubbish has been legally required there since the first of July, 2019. I'm talking about a local rule in Shanghai, rather than one identical rule for the whole country.","heading":"上海垃圾分类","sentences":[{"en":"An existing rule I think is useful is Shanghai's household waste sorting rule.","zh":"我觉得一项很有用的现行规定，是上海的生活垃圾分类规定。"},{"en":"Shanghai is a city in China, and sorting household rubbish has been legally required there since the first of July, 2019.","zh":"上海是中国的一座城市，从2019年7月1日起，那里依法要求居民对生活垃圾进行分类。","skeleton":"Shanghai is a city in China, and sorting household rubbish has been legally required there since ..."},{"en":"I'm talking about a local rule in Shanghai, rather than one identical rule for the whole country.","zh":"我说的是上海的一项地方规定，并不是全国都完全一样的一项规定。"}]},{"source":"The system separates household waste into four categories: recyclables, hazardous waste, wet waste and dry waste. For example, food leftovers belong with wet waste, while materials that can be recycled should go into the appropriate recycling bin. Hazardous items need to be handled separately.","heading":"四类垃圾处理","sentences":[{"en":"The system separates household waste into four categories: recyclables, hazardous waste, wet waste and dry waste.","zh":"这套分类制度把生活垃圾分成四类：可回收物、有害垃圾、湿垃圾和干垃圾。","skeleton":"The system separates household waste into four categories: ..."},{"en":"For example, food leftovers belong with wet waste, while materials that can be recycled should go into the appropriate recycling bin.","zh":"比如，剩饭剩菜属于湿垃圾，而可以回收的材料应该放进相应的回收桶里。","skeleton":"For example, food leftovers belong with wet waste, while materials ... should go into ..."},{"en":"Hazardous items need to be handled separately.","zh":"有害物品需要单独处理。"}]},{"source":"I became more aware of this rule during a visit to relatives in Shanghai. In their kitchen, they kept separate containers and checked the labels before throwing things away. At first, I found it a little confusing, especially when an item contained different materials. After a few days, though, the basic routine felt much easier.","heading":"逐渐习惯分类","sentences":[{"en":"I became more aware of this rule during a visit to relatives in Shanghai.","zh":"有一次去上海探望亲戚时，我对这项规定有了更多了解。"},{"en":"In their kitchen, they kept separate containers and checked the labels before throwing things away.","zh":"他们在厨房里放了不同的垃圾容器，扔东西前会先看标签。"},{"en":"At first, I found it a little confusing, especially when an item contained different materials.","zh":"刚开始，我觉得有点搞不清楚，尤其是一样东西里含有不同材料的时候。"},{"en":"After a few days, though, the basic routine felt much easier.","zh":"不过，过了几天后，这些基本操作就觉得容易多了。"}]},{"source":"I support the idea because it encourages people to think about what happens after they throw something away. However, I think clear signs and convenient collection points are essential. People are more likely to follow a rule when they understand it and can fit it into their daily routine. For me, good environmental rules need practical support as well as expectations.","heading":"规定需要配套","sentences":[{"en":"I support the idea because it encourages people to think about what happens after they throw something away.","zh":"我支持这个做法，因为它会鼓励人们去想，东西扔掉之后会怎样。"},{"en":"However, I think clear signs and convenient collection points are essential.","zh":"不过，我觉得清楚的标识和方便的收集点必不可少。"},{"en":"People are more likely to follow a rule when they understand it and can fit it into their daily routine.","zh":"当人们理解一项规定，又能把它融入日常生活时，就更有可能遵守它。"},{"en":"For me, good environmental rules need practical support as well as expectations.","zh":"对我来说，好的环保规定除了提出要求，也需要实际的配套支持。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"For example, food leftovers belong with wet waste, while materials that can be recycled should go into the appropriate recycling bin.","method":"先记“剩饭剩菜归湿垃圾”，再用while对照“可回收材料进相应回收桶”，把两类投放方式分开记。"}},"T046":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A time I waited a long time for a reply was when I contacted a shop about a problem with my headphones. One side had stopped working, and I wanted to know what I needed to bring in for a replacement.","heading":"等店家回复","sentences":[{"en":"A time I waited a long time for a reply was when I contacted a shop about a problem with my headphones.","zh":"有一次等回复等了很久，是我因为耳机出了问题而联系一家店的时候。"},{"en":"One side had stopped working, and I wanted to know what I needed to bring in for a replacement.","zh":"耳机有一边不能用了，我想知道去更换时需要带些什么。"}]},{"source":"I sent a short message with the purchase details and a description of the fault. I thought I would hear back fairly quickly, but after several days there was still no reply. I checked that I had used the correct contact information before sending a polite follow-up.","heading":"礼貌地追问","sentences":[{"en":"I sent a short message with the purchase details and a description of the fault.","zh":"我发了条简短消息，附上购买信息，并描述了故障。"},{"en":"I thought I would hear back fairly quickly, but after several days there was still no reply.","zh":"我以为很快就会收到回复，但过了几天仍然没有回应。"},{"en":"I checked that I had used the correct contact information before sending a polite follow-up.","zh":"我先确认自己用的是正确的联系方式，然后又礼貌地问了一次。"}]},{"source":"The wait was frustrating mainly because I didn't know what to do next. I was unsure whether the message had been received, whether the shop needed more information or whether I should visit in person. I didn't want to make an unnecessary trip.","heading":"等回复不知下一步","sentences":[{"en":"The wait was frustrating mainly because I didn't know what to do next.","zh":"这次等待让我很烦，主要是因为我不知道下一步该怎么办。"},{"en":"I was unsure whether the message had been received, whether the shop needed more information or whether I should visit in person.","zh":"我不确定对方有没有收到消息，不确定店里是不是还需要更多信息，也不知道自己是不是应该亲自过去。","skeleton":"I was unsure whether ..., whether ... or whether I should visit in person."},{"en":"I didn't want to make an unnecessary trip.","zh":"我不想白跑一趟。"}]},{"source":"In the end, I went to the shop with the headphones and the proof of purchase. An assistant checked the problem and explained the process. Once I had that information, I felt much more relaxed.","heading":"到店了解处理过程","sentences":[{"en":"In the end, I went to the shop with the headphones and the proof of purchase.","zh":"最后，我带着耳机和购买凭证去了店里。"},{"en":"An assistant checked the problem and explained the process.","zh":"一位店员检查了问题，并解释了处理流程。"},{"en":"Once I had that information, I felt much more relaxed.","zh":"知道这些信息后，我就放松多了。"}]},{"source":"The experience reminded me that even a brief response can be helpful. It doesn't have to solve a problem immediately, but it should let the customer know what is happening. Since then, I've tried to acknowledge messages when I can't give a complete answer straight away.","heading":"及时回应的作用","sentences":[{"en":"The experience reminded me that even a brief response can be helpful.","zh":"这次经历提醒我，即使是简短的回复，也会有帮助。"},{"en":"It doesn't have to solve a problem immediately, but it should let the customer know what is happening.","zh":"回复不一定要马上解决问题，但应该让顾客知道事情进展如何。"},{"en":"Since then, I've tried to acknowledge messages when I can't give a complete answer straight away.","zh":"从那以后，如果不能马上给出完整的回答，我也会尽量先回复一下，表示已经收到消息。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I was unsure whether the message had been received, whether the shop needed more information or whether I should visit in person.","method":"用三个whether按“消息收到没—资料还缺不缺—要不要亲自去”的顺序记住三种不确定。"}},"T047":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A long-term goal I'd like to achieve is being able to use English comfortably in work and study. I understand a lot when I read, but I sometimes hesitate when explaining my own ideas. I want that gap to shrink.","heading":"自在使用英语","sentences":[{"en":"A long-term goal I'd like to achieve is being able to use English comfortably in work and study.","zh":"我想实现的一个长期目标，是在工作和学习中能轻松自如地使用英语。"},{"en":"I understand a lot when I read, but I sometimes hesitate when explaining my own ideas.","zh":"阅读时，我能理解很多内容，但有时候要解释自己的想法，还是会犹豫。"},{"en":"I want that gap to shrink.","zh":"我想缩小这种差距。"}]},{"source":"This matters because good ideas are less useful if I can't communicate them clearly. I'd like to take part in discussions, ask questions when something is unclear and explain a problem without worrying much about finding the perfect words.","heading":"清楚表达的意义","sentences":[{"en":"This matters because good ideas are less useful if I can't communicate them clearly.","zh":"这很重要，因为如果我不能把好点子说清楚，它们的作用就会打折扣。"},{"en":"I'd like to take part in discussions, ask questions when something is unclear and explain a problem without worrying much about finding the perfect words.","zh":"我希望能参与讨论，在有不明白的地方时提问，解释一个问题时也不用太担心找不到最恰当的词。","skeleton":"I'd like to take part in discussions, ask questions ... and explain a problem without worrying much ..."}]},{"source":"I've started with a simple routine. I choose a short question, record an answer and listen back. If a sentence is difficult to say, I try again with simpler language. I also read or listen to something useful and explain the main point in my own words.","heading":"英语练习法","sentences":[{"en":"I've started with a simple routine.","zh":"我先从一个简单的日常练习安排开始了。"},{"en":"I choose a short question, record an answer and listen back.","zh":"我选一个简短的问题，把答案录下来，再回放听一听。"},{"en":"If a sentence is difficult to say, I try again with simpler language.","zh":"如果某个句子说起来很难，我就换成更简单的表达再试一次。"},{"en":"I also read or listen to something useful and explain the main point in my own words.","zh":"我也会读或听一些有用的内容，再用自己的话讲出它的要点。"}]},{"source":"Some days feel easier than others. I don't expect every recording to be better than the previous one, but I can notice small changes, such as pausing less or giving a clearer example. That helps me continue when progress feels slow.","heading":"留意点滴进步","sentences":[{"en":"Some days feel easier than others.","zh":"有些日子会比其他日子轻松一些。"},{"en":"I don't expect every recording to be better than the previous one, but I can notice small changes, such as pausing less or giving a clearer example.","zh":"我并不指望每次录音都比上一次更好，但我能注意到一些小变化，比如停顿少了，或者举的例子更清楚了。","skeleton":"I don't expect every recording to be better ..., but I can notice small changes, such as ..."},{"en":"That helps me continue when progress feels slow.","zh":"当我觉得进步很慢时，这些变化能帮我坚持下去。"}]},{"source":"I would consider the goal achieved when I can express what I mean and follow a conversation more confidently. It isn't about using impressive words all the time. For me, it is about being able to communicate naturally and take part more fully.","heading":"目标的标准","sentences":[{"en":"I would consider the goal achieved when I can express what I mean and follow a conversation more confidently.","zh":"当我能更有信心地表达自己的意思，也能更有信心地听懂并跟上对话时，我就会觉得这个目标实现了。"},{"en":"It isn't about using impressive words all the time.","zh":"这并不是说，要一直使用让人觉得很厉害的词。"},{"en":"For me, it is about being able to communicate naturally and take part more fully.","zh":"对我来说，目标是能自然地交流，更充分地参与其中。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I'd like to take part in discussions, ask questions when something is unclear and explain a problem without worrying much about finding the perfect words.","method":"按“参与讨论—有疑问就问—解释问题”记三个并列动作，再给最后一个动作接 without worrying。"}},"T048":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"An opinion I changed was my belief that a new idea should be fully developed before anyone tried it. I changed my mind during a small project at work. We wanted to build a tool that would make a repeated manual task easier.","heading":"新想法先小步尝试","sentences":[{"en":"An opinion I changed was my belief that a new idea should be fully developed before anyone tried it.","zh":"我改变过的一个看法是，我曾相信，一个新想法应该先完善到位，再让人去尝试。"},{"en":"I changed my mind during a small project at work.","zh":"我是在工作中的一个小项目里改变这个想法的。"},{"en":"We wanted to build a tool that would make a repeated manual task easier.","zh":"我们想做一个工具，让一项反复要手动完成的任务变得更容易。"}]},{"source":"At first, I thought we should create a complete system with lots of features. However, a colleague suggested starting with a simple version. I wasn't fully convinced because I worried it would look unfinished, but we discussed the idea and agreed to test it.","heading":"先试简版","sentences":[{"en":"At first, I thought we should create a complete system with lots of features.","zh":"一开始，我觉得我们应该做一个功能很多的完整系统。"},{"en":"However, a colleague suggested starting with a simple version.","zh":"不过，一位同事建议先从简单的版本做起。"},{"en":"I wasn't fully convinced because I worried it would look unfinished, but we discussed the idea and agreed to test it.","zh":"我还没有完全被说服，因为我担心它看起来像没做完，但我们讨论了这个想法，决定先试一试。","skeleton":"I wasn't fully convinced because I worried ..., but we discussed the idea and agreed to test it."}]},{"source":"We divided the work between us and focused on the most common problem. I worked on the main function, while another person tested it with a few examples. Our first attempt didn't work properly because we had misunderstood part of the information. We checked the issue together and corrected it.","heading":"分工纠错","sentences":[{"en":"We divided the work between us and focused on the most common problem.","zh":"我们分好了工，把重点放在最常见的问题上。"},{"en":"I worked on the main function, while another person tested it with a few examples.","zh":"我负责主要功能，另一个人则用几个例子进行测试。"},{"en":"Our first attempt didn't work properly because we had misunderstood part of the information.","zh":"第一次尝试没能正常运行，因为我们误解了部分信息。"},{"en":"We checked the issue together and corrected it.","zh":"我们一起检查了问题，并把它纠正了。"}]},{"source":"Eventually, the tool handled the basic task well. It wasn't perfect, but it saved us time and helped us understand what to improve next. Seeing it work was a satisfying moment for me.","heading":"原型成功运行","sentences":[{"en":"Eventually, the tool handled the basic task well.","zh":"最后，这个工具很好地完成了基本任务。"},{"en":"It wasn't perfect, but it saved us time and helped us understand what to improve next.","zh":"它并不完美，但帮我们省了时间，也让我们知道下一步该改进什么。"},{"en":"Seeing it work was a satisfying moment for me.","zh":"看到它运行起来的那一刻，我很有成就感。"}]},{"source":"I was happy with the decision because we learned something useful without spending weeks on an idea that might not work. The experience changed my opinion about planning. I still think planning matters, but now I prefer to try a small, practical solution before making a bigger commitment.","heading":"小步尝试","sentences":[{"en":"I was happy with the decision because we learned something useful without spending weeks on an idea that might not work.","zh":"我对这个决定很满意，因为我们学到了有用的东西，又没有花好几周去做一个可能行不通的想法。","skeleton":"I was happy with the decision because we learned something useful without spending weeks on an idea ..."},{"en":"The experience changed my opinion about planning.","zh":"这次经历改变了我对做计划的看法。"},{"en":"I still think planning matters, but now I prefer to try a small, practical solution before making a bigger commitment.","zh":"我还是觉得计划很重要，但现在我更愿意先尝试一个小而实用的解决办法，再投入更多。","skeleton":"I still think planning matters, but now I prefer to try a small, practical solution before making ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I was happy with the decision because we learned something useful without spending weeks on an idea that might not work.","method":"以对决定满意为开头，用 because 接学到东西，再用 without spending 补上没有白花好几周的好处。"}},"T049":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A piece of local news I found encouraging was about improvements to Dubai's bus network. I read an RTA announcement in September 2026 after a friend shared the link. The announcement itself was published on the sixth of January, so I was discovering an earlier development rather than reading about something launched that week.","heading":"读到公交新消息","sentences":[{"en":"A piece of local news I found encouraging was about improvements to Dubai's bus network.","zh":"有一条当地新闻让我觉得很振奋，讲的是迪拜公交网络的改善。"},{"en":"I read an RTA announcement in September 2026 after a friend shared the link.","zh":"2026年9月，一位朋友分享了链接，我读到了迪拜道路与交通管理局的一则公告。"},{"en":"The announcement itself was published on the sixth of January, so I was discovering an earlier development rather than reading about something launched that week.","zh":"公告本身是在1月6日发布的，所以我了解到的是之前已经发生的变化，而不是那一周刚推出的新措施。","skeleton":"The announcement itself was published ..., so I was discovering an earlier development rather than reading about ..."}]},{"source":"According to the announcement, four new public bus routes were scheduled to start operating on the ninth of January. RTA also announced improvements to more than seventy existing internal routes, including changes to route coverage and services during busy periods. The aim was to make everyday travel more convenient.","heading":"公交新安排","sentences":[{"en":"According to the announcement, four new public bus routes were scheduled to start operating on the ninth of January.","zh":"根据公告，四条新的公共公交线路计划于一月九日开始运营。","skeleton":"According to the announcement, four new public bus routes were scheduled to start operating ..."},{"en":"RTA also announced improvements to more than seventy existing internal routes, including changes to route coverage and services during busy periods.","zh":"迪拜道路与交通管理局还宣布，要对七十多条现有的市内线路进行优化，包括调整线路覆盖范围和繁忙时段的服务。","skeleton":"RTA also announced improvements to ... existing internal routes, including changes to route coverage and services ..."},{"en":"The aim was to make everyday travel more convenient.","zh":"目的是让日常出行更方便。"}]},{"source":"This caught my attention because I live in Dubai and sometimes use public transport. I don't use every route mentioned, so I can't say that the changes directly shortened my own commute. Still, better connections could make buses a more practical option for people travelling between neighbourhoods.","heading":"出行的意义","sentences":[{"en":"This caught my attention because I live in Dubai and sometimes use public transport.","zh":"这条消息引起了我的注意，因为我住在迪拜，有时也会乘坐公共交通。"},{"en":"I don't use every route mentioned, so I can't say that the changes directly shortened my own commute.","zh":"公告里提到的线路，我并不是每一条都坐，所以不能说这些变化直接缩短了我自己的通勤时间。"},{"en":"Still, better connections could make buses a more practical option for people travelling between neighbourhoods.","zh":"不过，更好的线路衔接可能会让公交车成为来往于不同社区的人更实用的选择。","skeleton":"Still, better connections could make buses a more practical option for people ..."}]},{"source":"After reading the article, I checked whether any of the routes were relevant to places I visit. I also sent the link back to my friend with a short comment saying that this was the kind of local news I liked: a practical improvement that could affect ordinary daily life. It made me feel positive about the city, and I would like to see the network continue to improve.","heading":"实用新闻的影响","sentences":[{"en":"After reading the article, I checked whether any of the routes were relevant to places I visit.","zh":"读完文章后，我查了一下这些线路里有没有哪条能到我常去的地方。"},{"en":"I also sent the link back to my friend with a short comment saying that this was the kind of local news I liked: a practical improvement that could affect ordinary daily life.","zh":"我还把链接回发给朋友，附了一句简短的评论，说这正是我喜欢的本地新闻：切实的改善，能影响普通人的日常生活。","skeleton":"I also sent the link back ... with a short comment saying that this was the kind of local news I liked: ..."},{"en":"It made me feel positive about the city, and I would like to see the network continue to improve.","zh":"这让我对这座城市更有好感，我也希望看到公交网络继续改善。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I also sent the link back to my friend with a short comment saying that this was the kind of local news I liked: a practical improvement that could affect ordinary daily life.","method":"先记“回发链接并附评论”，接 saying that 说明喜欢这类新闻，最后用冒号补“能影响日常生活的实际改善”。"}},"T050":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to talk about a novel called The Martian, by Andy Weir. I read it a few months ago after a friend recommended it. I usually prefer stories that feel practical, so the combination of science and adventure appealed to me.","heading":"初读火星救援","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to talk about a novel called The Martian, by Andy Weir.","zh":"我想聊一本小说，叫《火星救援》，作者是安迪·威尔。"},{"en":"I read it a few months ago after a friend recommended it.","zh":"几个月前，一位朋友推荐了这本书，我就读了。"},{"en":"I usually prefer stories that feel practical, so the combination of science and adventure appealed to me.","zh":"我平时更喜欢感觉贴近实际的故事，所以科学和冒险结合在一起，很吸引我。"}]},{"source":"The main character is an astronaut called Mark Watney, who is accidentally left behind on Mars. He has to find ways to stay alive and contact people on Earth. The situation sounds hopeless, but he doesn't give up. He deals with one problem at a time, using whatever resources he has.","heading":"火星求生故事","sentences":[{"en":"The main character is an astronaut called Mark Watney, who is accidentally left behind on Mars.","zh":"主角是一位叫马克·沃特尼的宇航员，他意外地被留在了火星上。"},{"en":"He has to find ways to stay alive and contact people on Earth.","zh":"他必须想办法活下去，并联系上地球上的人。"},{"en":"The situation sounds hopeless, but he doesn't give up.","zh":"处境听起来没有希望，但他没有放弃。"},{"en":"He deals with one problem at a time, using whatever resources he has.","zh":"他利用手头所有能用的资源，一次解决一个问题。"}]},{"source":"What I enjoyed most was the way he thought through his difficulties. The book made me feel as if I was following his attempts step by step. Some parts were tense, but his sense of humour made the story enjoyable as well.","heading":"理性与幽默感","sentences":[{"en":"What I enjoyed most was the way he thought through his difficulties.","zh":"我最喜欢的是他认真思考、想办法解决困难的方式。","skeleton":"What I enjoyed most was the way ..."},{"en":"The book made me feel as if I was following his attempts step by step.","zh":"这本书让我感觉，自己好像在一步一步跟着他尝试。"},{"en":"Some parts were tense, but his sense of humour made the story enjoyable as well.","zh":"有些情节很紧张，但他的幽默感又让故事读起来很有意思。"}]},{"source":"I read a little in the evening, and I often continued longer than I had planned because I wanted to know what would happen next. I felt relieved whenever one of his ideas worked.","heading":"读得入迷","sentences":[{"en":"I read a little in the evening, and I often continued longer than I had planned because I wanted to know what would happen next.","zh":"我晚上会读一会儿，而且经常读得比原本计划的更久，因为我想知道接下来会发生什么。","skeleton":"I read a little in the evening, and I often continued longer than I had planned because I wanted to know ..."},{"en":"I felt relieved whenever one of his ideas worked.","zh":"每当他的某个办法奏效时，我就会松一口气。"}]},{"source":"The story also gave me a useful reminder: a big problem becomes less frightening when you focus on the next small action. I think that's why it stayed with me. I'd recommend it to someone who enjoys a hopeful story with a clever main character.","heading":"小步化解难题","sentences":[{"en":"The story also gave me a useful reminder: a big problem becomes less frightening when you focus on the next small action.","zh":"这个故事也给了我一个很有用的提醒：当你专注于下一步小行动时，大问题就没那么吓人了。","skeleton":"The story also gave me a useful reminder: a big problem becomes less frightening when you focus on ..."},{"en":"I think that's why it stayed with me.","zh":"我想，这就是它一直留在我心里的原因。"},{"en":"I'd recommend it to someone who enjoys a hopeful story with a clever main character.","zh":"如果有人喜欢充满希望、主角又很聪明的故事，我会向他们推荐这本书。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I read a little in the evening, and I often continued longer than I had planned because I wanted to know what would happen next.","method":"按晚上读书、比计划读得久、想知道后续这三步记，分别用 and 和 because 串起来。"}},"T051":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A person I know about who overcame difficulties and became successful is Lei Jun, the co-founder of Xiaomi. We come from the same part of China, and we both studied at Wuhan University. That gives me a personal reason to pay attention to him, beyond simply recognising his name.","heading":"雷军克服困难","sentences":[{"en":"A person I know about who overcame difficulties and became successful is Lei Jun, the co-founder of Xiaomi.","zh":"我知道的一位克服困难、取得成功的人，是小米的联合创始人雷军。"},{"en":"We come from the same part of China, and we both studied at Wuhan University.","zh":"我们来自中国的同一个地区，也都在武汉大学读过书。"},{"en":"That gives me a personal reason to pay attention to him, beyond simply recognising his name.","zh":"所以，我关注他有一个与自己有关的原因，并不只是因为听过他的名字。"}]},{"source":"One difficulty he described was an early business he started with others while he was at university. It eventually closed. In his public account, he explained that the team lacked business experience and hadn't clearly agreed who was responsible or what the company should focus on.","heading":"早期的挫折","sentences":[{"en":"One difficulty he described was an early business he started with others while he was at university.","zh":"他讲过的一个困难，是早期在大学期间和别人一起创办的一家公司。"},{"en":"It eventually closed.","zh":"那家公司最终关闭了。"},{"en":"In his public account, he explained that the team lacked business experience and hadn't clearly agreed who was responsible or what the company should focus on.","zh":"在他公开讲述的经历中，他解释说，团队缺乏商业经验，也没有明确商定谁来负责，以及公司应该把重点放在哪里。","skeleton":"In his public account, he explained that the team lacked business experience and hadn't clearly agreed ..."}]},{"source":"What interests me is what happened afterwards. He treated that experience as a lesson about running a business, rather than a reason to stop trying. He later worked at Kingsoft and co-founded Xiaomi in 2010. His career reminds me that being good at technology and being good at managing a company are different skills.","heading":"失败后的事业发展","sentences":[{"en":"What interests me is what happened afterwards.","zh":"我感兴趣的是，后来发生了什么。"},{"en":"He treated that experience as a lesson about running a business, rather than a reason to stop trying.","zh":"他把那次经历当作经营企业的一堂课，而不是停止尝试的理由。"},{"en":"He later worked at Kingsoft and co-founded Xiaomi in 2010.","zh":"后来，他在金山工作，并于2010年共同创立了小米。"},{"en":"His career reminds me that being good at technology and being good at managing a company are different skills.","zh":"他的职业经历提醒我，擅长技术和擅长管理公司，是两种不同的能力。"}]},{"source":"I admire his willingness to learn from a disappointing experience. Because we're from the same home region and share a university background, the story feels quite personal to me. When an unfamiliar task doesn't go well, it helps to ask what I can improve instead of assuming I can't do it. That's the lesson I take from his success.","heading":"从失败中学改进","sentences":[{"en":"I admire his willingness to learn from a disappointing experience.","zh":"我很钦佩他愿意从令人失望的经历中学习。"},{"en":"Because we're from the same home region and share a university background, the story feels quite personal to me.","zh":"因为我们来自同一个家乡地区，也有相同的大学背景，所以我对这个故事有很强的亲切感。","skeleton":"Because we're from ... and share ..., the story feels quite personal to me."},{"en":"When an unfamiliar task doesn't go well, it helps to ask what I can improve instead of assuming I can't do it.","zh":"当一项不熟悉的任务进展不顺时，问问自己能改进什么，会比直接认定自己做不到更有帮助。"},{"en":"That's the lesson I take from his success.","zh":"这就是我从他的成功中学到的道理。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"In his public account, he explained that the team lacked business experience and hadn't clearly agreed who was responsible or what the company should focus on.","method":"先用 he explained that 引出原因，分别记 lacked business experience 和 hadn't clearly agreed，再在后者补谁负责与重点是什么。"}},"T052":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A problem I had with an electronic device was when one side of my headphones stopped working. I had bought them a few weeks earlier and was using them regularly for work and English recordings. At first, I thought the recording or connection might be the problem.","heading":"耳机一侧出故障","sentences":[{"en":"A problem I had with an electronic device was when one side of my headphones stopped working.","zh":"我遇到过一次电子设备故障，就是耳机的一边不能用了。"},{"en":"I had bought them a few weeks earlier and was using them regularly for work and English recordings.","zh":"我是在几周前买的，当时经常用它来工作和录英语。"},{"en":"At first, I thought the recording or connection might be the problem.","zh":"起初，我以为可能是录音或连接出了问题。"}]},{"source":"I tried a different recording and connected the headphones again. The same side still wasn't working, so I decided to stop guessing and contact the shop. I found the proof of purchase and explained when the fault had started.","heading":"排查再求助","sentences":[{"en":"I tried a different recording and connected the headphones again.","zh":"我换了一个录音试试，又重新连接了耳机。"},{"en":"The same side still wasn't working, so I decided to stop guessing and contact the shop.","zh":"同一边还是不能用，所以我决定不再猜来猜去，直接联系店家。"},{"en":"I found the proof of purchase and explained when the fault had started.","zh":"我找出了购买凭证，并说明故障是什么时候开始的。"}]},{"source":"The shop assistant checked the headphones and confirmed that they weren't working properly. He explained the replacement process clearly. I was relieved that I didn't have to understand the internal parts of the device in order to get help.","heading":"店员确认故障","sentences":[{"en":"The shop assistant checked the headphones and confirmed that they weren't working properly.","zh":"店员检查了耳机，确认它确实不能正常工作。"},{"en":"He explained the replacement process clearly.","zh":"他清楚地解释了更换流程。"},{"en":"I was relieved that I didn't have to understand the internal parts of the device in order to get help.","zh":"让我松一口气的是，我不用搞懂设备的内部零件，也能得到帮助。"}]},{"source":"A few weeks later, one side stopped working properly. I took them back to the shop, expecting a long argument. Instead, the assistant listened carefully, checked the problem and explained the next steps. After confirming the fault, the shop arranged a replacement.","heading":"故障换新","sentences":[{"en":"A few weeks later, one side stopped working properly.","zh":"几周后，其中一边开始不能正常工作了。"},{"en":"I took them back to the shop, expecting a long argument.","zh":"我把耳机拿回店里，本以为要争论很久。"},{"en":"Instead, the assistant listened carefully, checked the problem and explained the next steps.","zh":"结果店员认真听了我的情况，检查了问题，还解释了接下来怎么处理。"},{"en":"After confirming the fault, the shop arranged a replacement.","zh":"确认故障后，店里安排给我换了一副。"}]},{"source":"That experience made the purchase more memorable. I appreciated both the product and the way the problem was handled. For me, the value wasn't just the price or the brand. It was having something useful and knowing that I could get help when it didn't work as expected.","heading":"产品与服务价值","sentences":[{"en":"That experience made the purchase more memorable.","zh":"这次经历让这笔购买更让我印象深刻。"},{"en":"I appreciated both the product and the way the problem was handled.","zh":"我既喜欢这个产品，也很认可他们处理问题的方式。"},{"en":"For me, the value wasn't just the price or the brand.","zh":"对我来说，它的价值不只是价格或者品牌。"},{"en":"It was having something useful and knowing that I could get help when it didn't work as expected.","zh":"真正的价值在于，拥有一件实用的东西，而且知道它没有正常发挥作用时，我能得到帮助。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I was relieved that I didn't have to understand the internal parts of the device in order to get help.","method":"先说 I was relieved that，再接 didn't have to understand，最后用 in order to get help 记不用懂内部构造也能求助。"}},"T053":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A public building I'd like to describe is Mohammed Bin Rashid Library in Dubai. It stands beside Dubai Creek, and its design is inspired by a traditional book rest. The library has seven levels, but what first caught my attention was its unusual shape rather than its height.","heading":"图书馆独特外形","sentences":[{"en":"A public building I'd like to describe is Mohammed Bin Rashid Library in Dubai.","zh":"我想介绍的一座公共建筑是迪拜的穆罕默德·本·拉希德图书馆。"},{"en":"It stands beside Dubai Creek, and its design is inspired by a traditional book rest.","zh":"它位于迪拜河畔，设计灵感来自一种传统的书托。"},{"en":"The library has seven levels, but what first caught my attention was its unusual shape rather than its height.","zh":"这座图书馆有七层，不过最先吸引我的，是它独特的外形，而不是它的高度。"}]},{"source":"I visited it one afternoon after a friend suggested going somewhere different from our usual cafés. Before that visit, I had seen photographs of the building, but I wanted to understand what it was like to spend time there.","heading":"初访图书馆","sentences":[{"en":"I visited it one afternoon after a friend suggested going somewhere different from our usual cafés.","zh":"一位朋友提议去个和平常那些咖啡馆不一样的地方，于是一个下午我去了那里。"},{"en":"Before that visit, I had seen photographs of the building, but I wanted to understand what it was like to spend time there.","zh":"去之前，我看过这座建筑的照片，但想了解一下真的在里面待着是什么感觉。","skeleton":"Before that visit, I had seen photographs of the building, but I wanted to understand ..."}]},{"source":"We looked around and then found somewhere to sit and read. I chose a book in English and spent some time working through a few pages. I didn't understand every word, but the setting helped me stay focused instead of moving between different things on my phone.","heading":"图书馆里专注","sentences":[{"en":"We looked around and then found somewhere to sit and read.","zh":"我们先四处看了看，然后找了个地方坐下来读书。"},{"en":"I chose a book in English and spent some time working through a few pages.","zh":"我选了一本英文书，花了些时间慢慢读了几页。"},{"en":"I didn't understand every word, but the setting helped me stay focused instead of moving between different things on my phone.","zh":"我并不是每个词都认识，但那里的环境帮我保持专注，不会在手机上不断切换着看各种东西。","skeleton":"I didn't understand every word, but the setting helped me stay focused instead of ..."}]},{"source":"What I appreciated most was that the visit had a clear purpose without feeling rushed. I could read, notice the building and take a short break from work. It felt different from being in a shopping centre, where I often end up looking at things I don't need.","heading":"有目的的参观","sentences":[{"en":"What I appreciated most was that the visit had a clear purpose without feeling rushed.","zh":"我最喜欢的是，这次参观有明确的目的，却不会让人觉得很赶。"},{"en":"I could read, notice the building and take a short break from work.","zh":"我可以读读书，看看这座建筑，也能暂时从工作中休息一下。"},{"en":"It felt different from being in a shopping centre, where I often end up looking at things I don't need.","zh":"这和去购物中心的感觉不一样，在购物中心，我最后常常会看一些自己并不需要的东西。"}]},{"source":"I'd recommend it to someone interested in books or architecture. For me, a useful public building offers more than an interesting photograph. It gives people somewhere to learn and spend their time well.","heading":"公共建筑的价值","sentences":[{"en":"I'd recommend it to someone interested in books or architecture.","zh":"我会把这里推荐给对书籍或建筑感兴趣的人。"},{"en":"For me, a useful public building offers more than an interesting photograph.","zh":"对我来说，一座有用的公共建筑，提供的不只是拍一张有意思的照片的机会。"},{"en":"It gives people somewhere to learn and spend their time well.","zh":"它也给人们提供了一个可以学习、把时间过得有意义的地方。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I didn't understand every word, but the setting helped me stay focused instead of moving between different things on my phone.","method":"先说“不懂每个词”，再用but转到“环境帮我专注”，最后用instead of补“手机上来回切换”的对照。"}},"T054":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to describe a birthday dinner I helped organise for a friend. It happened a few months ago, and there were just a few of us. We wanted to make the evening special without turning it into a complicated or expensive event.","heading":"生日筹备","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to describe a birthday dinner I helped organise for a friend.","zh":"我想讲讲我帮朋友筹办的一次生日晚餐。"},{"en":"It happened a few months ago, and there were just a few of us.","zh":"那是几个月前的事，当时就我们几个人。"},{"en":"We wanted to make the evening special without turning it into a complicated or expensive event.","zh":"我们想让那个晚上特别一点，又不想把它弄成一场复杂或昂贵的活动。"}]},{"source":"I checked when everyone was available and chose a place that was easy for us to reach. Another friend arranged the cake, while I made the reservation and confirmed the time. We also asked him what food he liked so that he would enjoy the meal.","heading":"晚餐分工","sentences":[{"en":"I checked when everyone was available and chose a place that was easy for us to reach.","zh":"我确认了大家什么时候有空，选了一个我们都方便去的地方。"},{"en":"Another friend arranged the cake, while I made the reservation and confirmed the time.","zh":"另一位朋友负责蛋糕，我则负责订位和确认时间。"},{"en":"We also asked him what food he liked so that he would enjoy the meal.","zh":"我们也问了他喜欢吃什么，好让他能吃得开心。"}]},{"source":"On the evening itself, we arrived a little early and made sure everything was ready. The atmosphere was relaxed. We talked about work, shared some funny stories and took a few photos together.","heading":"轻松的生日聚会","sentences":[{"en":"On the evening itself, we arrived a little early and made sure everything was ready.","zh":"到了聚会那天晚上，我们稍微提前到场，确认一切都准备好了。"},{"en":"The atmosphere was relaxed.","zh":"气氛很轻松。"},{"en":"We talked about work, shared some funny stories and took a few photos together.","zh":"我们聊了工作，分享了几个有趣的故事，还一起拍了几张照片。"}]},{"source":"The most memorable moment was when the cake came out. It was quite simple, but it had a small decoration connected to one of his hobbies. He hadn't expected it, and his reaction made the effort feel worthwhile.","heading":"蛋糕惊喜","sentences":[{"en":"The most memorable moment was when the cake came out.","zh":"最难忘的时刻，是蛋糕端上来的时候。"},{"en":"It was quite simple, but it had a small decoration connected to one of his hobbies.","zh":"蛋糕挺简单，但上面有一个与他的某项爱好有关的小装饰。"},{"en":"He hadn't expected it, and his reaction made the effort feel worthwhile.","zh":"他没想到会有这个安排，他的反应让我们觉得这番心思花得很值。"}]},{"source":"I was pleased that the plan worked and that everyone had a good time. It reminded me that a successful celebration doesn't depend on spending a lot of money. Paying attention to the person and making time for each other can be much more important.","heading":"用心胜过花费","sentences":[{"en":"I was pleased that the plan worked and that everyone had a good time.","zh":"计划顺利实现，大家也都玩得很开心，这让我很高兴。"},{"en":"It reminded me that a successful celebration doesn't depend on spending a lot of money.","zh":"这提醒了我，一场成功的庆祝活动，并不取决于花多少钱。"},{"en":"Paying attention to the person and making time for each other can be much more important.","zh":"关心对方，并为彼此留出时间，可能要重要得多。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"We wanted to make the evening special without turning it into a complicated or expensive event.","method":"先记 make the evening special 这个目标，再用 without turning it into 接上希望避免的复杂和昂贵。"}},"T055":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to describe my colleague Adam, who helped solve a problem in a simple but clever way. We met at work about two years ago. I often ask him for advice because he can identify what is actually making a task difficult.","heading":"同事巧妙解难题","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to describe my colleague Adam, who helped solve a problem in a simple but clever way.","zh":"我想介绍我的同事 Adam，他用一个简单又聪明的办法，帮忙解决了一个问题。"},{"en":"We met at work about two years ago.","zh":"我们大约两年前在工作中认识。"},{"en":"I often ask him for advice because he can identify what is actually making a task difficult.","zh":"我经常向他请教，因为他能找出究竟是什么让一项任务变得困难。"}]},{"source":"The problem was that I had too much information in a presentation. My first reaction was to add even more explanation. Adam suggested doing the opposite: remove the unnecessary details and show one example that people could easily understand.","heading":"删去细节讲清楚","sentences":[{"en":"The problem was that I had too much information in a presentation.","zh":"问题在于，我的演示里放了太多信息。"},{"en":"My first reaction was to add even more explanation.","zh":"我的第一反应，是再加更多解释。"},{"en":"Adam suggested doing the opposite: remove the unnecessary details and show one example that people could easily understand.","zh":"Adam建议反过来做：删掉不必要的细节，展示一个大家容易理解的例子。","skeleton":"Adam suggested doing the opposite: remove ... and show one example that ..."}]},{"source":"A few months ago, I had to explain a new idea to our team. I knew the details, but I couldn't present them clearly. Adam suggested using one simple example instead of showing everything at once. He also helped me practise and pointed out the parts that were difficult to follow.","heading":"练习表达","sentences":[{"en":"A few months ago, I had to explain a new idea to our team.","zh":"几个月前，我需要向团队解释一个新想法。"},{"en":"I knew the details, but I couldn't present them clearly.","zh":"我了解其中的细节，却没办法把它们讲清楚。"},{"en":"Adam suggested using one simple example instead of showing everything at once.","zh":"Adam 建议用一个简单的例子来说明，而不是一下子把所有内容都展示出来。"},{"en":"He also helped me practise and pointed out the parts that were difficult to follow.","zh":"他还帮我练习，指出了哪些地方让人听不明白。"}]},{"source":"The presentation went much better than I expected. People understood the idea, and I felt more confident afterwards. What I appreciate most is that he helped me learn a useful skill rather than just doing the work for me.","heading":"学会表达","sentences":[{"en":"The presentation went much better than I expected.","zh":"那次演示比我预想的顺利得多。"},{"en":"People understood the idea, and I felt more confident afterwards.","zh":"大家理解了这个想法，之后我也更有信心了。"},{"en":"What I appreciate most is that he helped me learn a useful skill rather than just doing the work for me.","zh":"我最感谢的是，他帮我学会了一项实用的技能，而不是直接替我把工作做完。","skeleton":"What I appreciate most is that he helped me learn a useful skill ..."}]},{"source":"Since then, I've tried to follow his approach. Whenever a task feels overwhelming, I break it into smaller steps. So he's had a positive influence on the way I work.","heading":"拆分任务的方法","sentences":[{"en":"Since then, I've tried to follow his approach.","zh":"从那以后，我就试着照他的方法去做。"},{"en":"Whenever a task feels overwhelming, I break it into smaller steps.","zh":"每当一项任务让我觉得难以应付时，我就把它拆成更小的步骤。"},{"en":"So he's had a positive influence on the way I work.","zh":"所以，他对我的工作方式产生了积极的影响。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"Adam suggested doing the opposite: remove the unnecessary details and show one example that people could easily understand.","method":"先记“建议反着做”，再用冒号展开“删细节”和“给易懂例子”两个解决动作。"}},"T056":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A new rule I'd like to introduce more widely in China, my home country, would require large residential buildings to provide convenient recycling points and clear instructions. Some places already have useful systems, but I'd like residents in more communities to have easy access to them. The focus would be on making recycling a simple part of everyday life.","heading":"便利回收新规定","sentences":[{"en":"A new rule I'd like to introduce more widely in China, my home country, would require large residential buildings to provide convenient recycling points and clear instructions.","zh":"我希望在我的祖国中国，更广泛地引入一项新规定，要求大型住宅楼提供方便的回收点和清楚的说明。","skeleton":"A new rule ... would require large residential buildings to provide ... and clear instructions."},{"en":"Some places already have useful systems, but I'd like residents in more communities to have easy access to them.","zh":"有些地方已经有了实用的制度，但我希望更多社区的居民都能方便地使用这样的设施。","skeleton":"Some places already have useful systems, but I'd like residents ... to have easy access to them."},{"en":"The focus would be on making recycling a simple part of everyday life.","zh":"重点是让回收成为日常生活里一件简单的事。"}]},{"source":"For example, each building could have an accessible collection area for paper, plastic bottles and metal cans. The signs could use simple pictures and several languages, so new residents would understand what belongs in each container. Building managers would also need to arrange regular collection.","heading":"回收的安排","sentences":[{"en":"For example, each building could have an accessible collection area for paper, plastic bottles and metal cans.","zh":"比如，每栋楼都可以设置一个方便使用的回收区，用来收集纸张、塑料瓶和金属罐。"},{"en":"The signs could use simple pictures and several languages, so new residents would understand what belongs in each container.","zh":"标识可以用简单的图片和几种语言，这样新住户就能知道每种东西该放进哪个容器。","skeleton":"The signs could use simple pictures and several languages, so new residents would understand ..."},{"en":"Building managers would also need to arrange regular collection.","zh":"楼宇管理人员也需要安排定期回收。"}]},{"source":"I started thinking about this while sorting packaging at home. Sometimes I have a few empty bottles or delivery boxes, and I want to deal with them properly without making a separate trip across the city. A reliable collection point close to home would make the routine much simpler.","heading":"家附近的回收点","sentences":[{"en":"I started thinking about this while sorting packaging at home.","zh":"我是在家分类整理包装废弃物时，开始考虑这件事的。"},{"en":"Sometimes I have a few empty bottles or delivery boxes, and I want to deal with them properly without making a separate trip across the city.","zh":"有时家里会有几个空瓶子或快递箱，我想妥善处理它们，又不想为此专门跑到城市另一头。","skeleton":"Sometimes I have a few empty bottles or delivery boxes, and I want to deal with them properly ..."},{"en":"A reliable collection point close to home would make the routine much simpler.","zh":"如果家附近有一个可靠的回收点，这件日常小事就会简单得多。"}]},{"source":"I'd prefer a gradual introduction, with clear guidance before penalties. If people misunderstand the system, helping them correct the mistake would be more useful than immediately punishing them.","heading":"逐步推新规","sentences":[{"en":"I'd prefer a gradual introduction, with clear guidance before penalties.","zh":"我更希望逐步推行，在处罚之前先给出明确的指导。"},{"en":"If people misunderstand the system, helping them correct the mistake would be more useful than immediately punishing them.","zh":"如果大家误解了这套制度，帮他们改正错误会比立刻处罚他们更有用。","skeleton":"If people misunderstand the system, helping them ... would be more useful than ... punishing them."}]},{"source":"The main reason I support this idea is that convenience affects behaviour. When the easier choice is also the environmentally responsible choice, more people are likely to follow it consistently.","heading":"便利促进环保","sentences":[{"en":"The main reason I support this idea is that convenience affects behaviour.","zh":"我支持这个想法的主要原因是，方便与否会影响人的行为。"},{"en":"When the easier choice is also the environmentally responsible choice, more people are likely to follow it consistently.","zh":"当更方便的选择也是对环境负责任的选择时，更多人就可能一直照着做。","skeleton":"When ..., more people are likely to follow it consistently."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"A new rule I'd like to introduce more widely in China, my home country, would require large residential buildings to provide convenient recycling points and clear instructions.","method":"先抓“A new rule would require buildings to provide”这个主干，再补“在中国推广”和“回收点及说明”两组细节。"}},"T057":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to talk about a small change I made to my evening routine. I used to come home from work and immediately start looking at my phone. I told myself I was taking a short break, but quite often I ended up scrolling for nearly an hour.","heading":"下班刷屏","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to talk about a small change I made to my evening routine.","zh":"我想聊聊我对晚间习惯作出的一点小改变。"},{"en":"I used to come home from work and immediately start looking at my phone.","zh":"以前我下班回到家，就会马上开始看手机。"},{"en":"I told myself I was taking a short break, but quite often I ended up scrolling for nearly an hour.","zh":"我告诉自己只是休息一小会儿，但经常一刷就刷了将近一个小时。"}]},{"source":"The problem was that I didn't feel rested afterwards. I was still tired, and sometimes I went to bed later than I had planned. So I decided to replace part of that screen time with a short walk.","heading":"散步替代","sentences":[{"en":"The problem was that I didn't feel rested afterwards.","zh":"问题是，刷完以后我并没有觉得休息好了。"},{"en":"I was still tired, and sometimes I went to bed later than I had planned.","zh":"我还是很累，有时还比计划的时间更晚睡。"},{"en":"So I decided to replace part of that screen time with a short walk.","zh":"所以我决定用短时间的散步，代替一部分看屏幕的时间。"}]},{"source":"I started with just ten minutes because I knew I wouldn't stick to an ambitious exercise plan. When the weather was comfortable, I walked outside. On other days, I found somewhere indoors where I could move around. I usually left my phone in my pocket and paid attention to my surroundings.","heading":"从短时散步起","sentences":[{"en":"I started with just ten minutes because I knew I wouldn't stick to an ambitious exercise plan.","zh":"我一开始只走十分钟，因为我知道，目标定得太高的锻炼计划，我坚持不下来。"},{"en":"When the weather was comfortable, I walked outside.","zh":"天气舒服的时候，我就去外面走走。"},{"en":"On other days, I found somewhere indoors where I could move around.","zh":"其他时候，我会找个能走动的室内地方。"},{"en":"I usually left my phone in my pocket and paid attention to my surroundings.","zh":"我通常把手机放在口袋里，留意周围的环境。"}]},{"source":"After a while, a friend began joining me. That made the habit easier to maintain because we could chat and remind each other to go. We weren't trying to become athletes. We just wanted to do something more active after sitting for most of the day.","heading":"结伴坚持","sentences":[{"en":"After a while, a friend began joining me.","zh":"过了一阵子，一位朋友开始和我一起走。"},{"en":"That made the habit easier to maintain because we could chat and remind each other to go.","zh":"这样更容易坚持这个习惯，因为我们可以聊天，也能互相提醒出去走走。"},{"en":"We weren't trying to become athletes.","zh":"我们并不是想成为运动员。"},{"en":"We just wanted to do something more active after sitting for most of the day.","zh":"我们只是想在坐了大半天之后，做点能让身体活动起来的事。"}]},{"source":"The walk gives me a clear break between work and the rest of my evening. The change is simple, but it helps me relax and makes me feel more in control of my time.","heading":"散步带来的改变","sentences":[{"en":"The walk gives me a clear break between work and the rest of my evening.","zh":"这段散步时间，让我的工作和当晚剩下的时间之间有了一个明确的分界。"},{"en":"The change is simple, but it helps me relax and makes me feel more in control of my time.","zh":"这个改变很简单，但它让我放松下来，也让我觉得自己更能掌控时间。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I told myself I was taking a short break, but quite often I ended up scrolling for nearly an hour.","method":"把 taking a short break 和 scrolling for nearly an hour 当成前后对照，用 but 和 ended up 说出实际结果。"}},"T058":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A city I'd like to visit again is Hangzhou, in eastern China. I went there with a friend during a short holiday last year, but the trip felt too short. What I enjoyed most was being able to slow down and spend time outdoors.","heading":"还想再去杭州","sentences":[{"en":"A city I'd like to visit again is Hangzhou, in eastern China.","zh":"我想再去一次的城市，是位于中国东部的杭州。"},{"en":"I went there with a friend during a short holiday last year, but the trip felt too short.","zh":"去年短假时，我和朋友去过那里，但总觉得待的时间太短了。"},{"en":"What I enjoyed most was being able to slow down and spend time outdoors.","zh":"我最喜欢的，就是能放慢节奏，多在户外待一待。"}]},{"source":"We spent an afternoon walking beside West Lake. There were trees along the path, and we stopped several times to look at the water. We also sat down for a while and talked, without feeling that we had to move straight to another attraction.","heading":"湖边慢慢走","sentences":[{"en":"We spent an afternoon walking beside West Lake.","zh":"我们花了一个下午在西湖边散步。"},{"en":"There were trees along the path, and we stopped several times to look at the water.","zh":"小路两旁都是树，我们停了好几次，看看湖水。"},{"en":"We also sat down for a while and talked, without feeling that we had to move straight to another attraction.","zh":"我们还坐下来聊了一会儿，也没觉得必须马上赶去另一个景点。"}]},{"source":"Away from the lake, we walked through some nearby streets and found a place to eat. I enjoyed noticing ordinary parts of the city as well as the view by the water. However, we didn't have much time to explore further.","heading":"湖外逛街巷","sentences":[{"en":"Away from the lake, we walked through some nearby streets and found a place to eat.","zh":"离开湖边后，我们走了附近几条街，找了个地方吃饭。"},{"en":"I enjoyed noticing ordinary parts of the city as well as the view by the water.","zh":"除了水边的景色，我也喜欢看看这座城市普通的日常一面。"},{"en":"However, we didn't have much time to explore further.","zh":"不过，我们没有太多时间再往别处逛。"}]},{"source":"On a second visit, I'd stay for a few days. I'd leave one morning for the lake and spend another afternoon looking around a different neighbourhood. I'd also allow time for a meal with anyone I knew in the area.","heading":"再次游览的安排","sentences":[{"en":"On a second visit, I'd stay for a few days.","zh":"第二次去的话，我会待上几天。"},{"en":"I'd leave one morning for the lake and spend another afternoon looking around a different neighbourhood.","zh":"我会留出一个上午去湖边，再花另一个下午逛逛不同的街区。"},{"en":"I'd also allow time for a meal with anyone I knew in the area.","zh":"我也会留出时间，和那一带我认识的人吃顿饭。"}]},{"source":"I'd like to return because I already know one part I enjoy, but still feel curious about the rest. I prefer that kind of trip to a packed schedule where I spend most of the day checking what I need to do next.","heading":"轻松再访的期待","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to return because I already know one part I enjoy, but still feel curious about the rest.","zh":"我想再去，是因为我已经知道那里有一部分是我喜欢的，同时又对其他地方很好奇。"},{"en":"I prefer that kind of trip to a packed schedule where I spend most of the day checking what I need to do next.","zh":"我更喜欢这种旅行，而不是行程排得满满的，一天大部分时间都在查看下一步该做什么。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I prefer that kind of trip to a packed schedule where I spend most of the day checking what I need to do next.","method":"先记I prefer that kind of trip to这个比较框架，再补packed schedule后“整天查看下一安排”的具体表现。"}},"T059":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A person I only met once but would like to know better is a man called Adam. I met him at a small photography workshop last month. We spoke for about twenty minutes while practising how to take pictures of the street outside.","heading":"摄影课上初相识","sentences":[{"en":"A person I only met once but would like to know better is a man called Adam.","zh":"有一个人，我只见过一次，但想多了解一些，他叫Adam。"},{"en":"I met him at a small photography workshop last month.","zh":"上个月，我在一次小型摄影工作坊上认识了他。"},{"en":"We spoke for about twenty minutes while practising how to take pictures of the street outside.","zh":"我们一边练习怎么拍外面的街景，一边聊了大约二十分钟。"}]},{"source":"I noticed him because he was using a basic phone but still taking interesting photos. He didn't seem concerned about having the most expensive equipment. Instead, he paid attention to the light, the background and the position of the people in the picture.","heading":"用心拍照片","sentences":[{"en":"I noticed him because he was using a basic phone but still taking interesting photos.","zh":"我注意到他，是因为他用的只是普通手机，却还能拍出很有意思的照片。"},{"en":"He didn't seem concerned about having the most expensive equipment.","zh":"他似乎不太在意是不是拥有最昂贵的设备。"},{"en":"Instead, he paid attention to the light, the background and the position of the people in the picture.","zh":"相反，他关注的是光线、背景，以及照片里人物的位置。"}]},{"source":"When I asked how he made an ordinary scene look so good, he showed me a simple example. He moved a little to one side, waited for a person to walk past and then took the photo. That small change made the picture much more balanced.","heading":"角度的小变化","sentences":[{"en":"When I asked how he made an ordinary scene look so good, he showed me a simple example.","zh":"我问他怎么把普通场景拍得这么好看，他就给我示范了一个简单的例子。"},{"en":"He moved a little to one side, waited for a person to walk past and then took the photo.","zh":"他往一侧挪了一点，等一个人走过去，然后拍下了照片。"},{"en":"That small change made the picture much more balanced.","zh":"这么小的调整，就让画面平衡了很多。"}]},{"source":"He explained the idea patiently and asked me to try it myself. I liked the fact that he was willing to share what he knew without making me feel inexperienced. Before we left, he mentioned that he enjoyed photographing different cities.","heading":"耐心分享摄影经验","sentences":[{"en":"He explained the idea patiently and asked me to try it myself.","zh":"他耐心地解释那个想法，还让我自己试一试。"},{"en":"I liked the fact that he was willing to share what he knew without making me feel inexperienced.","zh":"我喜欢的一点是，他愿意分享自己知道的东西，又不会让我觉得自己没经验。"},{"en":"Before we left, he mentioned that he enjoyed photographing different cities.","zh":"离开前，他提到，自己喜欢拍摄不同的城市。"}]},{"source":"I'd like to know more about his travels and see some of those photographs. He seemed observant, friendly and easy to talk to. Although our conversation was short, I came away with a useful idea and the feeling that we could have an interesting conversation again.","heading":"想再次见面聊天","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to know more about his travels and see some of those photographs.","zh":"我想多了解一些他的旅行经历，也想看看那些照片。"},{"en":"He seemed observant, friendly and easy to talk to.","zh":"他看起来很善于观察，人也友善，很好聊。"},{"en":"Although our conversation was short, I came away with a useful idea and the feeling that we could have an interesting conversation again.","zh":"虽然我们的谈话很短，但离开时我收获了一个有用的想法，也觉得我们以后还能再聊得很有意思。","skeleton":"Although our conversation was short, I came away with a useful idea and the feeling that ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"Although our conversation was short, I came away with a useful idea and the feeling that we could have an interesting conversation again.","method":"先用 Although 说聊天很短，再用 came away with 接两项收获：“有用想法”和“还可再聊的感觉”。"}},"T060":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A gift I'd like to buy for a friend is a pair of comfortable headphones. My friend Sam enjoys listening to music and is also trying to improve his English. We've known each other for a few years, so I have a fairly good idea of what he would use.","heading":"给朋友选实用礼物","sentences":[{"en":"A gift I'd like to buy for a friend is a pair of comfortable headphones.","zh":"我想给朋友买的一份礼物，是一副舒服的耳机。"},{"en":"My friend Sam enjoys listening to music and is also trying to improve his English.","zh":"我的朋友萨姆喜欢听音乐，也正在努力提高英语。"},{"en":"We've known each other for a few years, so I have a fairly good idea of what he would use.","zh":"我们认识好几年了，所以我大致知道什么东西他会用得上。"}]},{"source":"He sometimes listens through his phone's speaker, which isn't very convenient when other people are nearby. I think headphones would let him enjoy recordings and practise listening without disturbing anyone. They could also be useful when he wants to concentrate.","heading":"耳机的用途","sentences":[{"en":"He sometimes listens through his phone's speaker, which isn't very convenient when other people are nearby.","zh":"他有时用手机扬声器听东西，旁边有人时，这样不太方便。"},{"en":"I think headphones would let him enjoy recordings and practise listening without disturbing anyone.","zh":"我觉得耳机能让他听录音、练听力，又不会打扰别人。"},{"en":"They could also be useful when he wants to concentrate.","zh":"他想集中注意力时，耳机也可能派得上用场。"}]},{"source":"I wouldn't choose the most expensive pair automatically. I'd compare comfort, sound quality and how easy they are to use. If possible, I'd ask him about his preferences without immediately revealing that I was thinking about a gift.","heading":"挑选耳机作礼物","sentences":[{"en":"I wouldn't choose the most expensive pair automatically.","zh":"我不会想都不想就选最贵的那副耳机。"},{"en":"I'd compare comfort, sound quality and how easy they are to use.","zh":"我会比较佩戴舒适度、音质，还有它们用起来是否方便。"},{"en":"If possible, I'd ask him about his preferences without immediately revealing that I was thinking about a gift.","zh":"如果可以，我会问问他的偏好，但不会立刻透露自己在考虑送礼物。"}]},{"source":"I'd probably give them to him on his birthday. I would include a short note explaining why I chose them, because I think that personal detail matters. I might also suggest an English podcast we could both listen to and discuss afterwards.","heading":"生日礼物心意","sentences":[{"en":"I'd probably give them to him on his birthday.","zh":"我大概会在他生日那天把耳机送给他。"},{"en":"I would include a short note explaining why I chose them, because I think that personal detail matters.","zh":"我会附一张简短的便条，解释为什么选这份礼物，因为我觉得这种个人化的小细节很重要。"},{"en":"I might also suggest an English podcast we could both listen to and discuss afterwards.","zh":"我可能还会推荐一个我们都能听的英语播客，之后可以一起讨论。"}]},{"source":"I'd choose this gift because it connects with his actual interests. A useful present can show that someone has paid attention to you. I hope he would enjoy it regularly, rather than put it away after the first day.","heading":"贴合兴趣礼物","sentences":[{"en":"I'd choose this gift because it connects with his actual interests.","zh":"我会选这份礼物，因为它和他真正的兴趣有关。"},{"en":"A useful present can show that someone has paid attention to you.","zh":"一份实用的礼物，能让人感受到有人一直在留意自己。"},{"en":"I hope he would enjoy it regularly, rather than put it away after the first day.","zh":"我希望他会经常用它，而不是第一天过后就把它收起来。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"If possible, I'd ask him about his preferences without immediately revealing that I was thinking about a gift.","method":"先放 If possible，再说“询问偏好”，最后用 without immediately revealing that 接“不马上透露送礼打算”。"}},"T061":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A city I'd like to visit in the future is Suzhou, in eastern China. I haven't been there yet, but photographs of its canals have made me curious about it. I'd like to go with a friend who enjoys walking and a slower kind of holiday.","heading":"想去游苏州","sentences":[{"en":"A city I'd like to visit in the future is Suzhou, in eastern China.","zh":"将来我想去的一座城市，是中国东部的苏州。"},{"en":"I haven't been there yet, but photographs of its canals have made me curious about it.","zh":"我还没去过，但它那些运河的照片让我对那里很好奇。"},{"en":"I'd like to go with a friend who enjoys walking and a slower kind of holiday.","zh":"我想和一位喜欢散步、也喜欢慢节奏度假的朋友一起去。"}]},{"source":"The place I'd most like to see is one of the canals. I'd spend a morning exploring the paths beside the water, stopping when we found somewhere pleasant to sit. I wouldn't want the whole visit to become a list of photographs I needed to take.","heading":"沿着运河慢慢逛","sentences":[{"en":"The place I'd most like to see is one of the canals.","zh":"我最想看的地方，是其中一条运河。"},{"en":"I'd spend a morning exploring the paths beside the water, stopping when we found somewhere pleasant to sit.","zh":"我会花一个上午，沿着水边的小路走走，找到舒服的地方就停下来坐一会儿。"},{"en":"I wouldn't want the whole visit to become a list of photographs I needed to take.","zh":"我不想让整个游览过程变成一张必须拍完的照片清单。"}]},{"source":"I'd also leave time to explore another part of the city. We could look around some streets, find somewhere to eat and choose one other activity according to what interested us. I'd rather make a realistic plan than try to see everything in a day.","heading":"合理安排城市游","sentences":[{"en":"I'd also leave time to explore another part of the city.","zh":"我也会留出时间，去看看这座城市的另一个区域。"},{"en":"We could look around some streets, find somewhere to eat and choose one other activity according to what interested us.","zh":"我们可以逛逛一些街道，找个地方吃饭，再根据自己的兴趣选一个其他活动。","skeleton":"We could look around some streets, find somewhere to eat and choose one other activity ..."},{"en":"I'd rather make a realistic plan than try to see everything in a day.","zh":"我宁愿做一个现实可行的计划，也不想一天之内看遍所有地方。"}]},{"source":"Before booking, I'd check the weather, transport and accommodation costs. I would also look for recent practical information so that I understood how to get between the places we wanted to visit.","heading":"出发前查实用信息","sentences":[{"en":"Before booking, I'd check the weather, transport and accommodation costs.","zh":"预订之前，我会查一下天气、交通情况和住宿费用。"},{"en":"I would also look for recent practical information so that I understood how to get between the places we wanted to visit.","zh":"我还会找一些最新的实用信息，这样就知道怎么往返于我们想去的几个地方。","skeleton":"I would also look for ... so that I understood how to get between the places ..."}]},{"source":"What attracts me is the possibility of combining a city visit with time by the water. I spend a lot of time indoors, so that balance sounds appealing. I'd hope to come home with a clearer impression of the place and a few memories shared with a friend.","heading":"城市与水边相结合","sentences":[{"en":"What attracts me is the possibility of combining a city visit with time by the water.","zh":"吸引我的是，可以既逛城市，又在水边待些时间。"},{"en":"I spend a lot of time indoors, so that balance sounds appealing.","zh":"我平时经常待在室内，所以这种平衡听起来很吸引人。"},{"en":"I'd hope to come home with a clearer impression of the place and a few memories shared with a friend.","zh":"我希望回来时，对那个地方有更清晰的印象，也能带回几段和朋友一起留下的回忆。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I would also look for recent practical information so that I understood how to get between the places we wanted to visit.","method":"先记“查最新实用信息”，再用so that接“了解如何往返各景点”这个目的。"}},"T062":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A special cake I received was one my friends gave me on my birthday a few months ago. I hadn't planned a large celebration, so I was surprised when they invited me to a simple dinner and brought out the cake afterwards.","heading":"意外生日蛋糕","sentences":[{"en":"A special cake I received was one my friends gave me on my birthday a few months ago.","zh":"几个月前的生日，朋友们送了我一个很特别的蛋糕。"},{"en":"I hadn't planned a large celebration, so I was surprised when they invited me to a simple dinner and brought out the cake afterwards.","zh":"我原本没打算大办，所以他们请我简单吃顿晚饭、之后又端出蛋糕时，我很惊讶。","skeleton":"I hadn't planned a large celebration, so I was surprised when they invited me ... and brought out the cake afterwards."}]},{"source":"It was a chocolate cake with a small decoration connected to one of my hobbies. It wasn't especially large or expensive, but the detail showed that they had thought about me. They had arranged it without telling me, which made the surprise work.","heading":"蛋糕的小细节","sentences":[{"en":"It was a chocolate cake with a small decoration connected to one of my hobbies.","zh":"那是一个巧克力蛋糕，上面有一个与我的某项爱好有关的小装饰。"},{"en":"It wasn't especially large or expensive, but the detail showed that they had thought about me.","zh":"它不是特别大，也不贵，但这个细节说明他们把我放在了心上。"},{"en":"They had arranged it without telling me, which made the surprise work.","zh":"他们没告诉我就安排好了，所以这个惊喜才成功了。"}]},{"source":"We sat together, talked about things that had happened that week and took a few photos. When the cake arrived, everyone smiled and sang. I felt slightly embarrassed by the attention at first, but it was a very warm moment.","heading":"收到蛋糕的温暖","sentences":[{"en":"We sat together, talked about things that had happened that week and took a few photos.","zh":"我们坐在一起，聊了那周发生的事情，也拍了几张照片。"},{"en":"When the cake arrived, everyone smiled and sang.","zh":"蛋糕端来时，大家笑着唱起了歌。"},{"en":"I felt slightly embarrassed by the attention at first, but it was a very warm moment.","zh":"起初大家都关注着我，让我有点不好意思，但那是一个很温暖的时刻。"}]},{"source":"We shared the cake after the meal. What I remember most isn't the exact taste, although I enjoyed it. It's the feeling of spending time with people who had made an effort to celebrate with me. I also kept a photo of the cake as a reminder.","heading":"蛋糕承载的心意","sentences":[{"en":"We shared the cake after the meal.","zh":"饭后，我们一起分着吃了蛋糕。"},{"en":"What I remember most isn't the exact taste, although I enjoyed it.","zh":"虽然蛋糕很好吃，但我记得最深的并不是它具体的味道。"},{"en":"It's the feeling of spending time with people who had made an effort to celebrate with me.","zh":"而是和这些特意花心思来陪我庆祝的人一起相处的感觉。"},{"en":"I also kept a photo of the cake as a reminder.","zh":"我还留了一张蛋糕的照片，作为纪念。"}]},{"source":"The cake was special because it felt personal. A simple gift can mean a lot when it reflects something about the person receiving it. I'd like to do something similar for a friend rather than assume that a more expensive present is always better.","heading":"用心的礼物","sentences":[{"en":"The cake was special because it felt personal.","zh":"这个蛋糕很特别，因为它让我觉得是专门为我准备的。"},{"en":"A simple gift can mean a lot when it reflects something about the person receiving it.","zh":"一份简单的礼物，只要能体现收礼人的某些特点，就可以很有意义。"},{"en":"I'd like to do something similar for a friend rather than assume that a more expensive present is always better.","zh":"我想为朋友做类似的事，而不是认定更贵的礼物总是更好。","skeleton":"I'd like to do something similar for a friend rather than assume that ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I hadn't planned a large celebration, so I was surprised when they invited me to a simple dinner and brought out the cake afterwards.","method":"先用 hadn't planned 交代原本没大办，再用 so I was surprised when 接朋友先请吃饭、后端蛋糕的两个动作。"}},"T063":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"One thing I did to improve my English was start recording myself answering a short question each day. I began a few months ago because I realised that reading and listening alone weren't giving me enough practice in expressing my own ideas.","heading":"录音练习英语","sentences":[{"en":"One thing I did to improve my English was start recording myself answering a short question each day.","zh":"为了提高英语，我做过的一件事，就是开始每天回答一个简短的问题，并把自己说的内容录下来。"},{"en":"I began a few months ago because I realised that reading and listening alone weren't giving me enough practice in expressing my own ideas.","zh":"几个月前，我开始这样做，因为我意识到，光靠阅读和听力，并不能让我充分练习表达自己的想法。","skeleton":"I began a few months ago because I realised that reading and listening alone weren't giving me enough practice ..."}]},{"source":"I usually chose a topic connected with my daily life, such as a recent outing or something I had learned at work. That meant I could concentrate on explaining my meaning instead of trying to invent an interesting story at the same time.","heading":"熟悉话题练习","sentences":[{"en":"I usually chose a topic connected with my daily life, such as a recent outing or something I had learned at work.","zh":"我通常会选和日常生活有关的话题，比如最近的一次外出，或者我在工作中学到的东西。","skeleton":"I usually chose a topic connected with my daily life, such as a recent outing or something ..."},{"en":"That meant I could concentrate on explaining my meaning instead of trying to invent an interesting story at the same time.","zh":"这样我就能专注于把自己的意思讲清楚，而不用同时费心编一个有趣的故事。","skeleton":"That meant I could concentrate on explaining my meaning instead of trying to invent ... at the same time."}]},{"source":"After recording, I listened back and noticed the places where I hesitated. Sometimes the problem was a word I couldn't remember. More often, I was trying to make a sentence too complicated. I then answered the same question again using simpler language.","heading":"回听发现表达问题","sentences":[{"en":"After recording, I listened back and noticed the places where I hesitated.","zh":"录完之后，我会回听，找出自己犹豫的地方。"},{"en":"Sometimes the problem was a word I couldn't remember.","zh":"有时候，问题是某个词想不起来。"},{"en":"More often, I was trying to make a sentence too complicated.","zh":"但更多的时候，是我把句子想得太复杂了。"},{"en":"I then answered the same question again using simpler language.","zh":"然后，我会用更简单的语言，再回答一次同样的问题。"}]},{"source":"Occasionally, I asked a friend whether my example was clear. I found that more useful than only asking whether the answer sounded good. If the meaning was difficult to follow, I changed the order or added one concrete detail.","heading":"检查意思是否清楚","sentences":[{"en":"Occasionally, I asked a friend whether my example was clear.","zh":"偶尔，我会问朋友，我举的例子是不是清楚。"},{"en":"I found that more useful than only asking whether the answer sounded good.","zh":"我发现，这比只问回答听起来好不好更有用。"},{"en":"If the meaning was difficult to follow, I changed the order or added one concrete detail.","zh":"如果意思不太好理解，我就调整顺序，或者加一个具体的细节。"}]},{"source":"The routine didn't solve everything, but it made speaking feel less unfamiliar. I could notice small improvements, and it was easy enough to continue on a busy day. I'd keep using it because it gives me practice and a clear way to check my progress.","heading":"练习的小进步","sentences":[{"en":"The routine didn't solve everything, but it made speaking feel less unfamiliar.","zh":"这个练习安排没有解决所有问题，但让说英语没那么陌生了。"},{"en":"I could notice small improvements, and it was easy enough to continue on a busy day.","zh":"我能注意到一点点进步，而且练习足够简单，忙碌的日子也能继续。"},{"en":"I'd keep using it because it gives me practice and a clear way to check my progress.","zh":"我会继续用这个方法，因为它既让我得到练习，也给了我一个清楚检验进步的办法。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I began a few months ago because I realised that reading and listening alone weren't giving me enough practice in expressing my own ideas.","method":"按“几个月前开始—因为意识到—读和听练表达不够”记三层，用 because 和 that 逐层接上。"}},"T064":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"An important lake in China that I'd like to describe is West Lake in Hangzhou, in Zhejiang Province. I visited it with a friend during a short holiday last year. We had a busy few weeks before the trip, so we wanted somewhere we could explore without rushing.","heading":"假期走访杭州西湖","sentences":[{"en":"An important lake in China that I'd like to describe is West Lake in Hangzhou, in Zhejiang Province.","zh":"我想介绍中国一处重要的湖泊，就是浙江省杭州市的西湖。"},{"en":"I visited it with a friend during a short holiday last year.","zh":"去年短假时，我和朋友一起去过。"},{"en":"We had a busy few weeks before the trip, so we wanted somewhere we could explore without rushing.","zh":"出发前几周，我们都很忙，所以想找个能慢慢逛、不用赶时间的地方。"}]},{"source":"We spent an afternoon walking along the paths beside the lake. What I remember most is the space around the water. There were trees beside the path, and we could stop whenever we noticed a view we liked. I took a few photos, but I also put my phone away for part of the walk.","heading":"沿着湖边慢行","sentences":[{"en":"We spent an afternoon walking along the paths beside the lake.","zh":"我们花了一个下午，沿着湖边的小路散步。"},{"en":"What I remember most is the space around the water.","zh":"我印象最深的是水边的那片空间。"},{"en":"There were trees beside the path, and we could stop whenever we noticed a view we liked.","zh":"小路旁边有树，每当看到喜欢的景色，我们就可以停下来。"},{"en":"I took a few photos, but I also put my phone away for part of the walk.","zh":"我拍了几张照片，不过散步途中也有一段时间把手机收了起来。"}]},{"source":"At one point, we sat down and watched the light change on the water. We talked about ordinary things and didn't feel that we had to keep moving to another attraction. Afterwards, we found somewhere nearby to have a simple meal.","heading":"湖边闲坐","sentences":[{"en":"At one point, we sat down and watched the light change on the water.","zh":"途中我们坐下来，看着水面上的光线变化。"},{"en":"We talked about ordinary things and didn't feel that we had to keep moving to another attraction.","zh":"我们聊些日常小事，也没觉得非得一直赶去下一个景点。"},{"en":"Afterwards, we found somewhere nearby to have a simple meal.","zh":"之后，我们在附近找了个地方，简单吃了顿饭。"}]},{"source":"For me, the lake is important because it gives people a place to enjoy being outdoors while visiting a city. I liked the balance between walking, looking around and having time to talk.","heading":"湖畔的价值","sentences":[{"en":"For me, the lake is important because it gives people a place to enjoy being outdoors while visiting a city.","zh":"对我来说，这个湖很重要，因为它让人们在游览一座城市的同时，也有地方可以享受户外时光。"},{"en":"I liked the balance between walking, looking around and having time to talk.","zh":"我喜欢那种平衡：既能走走看看，又有时间聊天。"}]},{"source":"I'd happily go back, especially with someone who enjoys walking and spending time outdoors. I'd leave enough time to enjoy the lake properly instead of trying to fit several activities into one afternoon. To me, that is what makes a place worth visiting.","heading":"留足时间欣赏湖景","sentences":[{"en":"I'd happily go back, especially with someone who enjoys walking and spending time outdoors.","zh":"我很愿意再去，尤其是和喜欢散步、喜欢户外活动的人一起。"},{"en":"I'd leave enough time to enjoy the lake properly instead of trying to fit several activities into one afternoon.","zh":"我会留出足够的时间，好好欣赏这片湖，而不是想在一个下午硬塞进好几项活动。","skeleton":"I'd leave enough time to enjoy the lake properly instead of trying to fit ... into one afternoon."},{"en":"To me, that is what makes a place worth visiting.","zh":"对我来说，这正是一个地方值得去的原因。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I'd leave enough time to enjoy the lake properly instead of trying to fit several activities into one afternoon.","method":"把“留足时间好好看湖”和“一个下午塞多项活动”用instead of连起来，记住两种游览节奏的对照。"}},"T065":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A day out that cost me very little was an afternoon exploring an older part of Dubai with a friend. We chose it because we wanted to do something enjoyable without spending much. Most of the plan involved walking around, looking at the shops and taking photos.","heading":"花费很少的出游","sentences":[{"en":"A day out that cost me very little was an afternoon exploring an older part of Dubai with a friend.","zh":"有一次外出花钱很少，是我和朋友花了一个下午，去逛迪拜一片老城区。"},{"en":"We chose it because we wanted to do something enjoyable without spending much.","zh":"我们选择去那里，是因为想做点开心的事，又不想花太多钱。"},{"en":"Most of the plan involved walking around, looking at the shops and taking photos.","zh":"计划主要就是四处走走、看看店铺、拍拍照片。"}]},{"source":"We started near the creek and spent some time looking at the old buildings and small shops. What I liked was the atmosphere. It felt different from the modern shopping malls I normally see. There were narrow streets, people selling different products, and plenty of small details to notice.","heading":"老城氛围","sentences":[{"en":"We started near the creek and spent some time looking at the old buildings and small shops.","zh":"我们从迪拜河附近开始逛，花了些时间看看老建筑和小商店。"},{"en":"What I liked was the atmosphere.","zh":"我喜欢的是那里的氛围。"},{"en":"It felt different from the modern shopping malls I normally see.","zh":"那种感觉和我平时见到的现代购物中心很不一样。"},{"en":"There were narrow streets, people selling different products, and plenty of small details to notice.","zh":"那里有狭窄的街道、售卖各种商品的人，还有很多值得留意的小细节。"}]},{"source":"At one point, we walked through a busy market. It was quite crowded, and I could hear people talking and calling out to customers. Later, we moved to a quieter spot by the water and took a few photos. The light was softer by then, which made the area look especially nice.","heading":"市场水边","sentences":[{"en":"At one point, we walked through a busy market.","zh":"途中有一段，我们穿过了一个热闹的市场。"},{"en":"It was quite crowded, and I could hear people talking and calling out to customers.","zh":"那里挺拥挤的，我能听到人们聊天和招呼顾客的声音。"},{"en":"Later, we moved to a quieter spot by the water and took a few photos.","zh":"后来，我们去了水边一个更安静的地方，拍了几张照片。"},{"en":"The light was softer by then, which made the area look especially nice.","zh":"那时候光线已经柔和了些，让那一带看起来特别漂亮。"}]},{"source":"We only spent money on transport and a simple drink. We didn't book an expensive activity or buy things just because they were available. Sitting by the water and talking was one of the best parts, and that didn't require a large budget.","heading":"低花费外出","sentences":[{"en":"We only spent money on transport and a simple drink.","zh":"我们只在交通和简单的饮品上花了钱。"},{"en":"We didn't book an expensive activity or buy things just because they were available.","zh":"我们没有预订昂贵的活动，也没有因为东西摆在那里就买。"},{"en":"Sitting by the water and talking was one of the best parts, and that didn't require a large budget.","zh":"坐在水边聊天是最开心的部分之一，而且不需要很高的预算。"}]},{"source":"I remember feeling relaxed afterwards. It reminded me that I don't always need a complicated plan to have a good day. Sometimes a walk, a friend and a change of surroundings are enough.","heading":"简单的快乐一天","sentences":[{"en":"I remember feeling relaxed afterwards.","zh":"我记得结束后，整个人都很放松。"},{"en":"It reminded me that I don't always need a complicated plan to have a good day.","zh":"这让我意识到，想过得开心，不一定每次都要安排一个复杂的计划。"},{"en":"Sometimes a walk, a friend and a change of surroundings are enough.","zh":"有时候，散散步、和朋友在一起、换个环境，就足够了。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"There were narrow streets, people selling different products, and plenty of small details to notice.","method":"用 There were 开头，依次记街道、卖东西的人、小细节这三个画面。"}},"T066":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to describe a birthday dinner I helped organise for a friend. It happened a few months ago, and there were just a few of us. We wanted to make the evening special without turning it into a complicated or expensive event.","heading":"生日筹备","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to describe a birthday dinner I helped organise for a friend.","zh":"我想讲讲我帮朋友筹办的一次生日晚餐。"},{"en":"It happened a few months ago, and there were just a few of us.","zh":"那是几个月前的事，当时就我们几个人。"},{"en":"We wanted to make the evening special without turning it into a complicated or expensive event.","zh":"我们想让那个晚上特别一点，又不想把它弄成一场复杂或昂贵的活动。"}]},{"source":"I checked when everyone was available and chose a place that was easy for us to reach. Another friend arranged the cake, while I made the reservation and confirmed the time. We also asked him what food he liked so that he would enjoy the meal.","heading":"晚餐分工","sentences":[{"en":"I checked when everyone was available and chose a place that was easy for us to reach.","zh":"我确认了大家什么时候有空，选了一个我们都方便去的地方。"},{"en":"Another friend arranged the cake, while I made the reservation and confirmed the time.","zh":"另一位朋友负责蛋糕，我则负责订位和确认时间。"},{"en":"We also asked him what food he liked so that he would enjoy the meal.","zh":"我们也问了他喜欢吃什么，好让他能吃得开心。"}]},{"source":"On the evening itself, we arrived a little early and made sure everything was ready. The atmosphere was relaxed. We talked about work, shared some funny stories and took a few photos together.","heading":"轻松的生日聚会","sentences":[{"en":"On the evening itself, we arrived a little early and made sure everything was ready.","zh":"到了聚会那天晚上，我们稍微提前到场，确认一切都准备好了。"},{"en":"The atmosphere was relaxed.","zh":"气氛很轻松。"},{"en":"We talked about work, shared some funny stories and took a few photos together.","zh":"我们聊了工作，分享了几个有趣的故事，还一起拍了几张照片。"}]},{"source":"The most memorable moment was when the cake came out. It was quite simple, but it had a small decoration connected to one of his hobbies. He hadn't expected it, and his reaction made the effort feel worthwhile.","heading":"蛋糕惊喜","sentences":[{"en":"The most memorable moment was when the cake came out.","zh":"最难忘的时刻，是蛋糕端上来的时候。"},{"en":"It was quite simple, but it had a small decoration connected to one of his hobbies.","zh":"蛋糕挺简单，但上面有一个与他的某项爱好有关的小装饰。"},{"en":"He hadn't expected it, and his reaction made the effort feel worthwhile.","zh":"他没想到会有这个安排，他的反应让我们觉得这番心思花得很值。"}]},{"source":"I was pleased that the plan worked and that everyone had a good time. It reminded me that a successful celebration doesn't depend on spending a lot of money. Paying attention to the person and making time for each other can be much more important.","heading":"用心胜过花费","sentences":[{"en":"I was pleased that the plan worked and that everyone had a good time.","zh":"计划顺利实现，大家也都玩得很开心，这让我很高兴。"},{"en":"It reminded me that a successful celebration doesn't depend on spending a lot of money.","zh":"这提醒了我，一场成功的庆祝活动，并不取决于花多少钱。"},{"en":"Paying attention to the person and making time for each other can be much more important.","zh":"关心对方，并为彼此留出时间，可能要重要得多。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"We wanted to make the evening special without turning it into a complicated or expensive event.","method":"先记 make the evening special 这个目标，再用 without turning it into 接上希望避免的复杂和昂贵。"}},"T067":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A course that impressed me was a short course on giving presentations. I took it a while ago because I often needed to explain ideas at work, but I found it difficult to decide what to include and what to leave out. It was held in a training room at my workplace in Dubai.","heading":"参加表达培训课","sentences":[{"en":"A course that impressed me was a short course on giving presentations.","zh":"让我印象深刻的一门课，是一门简短的演示表达课程。"},{"en":"I took it a while ago because I often needed to explain ideas at work, but I found it difficult to decide what to include and what to leave out.","zh":"前一阵我上了这门课，因为工作中经常需要解释想法，但我发现很难决定哪些内容该讲，哪些该省略。","skeleton":"I took it ... because ..., but I found it difficult to decide what to include and what to leave out."},{"en":"It was held in a training room at my workplace in Dubai.","zh":"课程是在我迪拜工作地点的一间培训室里进行的。"}]},{"source":"The teacher asked us to begin with one main message and support it with a simple example. That sounded easy, but during the first exercise I realised that I was adding details which didn't help the audience understand my point.","heading":"课程的要点","sentences":[{"en":"The teacher asked us to begin with one main message and support it with a simple example.","zh":"老师让我们先从一个主要观点开始，再用一个简单的例子来支持它。"},{"en":"That sounded easy, but during the first exercise I realised that I was adding details which didn't help the audience understand my point.","zh":"听起来容易，但第一次练习时，我才发现自己加了很多细节，而那些细节并没帮听众理解我的观点。","skeleton":"That sounded easy, but during the first exercise I realised that I was adding details ..."}]},{"source":"We practised in small groups and gave each other feedback. I tried again with fewer slides and a clearer order. The teacher also asked us to explain our ideas without reading whole sentences from the screen, which made the exercise feel more practical.","heading":"分组练习与反馈","sentences":[{"en":"We practised in small groups and gave each other feedback.","zh":"我们分成小组练习，互相给反馈。"},{"en":"I tried again with fewer slides and a clearer order.","zh":"我减少了幻灯片数量，也把顺序整理得更清楚，然后又试了一遍。"},{"en":"The teacher also asked us to explain our ideas without reading whole sentences from the screen, which made the exercise feel more practical.","zh":"老师还让我们讲解自己的想法时，不要照着屏幕读完整的句子，这让练习显得更贴近实际。","skeleton":"The teacher also asked us to explain our ideas ... which made the exercise feel more practical."}]},{"source":"After the course, I used the method in a team presentation. I began with the problem and one example before explaining the details. People understood the idea more quickly, and their questions helped us have a useful discussion.","heading":"课堂方法用于工作","sentences":[{"en":"After the course, I used the method in a team presentation.","zh":"课后，我在一次团队演示中用了这个方法。"},{"en":"I began with the problem and one example before explaining the details.","zh":"我先讲问题，再举一个例子，然后才解释细节。"},{"en":"People understood the idea more quickly, and their questions helped us have a useful discussion.","zh":"大家更快地理解了这个想法，他们的问题也让我们有了一场有用的讨论。"}]},{"source":"What impressed me most was the chance to practise rather than simply listen to advice. I left with a method I could use straight away. I still need preparation before a presentation, but I now have a clearer way to organise my thoughts.","heading":"课程带来表达方法","sentences":[{"en":"What impressed me most was the chance to practise rather than simply listen to advice.","zh":"最让我印象深刻的，是有机会实际练习，而不只是听建议。"},{"en":"I left with a method I could use straight away.","zh":"上完后，我带走了一个马上就能用的方法。"},{"en":"I still need preparation before a presentation, but I now have a clearer way to organise my thoughts.","zh":"做演示前，我依然需要准备，但现在更清楚该怎么组织思路了。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I took it a while ago because I often needed to explain ideas at work, but I found it difficult to decide what to include and what to leave out.","method":"先说“前阵子上课”，再用 because 接工作需要，最后用 but 引出难处，并把 include 与 leave out 成对记。"}},"T068":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A café close to nature that I'd like to describe is a small beachside cafe, near Sunset Beach in Dubai. I went there with a friend one evening after we had spent some time walking beside the sea. We wanted somewhere to sit and have a drink.","heading":"海边咖啡馆小坐","sentences":[{"en":"A café close to nature that I'd like to describe is a small beachside cafe, near Sunset Beach in Dubai.","zh":"我想介绍一家很接近自然的咖啡馆，是迪拜日落海滩附近的一家小海边咖啡馆。"},{"en":"I went there with a friend one evening after we had spent some time walking beside the sea.","zh":"有天傍晚，我和朋友在海边走了一阵子之后，去了那里。"},{"en":"We wanted somewhere to sit and have a drink.","zh":"我们想找个地方坐下来，喝点东西。"}]},{"source":"We chose a table where we could see the water. The view was the main reason I liked the place. I could notice the light changing outside while sitting comfortably, which felt different from spending another evening inside a shopping centre.","heading":"窗外看水景","sentences":[{"en":"We chose a table where we could see the water.","zh":"我们选了一张能看到水面的桌子。"},{"en":"The view was the main reason I liked the place.","zh":"景色是我喜欢这个地方的主要原因。"},{"en":"I could notice the light changing outside while sitting comfortably, which felt different from spending another evening inside a shopping centre.","zh":"我可以舒服地坐着，看着外面的光线变化，那种感觉和又在购物中心里度过一个晚上很不一样。","skeleton":"I could notice the light changing outside ..., which felt different from spending another evening inside a shopping centre."}]},{"source":"I ordered a cold drink, and we stayed for about half an hour. We talked about our week and a few things we hoped to do at the weekend. The conversation felt relaxed because neither of us was trying to get to another activity immediately.","heading":"喝着冷饮慢慢聊","sentences":[{"en":"I ordered a cold drink, and we stayed for about half an hour.","zh":"我点了一杯冷饮，我们在那里待了大约半小时。"},{"en":"We talked about our week and a few things we hoped to do at the weekend.","zh":"我们聊了聊这周的事，以及周末想做的几件事。"},{"en":"The conversation felt relaxed because neither of us was trying to get to another activity immediately.","zh":"这次聊天很放松，因为我们俩都不急着马上赶去参加别的活动。"}]},{"source":"I remember putting my phone away for most of the visit. There was enough to look at outside, and I didn't feel that I needed something else to keep me interested. The drink was pleasant, but it wasn't the most memorable part.","heading":"放下手机看景","sentences":[{"en":"I remember putting my phone away for most of the visit.","zh":"我记得那次去的时候，大部分时间都把手机收了起来。"},{"en":"There was enough to look at outside, and I didn't feel that I needed something else to keep me interested.","zh":"外面有足够多的东西可看，我没觉得还需要别的东西来让我保持兴趣。"},{"en":"The drink was pleasant, but it wasn't the most memorable part.","zh":"饮品挺好喝，但并不是最难忘的部分。"}]},{"source":"I'd go back for the setting and the chance to spend quiet time with a friend. For me, a café near nature can turn an ordinary break into something more refreshing, as long as it is comfortable and doesn't feel rushed.","heading":"想再去的理由","sentences":[{"en":"I'd go back for the setting and the chance to spend quiet time with a friend.","zh":"我会为了那里的环境，还有和朋友安静相处的机会，再去一次。"},{"en":"For me, a café near nature can turn an ordinary break into something more refreshing, as long as it is comfortable and doesn't feel rushed.","zh":"对我来说，一家贴近自然的咖啡馆，只要坐着舒服、不觉得匆忙，就能让普通的休息变成更能放松身心的时光。","skeleton":"For me, a café near nature can turn an ordinary break into something more refreshing, as long as ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I could notice the light changing outside while sitting comfortably, which felt different from spending another evening inside a shopping centre.","method":"先记 could notice the light changing，再补舒服地坐着，最后用 which felt different from 接购物中心的对比。"}},"T069":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"One time I was stuck in traffic was on the way to the supermarket on a Saturday. I had left home at a busy hour and expected a quick journey, because the distance wasn't very long. I also had several other things planned for that afternoon.","heading":"周末购物遇堵车","sentences":[{"en":"One time I was stuck in traffic was on the way to the supermarket on a Saturday.","zh":"我有一次堵在路上，是星期六去超市的时候。"},{"en":"I had left home at a busy hour and expected a quick journey, because the distance wasn't very long.","zh":"我在繁忙时段离家，但觉得路程不远，所以原本以为很快就能到。"},{"en":"I also had several other things planned for that afternoon.","zh":"那天下午，我还安排了另外几件事。"}]},{"source":"After a few minutes, the cars began moving very slowly. I spent about half an hour on a journey that was usually much shorter. I couldn't see a clear reason for the delay, so I didn't know when the traffic would improve.","heading":"路上耽搁半小时","sentences":[{"en":"After a few minutes, the cars began moving very slowly.","zh":"过了几分钟，车就开始走得非常慢。"},{"en":"I spent about half an hour on a journey that was usually much shorter.","zh":"平时用不了多久的路程，那次我花了大约半个小时。"},{"en":"I couldn't see a clear reason for the delay, so I didn't know when the traffic would improve.","zh":"我看不出是什么原因导致了拥堵，所以也不知道交通什么时候才能好转。"}]},{"source":"I was driving, which meant I needed to keep paying attention to the road. I tried to stay patient, but I kept thinking about the time I was losing. I was especially annoyed because I had assumed that buying a few groceries would be a simple errand.","heading":"堵车耽误小差事","sentences":[{"en":"I was driving, which meant I needed to keep paying attention to the road.","zh":"我当时在开车，这意味着我得一直留意路况。"},{"en":"I tried to stay patient, but I kept thinking about the time I was losing.","zh":"我尽量保持耐心，但总想着白白耗掉的时间。"},{"en":"I was especially annoyed because I had assumed that buying a few groceries would be a simple errand.","zh":"我尤其烦，是因为原本以为买点日常食材，只是件简单的小事。"}]},{"source":"When I reached the supermarket, I decided to change my plan for the rest of the afternoon. I bought the things I needed most and left the less urgent tasks for another day. That helped me stop feeling that everything had to happen at once.","heading":"重新安排下午任务","sentences":[{"en":"When I reached the supermarket, I decided to change my plan for the rest of the afternoon.","zh":"到了超市后，我决定调整那天下午接下来的安排。"},{"en":"I bought the things I needed most and left the less urgent tasks for another day.","zh":"我买了最需要的东西，把没那么急的任务留到另一天。"},{"en":"That helped me stop feeling that everything had to happen at once.","zh":"这样一来，我就不再觉得所有事情都得一次做完。"}]},{"source":"The experience wasn't dangerous or dramatic, but it was frustrating. Since then, I've tried to go shopping at a quieter time and leave a little more room in my schedule. It reminded me that a short distance doesn't always mean a short journey.","heading":"调整购物的时间","sentences":[{"en":"The experience wasn't dangerous or dramatic, but it was frustrating.","zh":"这次经历没有危险，也没什么大波折，但很让人烦躁。"},{"en":"Since then, I've tried to go shopping at a quieter time and leave a little more room in my schedule.","zh":"从那以后，我就尽量挑人少车少的时候去购物，也在日程里多留一点余地。"},{"en":"It reminded me that a short distance doesn't always mean a short journey.","zh":"这让我明白，距离短，并不总意味着路上用的时间也短。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I was especially annoyed because I had assumed that buying a few groceries would be a simple errand.","method":"先说“尤其恼火”，再用because接“原以为买东西很简单”，用had assumed标出先前的预期。"}},"T070":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"Something I waited for was a package containing replacement headphones. My original pair had developed a fault, and the shop had agreed to send another pair after checking the problem. I used the headphones for listening practice and work, so I wanted them back quite quickly.","heading":"等待替换耳机包裹","sentences":[{"en":"Something I waited for was a package containing replacement headphones.","zh":"我曾等过一个包裹，里面是用来替换的耳机。"},{"en":"My original pair had developed a fault, and the shop had agreed to send another pair after checking the problem.","zh":"原来的耳机出了故障，店里检查过问题后，同意再给我寄一副。","skeleton":"My original pair had developed a fault, and the shop had agreed to send another pair after ..."},{"en":"I used the headphones for listening practice and work, so I wanted them back quite quickly.","zh":"我会用耳机做听力练习和工作，所以希望尽快重新用上。"}]},{"source":"I expected the package by the end of that week, but it took about ten days to arrive. During the wait, I used an older pair which wasn't as comfortable. That wasn't a serious problem, but it reminded me of the replacement whenever I needed to listen to something.","heading":"包裹比预期晚到","sentences":[{"en":"I expected the package by the end of that week, but it took about ten days to arrive.","zh":"我预计那个星期结束前就能收到包裹，但它大约过了十天才到。"},{"en":"During the wait, I used an older pair which wasn't as comfortable.","zh":"等的时候，我用了一副旧耳机，没有那么舒服。"},{"en":"That wasn't a serious problem, but it reminded me of the replacement whenever I needed to listen to something.","zh":"这不是什么严重的问题，但每次需要听点什么时，都会让我想起那副还在等的替换耳机。"}]},{"source":"At first, I checked the tracking information several times a day. However, seeing the same update didn't make the delivery any faster. I eventually contacted the shop once, asked for a clearer estimate and then tried to stop checking so often.","heading":"少查快递信息","sentences":[{"en":"At first, I checked the tracking information several times a day.","zh":"一开始，我每天会查好几次物流信息。"},{"en":"However, seeing the same update didn't make the delivery any faster.","zh":"不过，一直看到同样的更新，也不会让包裹送得更快。"},{"en":"I eventually contacted the shop once, asked for a clearer estimate and then tried to stop checking so often.","zh":"最后我联系了店家一次，问了一个更明确的预计时间，然后尽量不再查得那么频繁。"}]},{"source":"When the package arrived, I opened it and tested both sides of the headphones. I was pleased that they worked properly, and I could finally return to my usual listening routine. I also felt relieved that I didn't need another conversation about the fault.","heading":"耳机终于送到","sentences":[{"en":"When the package arrived, I opened it and tested both sides of the headphones.","zh":"包裹到的时候，我打开它，试了试耳机的两边。"},{"en":"I was pleased that they worked properly, and I could finally return to my usual listening routine.","zh":"我很高兴耳机能正常使用，终于可以恢复平时的听录音习惯了。"},{"en":"I also felt relieved that I didn't need another conversation about the fault.","zh":"我也松了口气，因为不用再为那个故障和店家沟通了。"}]},{"source":"What made the wait frustrating was not knowing exactly when it would end. The experience taught me that a useful update can matter almost as much as a quick delivery. It helped me manage my expectations and spend less time checking.","heading":"等待需要明确消息","sentences":[{"en":"What made the wait frustrating was not knowing exactly when it would end.","zh":"这次等待让人烦的，是不知道它到底什么时候会结束。"},{"en":"The experience taught me that a useful update can matter almost as much as a quick delivery.","zh":"这次经历让我明白，一个有用的进展消息，几乎和尽快送到一样重要。"},{"en":"It helped me manage my expectations and spend less time checking.","zh":"这帮助我调整了预期，也减少了反复查看的时间。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"My original pair had developed a fault, and the shop had agreed to send another pair after checking the problem.","method":"先记“旧耳机出故障”，再接“店里同意寄另一副”，最后用after checking补“检查问题后”的前提。"}},"T071":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A time I helped someone solve a problem was when a colleague had to check the same information repeatedly. It was taking up too much of his day. I asked which part was most difficult and suggested building a simple tool to handle the repeated steps.","heading":"工具减少重复工作","sentences":[{"en":"A time I helped someone solve a problem was when a colleague had to check the same information repeatedly.","zh":"有一次，我帮一位同事解决了一个问题，当时他不得不反复核对同样的信息。"},{"en":"It was taking up too much of his day.","zh":"这占用了他一天里太多的时间。"},{"en":"I asked which part was most difficult and suggested building a simple tool to handle the repeated steps.","zh":"我问他哪一部分最难，然后建议做一个简单的工具，处理那些重复的步骤。"}]},{"source":"At first, I thought we should create a complete system with lots of features. However, a colleague suggested starting with a simple version. I wasn't fully convinced because I worried it would look unfinished, but we discussed the idea and agreed to test it.","heading":"先试简版","sentences":[{"en":"At first, I thought we should create a complete system with lots of features.","zh":"一开始，我觉得我们应该做一个功能很多的完整系统。"},{"en":"However, a colleague suggested starting with a simple version.","zh":"不过，一位同事建议先从简单的版本做起。"},{"en":"I wasn't fully convinced because I worried it would look unfinished, but we discussed the idea and agreed to test it.","zh":"我还没有完全被说服，因为我担心它看起来像没做完，但我们讨论了这个想法，决定先试一试。","skeleton":"I wasn't fully convinced because I worried ..., but we discussed the idea and agreed to test it."}]},{"source":"We divided the work between us and focused on the most common problem. I worked on the main function, while another person tested it with a few examples. Our first attempt didn't work properly because we had misunderstood part of the information. We checked the issue together and corrected it.","heading":"分工纠错","sentences":[{"en":"We divided the work between us and focused on the most common problem.","zh":"我们分好了工，把重点放在最常见的问题上。"},{"en":"I worked on the main function, while another person tested it with a few examples.","zh":"我负责主要功能，另一个人则用几个例子进行测试。"},{"en":"Our first attempt didn't work properly because we had misunderstood part of the information.","zh":"第一次尝试没能正常运行，因为我们误解了部分信息。"},{"en":"We checked the issue together and corrected it.","zh":"我们一起检查了问题，并把它纠正了。"}]},{"source":"Eventually, the tool handled the basic task well. It wasn't perfect, but it saved us time and helped us understand what to improve next. Seeing it work was a satisfying moment for me.","heading":"原型成功运行","sentences":[{"en":"Eventually, the tool handled the basic task well.","zh":"最后，这个工具很好地完成了基本任务。"},{"en":"It wasn't perfect, but it saved us time and helped us understand what to improve next.","zh":"它并不完美，但帮我们省了时间，也让我们知道下一步该改进什么。"},{"en":"Seeing it work was a satisfying moment for me.","zh":"看到它运行起来的那一刻，我很有成就感。"}]},{"source":"I was pleased that I could help with a problem that affected his everyday work. The tool didn't remove the need for all checks, but it made the process easier. I also learned that asking careful questions is useful before deciding what kind of help someone needs.","heading":"先了解再帮忙","sentences":[{"en":"I was pleased that I could help with a problem that affected his everyday work.","zh":"能帮他解决一个影响日常工作的问题，我很高兴。"},{"en":"The tool didn't remove the need for all checks, but it made the process easier.","zh":"用了这个工具，还是有些检查不能省，但整个流程更简单了。"},{"en":"I also learned that asking careful questions is useful before deciding what kind of help someone needs.","zh":"我也学到，在决定一个人需要什么帮助之前，仔细问清楚情况很有用。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I wasn't fully convinced because I worried it would look unfinished, but we discussed the idea and agreed to test it.","method":"按没被完全说服、担心没做完、讨论后同意试三个环节记，用 because 解释担心，再用 but 转折。"}},"T072":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"One time I lost something was during a visit to a market in the older part of Dubai. I was there with a friend, looking around the small shops and taking a few photographs. The item I lost was my set of keys.","heading":"市场丢钥匙","sentences":[{"en":"One time I lost something was during a visit to a market in the older part of Dubai.","zh":"有一次我丢了东西，是在逛迪拜老城区一个市场的时候。"},{"en":"I was there with a friend, looking around the small shops and taking a few photographs.","zh":"当时我和一位朋友在那里看看小商店，拍了几张照片。"},{"en":"The item I lost was my set of keys.","zh":"我丢的是一串钥匙。"}]},{"source":"I noticed they were missing when we were about to leave. At first, I thought they must be in another pocket, so I checked my clothes and bag carefully. When I still couldn't find them, I began feeling worried because I needed them to get into my home.","heading":"找不到钥匙","sentences":[{"en":"I noticed they were missing when we were about to leave.","zh":"我们快要离开的时候，我才发现钥匙不见了。"},{"en":"At first, I thought they must be in another pocket, so I checked my clothes and bag carefully.","zh":"一开始，我觉得它们肯定在另一个口袋里，就仔细检查了衣服和包。"},{"en":"When I still couldn't find them, I began feeling worried because I needed them to get into my home.","zh":"还是找不到时，我开始担心，因为我得靠钥匙才能进家门。"}]},{"source":"My friend helped me think through where we had been. I remembered taking the keys out while looking for my wallet in one shop. We walked back along the same route and asked a member of staff whether anyone had found them.","heading":"沿原路寻找钥匙","sentences":[{"en":"My friend helped me think through where we had been.","zh":"我的朋友帮我仔细回想了我们去过哪些地方。"},{"en":"I remembered taking the keys out while looking for my wallet in one shop.","zh":"我记得，在一家店里找钱包时，我把钥匙拿出来过。"},{"en":"We walked back along the same route and asked a member of staff whether anyone had found them.","zh":"我们沿着原路走回去，问一位工作人员，有没有人捡到它们。"}]},{"source":"Fortunately, someone had noticed the keys on the counter and kept them safely. I described the key ring before the staff member returned them to me. I felt relieved and thanked him, because a small mistake could have caused a much more inconvenient evening.","heading":"钥匙失而复得","sentences":[{"en":"Fortunately, someone had noticed the keys on the counter and kept them safely.","zh":"幸好，有人发现钥匙在柜台上，并替我妥善收了起来。"},{"en":"I described the key ring before the staff member returned them to me.","zh":"我先描述了钥匙圈的样子，工作人员才把钥匙还给我。"},{"en":"I felt relieved and thanked him, because a small mistake could have caused a much more inconvenient evening.","zh":"我松了口气，也向他道谢，因为一个小失误，本来可能让那天晚上变得麻烦得多。"}]},{"source":"Afterwards, I put the keys in one specific pocket instead of moving them between my bag and clothes. I also tried to check them before leaving a place. The experience was stressful at the time, but it reminded me that a simple habit can help me avoid the same problem again.","heading":"固定位置放钥匙","sentences":[{"en":"Afterwards, I put the keys in one specific pocket instead of moving them between my bag and clothes.","zh":"之后，我把钥匙固定放在一个口袋里，不再把它在包和衣服口袋之间换来换去。"},{"en":"I also tried to check them before leaving a place.","zh":"离开一个地方前，我也尽量检查一下钥匙还在不在。"},{"en":"The experience was stressful at the time, but it reminded me that a simple habit can help me avoid the same problem again.","zh":"当时这次经历让我很紧张，但也提醒我，一个简单的习惯，就能帮我避免再次遇到同样的问题。","skeleton":"The experience was stressful ..., but it reminded me that a simple habit can help me avoid ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"The experience was stressful at the time, but it reminded me that a simple habit can help me avoid the same problem again.","method":"先说“当时很紧张”，用 but 接“提醒了我”，再用 that 引出“简单习惯能避免重犯”的道理。"}},"T073":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A change that helped save time was using a simple tool for a repeated task at work. Before that, my team checked the information manually each time. We still needed to look at the results, but we wanted to avoid repeating every basic step ourselves.","heading":"用工具省重复劳动","sentences":[{"en":"A change that helped save time was using a simple tool for a repeated task at work.","zh":"有一个改变帮我们省了时间，就是在工作中用一个简单工具，处理一项重复性的任务。"},{"en":"Before that, my team checked the information manually each time.","zh":"在那之前，我们团队每次都要手动检查信息。"},{"en":"We still needed to look at the results, but we wanted to avoid repeating every basic step ourselves.","zh":"我们依然需要查看结果，但想避免每个基本步骤都由自己反复去做。"}]},{"source":"At first, I thought we should create a complete system with lots of features. However, a colleague suggested starting with a simple version. I wasn't fully convinced because I worried it would look unfinished, but we discussed the idea and agreed to test it.","heading":"先试简版","sentences":[{"en":"At first, I thought we should create a complete system with lots of features.","zh":"一开始，我觉得我们应该做一个功能很多的完整系统。"},{"en":"However, a colleague suggested starting with a simple version.","zh":"不过，一位同事建议先从简单的版本做起。"},{"en":"I wasn't fully convinced because I worried it would look unfinished, but we discussed the idea and agreed to test it.","zh":"我还没有完全被说服，因为我担心它看起来像没做完，但我们讨论了这个想法，决定先试一试。","skeleton":"I wasn't fully convinced because I worried ..., but we discussed the idea and agreed to test it."}]},{"source":"We divided the work between us and focused on the most common problem. I worked on the main function, while another person tested it with a few examples. Our first attempt didn't work properly because we had misunderstood part of the information. We checked the issue together and corrected it.","heading":"分工纠错","sentences":[{"en":"We divided the work between us and focused on the most common problem.","zh":"我们分好了工，把重点放在最常见的问题上。"},{"en":"I worked on the main function, while another person tested it with a few examples.","zh":"我负责主要功能，另一个人则用几个例子进行测试。"},{"en":"Our first attempt didn't work properly because we had misunderstood part of the information.","zh":"第一次尝试没能正常运行，因为我们误解了部分信息。"},{"en":"We checked the issue together and corrected it.","zh":"我们一起检查了问题，并把它纠正了。"}]},{"source":"Eventually, the tool handled the basic task well. It wasn't perfect, but it saved us time and helped us understand what to improve next. Seeing it work was a satisfying moment for me.","heading":"原型成功运行","sentences":[{"en":"Eventually, the tool handled the basic task well.","zh":"最后，这个工具很好地完成了基本任务。"},{"en":"It wasn't perfect, but it saved us time and helped us understand what to improve next.","zh":"它并不完美，但帮我们省了时间，也让我们知道下一步该改进什么。"},{"en":"Seeing it work was a satisfying moment for me.","zh":"看到它运行起来的那一刻，我很有成就感。"}]},{"source":"I was happy with the decision because we learned something useful without spending weeks on an idea that might not work. The experience changed my opinion about planning. I still think planning matters, but now I prefer to try a small, practical solution before making a bigger commitment.","heading":"小步尝试","sentences":[{"en":"I was happy with the decision because we learned something useful without spending weeks on an idea that might not work.","zh":"我对这个决定很满意，因为我们学到了有用的东西，又没有花好几周去做一个可能行不通的想法。","skeleton":"I was happy with the decision because we learned something useful without spending weeks on an idea ..."},{"en":"The experience changed my opinion about planning.","zh":"这次经历改变了我对做计划的看法。"},{"en":"I still think planning matters, but now I prefer to try a small, practical solution before making a bigger commitment.","zh":"我还是觉得计划很重要，但现在我更愿意先尝试一个小而实用的解决办法，再投入更多。","skeleton":"I still think planning matters, but now I prefer to try a small, practical solution before making ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I was happy with the decision because we learned something useful without spending weeks on an idea that might not work.","method":"以对决定满意为开头，用 because 接学到东西，再用 without spending 补上没有白花好几周的好处。"}},"T074":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A reading experience that made me happy was finishing an illustrated version of The Tortoise and the Hare by myself in primary school. My father had told me the story before, but reading it without help felt different. I remember sitting beside him and explaining the ending in my own words. He listened patiently, and I felt that I was finally becoming a more independent reader.","heading":"独立读完龟兔赛跑","sentences":[{"en":"A reading experience that made me happy was finishing an illustrated version of The Tortoise and the Hare by myself in primary school.","zh":"有一次阅读让我很开心，是小学时，我独自读完了带插图的《龟兔赛跑》。","skeleton":"A reading experience ... was finishing ... by myself in primary school."},{"en":"My father had told me the story before, but reading it without help felt different.","zh":"爸爸以前给我讲过这个故事，但不靠别人帮忙，自己读出来，感觉很不一样。"},{"en":"I remember sitting beside him and explaining the ending in my own words.","zh":"我记得坐在他身边，用自己的话向他解释故事的结局。"},{"en":"He listened patiently, and I felt that I was finally becoming a more independent reader.","zh":"他耐心地听着，我觉得自己终于变成了一个能更独立阅读的人。"}]},{"source":"The story is about a race between two very different animals. The hare is fast and confident, while the tortoise moves slowly. Because the hare thinks winning will be easy, he stops for a nap. The tortoise keeps going and reaches the finish before him.","heading":"龟兔比赛经过","sentences":[{"en":"The story is about a race between two very different animals.","zh":"这个故事讲的是两只很不一样的动物之间的一场比赛。"},{"en":"The hare is fast and confident, while the tortoise moves slowly.","zh":"兔子跑得快，也很有信心，而乌龟走得慢。"},{"en":"Because the hare thinks winning will be easy, he stops for a nap.","zh":"兔子觉得赢得比赛很容易，就停下来睡了一觉。"},{"en":"The tortoise keeps going and reaches the finish before him.","zh":"乌龟一直往前走，比兔子先到达了终点。"}]},{"source":"As a child, I found the ending funny and surprising. At the beginning, I was certain that the hare would win, so I wanted to turn the pages quickly. I also liked the pictures because they helped me understand what was happening without needing an adult to explain every sentence.","heading":"童年读故事","sentences":[{"en":"As a child, I found the ending funny and surprising.","zh":"小时候，我觉得这个结局又好笑又出人意料。"},{"en":"At the beginning, I was certain that the hare would win, so I wanted to turn the pages quickly.","zh":"一开始，我很确定兔子会赢，所以很想赶紧往后翻。"},{"en":"I also liked the pictures because they helped me understand what was happening without needing an adult to explain every sentence.","zh":"我也喜欢里面的插图，因为不用大人逐句解释，它们就能帮我看懂发生了什么。","skeleton":"I also liked the pictures because they helped me understand ... without needing an adult to explain every sentence."}]},{"source":"The lesson has stayed with me: steady effort matters, and being good at something doesn't mean you can stop trying. I think of it when I'm learning a skill and comparing myself with people who improve faster. The story reminds me to focus on my own progress. It's simple, but that's probably why I still remember it after so many years.","heading":"坚持比天赋重要","sentences":[{"en":"The lesson has stayed with me: steady effort matters, and being good at something doesn't mean you can stop trying.","zh":"这个道理我一直记着：持续努力很重要，擅长一件事也不意味着你就可以不再努力。","skeleton":"The lesson has stayed with me: ... being good at something doesn't mean you can stop trying."},{"en":"I think of it when I'm learning a skill and comparing myself with people who improve faster.","zh":"每当我学习一项技能，又拿自己和进步更快的人比较时，我就会想到这个故事。"},{"en":"The story reminds me to focus on my own progress.","zh":"这个故事提醒我要关注自己的进步。"},{"en":"It's simple, but that's probably why I still remember it after so many years.","zh":"它很简单，但也许正因为如此，这么多年以后我仍然记得它。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"A reading experience that made me happy was finishing an illustrated version of The Tortoise and the Hare by myself in primary school.","method":"先搭“A reading experience was finishing”主干，再依次补“让我开心—带插图的龟兔赛跑—独自读完—小学时”。"}},"T075":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to talk about Adam, a colleague who works for a successful software company. I've known him for about two years. The company has developed a practical product that helps its customers handle repeated tasks, and Adam works on making the product easier to use.","heading":"成功公司的同事","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to talk about Adam, a colleague who works for a successful software company.","zh":"我想聊聊 Adam，他是我的一位同事，在一家成功的软件公司工作。"},{"en":"I've known him for about two years.","zh":"我认识他大约两年了。"},{"en":"The company has developed a practical product that helps its customers handle repeated tasks, and Adam works on making the product easier to use.","zh":"公司开发了一款实用的产品，帮客户处理重复性的任务，而 Adam 的工作是让这款产品更容易使用。","skeleton":"The company has developed a practical product ..., and Adam works on making the product easier to use."}]},{"source":"I think the company has done well because it understands what its customers actually need. It doesn't try to add every possible feature at once. Adam follows the same approach in his own work: he sets a clear goal and keeps the solution simple.","heading":"理解顾客的需要","sentences":[{"en":"I think the company has done well because it understands what its customers actually need.","zh":"我觉得这家公司做得不错，是因为它明白顾客真正需要什么。"},{"en":"It doesn't try to add every possible feature at once.","zh":"它不会试图一次加上所有可能的功能。"},{"en":"Adam follows the same approach in his own work: he sets a clear goal and keeps the solution simple.","zh":"Adam 在自己的工作里也采用同样的做法：定一个明确的目标，让解决方案保持简单。"}]},{"source":"A few months ago, I had to explain a new idea to our team. I knew the details, but I couldn't present them clearly. Adam suggested using one simple example instead of showing everything at once. He also helped me practise and pointed out the parts that were difficult to follow.","heading":"练习表达","sentences":[{"en":"A few months ago, I had to explain a new idea to our team.","zh":"几个月前，我需要向团队解释一个新想法。"},{"en":"I knew the details, but I couldn't present them clearly.","zh":"我了解其中的细节，却没办法把它们讲清楚。"},{"en":"Adam suggested using one simple example instead of showing everything at once.","zh":"Adam 建议用一个简单的例子来说明，而不是一下子把所有内容都展示出来。"},{"en":"He also helped me practise and pointed out the parts that were difficult to follow.","zh":"他还帮我练习，指出了哪些地方让人听不明白。"}]},{"source":"The presentation went much better than I expected. People understood the idea, and I felt more confident afterwards. What I appreciate most is that he helped me learn a useful skill rather than just doing the work for me.","heading":"学会表达","sentences":[{"en":"The presentation went much better than I expected.","zh":"那次演示比我预想的顺利得多。"},{"en":"People understood the idea, and I felt more confident afterwards.","zh":"大家理解了这个想法，之后我也更有信心了。"},{"en":"What I appreciate most is that he helped me learn a useful skill rather than just doing the work for me.","zh":"我最感谢的是，他帮我学会了一项实用的技能，而不是直接替我把工作做完。","skeleton":"What I appreciate most is that he helped me learn a useful skill ..."}]},{"source":"Talking to Adam has helped me understand that a successful company needs useful products and people who communicate clearly. I admire his contribution because he pays attention to the person using the product. That is a quality I'd like to develop in my own work.","heading":"工作的启发","sentences":[{"en":"Talking to Adam has helped me understand that a successful company needs useful products and people who communicate clearly.","zh":"和 Adam 聊天让我明白，一家成功的公司需要实用的产品，也需要能把话说清楚的人。","skeleton":"Talking to Adam has helped me understand that a successful company needs useful products and people ..."},{"en":"I admire his contribution because he pays attention to the person using the product.","zh":"我佩服他的贡献，因为他会关注真正使用产品的人。"},{"en":"That is a quality I'd like to develop in my own work.","zh":"这也是我想在自己的工作中培养的一种品质。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"The company has developed a practical product that helps its customers handle repeated tasks, and Adam works on making the product easier to use.","method":"先记 company has developed a product，再用 that helps 补产品用途，最后用 and Adam works on 接他负责的改进。"}},"T076":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A famous person from my home region I'd like to describe is Lei Jun, the co-founder of Xiaomi. We come from the same part of China, and we both studied at Wuhan University. That gives me a personal reason to pay attention to him, beyond simply recognising his name.","heading":"家乡的名人雷军","sentences":[{"en":"A famous person from my home region I'd like to describe is Lei Jun, the co-founder of Xiaomi.","zh":"我想介绍的一位家乡名人，是小米的联合创始人雷军。"},{"en":"We come from the same part of China, and we both studied at Wuhan University.","zh":"我们来自中国的同一个地区，也都在武汉大学读过书。"},{"en":"That gives me a personal reason to pay attention to him, beyond simply recognising his name.","zh":"所以，我关注他有一个与自己有关的原因，并不只是因为听过他的名字。"}]},{"source":"He's well known for building a technology company whose products reach people far beyond our home region. Although I now live in Dubai, I still feel connected to where I come from. Hearing about someone from the same area doing something significant makes his story feel closer to my own life.","heading":"同乡名人的亲近感","sentences":[{"en":"He's well known for building a technology company whose products reach people far beyond our home region.","zh":"他因为创办一家科技公司而出名，这家公司的产品面向的人群，远远超出了我们家乡的范围。"},{"en":"Although I now live in Dubai, I still feel connected to where I come from.","zh":"虽然我现在住在迪拜，但还是觉得自己和家乡有联系。"},{"en":"Hearing about someone from the same area doing something significant makes his story feel closer to my own life.","zh":"听到同一个地方出来的人做成了重要的事，会让我觉得他的故事和自己的生活更贴近。","skeleton":"Hearing about someone ... doing something significant makes his story feel closer to ..."}]},{"source":"The university connection matters to me as well. We both studied at Wuhan University, although at different times. I enjoy learning about what he did as a student and how those experiences influenced his later career. It makes me think about how much a person can develop after leaving university.","heading":"共同的大学背景","sentences":[{"en":"The university connection matters to me as well.","zh":"同为校友的这层联系，对我也很重要。"},{"en":"We both studied at Wuhan University, although at different times.","zh":"我们都在武汉大学读过书，只是时间不同。"},{"en":"I enjoy learning about what he did as a student and how those experiences influenced his later career.","zh":"我喜欢了解他学生时代做过什么，以及那些经历怎样影响了他后来的职业发展。"},{"en":"It makes me think about how much a person can develop after leaving university.","zh":"这让我思考，一个人离开大学后，还能有多大的成长空间。"}]},{"source":"I admire him because he turned his interest in technology into a successful business and built considerable wealth. I don't know him personally, but I'd be interested in meeting him. I'd ask how he made his first significant amount of money and which business decision contributed most to his financial success. Because we share a home region and university background, I'd feel comfortable asking him those questions.","heading":"想向雷军请教","sentences":[{"en":"I admire him because he turned his interest in technology into a successful business and built considerable wealth.","zh":"我钦佩他，因为他把对科技的兴趣做成了成功的生意，也积累了可观的财富。","skeleton":"I admire him because he turned his interest ... into a successful business and built considerable wealth."},{"en":"I don't know him personally, but I'd be interested in meeting him.","zh":"我并不认识他本人，但很想有机会见见他。"},{"en":"I'd ask how he made his first significant amount of money and which business decision contributed most to his financial success.","zh":"我会问，他是怎样赚到第一笔数额可观的钱的，还有哪一个商业决策对他的财务成功贡献最大。","skeleton":"I'd ask how he made his first significant amount of money and which business decision contributed most ..."},{"en":"Because we share a home region and university background, I'd feel comfortable asking him those questions.","zh":"因为我们有共同的家乡和大学背景，我会觉得问他这些问题挺自在的。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I'd ask how he made his first significant amount of money and which business decision contributed most to his financial success.","method":"用 I'd ask 开头，按“如何赚到第一笔大钱—哪个决策贡献最大”记两个问题，分别由 how 和 which 引出。"}},"T077":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A piece of technology I'd like to buy is a better pair of headphones. I already use a basic pair, but I would like something more comfortable that could reduce distracting background noise. It isn't a phone, and it would serve a clear purpose in my routine.","heading":"想买更舒适的耳机","sentences":[{"en":"A piece of technology I'd like to buy is a better pair of headphones.","zh":"我想买的一件科技产品，是一副更好的耳机。"},{"en":"I already use a basic pair, but I would like something more comfortable that could reduce distracting background noise.","zh":"我现在已经有一副基础款，但想要更舒服、能减少周围干扰噪音的耳机。","skeleton":"I already use ..., but I would like something more comfortable that could reduce ..."},{"en":"It isn't a phone, and it would serve a clear purpose in my routine.","zh":"它不是手机，而且在我的日常生活里有很明确的用途。"}]},{"source":"I often need to concentrate on work or listen to English recordings. When the surroundings are noisy, I find myself repeating the same section because I've missed something. A better pair could make those activities easier, especially in a shared space.","heading":"噪声影响听力","sentences":[{"en":"I often need to concentrate on work or listen to English recordings.","zh":"我经常需要专注工作，或者听英语录音。"},{"en":"When the surroundings are noisy, I find myself repeating the same section because I've missed something.","zh":"周围很吵的时候，我常会反复听同一段，因为漏听了一些内容。"},{"en":"A better pair could make those activities easier, especially in a shared space.","zh":"更好的一副耳机可以让这些事更容易，尤其是在共用的空间里。"}]},{"source":"Before buying anything, I would compare a few models and read about their comfort and everyday use. I'd prefer to try them in a shop if possible. The most expensive option wouldn't necessarily be the best one for me.","heading":"购买前比较试用","sentences":[{"en":"Before buying anything, I would compare a few models and read about their comfort and everyday use.","zh":"买之前，我会比较几个型号，看看它们的舒适度和日常使用体验。"},{"en":"I'd prefer to try them in a shop if possible.","zh":"如果可以，我更想先去店里试一试。"},{"en":"The most expensive option wouldn't necessarily be the best one for me.","zh":"最贵的那款，不一定就是最适合我的。"}]},{"source":"I plan to save a little money each month instead of buying them immediately. I would also check what help is available if they stop working. My experience with electronic products has taught me that service matters as well as the product itself.","heading":"攒钱也考虑售后","sentences":[{"en":"I plan to save a little money each month instead of buying them immediately.","zh":"我打算每个月存一点钱，而不是马上买。"},{"en":"I would also check what help is available if they stop working.","zh":"我也会查清楚，如果耳机坏了，能得到什么帮助。"},{"en":"My experience with electronic products has taught me that service matters as well as the product itself.","zh":"我用电子产品的经历让我明白，除了产品本身，服务也很重要。"}]},{"source":"I want them because I expect to use them often, not just because they are new. If they help me work and study with fewer interruptions, I would consider the purchase worthwhile. Until then, I can continue using what I already have.","heading":"为实际使用而购买","sentences":[{"en":"I want them because I expect to use them often, not just because they are new.","zh":"我想买它，是因为预计会经常用，而不只是因为它是新的。"},{"en":"If they help me work and study with fewer interruptions, I would consider the purchase worthwhile.","zh":"如果它能让我工作和学习时少被打断，我就会觉得这笔钱花得值得。"},{"en":"Until then, I can continue using what I already have.","zh":"在那之前，我可以继续用已经有的耳机。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I already use a basic pair, but I would like something more comfortable that could reduce distracting background noise.","method":"用“已经有基础款”和“想要更舒服的”作对照，再用that could补充“减少干扰噪音”的功能。"}},"T078":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A useful app I use at work is a small internal program that our team developed. It brings requests into one shared list, so we can see what needs attention without searching through several different conversations. I helped work on an early version of it.","heading":"集中需求的小程序","sentences":[{"en":"A useful app I use at work is a small internal program that our team developed.","zh":"我在工作中用的一个实用应用，是我们团队开发的一个内部小程序。"},{"en":"It brings requests into one shared list, so we can see what needs attention without searching through several different conversations.","zh":"它把各种请求集中到一个共享列表里，这样我们不用翻找好几个不同的对话，就能看到哪些事情需要处理。","skeleton":"It brings requests into ..., so we can see what needs attention without searching through ..."},{"en":"I helped work on an early version of it.","zh":"我参与过它早期版本的开发。"}]},{"source":"Before we had the program, requests were spread across messages and emails. It was easy to miss an update or forget who was handling something. Even a simple question could involve looking through old conversations before finding the information we needed.","heading":"过去信息分散难找","sentences":[{"en":"Before we had the program, requests were spread across messages and emails.","zh":"有这个程序之前，各种请求散落在消息和邮件里。"},{"en":"It was easy to miss an update or forget who was handling something.","zh":"很容易漏掉更新，或者忘记谁正在处理某件事。"},{"en":"Even a simple question could involve looking through old conversations before finding the information we needed.","zh":"就算只是一个简单的问题，也可能要先翻找旧聊天记录，才能找到所需的信息。","skeleton":"Even a simple question could involve looking through ... before finding the information we needed."}]},{"source":"We started with a basic version instead of trying to build a complete system. The main features were a list of requests, the person responsible for each one and its current status. We tested it with a few examples and corrected the parts that were unclear.","heading":"先做基础版本","sentences":[{"en":"We started with a basic version instead of trying to build a complete system.","zh":"我们先做了一个基础版本，没有一开始就试着搭建完整的系统。"},{"en":"The main features were a list of requests, the person responsible for each one and its current status.","zh":"主要功能包括一份请求清单、每项请求的负责人，以及它当前的状态。"},{"en":"We tested it with a few examples and corrected the parts that were unclear.","zh":"我们用几个例子测试了一下，把不清楚的部分改了改。"}]},{"source":"I now use it to check my tasks and update their progress. During team discussions, we can look at the same information rather than explain everything again from memory. It doesn't do the work for us, but it helps us keep track of it.","heading":"跟进工作任务","sentences":[{"en":"I now use it to check my tasks and update their progress.","zh":"现在我用它查看自己的任务，并更新进度。"},{"en":"During team discussions, we can look at the same information rather than explain everything again from memory.","zh":"团队讨论时，我们可以一起查看同一份信息，而不用再凭记忆把所有事情解释一遍。"},{"en":"It doesn't do the work for us, but it helps us keep track of it.","zh":"它不会替我们把工作做完，但能帮我们跟进工作。"}]},{"source":"What I like most is that it solves a problem I actually have. The interface is simple, and I don't need a long explanation each time I open it. For me, useful software makes an ordinary task easier to manage, rather than adding features I rarely need.","heading":"好软件解决真问题","sentences":[{"en":"What I like most is that it solves a problem I actually have.","zh":"我最喜欢的一点是，它解决了我实际遇到的问题。"},{"en":"The interface is simple, and I don't need a long explanation each time I open it.","zh":"界面很简单，我每次打开它时，都不需要听一大段说明。"},{"en":"For me, useful software makes an ordinary task easier to manage, rather than adding features I rarely need.","zh":"对我来说，实用的软件应该让普通任务更好处理，而不是增加那些我很少用到的功能。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"It brings requests into one shared list, so we can see what needs attention without searching through several different conversations.","method":"按“请求集中到一张表—所以看出待处理事项—不用翻多个聊天”的功能与结果顺序记。"}},"T079":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"Something I find difficult to do without is my pair of headphones. They aren't a phone or a computer, but I use them almost every day. They help me concentrate in places with background noise and listen to English recordings without disturbing other people.","heading":"离不开的耳机","sentences":[{"en":"Something I find difficult to do without is my pair of headphones.","zh":"有一样东西我觉得挺离不开的，就是我的那副耳机。"},{"en":"They aren't a phone or a computer, but I use them almost every day.","zh":"它不是手机，也不是电脑，但我几乎每天都会用。"},{"en":"They help me concentrate in places with background noise and listen to English recordings without disturbing other people.","zh":"它能让我在有背景噪声的地方集中注意力，也能让我听英语录音时不打扰别人。","skeleton":"They help me concentrate ... and listen to English recordings without disturbing other people."}]},{"source":"I chose a comfortable pair because I knew I would wear them for a while. Before buying them, I compared a few options and saved a little money each month. I wanted something useful, rather than simply buying the most fashionable brand.","heading":"选耳机重舒适实用","sentences":[{"en":"I chose a comfortable pair because I knew I would wear them for a while.","zh":"我选了一副舒服的耳机，因为知道自己会戴挺长时间。"},{"en":"Before buying them, I compared a few options and saved a little money each month.","zh":"买之前，我比较了几个选择，也每个月存了一点钱。"},{"en":"I wanted something useful, rather than simply buying the most fashionable brand.","zh":"我想买实用的东西，而不是一味地买最时髦的牌子。"}]},{"source":"When I finally bought them, I was pleased because I had made a deliberate choice rather than buying something on impulse. I started using them regularly for work and language practice.","heading":"理性购买耳机","sentences":[{"en":"When I finally bought them, I was pleased because I had made a deliberate choice rather than buying something on impulse.","zh":"终于买下这副耳机时，我挺开心的，因为这是我认真考虑后的选择，而不是一时冲动买下的东西。","skeleton":"When I finally bought them, I was pleased because I had made a deliberate choice rather than ..."},{"en":"I started using them regularly for work and language practice.","zh":"之后，我经常用它来工作和练习语言。"}]},{"source":"A few weeks later, one side stopped working properly. I took them back to the shop, expecting a long argument. Instead, the assistant listened carefully, checked the problem and explained the next steps. After confirming the fault, the shop arranged a replacement.","heading":"故障换新","sentences":[{"en":"A few weeks later, one side stopped working properly.","zh":"几周后，其中一边开始不能正常工作了。"},{"en":"I took them back to the shop, expecting a long argument.","zh":"我把耳机拿回店里，本以为要争论很久。"},{"en":"Instead, the assistant listened carefully, checked the problem and explained the next steps.","zh":"结果店员认真听了我的情况，检查了问题，还解释了接下来怎么处理。"},{"en":"After confirming the fault, the shop arranged a replacement.","zh":"确认故障后，店里安排给我换了一副。"}]},{"source":"When I couldn't use them, I realised how much they were part of my routine. I could still work and study, but I found it harder to focus and practise listening in a shared space. That's why I think of them as a small but important everyday item.","heading":"耳机融入日常","sentences":[{"en":"When I couldn't use them, I realised how much they were part of my routine.","zh":"没法用它的时候，我才意识到，它已经是我日常生活里很重要的一部分。"},{"en":"I could still work and study, but I found it harder to focus and practise listening in a shared space.","zh":"我仍然能工作和学习，但在与别人共用的空间里，我更难集中注意力，也更难练习听力。"},{"en":"That's why I think of them as a small but important everyday item.","zh":"所以，我觉得它是一件虽小却很重要的日常用品。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"They help me concentrate in places with background noise and listen to English recordings without disturbing other people.","method":"先记 They help me 后接 concentrate 和 listen 两个动作，再分别补“有背景噪声的地方”和“不打扰别人”。"}},"T080":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"The place where I like to relax at home is a small corner of my living room. I have a comfortable chair there, with a lamp and a little space beside it for a drink or a book. It isn't a large or impressive area.","heading":"客厅里的放松角落","sentences":[{"en":"The place where I like to relax at home is a small corner of my living room.","zh":"我在家喜欢放松的地方，是客厅里的一个小角落。"},{"en":"I have a comfortable chair there, with a lamp and a little space beside it for a drink or a book.","zh":"那里有一把舒服的椅子、一盏灯，椅子旁边还有一点空间，可以放饮料或书。"},{"en":"It isn't a large or impressive area.","zh":"那一块地方不大，也没什么特别显眼的。"}]},{"source":"I usually sit there after work, once I've finished the things I need to do around the apartment. Sometimes I read a few pages, and sometimes I just sit quietly for a while. I like having an activity that doesn't involve another screen.","heading":"下班后的休息角落","sentences":[{"en":"I usually sit there after work, once I've finished the things I need to do around the apartment.","zh":"下班后，等公寓里该做的事情都做完，我通常就坐在那里。"},{"en":"Sometimes I read a few pages, and sometimes I just sit quietly for a while.","zh":"有时读几页书，有时只是安静地坐一会儿。"},{"en":"I like having an activity that doesn't involve another screen.","zh":"我喜欢有一种不用再盯着屏幕的活动。"}]},{"source":"I try to keep my work laptop away from that corner. Otherwise, a short break can turn into checking messages and thinking about unfinished tasks. On some evenings, I also leave my phone in another room so that I can properly rest.","heading":"休息时远离屏幕","sentences":[{"en":"I try to keep my work laptop away from that corner.","zh":"我尽量不把工作用的笔记本电脑放在那个角落。"},{"en":"Otherwise, a short break can turn into checking messages and thinking about unfinished tasks.","zh":"不然，原本短短的休息就会变成查看消息、想着还没做完的任务。"},{"en":"On some evenings, I also leave my phone in another room so that I can properly rest.","zh":"有些晚上，我也会把手机留在另一个房间，这样才能好好休息。"}]},{"source":"One weekend, I spent part of an afternoon there reading a novel. I wasn't following a schedule or trying to finish a certain number of pages. I simply enjoyed being comfortable and having enough time to stay with the story.","heading":"自在读小说","sentences":[{"en":"One weekend, I spent part of an afternoon there reading a novel.","zh":"有一个周末，我在那儿读了会儿小说，度过了下午的一段时光。"},{"en":"I wasn't following a schedule or trying to finish a certain number of pages.","zh":"我没有按时间表来，也没打算读完固定的页数。"},{"en":"I simply enjoyed being comfortable and having enough time to stay with the story.","zh":"我只是享受那种舒适的感觉，也享受有足够时间慢慢读这个故事。"}]},{"source":"What I enjoy most is the feeling of having no urgent task. The space suits the way I relax, even though it is quite simple. Twenty quiet minutes there can make the rest of my evening feel calmer and more separate from work.","heading":"安静片刻远离工作","sentences":[{"en":"What I enjoy most is the feeling of having no urgent task.","zh":"我最享受的，是没有急事要做的感觉。"},{"en":"The space suits the way I relax, even though it is quite simple.","zh":"虽然这个空间很简单，但很适合我放松的方式。"},{"en":"Twenty quiet minutes there can make the rest of my evening feel calmer and more separate from work.","zh":"在那里安静地待二十分钟，就能让我接下来的晚上更平静，也更能从工作里抽离出来。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"Twenty quiet minutes there can make the rest of my evening feel calmer and more separate from work.","method":"以Twenty quiet minutes there作主语，接can make，再记“余下夜晚更平静”和“与工作拉开距离”两个效果。"}},"T081":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A place I visit regularly but don't particularly like is the supermarket near my flat in Dubai. I go there about once a week to buy groceries. It's convenient, which is why I keep using it, but the experience is usually quite tiring.","heading":"常去却不喜欢超市","sentences":[{"en":"A place I visit regularly but don't particularly like is the supermarket near my flat in Dubai.","zh":"有一个地方我经常去，却不是特别喜欢，就是迪拜我住的公寓附近的超市。"},{"en":"I go there about once a week to buy groceries.","zh":"我大约每周去一次，买些日常食材和用品。"},{"en":"It's convenient, which is why I keep using it, but the experience is usually quite tiring.","zh":"它很方便，所以我一直去那里，不过购物过程通常挺累的。"}]},{"source":"I normally go after work, when quite a few other people have the same idea. The aisles can feel crowded, and there is often a queue at the checkout. I only need a few basic things, but finding them sometimes takes longer than I expect.","heading":"下班买东西","sentences":[{"en":"I normally go after work, when quite a few other people have the same idea.","zh":"我通常下班后去，那时也有不少人和我想的一样。"},{"en":"The aisles can feel crowded, and there is often a queue at the checkout.","zh":"货架间的过道有时很挤，结账处也经常排队。"},{"en":"I only need a few basic things, but finding them sometimes takes longer than I expect.","zh":"我只需要买几样基本的东西，但有时找它们花的时间比我预想的更久。"}]},{"source":"The layout is another reason I don't enjoy it. Items occasionally move to a different shelf, so I walk around looking for something I bought easily the previous week. There is also background music and a lot of activity, which makes it hard to relax after a busy day.","heading":"货架变动让人疲惫","sentences":[{"en":"The layout is another reason I don't enjoy it.","zh":"超市的布局，也是我不喜欢它的另一个原因。"},{"en":"Items occasionally move to a different shelf, so I walk around looking for something I bought easily the previous week.","zh":"商品偶尔会被挪到另一个货架，所以我会四处走动，寻找那些上周还能轻松买到的东西。","skeleton":"Items ... move to a different shelf, so I walk around looking for something ..."},{"en":"There is also background music and a lot of activity, which makes it hard to relax after a busy day.","zh":"那里还有背景音乐，来来往往的动静也很多，这让我在忙了一天之后很难放松。"}]},{"source":"I remember one evening when I went in just to buy vegetables, bread and milk. I spent more time waiting to pay than choosing the food. By the time I got home, I felt that a small everyday task had taken up most of my evening.","heading":"排队耗掉大半晚上","sentences":[{"en":"I remember one evening when I went in just to buy vegetables, bread and milk.","zh":"我记得有天晚上，进去只是想买蔬菜、面包和牛奶。"},{"en":"I spent more time waiting to pay than choosing the food.","zh":"等着付款花的时间，比挑食物还长。"},{"en":"By the time I got home, I felt that a small everyday task had taken up most of my evening.","zh":"等到家时，我觉得一件日常小事，已经占去了我大半个晚上。"}]},{"source":"I still shop there because it is nearby and the prices are reasonable. However, I try to go at quieter times and make a list before I leave. I don't dislike shopping in general; I just prefer an experience where I can find what I need and get home without too much waiting.","heading":"调整购物时间","sentences":[{"en":"I still shop there because it is nearby and the prices are reasonable.","zh":"我还是在那里购物，因为离得近，价格也合理。"},{"en":"However, I try to go at quieter times and make a list before I leave.","zh":"不过，我会尽量在没那么忙的时候去，出门前也会列个清单。"},{"en":"I don't dislike shopping in general; I just prefer an experience where I can find what I need and get home without too much waiting.","zh":"总的来说，我不是不喜欢购物，只是更喜欢能找到需要的东西、不用等太久就能回家的体验。","skeleton":"I don't dislike shopping in general; I just prefer an experience where I can find what I need and get home ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I don't dislike shopping in general; I just prefer an experience where I can find what I need and get home without too much waiting.","method":"先用 I don't dislike shopping in general 说明总体态度，再用 I just prefer 转到偏好，最后用 where 接找到东西与回家。"}},"T082":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"One time I paid close attention to the sky was during an evening visit to Sunset Beach in Dubai. I was there with a friend a few months ago, after a week when we had both spent too much time indoors.","heading":"日落海滩观天空","sentences":[{"en":"One time I paid close attention to the sky was during an evening visit to Sunset Beach in Dubai.","zh":"有一次我认真看了看天空，是在傍晚去迪拜日落海滩的时候。"},{"en":"I was there with a friend a few months ago, after a week when we had both spent too much time indoors.","zh":"那是几个月前，我和朋友一起去的；此前一周，我们俩在室内待的时间都太多了。"}]},{"source":"We walked along the sand and found somewhere to sit away from the busier area. At first, we were talking about work, but then we noticed the light beginning to change. We stopped our conversation for a while and looked towards the horizon.","heading":"停下来看天空","sentences":[{"en":"We walked along the sand and found somewhere to sit away from the busier area.","zh":"我们沿着沙滩走，在远离热闹区域的地方找了个位置坐下。"},{"en":"At first, we were talking about work, but then we noticed the light beginning to change.","zh":"一开始，我们在聊工作，但后来注意到光线开始变化。"},{"en":"We stopped our conversation for a while and looked towards the horizon.","zh":"我们暂停了聊天，朝地平线看了一会儿。"}]},{"source":"The sky had been quite bright when we arrived. Later, there was orange near the horizon and a little pink above it. The colours were softer than before, and the water reflected some of the light. I liked noticing that change gradually rather than looking up only for a moment.","heading":"慢慢观察天色","sentences":[{"en":"The sky had been quite bright when we arrived.","zh":"我们到的时候，天空还挺明亮的。"},{"en":"Later, there was orange near the horizon and a little pink above it.","zh":"后来，地平线附近出现了橙色，上方还有一点粉色。"},{"en":"The colours were softer than before, and the water reflected some of the light.","zh":"颜色比之前柔和了一些，水面也映出了一部分光。"},{"en":"I liked noticing that change gradually rather than looking up only for a moment.","zh":"我喜欢慢慢留意这种变化，而不是只抬头看一眼。"}]},{"source":"I took a photograph, but it didn't quite capture what I could see. So I put my phone away and watched for a few more minutes. My friend did the same, and neither of us felt that we needed to speak constantly.","heading":"放下手机静静看","sentences":[{"en":"I took a photograph, but it didn't quite capture what I could see.","zh":"我拍了一张照片，但照片没能完全拍出眼前看到的景象。"},{"en":"So I put my phone away and watched for a few more minutes.","zh":"所以我把手机收了起来，又看了几分钟。"},{"en":"My friend did the same, and neither of us felt that we needed to speak constantly.","zh":"朋友也这么做了，我们俩都觉得不需要一直说话。"}]},{"source":"I remember the experience because it was simple and relaxing. It made me realise how often I ignore my surroundings when I'm busy. I'd like to make more time for moments like that, even when I only have a short break.","heading":"留出时间感受周围","sentences":[{"en":"I remember the experience because it was simple and relaxing.","zh":"我记得这次经历，是因为它简单又放松。"},{"en":"It made me realise how often I ignore my surroundings when I'm busy.","zh":"它让我意识到，自己忙起来时，经常会忽略周围的环境。"},{"en":"I'd like to make more time for moments like that, even when I only have a short break.","zh":"我想多留点时间给这样的时刻，即使只是短暂休息一下也好。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I was there with a friend a few months ago, after a week when we had both spent too much time indoors.","method":"先记“几个月前和朋友在那里”，再用after a week when补“此前一周都久待室内”的背景。"}},"T083":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A moment when I felt extremely happy was near the end of a birthday dinner I organised for my friend Ben. It happened a few months ago at a small restaurant in Dubai. When he saw the cake and heard everyone singing, he looked completely surprised.","heading":"生日惊喜带来快乐","sentences":[{"en":"A moment when I felt extremely happy was near the end of a birthday dinner I organised for my friend Ben.","zh":"有一个瞬间我特别开心，是在我为朋友本组织的生日晚餐快结束的时候。"},{"en":"It happened a few months ago at a small restaurant in Dubai.","zh":"那是几个月前，在迪拜一家小餐馆。"},{"en":"When he saw the cake and heard everyone singing, he looked completely surprised.","zh":"他看到蛋糕、听到大家唱歌时，一脸完全没想到的表情。"}]},{"source":"I checked when everyone was available and chose a place that was easy for us to reach. Another friend arranged the cake, while I made the reservation and confirmed the time. We also asked him what food he liked so that he would enjoy the meal.","heading":"晚餐分工","sentences":[{"en":"I checked when everyone was available and chose a place that was easy for us to reach.","zh":"我确认了大家什么时候有空，选了一个我们都方便去的地方。"},{"en":"Another friend arranged the cake, while I made the reservation and confirmed the time.","zh":"另一位朋友负责蛋糕，我则负责订位和确认时间。"},{"en":"We also asked him what food he liked so that he would enjoy the meal.","zh":"我们也问了他喜欢吃什么，好让他能吃得开心。"}]},{"source":"On the evening itself, we arrived a little early and made sure everything was ready. The atmosphere was relaxed. We talked about work, shared some funny stories and took a few photos together.","heading":"轻松的生日聚会","sentences":[{"en":"On the evening itself, we arrived a little early and made sure everything was ready.","zh":"到了聚会那天晚上，我们稍微提前到场，确认一切都准备好了。"},{"en":"The atmosphere was relaxed.","zh":"气氛很轻松。"},{"en":"We talked about work, shared some funny stories and took a few photos together.","zh":"我们聊了工作，分享了几个有趣的故事，还一起拍了几张照片。"}]},{"source":"The most memorable moment was when the cake came out. It was quite simple, but it had a small decoration connected to one of his hobbies. He hadn't expected it, and his reaction made the effort feel worthwhile.","heading":"蛋糕惊喜","sentences":[{"en":"The most memorable moment was when the cake came out.","zh":"最难忘的时刻，是蛋糕端上来的时候。"},{"en":"It was quite simple, but it had a small decoration connected to one of his hobbies.","zh":"蛋糕挺简单，但上面有一个与他的某项爱好有关的小装饰。"},{"en":"He hadn't expected it, and his reaction made the effort feel worthwhile.","zh":"他没想到会有这个安排，他的反应让我们觉得这番心思花得很值。"}]},{"source":"I was pleased that the plan worked and that everyone had a good time. It reminded me that a successful celebration doesn't depend on spending a lot of money. Paying attention to the person and making time for each other can be much more important.","heading":"用心胜过花费","sentences":[{"en":"I was pleased that the plan worked and that everyone had a good time.","zh":"计划顺利实现，大家也都玩得很开心，这让我很高兴。"},{"en":"It reminded me that a successful celebration doesn't depend on spending a lot of money.","zh":"这提醒了我，一场成功的庆祝活动，并不取决于花多少钱。"},{"en":"Paying attention to the person and making time for each other can be much more important.","zh":"关心对方，并为彼此留出时间，可能要重要得多。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"A moment when I felt extremely happy was near the end of a birthday dinner I organised for my friend Ben.","method":"先搭“A moment was near the end of a birthday dinner”主干，再补“我特别开心”和“晚餐是为本组织的”。"}},"T084":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"An important lesson I learned as a child was to keep practising instead of comparing myself with other people. My father helped me understand this when I was learning to ride a bicycle in primary school. At the time, I thought I was unusually slow at learning.","heading":"童年学到的道理","sentences":[{"en":"An important lesson I learned as a child was to keep practising instead of comparing myself with other people.","zh":"我小时候学到的一个重要道理，是要坚持练习，而不是总拿自己和别人比较。"},{"en":"My father helped me understand this when I was learning to ride a bicycle in primary school.","zh":"我上小学学骑自行车时，是爸爸帮我明白了这个道理。"},{"en":"At the time, I thought I was unusually slow at learning.","zh":"当时，我觉得自己学得特别慢。"}]},{"source":"Some of my friends could already ride without help, while I kept losing my balance. I became frustrated and wanted to stop trying. My father reminded me of The Tortoise and the Hare, a story he'd told me before. In it, the slow tortoise keeps going and wins while the confident hare takes a nap.","heading":"学车遇挫折","sentences":[{"en":"Some of my friends could already ride without help, while I kept losing my balance.","zh":"有些朋友已经能不用别人帮忙就骑车了，我却老是失去平衡。"},{"en":"I became frustrated and wanted to stop trying.","zh":"我变得很沮丧，想不再练了。"},{"en":"My father reminded me of The Tortoise and the Hare, a story he'd told me before.","zh":"父亲提醒我想想《龟兔赛跑》，那是他以前给我讲过的故事。"},{"en":"In it, the slow tortoise keeps going and wins while the confident hare takes a nap.","zh":"故事里，慢慢的乌龟一直向前，最后赢了，而自信的兔子却去睡了一觉。"}]},{"source":"The connection was simple: I didn't have to be the fastest learner to make progress. We practised for a short time each evening on a quiet part of our street. He stayed beside me, and I gradually became more comfortable balancing and turning.","heading":"坚持学骑车","sentences":[{"en":"The connection was simple: I didn't have to be the fastest learner to make progress.","zh":"这个故事和我的情况很容易联系起来：我不必学得最快，也能取得进步。"},{"en":"We practised for a short time each evening on a quiet part of our street.","zh":"我们每天傍晚都会在住处那条街比较安静的路段练一小会儿。"},{"en":"He stayed beside me, and I gradually became more comfortable balancing and turning.","zh":"父亲一直待在我旁边，我也慢慢更能自如地掌握平衡和转弯了。"}]},{"source":"Eventually, I managed to ride a short distance on my own. I was excited, but the bigger change was in how I understood learning. I realised that progress could be slow without being a failure. I still find that lesson useful when I'm studying something difficult or picking up a new skill. It helps me focus on small improvements rather than other people's results.","heading":"学会慢慢进步","sentences":[{"en":"Eventually, I managed to ride a short distance on my own.","zh":"最后，我终于能自己骑一小段了。"},{"en":"I was excited, but the bigger change was in how I understood learning.","zh":"我很兴奋，不过更大的变化，是我对学习这件事的理解。"},{"en":"I realised that progress could be slow without being a failure.","zh":"我意识到，进步慢并不意味着失败。"},{"en":"I still find that lesson useful when I'm studying something difficult or picking up a new skill.","zh":"现在，当我学习比较难的东西，或学一项新技能时，仍然觉得这个道理很有用。"},{"en":"It helps me focus on small improvements rather than other people's results.","zh":"它帮我把注意力放在小小的进步上，而不是别人的成绩上。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"An important lesson I learned as a child was to keep practising instead of comparing myself with other people.","method":"先搭 An important lesson ... was to 的框架，再把“坚持练习”和“比较别人”用 instead of 作对照。"}},"T085":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A moment when I felt confident was after explaining a new idea to my team in English. It happened a few months ago, during a meeting about a small work project. Before the meeting, I was worried that I would lose my words or confuse people.","heading":"英文表达后的自信","sentences":[{"en":"A moment when I felt confident was after explaining a new idea to my team in English.","zh":"有一次我觉得很有信心，是在用英语向团队解释了一个新想法之后。"},{"en":"It happened a few months ago, during a meeting about a small work project.","zh":"那是几个月前，我们开会讨论一个工作中的小项目时。"},{"en":"Before the meeting, I was worried that I would lose my words or confuse people.","zh":"开会前，我担心自己临场想不出词，或者把大家讲糊涂了。"}]},{"source":"I prepared by choosing one main message and a simple example. I also practised saying it aloud, because an explanation that looks clear on a page can still be difficult to say. A colleague helped me notice where I was adding unnecessary details.","heading":"准备让人自信","sentences":[{"en":"I prepared by choosing one main message and a simple example.","zh":"准备时，我选了一个主要观点和一个简单的例子。"},{"en":"I also practised saying it aloud, because an explanation that looks clear on a page can still be difficult to say.","zh":"我还练习把它大声说出来，因为有些说明写在纸上看着清楚，说起来却仍然可能很难。","skeleton":"I also practised saying it aloud, because an explanation ... can still be difficult to say."},{"en":"A colleague helped me notice where I was adding unnecessary details.","zh":"一位同事帮我发现了哪些地方加了不必要的细节。"}]},{"source":"When the meeting started, I spoke a little more slowly than usual. I explained the problem first, then used the example to show how the idea could help. I didn't remember every sentence I had practised, but I could still get the main point across.","heading":"清楚传达主要意思","sentences":[{"en":"When the meeting started, I spoke a little more slowly than usual.","zh":"会议开始后，我说话比平时稍微慢了一点。"},{"en":"I explained the problem first, then used the example to show how the idea could help.","zh":"我先解释问题，再用那个例子说明这个想法能怎样帮上忙。"},{"en":"I didn't remember every sentence I had practised, but I could still get the main point across.","zh":"我没有记住之前练过的每一句话，但仍然能把主要意思表达清楚。"}]},{"source":"The change in my confidence came when people began asking useful questions. Their questions showed that they understood the idea, and I could answer without restarting my whole explanation. One colleague also said that the example had made things clearer.","heading":"提问让我更有信心","sentences":[{"en":"The change in my confidence came when people began asking useful questions.","zh":"当大家开始提出有用的问题时，我的信心就发生了变化。"},{"en":"Their questions showed that they understood the idea, and I could answer without restarting my whole explanation.","zh":"他们的问题说明，他们理解了这个想法，我也能直接回答，不用重新从头解释一遍。","skeleton":"Their questions showed that they understood the idea, and I could answer without ..."},{"en":"One colleague also said that the example had made things clearer.","zh":"还有一位同事说，那个例子让事情更清楚了。"}]},{"source":"I felt pleased because I had managed something I had been nervous about. The experience didn't mean that speaking English was suddenly easy, but it gave me evidence that preparation and clear language could help me communicate. Since then, I've felt more willing to speak up.","heading":"开口更有信心","sentences":[{"en":"I felt pleased because I had managed something I had been nervous about.","zh":"我很高兴，因为我做成了一件原本让我紧张的事。"},{"en":"The experience didn't mean that speaking English was suddenly easy, but it gave me evidence that preparation and clear language could help me communicate.","zh":"这次经历并不意味着说英语突然变容易了，但它让我看到了证据：充分准备、表达清楚，能帮助我交流。","skeleton":"The experience didn't mean that speaking English was suddenly easy, but it gave me evidence that ... could help me communicate."},{"en":"Since then, I've felt more willing to speak up.","zh":"从那以后，我更愿意主动开口了。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"The experience didn't mean that speaking English was suddenly easy, but it gave me evidence that preparation and clear language could help me communicate.","method":"先记 didn't mean that 说英语没突然变容易，再用 but it gave me evidence that 接准备和清楚表达能帮助交流。"}},"T086":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A change I made to my evening routine was spending less time on my phone before bed. I used to tell myself I was having a short break, but I often kept scrolling until late. The next morning, I sometimes felt rushed and tired.","heading":"睡前少刷手机","sentences":[{"en":"A change I made to my evening routine was spending less time on my phone before bed.","zh":"我对晚间作息做的一个改变，是睡前少花一点时间玩手机。"},{"en":"I used to tell myself I was having a short break, but I often kept scrolling until late.","zh":"以前我总告诉自己只是稍微休息一下，可常常一刷就刷到很晚。"},{"en":"The next morning, I sometimes felt rushed and tired.","zh":"第二天早上，我有时会觉得时间很赶，人也很疲惫。"}]},{"source":"I decided to make the change small enough to maintain. I chose a time to stop looking at messages and social media, usually about half an hour before I wanted to sleep. I put my phone away from the bed so that it was less tempting to pick it up again.","heading":"睡前放下手机","sentences":[{"en":"I decided to make the change small enough to maintain.","zh":"我决定把改变控制得小一些，好坚持下去。"},{"en":"I chose a time to stop looking at messages and social media, usually about half an hour before I wanted to sleep.","zh":"我选了一个不再看消息和社交媒体的时间，通常是在打算睡觉前半小时左右。","skeleton":"I chose a time to stop looking at messages and social media, usually ... before I wanted to sleep."},{"en":"I put my phone away from the bed so that it was less tempting to pick it up again.","zh":"我把手机放到离床远一点的地方，这样就不太容易忍不住又拿起来。"}]},{"source":"During that time, I did a few things, such as preparing my clothes for the next day or reading a few pages of a book. I wasn't trying to follow a complicated routine. I mainly wanted the evening to feel as though it was coming to an end.","heading":"给晚上收尾感","sentences":[{"en":"During that time, I did a few things, such as preparing my clothes for the next day or reading a few pages of a book.","zh":"那段时间，我会做几件事，比如准备第二天的衣服，或者读几页书。"},{"en":"I wasn't trying to follow a complicated routine.","zh":"我并不是想按一套复杂的流程来过。"},{"en":"I mainly wanted the evening to feel as though it was coming to an end.","zh":"我主要是想让自己感觉，这个晚上已经快要结束了。"}]},{"source":"After a while, I noticed that I was getting into bed earlier more often. On some mornings, I felt more awake and had enough time for breakfast. Those mornings felt less hurried, which made the change feel worthwhile.","heading":"清晨不再匆忙","sentences":[{"en":"After a while, I noticed that I was getting into bed earlier more often.","zh":"过了一阵子，我发现自己更经常早些上床了。"},{"en":"On some mornings, I felt more awake and had enough time for breakfast.","zh":"有些早晨，我觉得更清醒，也有足够时间吃早餐。"},{"en":"Those mornings felt less hurried, which made the change feel worthwhile.","zh":"那些早晨没那么匆忙，让我觉得这个改变很值得。"}]},{"source":"I don't manage it perfectly every night, especially when I have something urgent to finish. Still, having a simple stopping point helps me control my time. I like the routine because it gives me a calmer end to the day and a less hurried start the next morning.","heading":"作息更从容","sentences":[{"en":"I don't manage it perfectly every night, especially when I have something urgent to finish.","zh":"我不是每晚都能做到很完美，尤其是有急事要完成的时候。"},{"en":"Still, having a simple stopping point helps me control my time.","zh":"不过，定一个简单的停止时间，能帮我掌控自己的时间。"},{"en":"I like the routine because it gives me a calmer end to the day and a less hurried start the next morning.","zh":"我喜欢这个习惯，因为它让我平静地结束一天，也让第二天早上开始得没那么匆忙。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I like the routine because it gives me a calmer end to the day and a less hurried start the next morning.","method":"先记 I like the routine because it gives me，再把 a calmer end 和 a less hurried start 并列，分别对应当天晚上与次日早晨。"}},"T087":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A song that has special meaning for me is Happy Birthday to You. It is a familiar song, but I associate it with being remembered and spending time with people I care about. The meaning comes from the occasions rather than a recording.","heading":"生日歌意义","sentences":[{"en":"A song that has special meaning for me is Happy Birthday to You.","zh":"一首对我有特别意义的歌，是《祝你生日快乐》。"},{"en":"It is a familiar song, but I associate it with being remembered and spending time with people I care about.","zh":"这是一首大家都熟悉的歌，但我会把它和被人惦记、与在乎的人共度时光联系起来。"},{"en":"The meaning comes from the occasions rather than a recording.","zh":"它的意义来自那些场合，而不是某个录音版本。"}]},{"source":"One evening that stands out was a birthday dinner we arranged for a friend. We had kept the plan simple and met at a place that was convenient for everyone. Towards the end of the meal, someone brought out a cake and we sang.","heading":"生日晚餐唱歌","sentences":[{"en":"One evening that stands out was a birthday dinner we arranged for a friend.","zh":"有一个晚上让我印象很深，是我们给一位朋友安排生日晚餐的那次。"},{"en":"We had kept the plan simple and met at a place that was convenient for everyone.","zh":"我们的安排很简单，约在了一个大家去都方便的地方。"},{"en":"Towards the end of the meal, someone brought out a cake and we sang.","zh":"饭快吃完时，有人端出了蛋糕，我们就唱起了歌。"}]},{"source":"None of us was a particularly good singer, and we didn't all start at the same moment. However, that made the experience feel relaxed rather than embarrassing. Our friend looked surprised and then started smiling, which made me enjoy the song even more.","heading":"不完美的生日歌","sentences":[{"en":"None of us was a particularly good singer, and we didn't all start at the same moment.","zh":"我们都算不上唱歌特别好的人，开始唱的时候也没有完全同步。"},{"en":"However, that made the experience feel relaxed rather than embarrassing.","zh":"不过，这反而让整个过程显得轻松，而不是尴尬。"},{"en":"Our friend looked surprised and then started smiling, which made me enjoy the song even more.","zh":"我们的朋友先是一脸惊讶，然后笑了起来，这也让我唱这首歌时更开心了。"}]},{"source":"What I like about the tune is that it is easy to recognise and join in with. I don't need to concentrate on a complicated performance. I can simply take part and pay attention to the people around me.","heading":"容易参与的旋律","sentences":[{"en":"What I like about the tune is that it is easy to recognise and join in with.","zh":"我喜欢这首曲子的一点是，它很容易听出来，也很容易跟着一起唱。"},{"en":"I don't need to concentrate on a complicated performance.","zh":"我不用费心去完成什么复杂的表演。"},{"en":"I can simply take part and pay attention to the people around me.","zh":"我只要参与其中，关注身边的人就行了。"}]},{"source":"I wouldn't put the song on when I'm working or travelling. Still, hearing it at a celebration brings back warm memories. For me, it shows how even a simple piece of music can become meaningful through the experiences connected with it.","heading":"歌曲承载的回忆","sentences":[{"en":"I wouldn't put the song on when I'm working or travelling.","zh":"工作或出行时，我不会特意放这首歌。"},{"en":"Still, hearing it at a celebration brings back warm memories.","zh":"不过，在庆祝活动中听到它，会勾起温暖的回忆。"},{"en":"For me, it shows how even a simple piece of music can become meaningful through the experiences connected with it.","zh":"对我来说，它说明了，即使是一首简单的曲子，也能因为与它相关的经历而变得有意义。","skeleton":"For me, it shows how even a simple piece of music can become meaningful through ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"For me, it shows how even a simple piece of music can become meaningful through the experiences connected with it.","method":"先说 it shows how，再按“简单音乐—变得有意义—因为相关经历”串起来，用 through 连接最后一块。"}},"T088":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A piece of art I like is a watercolour painting of Dubai Creek that a friend gave me. He enjoys painting in his free time, and he made it after we spent an afternoon walking around the area.","heading":"朋友送的水彩画","sentences":[{"en":"A piece of art I like is a watercolour painting of Dubai Creek that a friend gave me.","zh":"我喜欢的一件艺术作品，是朋友送我的一幅迪拜河水彩画。"},{"en":"He enjoys painting in his free time, and he made it after we spent an afternoon walking around the area.","zh":"他平时喜欢在空闲时间画画，这幅画是在我们花了一下午在那一带散步之后画的。"}]},{"source":"The picture shows a boat on the water, with a row of buildings behind it. The walls are painted in warm, pale colours, while the water has different shades of blue. There are a few soft reflections, which make the scene feel calm rather than completely still.","heading":"水彩的画面","sentences":[{"en":"The picture shows a boat on the water, with a row of buildings behind it.","zh":"画里是一艘水上的船，船后面有一排建筑。"},{"en":"The walls are painted in warm, pale colours, while the water has different shades of blue.","zh":"墙面画成了温暖的浅色，水面则有不同深浅的蓝色。"},{"en":"There are a few soft reflections, which make the scene feel calm rather than completely still.","zh":"水上有几处柔和的倒影，让画面显得平静，却不是完全静止。"}]},{"source":"What caught my attention was that it didn't include every detail. My friend had left out things that weren't important to the scene. That made it easier to notice the boat, the light and the relationship between the colours.","heading":"删去的细节","sentences":[{"en":"What caught my attention was that it didn't include every detail.","zh":"吸引我注意的是，这幅画没有把每一个细节都画进去。"},{"en":"My friend had left out things that weren't important to the scene.","zh":"朋友省略了对这个画面不重要的东西。"},{"en":"That made it easier to notice the boat, the light and the relationship between the colours.","zh":"这样更容易注意到船、光线，以及不同颜色之间的关系。"}]},{"source":"He gave it to me later as a gift. I put it near my desk, where I could see it without it taking up much space. I look at it after a busy day, and it reminds me of our walk and conversation.","heading":"画作陪伴日常","sentences":[{"en":"He gave it to me later as a gift.","zh":"后来，他把这幅画送给了我，当作礼物。"},{"en":"I put it near my desk, where I could see it without it taking up much space.","zh":"我把它放在书桌附近，既能看得到，又不会占太多地方。"},{"en":"I look at it after a busy day, and it reminds me of our walk and conversation.","zh":"忙了一天后，我会看看它，它让我想起我们那次散步和聊天。"}]},{"source":"I like it partly because of the picture itself, but also because someone I know took the time to make it. I wouldn't try to judge its financial value. For me, its value comes from the memory and the thought behind the gift.","heading":"礼物背后的心意","sentences":[{"en":"I like it partly because of the picture itself, but also because someone I know took the time to make it.","zh":"我喜欢它，一部分是因为画本身，另一部分则是因为一个我认识的人花时间画了它。"},{"en":"I wouldn't try to judge its financial value.","zh":"我不会试着评判它值多少钱。"},{"en":"For me, its value comes from the memory and the thought behind the gift.","zh":"对我来说，它的价值来自那段回忆，还有这份礼物背后的心意。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I like it partly because of the picture itself, but also because someone I know took the time to make it.","method":"用partly because和but also because记住两个喜欢的原因：“画本身”和“熟人花时间制作”。"}},"T089":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A book that influenced the way I think is The Martian by Andy Weir. It is a science-fiction novel about an astronaut called Mark Watney who is left on Mars and has to find a way to survive. I read it when I wanted something entertaining after work.","heading":"火星救援的故事","sentences":[{"en":"A book that influenced the way I think is The Martian by Andy Weir.","zh":"一本影响我思考方式的书，是安迪·威尔写的《火星救援》。"},{"en":"It is a science-fiction novel about an astronaut called Mark Watney who is left on Mars and has to find a way to survive.","zh":"这是一部科幻小说，讲的是一个叫马克·沃特尼的宇航员被留在火星上，必须想办法活下去的故事。","skeleton":"It is a science-fiction novel about an astronaut ... who is left on Mars and has to find a way to survive."},{"en":"I read it when I wanted something entertaining after work.","zh":"我是在想找点下班后能消遣的东西时读的。"}]},{"source":"The main character is an astronaut called Mark Watney, who is accidentally left behind on Mars. He has to find ways to stay alive and contact people on Earth. The situation sounds hopeless, but he doesn't give up. He deals with one problem at a time, using whatever resources he has.","heading":"火星求生故事","sentences":[{"en":"The main character is an astronaut called Mark Watney, who is accidentally left behind on Mars.","zh":"主角是一位叫马克·沃特尼的宇航员，他意外地被留在了火星上。"},{"en":"He has to find ways to stay alive and contact people on Earth.","zh":"他必须想办法活下去，并联系上地球上的人。"},{"en":"The situation sounds hopeless, but he doesn't give up.","zh":"处境听起来没有希望，但他没有放弃。"},{"en":"He deals with one problem at a time, using whatever resources he has.","zh":"他利用手头所有能用的资源，一次解决一个问题。"}]},{"source":"What I enjoyed most was the way he thought through his difficulties. The book made me feel as if I was following his attempts step by step. Some parts were tense, but his sense of humour made the story enjoyable as well.","heading":"理性与幽默感","sentences":[{"en":"What I enjoyed most was the way he thought through his difficulties.","zh":"我最喜欢的是他认真思考、想办法解决困难的方式。","skeleton":"What I enjoyed most was the way ..."},{"en":"The book made me feel as if I was following his attempts step by step.","zh":"这本书让我感觉，自己好像在一步一步跟着他尝试。"},{"en":"Some parts were tense, but his sense of humour made the story enjoyable as well.","zh":"有些情节很紧张，但他的幽默感又让故事读起来很有意思。"}]},{"source":"I read a little in the evening, and I often continued longer than I had planned because I wanted to know what would happen next. I felt relieved whenever one of his ideas worked.","heading":"读得入迷","sentences":[{"en":"I read a little in the evening, and I often continued longer than I had planned because I wanted to know what would happen next.","zh":"我晚上会读一会儿，而且经常读得比原本计划的更久，因为我想知道接下来会发生什么。","skeleton":"I read a little in the evening, and I often continued longer than I had planned because I wanted to know ..."},{"en":"I felt relieved whenever one of his ideas worked.","zh":"每当他的某个办法奏效时，我就会松一口气。"}]},{"source":"What influenced me most was his habit of breaking a huge problem into smaller tasks. I sometimes feel overwhelmed by a difficult project, and the story reminds me to work out what I can do next. I don't pretend my problems are as serious as his, but that practical way of thinking has stayed with me.","heading":"拆解难题的思路","sentences":[{"en":"What influenced me most was his habit of breaking a huge problem into smaller tasks.","zh":"最影响我的是，他习惯把一个巨大的问题拆成更小的任务。"},{"en":"I sometimes feel overwhelmed by a difficult project, and the story reminds me to work out what I can do next.","zh":"有时遇到难做的项目，我会觉得无从下手，而这个故事提醒我，先弄清楚下一步能做什么。"},{"en":"I don't pretend my problems are as serious as his, but that practical way of thinking has stayed with me.","zh":"我不会把自己的问题说得和他的一样严重，但这种务实的思考方式，我一直记在心里。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I read a little in the evening, and I often continued longer than I had planned because I wanted to know what would happen next.","method":"按晚上读书、比计划读得久、想知道后续这三步记，分别用 and 和 because 串起来。"}},"T090":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A change that made my daily life easier was moving into an apartment closer to work. It happened a while ago, when I realised that the time I spent travelling was affecting the rest of my day. I often got home feeling tired.","heading":"搬到离公司更近处","sentences":[{"en":"A change that made my daily life easier was moving into an apartment closer to work.","zh":"一个让我日常生活更轻松的改变，是搬进了一套离工作地点更近的公寓。"},{"en":"It happened a while ago, when I realised that the time I spent travelling was affecting the rest of my day.","zh":"这是前一阵的事，当时我意识到，花在路上的时间正在影响一天里的其他安排。"},{"en":"I often got home feeling tired.","zh":"我常常一回到家就觉得很累。"}]},{"source":"I compared a few places and tried to think beyond the first impression. The location mattered, but I also needed somewhere within my budget and with enough room for the things I used regularly. I didn't need a particularly large apartment.","heading":"比较公寓的条件","sentences":[{"en":"I compared a few places and tried to think beyond the first impression.","zh":"我比较了几个地方，尽量不只凭第一印象判断。"},{"en":"The location mattered, but I also needed somewhere within my budget and with enough room for the things I used regularly.","zh":"位置很重要，但我也需要价格在预算内，而且有足够空间放平时常用物品的地方。","skeleton":"The location mattered, but I also needed somewhere within my budget and with enough room ..."},{"en":"I didn't need a particularly large apartment.","zh":"我并不需要一套特别大的公寓。"}]},{"source":"Once I had chosen a place, I made a simple plan for moving. I packed the things I didn't use every day first and kept the important items together. A friend helped me carry a few things, which made the day less stressful.","heading":"有序搬新家","sentences":[{"en":"Once I had chosen a place, I made a simple plan for moving.","zh":"选好地方后，我就为搬家做了个简单的计划。"},{"en":"I packed the things I didn't use every day first and kept the important items together.","zh":"我先打包那些不是每天都会用的东西，并把重要物品放在一起。"},{"en":"A friend helped me carry a few things, which made the day less stressful.","zh":"一位朋友帮我搬了些东西，让搬家那天没那么有压力。"}]},{"source":"On the first weekend, I unpacked what I needed most and arranged a small place to read. It took a little time before the apartment felt familiar, but I enjoyed deciding how to use the space.","heading":"安顿新公寓","sentences":[{"en":"On the first weekend, I unpacked what I needed most and arranged a small place to read.","zh":"第一个周末，我先拆包拿出最需要的东西，还布置了一个小小的阅读区。"},{"en":"It took a little time before the apartment felt familiar, but I enjoyed deciding how to use the space.","zh":"过了一点时间，我才对公寓感到熟悉，不过我很享受自己决定怎么使用这个空间。"}]},{"source":"The biggest improvement was having more time in the evening. I could prepare a meal, take a short walk or relax instead of feeling that the whole day had disappeared into work and travel. The move involved some effort, but it suited the routine I wanted to have.","heading":"搬家留出晚间时间","sentences":[{"en":"The biggest improvement was having more time in the evening.","zh":"最大的改善，是晚上有了更多时间。"},{"en":"I could prepare a meal, take a short walk or relax instead of feeling that the whole day had disappeared into work and travel.","zh":"我可以做顿饭、散散步，或者放松一下，不再觉得一整天都被工作和路程占掉了。","skeleton":"I could prepare a meal, take a short walk or relax instead of feeling that the whole day had disappeared ..."},{"en":"The move involved some effort, but it suited the routine I wanted to have.","zh":"搬家费了些功夫，但很适合我想要的日常节奏。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I could prepare a meal, take a short walk or relax instead of feeling that the whole day had disappeared into work and travel.","method":"先按“做饭—散步—放松”记三个选择，再用 instead of feeling that 对照“整天耗在工作和路上”。"}},"T091":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A place with a sense of history that I'd like to describe is Al Fahidi Historical Neighbourhood in old Dubai. I visited it with my friend Adam a few months ago. We wanted a quiet walk somewhere that felt different from the city's newer areas.","heading":"走访法希迪历史区","sentences":[{"en":"A place with a sense of history that I'd like to describe is Al Fahidi Historical Neighbourhood in old Dubai.","zh":"我想介绍一个很有历史感的地方，就是老迪拜的阿尔法希迪历史街区。"},{"en":"I visited it with my friend Adam a few months ago.","zh":"几个月前，我和朋友Adam去过那里。"},{"en":"We wanted a quiet walk somewhere that felt different from the city's newer areas.","zh":"我们想找个与城市较新区域感觉不同的地方，安安静静地走走。"}]},{"source":"The narrow lanes and traditional buildings immediately caught my attention. Instead of rushing between large modern buildings, we could walk slowly and look at small courtyards and the details around us. I liked the feeling of discovering a place one corner at a time.","heading":"慢慢探索传统街巷","sentences":[{"en":"The narrow lanes and traditional buildings immediately caught my attention.","zh":"狭窄的巷子和传统建筑，一下就吸引了我的注意。"},{"en":"Instead of rushing between large modern buildings, we could walk slowly and look at small courtyards and the details around us.","zh":"我们不用在大型现代建筑之间匆匆赶路，而是可以慢慢走，看看小院子和身边的细节。","skeleton":"Instead of rushing ..., we could walk slowly and look at ..."},{"en":"I liked the feeling of discovering a place one corner at a time.","zh":"我喜欢那种走过一个转角、发现一点新东西，慢慢认识一个地方的感觉。"}]},{"source":"We spent some time looking around and stopped for a drink at a small cafe. Adam took a few photographs, while I was more interested in how the streets connected. Afterwards, we continued towards the creek and watched the boats crossing the water.","heading":"从街巷走到河边","sentences":[{"en":"We spent some time looking around and stopped for a drink at a small cafe.","zh":"我们花了些时间四处看看，还在一家小咖啡馆停下来喝了点东西。"},{"en":"Adam took a few photographs, while I was more interested in how the streets connected.","zh":"Adam拍了几张照片，而我更感兴趣的是这些街道怎样相互连接。"},{"en":"Afterwards, we continued towards the creek and watched the boats crossing the water.","zh":"后来，我们继续朝迪拜河走去，看着船只过河。"}]},{"source":"What made the visit enjoyable was the contrast within the same city. I usually associate Dubai with busy roads and tall buildings, but that afternoon gave me a different impression. We didn't need a strict schedule, so there was time to notice things we would normally walk past.","heading":"同一城市另一面","sentences":[{"en":"What made the visit enjoyable was the contrast within the same city.","zh":"这次游览有意思的地方，在于同一座城市里竟有这样的反差。"},{"en":"I usually associate Dubai with busy roads and tall buildings, but that afternoon gave me a different impression.","zh":"我通常会把迪拜和繁忙的道路、高楼联系起来，但那个下午给了我不一样的印象。","skeleton":"I usually associate Dubai with ..., but that afternoon gave me a different impression."},{"en":"We didn't need a strict schedule, so there was time to notice things we would normally walk past.","zh":"我们不需要严格的时间表，所以有时间去留意那些平常可能直接走过的东西。"}]},{"source":"I would like to go back and learn more about the area's history before visiting. I don't know every detail about the buildings, but the neighbourhood made me curious. For me, a historical place is interesting when it helps me imagine how everyday life used to be, rather than simply looking old.","heading":"历史街区引发好奇","sentences":[{"en":"I would like to go back and learn more about the area's history before visiting.","zh":"我想再去一次，而且会在去之前多了解一下那一带的历史。"},{"en":"I don't know every detail about the buildings, but the neighbourhood made me curious.","zh":"我并不了解那些建筑的每个细节，但那个街区让我很好奇。"},{"en":"For me, a historical place is interesting when it helps me imagine how everyday life used to be, rather than simply looking old.","zh":"对我来说，一个历史地点之所以有意思，是因为它能让我想象过去的日常生活是什么样，而不只是看起来很旧。","skeleton":"For me, a historical place is interesting when it helps me imagine how everyday life used to be, ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"For me, a historical place is interesting when it helps me imagine how everyday life used to be, rather than simply looking old.","method":"先说“历史地点有意思”，用 when 接“能想象过去生活”，最后用 rather than 对比“只是外观陈旧”。"}},"T092":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A journey I made by public transport was a trip to the area around Dubai Creek with a friend. We used a train for part of the journey and walked the final section. During the outing, we also crossed the creek in a small boat.","heading":"公共交通游迪拜河","sentences":[{"en":"A journey I made by public transport was a trip to the area around Dubai Creek with a friend.","zh":"我有一次坐公共交通出行，是和朋友去迪拜河周边一带。"},{"en":"We used a train for part of the journey and walked the final section.","zh":"其中一段路，我们坐了列车，最后一段是走过去的。"},{"en":"During the outing, we also crossed the creek in a small boat.","zh":"那次外出期间，我们还坐小船过了河。"}]},{"source":"I enjoyed being a passenger because I could look around rather than concentrate on driving. We checked the direction before getting on and kept the plan fairly simple. Travelling together made the journey feel like part of the outing, instead of just a way to reach the destination.","heading":"结伴乘车也是出游","sentences":[{"en":"I enjoyed being a passenger because I could look around rather than concentrate on driving.","zh":"我喜欢当乘客，因为可以看看周围，不用集中精神开车。"},{"en":"We checked the direction before getting on and kept the plan fairly simple.","zh":"乘坐前，我们确认了方向，整个安排也保持得比较简单。"},{"en":"Travelling together made the journey feel like part of the outing, instead of just a way to reach the destination.","zh":"一起出行，让路上的过程也像是游玩的一部分，而不只是到达目的地的方式。","skeleton":"Travelling together made the journey feel like part of the outing, instead of just a way to ..."}]},{"source":"The boat crossing was the most memorable part. It was a short journey, but being close to the water gave me a different view of the buildings and the people on the shore. I took a few pictures while my friend pointed out places we could explore next.","heading":"乘船过河印象深","sentences":[{"en":"The boat crossing was the most memorable part.","zh":"坐船过河，是最让我难忘的部分。"},{"en":"It was a short journey, but being close to the water gave me a different view of the buildings and the people on the shore.","zh":"虽然这段路很短，但靠近水面，让我从不同的角度看到了岸上的建筑和人。","skeleton":"It was a short journey, but being close to the water gave me a different view of ..."},{"en":"I took a few pictures while my friend pointed out places we could explore next.","zh":"我拍了几张照片，朋友则指着一些地方，告诉我接下来可以去逛逛。"}]},{"source":"We also had a simple drink and talked for a while. The outing didn't cost us much, but I enjoyed it more than some expensive activities I've tried.","heading":"花少玩好","sentences":[{"en":"We also had a simple drink and talked for a while.","zh":"我们还简单喝了点东西，聊了一会儿。"},{"en":"The outing didn't cost us much, but I enjoyed it more than some expensive activities I've tried.","zh":"这次外出没花多少钱，但比起我试过的一些昂贵的活动，我更喜欢这次。"}]},{"source":"I remember feeling relaxed afterwards. It reminded me that I don't always need a complicated plan to have a good day. Sometimes a walk, a friend and a change of surroundings are enough.","heading":"简单的快乐一天","sentences":[{"en":"I remember feeling relaxed afterwards.","zh":"我记得结束后，整个人都很放松。"},{"en":"It reminded me that I don't always need a complicated plan to have a good day.","zh":"这让我意识到，想过得开心，不一定每次都要安排一个复杂的计划。"},{"en":"Sometimes a walk, a friend and a change of surroundings are enough.","zh":"有时候，散散步、和朋友在一起、换个环境，就足够了。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"It was a short journey, but being close to the water gave me a different view of the buildings and the people on the shore.","method":"先说“旅程虽短”，再把being close to the water作主语，接“给了我不同视角”这个收获。"}},"T093":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"An open-minded person I know is my colleague Adam. We've worked together for two years, and I appreciate the way he listens when people suggest a different approach. He doesn't seem to feel that he needs to defend his first idea immediately.","heading":"同事接纳不同意见","sentences":[{"en":"An open-minded person I know is my colleague Adam.","zh":"我认识的一个思想开明的人，是我的同事 Adam。"},{"en":"We've worked together for two years, and I appreciate the way he listens when people suggest a different approach.","zh":"我们一起工作了两年，我很欣赏他在别人提出不同做法时，愿意听对方解释的态度。","skeleton":"We've worked together for two years, and I appreciate the way he listens when ..."},{"en":"He doesn't seem to feel that he needs to defend his first idea immediately.","zh":"他似乎不会觉得，自己必须马上为最初的想法辩护。"}]},{"source":"One example was a discussion about a small tool our team wanted to build. I was in favour of creating a complete system, while another colleague suggested testing a simple version first. At the beginning, Adam also seemed interested in planning more features in advance.","heading":"团队讨论先做什么","sentences":[{"en":"One example was a discussion about a small tool our team wanted to build.","zh":"有一个例子，是我们讨论团队想做的一个小工具时。"},{"en":"I was in favour of creating a complete system, while another colleague suggested testing a simple version first.","zh":"我赞成做一个完整的系统，而另一位同事建议先测试一个简单版本。","skeleton":"I was in favour of creating ..., while another colleague suggested testing a simple version first."},{"en":"At the beginning, Adam also seemed interested in planning more features in advance.","zh":"起初，Adam似乎也想提前规划更多功能。"}]},{"source":"However, he asked the colleague to explain what we could learn from a small prototype. He listened carefully and asked practical questions about the time involved and how we would check the result. He also made sure that I had a chance to explain my concerns.","heading":"认真听取双方意见","sentences":[{"en":"However, he asked the colleague to explain what we could learn from a small prototype.","zh":"不过，他请那位同事解释一下，我们能从一个小型原型中了解到什么。"},{"en":"He listened carefully and asked practical questions about the time involved and how we would check the result.","zh":"他认真听了，还就需要花多少时间、我们要怎样检验结果，问了一些实际的问题。"},{"en":"He also made sure that I had a chance to explain my concerns.","zh":"他也确保我有机会说明自己的顾虑。"}]},{"source":"After the discussion, he supported trying the smaller version. We agreed on one basic task, tested it with a few examples and used the results to decide what to do next. The approach gave us useful information before we committed more time to the project.","heading":"讨论后试简版","sentences":[{"en":"After the discussion, he supported trying the smaller version.","zh":"讨论后，他支持试试那个更小的版本。"},{"en":"We agreed on one basic task, tested it with a few examples and used the results to decide what to do next.","zh":"我们商定了一个基本任务，用几个例子测试，再根据结果决定下一步怎么做。"},{"en":"The approach gave us useful information before we committed more time to the project.","zh":"这个方法让我们在投入更多项目时间之前，就获得了有用的信息。"}]},{"source":"What impressed me was that Adam changed his view after considering the explanation. He didn't simply agree to avoid an argument. His questions showed that he was thinking seriously about the idea. I enjoy working with him because different opinions can become something useful instead of making the conversation uncomfortable.","heading":"认真接纳观点","sentences":[{"en":"What impressed me was that Adam changed his view after considering the explanation.","zh":"让我印象深刻的是，Adam 认真考虑了解释之后，改变了自己的看法。"},{"en":"He didn't simply agree to avoid an argument.","zh":"他并不是为了避免争论就简单地表示同意。"},{"en":"His questions showed that he was thinking seriously about the idea.","zh":"他提出的问题表明，他确实在认真思考这个想法。"},{"en":"I enjoy working with him because different opinions can become something useful instead of making the conversation uncomfortable.","zh":"我喜欢和他工作，因为不同的意见可以转化成有用的东西，而不是让谈话变得尴尬。","skeleton":"I enjoy working with him because different opinions can become something useful instead of making ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"I enjoy working with him because different opinions can become something useful instead of making the conversation uncomfortable.","method":"先记 enjoy working with him because，再接不同意见能 become something useful，最后用 instead of 对比谈话变尴尬。"}},"T094":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"A public place I like in my hometown is the area around West Lake in Hangzhou. When I am there, I enjoy walking along the paths beside the lake, especially when I want a break from a busy routine.","heading":"湖边散步放松","sentences":[{"en":"A public place I like in my hometown is the area around West Lake in Hangzhou.","zh":"我喜欢的一个家乡公共场所，是杭州西湖周边一带。"},{"en":"When I am there, I enjoy walking along the paths beside the lake, especially when I want a break from a busy routine.","zh":"我在那里时，喜欢沿着湖边的小路散步，尤其是想从忙碌的日常中歇一歇的时候。","skeleton":"When I am there, I enjoy walking along the paths beside the lake, especially when ..."}]},{"source":"We spent an afternoon walking along the paths beside the lake. What I remember most is the space around the water. There were trees beside the path, and we could stop whenever we noticed a view we liked. I took a few photos, but I also put my phone away for part of the walk.","heading":"沿着湖边慢行","sentences":[{"en":"We spent an afternoon walking along the paths beside the lake.","zh":"我们花了一个下午，沿着湖边的小路散步。"},{"en":"What I remember most is the space around the water.","zh":"我印象最深的是水边的那片空间。"},{"en":"There were trees beside the path, and we could stop whenever we noticed a view we liked.","zh":"小路旁边有树，每当看到喜欢的景色，我们就可以停下来。"},{"en":"I took a few photos, but I also put my phone away for part of the walk.","zh":"我拍了几张照片，不过散步途中也有一段时间把手机收了起来。"}]},{"source":"At one point, we sat down and watched the light change on the water. We talked about ordinary things and didn't feel that we had to keep moving to another attraction. Afterwards, we found somewhere nearby to have a simple meal.","heading":"湖边闲坐","sentences":[{"en":"At one point, we sat down and watched the light change on the water.","zh":"途中我们坐下来，看着水面上的光线变化。"},{"en":"We talked about ordinary things and didn't feel that we had to keep moving to another attraction.","zh":"我们聊些日常小事，也没觉得非得一直赶去下一个景点。"},{"en":"Afterwards, we found somewhere nearby to have a simple meal.","zh":"之后，我们在附近找了个地方，简单吃了顿饭。"}]},{"source":"For me, the lake is important because it gives people a place to enjoy being outdoors while visiting a city. I liked the balance between walking, looking around and having time to talk.","heading":"湖畔的价值","sentences":[{"en":"For me, the lake is important because it gives people a place to enjoy being outdoors while visiting a city.","zh":"对我来说，这个湖很重要，因为它让人们在游览一座城市的同时，也有地方可以享受户外时光。"},{"en":"I liked the balance between walking, looking around and having time to talk.","zh":"我喜欢那种平衡：既能走走看看，又有时间聊天。"}]},{"source":"I'd happily go back, especially with someone who enjoys a slower kind of holiday. Next time, I'd leave more time to explore Hangzhou beyond the lake, rather than trying to fit everything into one afternoon.","heading":"再次游览杭州","sentences":[{"en":"I'd happily go back, especially with someone who enjoys a slower kind of holiday.","zh":"我很愿意再去一次，尤其想和喜欢慢节奏度假的人一起去。"},{"en":"Next time, I'd leave more time to explore Hangzhou beyond the lake, rather than trying to fit everything into one afternoon.","zh":"下次，我会多留些时间，去看看西湖以外的杭州，而不是试着把所有行程都塞进一个下午。","skeleton":"I'd leave more time to explore Hangzhou ..., rather than trying to fit everything ..."}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"Next time, I'd leave more time to explore Hangzhou beyond the lake, rather than trying to fit everything into one afternoon.","method":"按“下次—多留时间—探索湖外杭州”记主线，再用 rather than 接“不把一切塞进一个下午”。"}},"T095":{"paragraphs":[{"source":"I'd like to talk about a film called The Martian. I watched it at home with a friend a few months ago. Matt Damon plays an astronaut who is accidentally left behind on Mars. The mixture of an unusual setting and practical problem-solving appealed to me.","heading":"在家看火星救援","sentences":[{"en":"I'd like to talk about a film called The Martian.","zh":"我想聊一部电影，叫《火星救援》。"},{"en":"I watched it at home with a friend a few months ago.","zh":"几个月前，我和朋友在家一起看了这部电影。"},{"en":"Matt Damon plays an astronaut who is accidentally left behind on Mars.","zh":"马特·达蒙饰演一位意外被留在火星上的宇航员。"},{"en":"The mixture of an unusual setting and practical problem-solving appealed to me.","zh":"特别的故事背景，加上实实在在解决问题的过程，很吸引我。"}]},{"source":"The main character is an astronaut called Mark Watney, who is accidentally left behind on Mars. He has to find ways to stay alive and contact people on Earth. The situation sounds hopeless, but he doesn't give up. He deals with one problem at a time, using whatever resources he has.","heading":"火星求生故事","sentences":[{"en":"The main character is an astronaut called Mark Watney, who is accidentally left behind on Mars.","zh":"主角是一位叫马克·沃特尼的宇航员，他意外地被留在了火星上。"},{"en":"He has to find ways to stay alive and contact people on Earth.","zh":"他必须想办法活下去，并联系上地球上的人。"},{"en":"The situation sounds hopeless, but he doesn't give up.","zh":"处境听起来没有希望，但他没有放弃。"},{"en":"He deals with one problem at a time, using whatever resources he has.","zh":"他利用手头所有能用的资源，一次解决一个问题。"}]},{"source":"What I enjoyed most was seeing how the character responded to each new difficulty. The film made me feel as if I was following his attempts step by step. Some parts were tense, but his sense of humour made the experience enjoyable as well.","heading":"困境中的幽默应对","sentences":[{"en":"What I enjoyed most was seeing how the character responded to each new difficulty.","zh":"我最喜欢的，是看主角怎么应对每一个新出现的困难。"},{"en":"The film made me feel as if I was following his attempts step by step.","zh":"这部电影让我觉得，自己好像在一步一步跟着他尝试。"},{"en":"Some parts were tense, but his sense of humour made the experience enjoyable as well.","zh":"有些情节很紧张，但他的幽默感又让观影过程很有意思。"}]},{"source":"I particularly liked the landscape and the way the acting conveyed his loneliness. My friend and I kept wondering how we would behave in that situation. Afterwards, we talked about which part of the story had made us feel most nervous.","heading":"景色表演的感染力","sentences":[{"en":"I particularly liked the landscape and the way the acting conveyed his loneliness.","zh":"我尤其喜欢片中的景色，还有表演是怎样传达出他的孤独感的。"},{"en":"My friend and I kept wondering how we would behave in that situation.","zh":"我和朋友一直在想，如果我们身处那种状况，会怎么做。"},{"en":"Afterwards, we talked about which part of the story had made us feel most nervous.","zh":"后来，我们聊了聊，故事里哪一部分让我们最紧张。"}]},{"source":"The story also gave me a useful reminder: a big problem becomes less frightening when you focus on the next small action. I think that's why it stayed with me. I'd recommend it to someone who enjoys a hopeful story with a clever main character.","heading":"小步化解难题","sentences":[{"en":"The story also gave me a useful reminder: a big problem becomes less frightening when you focus on the next small action.","zh":"这个故事也给了我一个很有用的提醒：当你专注于下一步小行动时，大问题就没那么吓人了。","skeleton":"The story also gave me a useful reminder: a big problem becomes less frightening when you focus on ..."},{"en":"I think that's why it stayed with me.","zh":"我想，这就是它一直留在我心里的原因。"},{"en":"I'd recommend it to someone who enjoys a hopeful story with a clever main character.","zh":"如果有人喜欢充满希望、主角又很聪明的故事，我会向他们推荐这本书。"}]}],"tip":{"sentence":"The story also gave me a useful reminder: a big problem becomes less frightening when you focus on the next small action.","method":"把这句记成“故事给出提醒—大问题没那么可怕—条件是专注下一小步”三个部分。"}}};
